window.__EOC__ = {"source":"CFA Institute 学习平台 Practice（Level II 2026），最近一次作答，导出于 2026-11-07","subjects":[{"key":"quant","name":"数量 Quantitative Methods","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Basics of Multiple Regression and Underlying Assumptions","2":"Module 2: Evaluating Regression Model Fit and Interpreting Model Results","3":"Module 3: Model Misspecification","4":"Module 4: Extensions of Multiple Regression","5":"Module 5: Time-Series Analysis","6":"Module 6: Machine Learning","7":"Module 7: Big Data Projects"}},{"key":"econ","name":"经济 Economics","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Currency Exchange Rates: Understanding Equilibrium Value","2":"Module 2: Economic Growth"}},{"key":"fsa","name":"财报 Financial Statement Analysis","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Intercorporate Investments","2":"Module 2: Employee Compensation: Post-Employment and Share-Based","3":"Module 3: Multinational Operations","4":"Module 4: Analysis of Financial Institutions","5":"Module 5: Evaluating Quality of Financial Reports","6":"Module 6: Integration of Financial Statement Analysis Techniques"}},{"key":"corp","name":"公司 Corporate Issuers","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Analysis of Dividends and Share Repurchases","2":"Module 2: Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) Considerations in Investment Analysis","3":"Module 3: Cost of Capital: Advanced Topics","4":"Module 4: Corporate Restructuring"}},{"key":"equity","name":"权益 Equity Valuation","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Equity Valuation: Applications and Processes","2":"Module 2: Discounted Dividend Valuation","3":"Module 3: Free Cash Flow Valuation","4":"Module 4: Market-Based Valuation: Price and Enterprise Value Multiples","5":"Module 5: Residual Income Valuation","6":"Module 6: Private Company Valuation"}},{"key":"fi","name":"固收 Fixed Income","modules":{"1":"Module 1: The Term Structure and Interest Rate Dynamics","2":"Module 2: The Arbitrage-Free Valuation Framework","3":"Module 3: Valuation and Analysis of Bonds with Embedded Options","4":"Module 4: Credit Analysis Models","5":"Module 5: Credit Default Swaps"}},{"key":"deriv","name":"衍生 Derivatives","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Pricing and Valuation of Forward Commitments","2":"Module 2: Valuation of Contingent Claims"}},{"key":"alt","name":"另类 Alternative Investments","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Introduction to Commodities and Commodity Derivatives","2":"Module 2: Overview of Types of Real Estate Investment","3":"Module 3: Investments in Real Estate through Publicly Traded Securities","4":"Module 4: Hedge Fund Strategies"}},{"key":"pm","name":"组合 Portfolio Management","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Economics and Investment Markets","2":"Module 2: Analysis of Active Portfolio Management","3":"Module 3: Exchange-Traded Funds: Mechanics and Applications","4":"Module 4: Using Multifactor Models","5":"Module 5: Measuring and Managing Market Risk","6":"Module 6: Backtesting and Simulation"}},{"key":"ethics","name":"道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","modules":{"1":"Module 1: Code of Ethics and Standards of Professional Conduct","2":"Module 2: Guidance for Standards I–VII"}}],"cards":[{"id":"eoc_quant_2_6","s":"quant","m":2,"q":6,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"单尾检验的原假设设定","n":"预期D/E与ROE显著负相关，应做单尾检验：把与预期相反的方向放进原假设 H0: b2 ≥ 0，t值足够负即可拒绝；b2 = 0 是双尾检验的写法。","p":"eocq_quant_2_6"},{"id":"eoc_quant_2_7","s":"quant","m":2,"q":7,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"用回归系数比较两家公司","n":"两家公司ROE之差 = 斜率系数 × 自变量取值之差；要先看清自变量的定义（例如规模变量是否为对数形式），不能直接用市值的算术差去乘系数。","p":"eocq_quant_2_7"},{"id":"eoc_quant_2_8","s":"quant","m":2,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"多因子模型的假设设定","n":"预期各因子与组合超额收益正相关时，应对每个系数设单尾假设 H0: b ≤ 0 vs Ha: b > 0；只有 Hypothesis 2 的方向和形式都写对了。","p":"eocq_quant_2_8"},{"id":"eoc_quant_2_13","s":"quant","m":2,"q":13,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"F统计量计算","n":"F = MSR / MSE = (RSS / k) ÷ (SSE / (n − k − 1))；分子要用回归平方和除以k，用错平方和会得到34.9，正确约69.7。","p":"eocq_quant_2_13"},{"id":"eoc_quant_3_2","s":"quant","m":3,"q":2,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"序列相关的后果（BG检验）","n":"BG统计量大于临界值说明存在序列相关；若自变量含因变量的滞后项，系数估计无效（不一致），且标准误被低估、t值被高估。","p":"eocq_quant_3_2"},{"id":"eoc_quant_4_4","s":"quant","m":4,"q":4,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"月度季节性虚拟变量","n":"R²只有约10%、调整R²为负、F检验不显著、各月份虚拟变量也不显著，说明组合存在月度季节性的可能性很低。","p":"eocq_quant_4_4"},{"id":"eoc_quant_4_9","s":"quant","m":4,"q":9,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"Logistic回归的概率变化","n":"把其他变量固定在均值，分别用原P/E和P/E+1算 P = 1/(1+e^(−z))，再求两个概率之差（约0.16%）；不能把系数直接当成概率变化。","p":"eocq_quant_4_9"},{"id":"eoc_quant_4_11","s":"quant","m":4,"q":11,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"对数似然比较模型拟合","n":"对数似然值越大（越接近0）拟合越好：−450.40 > −451.66，所以 Model 2 更好。","p":"eocq_quant_4_11"},{"id":"eoc_quant_5_1","s":"quant","m":5,"q":1,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"线性趋势模型预测","n":"ŷ = b0 + b1·t，t要取预测月份对应的期数（样本外第2个月，t = 183），代入得约 $103.10。","p":"eocq_quant_5_1"},{"id":"eoc_quant_5_2","s":"quant","m":5,"q":2,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"对数线性趋势模型预测","n":"ln ŷ = b0 + b1·t，算出 ln ŷ 后必须取指数 e^(ln ŷ) 还原成价格（t = 182 → 约 $116.50）。","p":"eocq_quant_5_2"},{"id":"eoc_quant_5_6","s":"quant","m":5,"q":6,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"残差自相关的显著性","n":"自相关的标准误 = 1/√T（T = 180 → 0.0745）；用 自相关 ÷ 标准误 做t检验，本题有两个滞后项显著，说明残差存在序列相关。","p":"eocq_quant_5_6"},{"id":"eoc_quant_5_29","s":"quant","m":5,"q":29,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"单位根 / 随机游走","n":"一阶差分后的回归中截距和斜率都不显著、误差项也无序列相关，说明原序列是随机游走，有单位根，不平稳。","p":"eocq_quant_5_29"},{"id":"eoc_quant_5_34","s":"quant","m":5,"q":34,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"协整","n":"两个序列都有单位根但彼此协整时，回归残差是平稳的，系数可以用来估计长期关系；应选两者都有单位根且协整的那家公司。","p":"eocq_quant_5_34"},{"id":"eoc_quant_5_69","s":"quant","m":5,"q":69,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"随机游走的最佳预测","n":"随机游走不是协方差平稳序列，不能用AR(1)；对它的最佳预测就是当期值。","p":"eocq_quant_5_69"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_2","s":"quant","m":6,"q":2,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"正则化（LASSO）","n":"LASSO 的 λ = 0 时惩罚项消失，等同于OLS，没有正则化，所以最不合适；回归树剪枝本身就是一种正则化。","p":"eocq_quant_6_2"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_7","s":"quant","m":6,"q":7,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"过拟合识别","n":"低偏差、高方差的模型就是过拟合；加入惩罚项（正则化）是减少过拟合的方法，不会导致过拟合。","p":"eocq_quant_6_7"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_14","s":"quant","m":6,"q":14,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"特征高度相关的处理","n":"特征之间高度相关时用PCA降维；集成方法是组合多个模型的预测，并不处理特征相关性。","p":"eocq_quant_6_14"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_15","s":"quant","m":6,"q":15,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"SVM的适用条件","n":"SVM是线性分类器，目标变量需为二元分类；公司估值是连续变量，所以这个建议错在目标变量的类型上。","p":"eocq_quant_6_15"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_18","s":"quant","m":6,"q":18,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"K折交叉验证","n":"把训练与验证数据合并、随机分成k组，每一轮用不同的一组做验证集，所以需要多个不同的验证样本。","p":"eocq_quant_6_18"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_24","s":"quant","m":6,"q":24,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"目标变量 vs 特征","n":"模型要预测的变量（Default_Status）是目标变量（target）；特征是用来解释目标的自变量。","p":"eocq_quant_6_24"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_25","s":"quant","m":6,"q":25,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"按预测目标选模型","n":"要输出的是违约概率（连续值）且有标签数据，需要能输出连续值的监督学习模型，如随机森林；当前的KNN模型用于分类。","p":"eocq_quant_6_25"},{"id":"eoc_quant_6_26","s":"quant","m":6,"q":26,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"过拟合的图形特征","n":"预测边界非常不规则、对训练集拟合得过好，属于过拟合，难以推广到新数据。","p":"eocq_quant_6_26"},{"id":"eoc_quant_7_5","s":"quant","m":7,"q":5,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"数据转换的类型","n":"从已有变量中生成新变量（如由IPO日期算出公司年龄）属于 Extraction；Aggregation 是把多个变量合并成一个。","p":"eocq_quant_7_5"},{"id":"eoc_quant_7_7","s":"quant","m":7,"q":7,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"文本清洗中的标点处理","n":"多数标点可以删除，但 %、货币符号、问号等有意义的标点应替换成标记（如 /percentSign/）保留，不能一律删除。","p":"eocq_quant_7_7"},{"id":"eoc_quant_7_11","s":"quant","m":7,"q":11,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"词汇剪枝（探索性分析）","n":"噪声特征是词频极高（如停用词）和极低（稀有词）的token，应按TF剔除两端；卡方统计量用于特征选择，保留的是卡方值高的词。","p":"eocq_quant_7_11"},{"id":"eoc_quant_7_32","s":"quant","m":7,"q":32,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"文本清洗 vs 文本整理","n":"文本清洗（cleansing）阶段去除标点、HTML标签、数字（替换为 /number/）和多余空格；停用词是在文本整理（wrangling）阶段去除的。","p":"eocq_quant_7_32"},{"id":"eoc_quant_7_34","s":"quant","m":7,"q":34,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"第一类 / 第二类错误","n":"违约概率0.41低于阈值0.60，模型预测“不违约”，但实际违约了，属于假阴性，即 Type II error；Type I 是假阳性。","p":"eocq_quant_7_34"},{"id":"eoc_quant_7_35","s":"quant","m":7,"q":35,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"类别不平衡时的评价指标","n":"类别分布不均衡时应看F1（精确率和召回率的调和平均，约0.86），而不是accuracy（0.92）。","p":"eocq_quant_7_35"},{"id":"eoc_quant_7_38","s":"quant","m":7,"q":38,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"One-hot 编码","n":"把一个多取值的类别特征拆成多个0/1变量就是 one-hot encoding；NER 是识别文本中的人名、机构等实体。","p":"eocq_quant_7_38"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_10","s":"econ","m":1,"q":10,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"抛补利率平价推断利率高低","n":"GBP/EUR 远期点为正，说明EUR远期升水；由 F = S × (1 + i_GBP)/(1 + i_EUR)，F > S 意味着 i_GBP > i_EUR，所以EUR利率低于GBP利率。","p":"eocq_econ_1_10"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_18","s":"econ","m":1,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"资产组合平衡法：财政扩张的长期影响","n":"扩张性财政带来赤字，靠发债融资；政府债务不断上升会让投资者担心可持续性、要求更高回报或抛售该国资产，长期导致货币贬值。触发因素是政府债务增加。","p":"eocq_econ_1_18"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_20","s":"econ","m":1,"q":20,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"货币危机的预警信号","n":"危机前外汇储备通常大幅下降而不是上升；广义货币增速上升，实际汇率明显高于平稳期均值。所以“储备增加”的预测最不可能正确。","p":"eocq_econ_1_20"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_21","s":"econ","m":1,"q":21,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"债务可持续性渠道","n":"持续的经常账户赤字使外债不断积累，到某个程度汇率必须大幅贬值才能恢复可持续，这决定了长期均衡汇率；资产组合平衡渠道讲的是财富在顺差国和逆差国之间转移。","p":"eocq_econ_1_21"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_23","s":"econ","m":1,"q":23,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"非抛补利率平价预测即期汇率","n":"UIP成立时预期即期汇率 = 远期汇率 = S × (1 + i_计价货币)/(1 + i_基础货币)；对 USD/NZD，分子是USD利率、分母是NZD利率，你把两者写反了。","p":"eocq_econ_1_23"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_26","s":"econ","m":1,"q":26,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"远期升贴水计算","n":"远期升贴水 = S_mid × (i_P − i_B) × (天数/360) ÷ (1 + i_B × 天数/360)；先用买卖价中点作即期，再做天数调整，两个选项很接近，分母要算准。","p":"eocq_econ_1_26"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_36","s":"econ","m":1,"q":36,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"外汇远期盯市价值","n":"卖出远期的头寸要通过买入同到期的远期来对冲，所以要用offer价（加上远期点）；你用了bid价。再把到期净现金流按剩余期限折现。","p":"eocq_econ_1_36"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_41","s":"econ","m":1,"q":41,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"三角套利","n":"银行间隐含交叉汇率为 78.19/78.23，交易商报价 78.18/78.22：交易商的bid不高于银行间offer，交易商的offer也不低于银行间bid，所以不存在套利机会。","p":"eocq_econ_1_41"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_44","s":"econ","m":1,"q":44,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"Mundell-Fleming 与资产组合平衡法","n":"短期看 Mundell-Fleming：资本流动性高时，扩张性财政推高利率，货币升值；长期看资产组合平衡：债务累积使货币贬值。所以是先升值、后贬值。","p":"eocq_econ_1_44"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_46","s":"econ","m":1,"q":46,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"交叉汇率 + 远期汇率","n":"先用 Sn/USD × USD/GBP（= 1/0.62 = 1.6129）算出 Sn/GBP 即期约13.71，再按 Sn 和 GBP 的利率差算远期；你直接用了 Sn/USD 的即期汇率。","p":"eocq_econ_1_46"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_51","s":"econ","m":1,"q":51,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"国际费雪效应 vs PPP","n":"国际费雪效应：两国名义利差完全由预期通胀差决定；PPP 是一价定律在货币上的应用，讲的是价格水平和汇率。","p":"eocq_econ_1_51"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_53","s":"econ","m":1,"q":53,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"非抛补利率平价预测即期汇率","n":"同第23题：E(S) = F = S × (1 + i_CAD)/(1 + i_NZD)，计价货币的利率放分子；你把分子分母写反了。","p":"eocq_econ_1_53"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_54","s":"econ","m":1,"q":54,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"买卖价差的影响因素","n":"客户信用越差，报价的买卖价差越宽，所以关于信用评级的说法正确；市场流动性最好的时段是伦敦与纽约同时开市的重叠时段，关于流动性的说法有误。","p":"eocq_econ_1_54"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_55","s":"econ","m":1,"q":55,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"外汇远期盯市价值","n":"盯市价值 = (原远期价 − 对冲远期价) × 名义本金，再按剩余期限的USD利率折现到今天；你漏了折现这一步。","p":"eocq_econ_1_55"},{"id":"eoc_econ_1_57","s":"econ","m":1,"q":57,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"资产组合平衡渠道","n":"经常账户逆差使逆差国资产不断流向顺差国投资者，投资者组合中该资产占比过高后会要求更高回报或减持，造成货币贬值，这就是资产组合平衡渠道；流量供求渠道讲的是贸易收支对外汇的需求。","p":"eocq_econ_1_57"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_3","s":"econ","m":2,"q":3,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"长期股市表现的驱动因素","n":"长期看，股市表现主要由GDP增长驱动；盈利/GDP 和 P/E 都不可能无限上升或下降，长期贡献趋于零。","p":"eocq_econ_2_3"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_11","s":"econ","m":2,"q":11,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"技术进步 vs 资本深化","n":"专利计划代表技术进步（TFP提高），使整条生产函数上移，在相同人均资本下产出更高；建工厂只是资本深化，会遇到边际报酬递减。","p":"eocq_econ_2_11"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_17","s":"econ","m":2,"q":17,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"利润占GDP比重的长期走势","n":"利润/GDP 已远高于历史均值，不可能一直上升（劳动收入停滞会压制需求和劳动供给），长期会回落。","p":"eocq_econ_2_17"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_18","s":"econ","m":2,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"潜在GDP增速与实际利率","n":"潜在GDP增长快意味着未来收入增长快，消费者不愿推迟消费，要求的实际利率更高。","p":"eocq_econ_2_18"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_24","s":"econ","m":2,"q":24,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"俱乐部趋同 vs 条件趋同","n":"俱乐部趋同：只有具备相应制度条件的“俱乐部”成员国才会向最富国家的收入水平收敛；条件趋同要求各国储蓄率、人口增长率和生产函数都相同。","p":"eocq_econ_2_24"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_25","s":"econ","m":2,"q":25,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"新古典增长模型的开放经济含义","n":"新古典模型：资本流向资本边际产出更高的发展中国家，其资本存量增长更快，促进收敛；“优胜劣汰”的选择效应是内生增长模型的观点。","p":"eocq_econ_2_25"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_26","s":"econ","m":2,"q":26,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"Solow增长核算","n":"ΔY/Y = ΔA/A + α·ΔK/K + (1 − α)·ΔL/L = 1.5 + 0.3 × 3.2 + 0.7 × 0.4 = 2.74%；你漏乘了劳动项的 (1 − α)。","p":"eocq_econ_2_26"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_29","s":"econ","m":2,"q":29,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"内生增长模型","n":"内生增长模型中没有稳态增长率，储蓄和投资决策可以永久提高增长率；新古典模型下长期增长只取决于外生的技术进步。","p":"eocq_econ_2_29"},{"id":"eoc_econ_2_36","s":"econ","m":2,"q":36,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"资源诅咒 / 荷兰病","n":"两条说法都错：荷兰病是资源出口旺盛导致本币升值（不是贬值），使制造业失去竞争力；她关于外资直接拥有种植园的说法也不对。","p":"eocq_econ_2_36"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_3","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":3,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"债券利息收入：摊余成本 vs FVPL","n":"按面值买入的债券没有折溢价摊销，无论分类为摊余成本还是FVPL，利息收入都等于票息，两者相同。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_3"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_9","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":9,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"会计方法对净利率的影响","n":"权益法只在利润表用一行确认应占净利润，不增加收入，所以净利率最高；并表会把子公司收入和费用全部计入。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_9"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_11","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":11,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"并表后的营业利润率","n":"被投资方营业利润率（8.0%）低于母公司（9.0%），并表后整体约8.6%，比原来低。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_11"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_15","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":15,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"控制下的合并收入","n":"取得控制就要并入子公司100%的收入：1,700 + 1,350 = 3,050，不按持股比例计算。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_15"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_17","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":17,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"合营企业（权益法）","n":"合营企业用权益法，只用一行确认应占净利润，不逐项并入收入和费用，所以合并报表中的合营企业收入为0。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_17"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_21","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":21,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"出售应收账款给SPE","n":"公司控制SPE就必须并表，内部交易在合并时抵消，收入不会因此增加，应收账款余额也不变。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_21"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_28","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":28,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"部分商誉法下的少数股东权益","n":"IFRS部分商誉法：NCI = NCI持股比例 × 子公司可辨认净资产公允价值 = 20% × 1.5bn = 300m；按子公司整体公允价值计算的是全部商誉法。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_28"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_30","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":30,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"权益法 vs 并表下的长期负债/权益","n":"权益法不并入子公司负债，权益也不含NCI：600/1,430 = 0.42；并表后负债增加，权益含NCI：1,000/1,750 = 0.57。所以权益法最低。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_30"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_33","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":33,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"不同方法下的期初权益回报率","n":"归属母公司的净利润在各方法下都相同；期初权益在两种并表方法下都是1,750（含NCI，本题无商誉差异），权益法下是1,430。所以两种并表相同，权益法不同。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_33"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_41","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":41,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"权益法投资的减值","n":"IFRS和US GAAP都要求权益法投资的减值损失计入利润表（Statement 2 正确）；Statement 3 对超出商誉部分减值的处理说错了（应按比例分摊到该单元的非现金资产）。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_41"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_42","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":42,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"SPE融资的成本与报表影响","n":"SPE与公司破产隔离，贷款人直接对应收账款有追索权，借款成本可能下降（Comment 1）；两种准则都要求并表SPE，合并报表与直接抵押借款时相同，所以 Comment 3 错。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_42"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_49","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":49,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"债券投资的分类","n":"若打算在需要流动性时提前出售，就不满足“持有以收取合同现金流”的业务模式，不能用摊余成本，所以最不合适的是摊余成本；FVPL可以。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_49"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_1_54","s":"fsa","m":1,"q":54,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"集团内部销售的抵消","n":"子公司的销售全部卖给母公司，属于集团内部交易，合并时全部抵消，所以合并利润表中反映的比例为0%。","p":"eocq_fsa_1_54"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_7","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":7,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"利率下降对养老金融资状况的影响","n":"利率下降使DBO增加，但计划资产（尤其是长久期债券）的公允价值同时上升，部分抵消，所以融资状况恶化的幅度小于DBO的增加。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_7"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_8","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"IFRS下DB计划计入营业费用的部分","n":"服务成本 = 当期服务成本200 + 过去服务成本120 = 320，计入营业费用；净利息单独列示。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_8"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_9","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":9,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"US GAAP下计入损益的养老金成本","n":"US GAAP下计入损益的是当期服务成本 + 利息成本 − 计划资产预期回报（本题假设无摊销）；过去服务成本和精算损失先计入OCI，不直接进损益，结果为20。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_9"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_10","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":10,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"预测IFRS下的养老金成本","n":"养老金成本 = 服务成本（200 + 120 = 320）+ 净利息（折现率 × 期初净养老金负债，即上年末的净负债），合计约531。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_10"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_13","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":13,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"RSU费用的计算","n":"费用 = 已归属RSU × 授予日公允价值 − 被没收的RSU × 其授予日公允价值 = 约51.4m；要用授予日公允价值，而不是当前股价。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_13"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_15","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":15,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"股权激励的超额税收利益（US GAAP）","n":"结算时的税前扣除（按结算时市价）超过已确认费用的部分 × 税率 = windfall；在US GAAP下它减少所得税费用，不是增加。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_15"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_16","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":16,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"税收windfall：IFRS vs US GAAP","n":"IFRS下超额税收利益直接计入权益，不减少利润表中的所得税费用，所以按IFRS计算的有效税率更高。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_16"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_21","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":21,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"折现率变化对报表的影响","n":"用更高的折现率（5.38%而非4.85%）会降低DBO现值，总负债更低；对净利润的影响不是本题考点。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_21"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_22","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":22,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"精算假设变化对利润的影响","n":"预期加薪率降低会减少服务成本，利润提高；折现率降低通常会增加DBO和利息成本，对利润不利。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_22"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_25","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":25,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"期权估值假设对费用的影响","n":"股息率越高，看涨期权价值越低，期权费用越低，利润越高；无风险利率和预期期限上升都会提高期权价值。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_25"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_26","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":26,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"DCF中养老金净利息的处理","n":"净利息反映的是折现的时间价值；已从企业价值中扣除净养老金负债现值后，再在FCF中扣除净利息就重复计算了，应从FCF中去掉净利息，服务成本则保留。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_26"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_2_28","s":"fsa","m":2,"q":28,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"净亏损时的反稀释证券","n":"公司报告净亏损时，所有未归属的股权激励都是反稀释的；题目问的就是这部分（unvested share-based awards）。","p":"eocq_fsa_2_28"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_2","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":2,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"折算方法的选择依据","n":"要看借款的境外子公司的功能货币（相对于母公司的列报货币），不是看贷款的币种；子公司功能货币为当地货币，用现行汇率法。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_2"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_8","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"恶性通胀下的折算（IFRS）","n":"三年累计通胀接近或超过100%即为恶性通胀；IFRS（IAS 29）要求先按当地通胀重述报表，再按现行汇率折算，累计折算损失约1.58m。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_8"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_14","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":14,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"恶性通胀下的资产价值（IFRS）","n":"同上：先用通胀指数重述非货币性资产（仓库），再按期末现行汇率折算成列报货币。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_14"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_22","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":22,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"现行汇率法下的CTA","n":"以外币为功能货币时用现行汇率法，折算差额计入权益中的CTA；外币贬值且净资产为正时产生负的折算调整，即从CTA中扣减。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_22"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_36","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":36,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"时态法下的资产负债表敞口","n":"时态法的敞口是净货币性资产/负债，本题为净货币性负债30m；出售固定资产（非货币性）换成现金可以抵消；发债买有价证券两边都按现行汇率折算，净敞口不变。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_36"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_42","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":42,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"汇率变动对营业利润的影响","n":"收入主要是GBP，美元升值对收入影响不大；燃油和租赁成本以USD计价，美元升值使成本上升，营业利润下降。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_42"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_55","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":55,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"时态法下的重新计量损益","n":"子公司的定价主要取决于美国市场，功能货币为USD，要用时态法，重新计量损益计入净利润（本题为收益2.526m）；1.792m的损失是按现行汇率法算出的。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_55"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_56","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":56,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"按功能货币计算的销售增长","n":"评价子公司管理层要看其功能货币（CAD）口径：把USD收入按各期平均汇率换回CAD再算增速（8.5%）；USD口径的6.3%混入了汇率影响。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_56"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_57","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":57,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"现行汇率法下对OCI的影响","n":"现行汇率法下的敞口是净资产；CAD对USD贬值时，净资产敞口产生折算损失，计入OCI（CTA）。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_57"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_3_61","s":"fsa","m":3,"q":61,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"税率变化对集团净利润的影响","n":"瑞典降税不只影响瑞典本地的税前利润（338），也影响税率低于瑞典的南美子公司利润（227），两部分都要算，合计约31.2；只算瑞典部分会得到18.6。","p":"eocq_fsa_3_61"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_7","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":7,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"银行风险指标的趋势解读","n":"两个VaR指标三年持续下降，说明市场风险暴露降低、敏感度改善；资本充足方面的指标并没有一致改善。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_7"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_9","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":9,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"资本充足率趋势","n":"逐一计算 CET1、Tier 1、总资本比率（资本 / 风险加权资产），三个比率的变化方向不一致，所以结论是“mixed”。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_9"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_11","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":11,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"减值准备的变化原因","n":"减值准备随“逾期但未减值”资产同比例上升（预期它们可能转为减值）；已减值资产其实在下降，所以不是由它驱动。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_11"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_13","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":13,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"非CAMELS的补充因素","n":"净设定受益计划负债三年持续下降，说明这方面的风险在减小，支持对前景的正面评价。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_13"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_15","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":15,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"保险公司的损失及损失调整费用率","n":"(损失 + 损失调整费用) / 已赚净保费 从61.3%降到59.1%，说明承保时对风险的估计更准确；整体效率要看费用率或综合成本率。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_15"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_18","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":18,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"独立信用衍生品对收益波动的影响","n":"独立（freestanding）衍生品的公允价值变动每期直接计入损益；这类敞口大幅下降，交易收益的波动性也随之降低。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_18"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_19","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":19,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"利率变化对净息差的影响","n":"银行短借长贷；按 Statement 1 描述的利率变化，负债端成本上升快于资产端收益，净息差会收窄。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_19"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_20","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":20,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"LCR vs NSFR","n":"30天期逆回购是高流动性资产，直接影响LCR（30天压力情景下高流动性资产 / 预期净现金流出）；NSFR衡量的是一年期稳定资金。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_20"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_25","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":25,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"互助银行的特征","n":"信用社、合作银行和互助银行是由会员（而不是股东）所有的存款机构；抵押贷款银行主要发放、出售和服务按揭，并参与证券化。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_25"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_26","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":26,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"Basel III 的流动性要求","n":"NSFR要求相对一年期（不是90天）的流动性需求持有足够的稳定资金，所以 Highlight 3 错；LCR对应30天压力情景，Highlight 2 正确。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_26"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_28","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":28,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"贷款损失准备的比率分析","n":"评估贷款损失准备是否充足常用：准备 / 不良贷款、准备 / 净冲销、拨备 / 净冲销；准备 / 净利润没有分析意义。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_28"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_29","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":29,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"Basel III 的主要改进","n":"Basel III 的关键变化之一是提高风险加权资产所需的权益资本比例；盈利质量不是 Basel III 关注的重点。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_29"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_36","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":36,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"非CAMELS因素的相关性","n":"区域性银行主要服务本国客户，几乎没有外汇敞口，所以货币敞口最不相关；银行的使命（集中于某一地区）是相关的。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_36"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_37","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":37,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"保险公司固定收益资产回报率","n":"固定收益资产除了债券还包括贷款和存款；只用债券平均余额会算出5.1%，正确约4.8%。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_37"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_40","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":40,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"美国保险公司的监管与会计","n":"美国保险公司按法定会计规则（statutory accounting）向州监管机构报告，全球也没有统一的保险监管标准；Cioffi 的说法全部正确。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_40"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_42","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":42,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"拨备变化对税前利润增长的贡献","n":"要用变化量：拨备的减少额 ÷ EBT 的增加额（21,800），约24.8%；你用的是拨备水平 ÷ EBT 水平（7.1%）。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_42"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_4_44","s":"fsa","m":4,"q":44,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"期限转换","n":"银行短借长贷、赚取长短期利差的价值创造方式叫期限转换（maturity transformation）；合同期限错配是这一策略的结果，不是策略名称。","p":"eocq_fsa_4_44"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_5_1","s":"fsa","m":5,"q":1,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"利润高估的会计预警信号","n":"收入增速明显高于同业是收入可能被高估或不可持续的预警信号；缩短折旧年限是保守做法；折扣和退货增加（不是减少）才是预警信号。","p":"eocq_fsa_5_1"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_5_28","s":"fsa","m":5,"q":28,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"获客成本资本化的影响","n":"把原本当期费用化的获客折扣改为资本化后，相关现金流出不再全部计入经营活动，经营现金流增加；资产增加，D/A 反而下降。","p":"eocq_fsa_5_28"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_5_29","s":"fsa","m":5,"q":29,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"资产减记后转回对指标的扭曲","n":"2014年减记、2016年转回，所以2015年无形资产被低估、摊销偏低、净利润偏高，净利率和ROA都被高估。","p":"eocq_fsa_5_29"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_5_30","s":"fsa","m":5,"q":30,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"Altman Z 分数的解读","n":"Z > 3.0 破产概率低，< 1.81 破产概率高，1.81–3.0 为不确定区间；分数虽然上升，但仍在这个区间内，所以结论是“仍不确定”。","p":"eocq_fsa_5_30"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_6_2","s":"fsa","m":6,"q":2,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"DuPont 分析","n":"利润率和资产周转率三年都在上升，但杠杆下降，抵消了一部分改善；“ROE本可以更高”的判断是基于杠杆。","p":"eocq_fsa_6_2"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_6_6","s":"fsa","m":6,"q":6,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"经营现金流 / 营业利润","n":"为了与EBIT可比，CFO要加回利息和税；该公司按IFRS把利息归入筹资活动，只需加回已付税款，结果约1.9。","p":"eocq_fsa_6_6"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_6_8","s":"fsa","m":6,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"由DuPont数据推算财务杠杆","n":"总资产 = 收入 / 资产周转率，权益 = 总资产 − 总负债，杠杆 = 总资产 / 权益；算出来三年基本稳定。","p":"eocq_fsa_6_8"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_6_12","s":"fsa","m":6,"q":12,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"并购扩张的报表证据","n":"商誉只在收购其他企业时产生，商誉和无形资产是并购增长策略的标志；PP&E的变化也可能来自内生增长。","p":"eocq_fsa_6_12"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_6_13","s":"fsa","m":6,"q":13,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"管理层可直接控制的净利润","n":"只剔除联营企业投资收益（不受直接控制）；归属于少数股东的净利润来自控股子公司，仍在管理层控制之内，不应剔除。","p":"eocq_fsa_6_13"},{"id":"eoc_fsa_6_18","s":"fsa","m":6,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"现金转换周期","n":"CCC = 存货天数 + 应收天数 − 应付天数；CCC延长主要来自存货天数上升，应付天数基本稳定（付款甚至略快）。","p":"eocq_fsa_6_18"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_3","s":"corp","m":1,"q":3,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"股票股利与拆股","n":"两句都错：其他条件不变时，股票股利会使每股价格下降（不是上升）；拆股使股价和EPS同比例下降，P/E不变。","p":"eocq_corp_1_3"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_6","s":"corp","m":1,"q":6,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"回购后的每股账面价值","n":"回购后BVPS = (原账面权益 − 回购金额) / (原股数 − 回购股数)，回购股数按当前市价计算，结果约25.71。","p":"eocq_corp_1_6"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_12","s":"corp","m":1,"q":12,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"股利再投资（税率为零）","n":"股利和资本利得税率都为0时，除息日股价下跌金额等于股利：40 − 1.50 = 38.50；150,000 ÷ 38.50 ≈ 3,896股，合计约103,900股。你按除息前的40元算了。","p":"eocq_corp_1_12"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_15","s":"corp","m":1,"q":15,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"低派息率的相关因素","n":"增长前景差的公司一般派息率高（把钱还给股东）；新股发行成本高会促使公司多留存收益，对应的是低派息率。","p":"eocq_corp_1_15"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_16","s":"corp","m":1,"q":16,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"股利渐进调整模型","n":"预期股利 = 上期股利 + (预期EPS × 目标派息率 − 上期股利) × 调整系数 = 0.60 + (4 × 0.25 − 0.60) × 0.2 = 0.68。","p":"eocq_corp_1_16"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_17","s":"corp","m":1,"q":17,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"稳定股利政策","n":"稳定股利政策是在长期前景不变时保持每股股利平稳（如多年维持1美元）；保持固定派息率属于目标派息率政策，股利会随盈利波动。","p":"eocq_corp_1_17"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_18","s":"corp","m":1,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"用现金回购对EPS的影响","n":"回购20万股后剩80万股；按题设总盈利不变，EPS = 2m / 0.8m = 2.50；2.30 是错误地扣减了盈利。","p":"eocq_corp_1_18"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_24","s":"corp","m":1,"q":24,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"用于托市的回购方式","n":"只有公开市场回购计划能让公司灵活地在股价下跌时买入；固定价格要约回购的价格和时间都是事先定死的。","p":"eocq_corp_1_24"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_25","s":"corp","m":1,"q":25,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"特别股利与回购的等价条件","n":"两者对股东财富等价，要求分配的现金、税负和信息含量都相同；只要税负或信息含量不同，结果就不一样。","p":"eocq_corp_1_25"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_32","s":"corp","m":1,"q":32,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"回购 vs 现金股利","n":"Statement 1 最不准确：分配的现金总额虽相同，但回购只有卖出股份的股东拿到现金，股利则是所有股东按比例获得；Statement 2 正确：宣布回购意向不构成义务，已宣告的股利则必须支付。","p":"eocq_corp_1_32"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_35","s":"corp","m":1,"q":35,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"回购对债务契约的影响","n":"举债回购同时增加债务、减少权益，D/E 超过35%的上限，构成违约；用现金回购则不一定违约。","p":"eocq_corp_1_35"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_36","s":"corp","m":1,"q":36,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"清算股利","n":"公司出售部分业务并把所得分给股东，属于清算股利；特别股利是不定期派发、或在常规股利之外额外派发的股利。","p":"eocq_corp_1_36"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_38","s":"corp","m":1,"q":38,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"股票股利的影响","n":"Statement 1 错：股票股利一般不需纳税，只是把同一块“蛋糕”切得更小；Statement 3 与发行成本有关，是正确的。","p":"eocq_corp_1_38"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_39","s":"corp","m":1,"q":39,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"绿邮（greenmail）","n":"绿邮是公司以高于市价的溢价回购潜在收购方的股票，不是折价，所以 Statement 1 最不准确；关于固定价格要约回购的说法是对的。","p":"eocq_corp_1_39"},{"id":"eoc_corp_1_42","s":"corp","m":1,"q":42,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"股利安全性","n":"股利覆盖率 = 税后净利 / 已付股利，从 300/115 ≈ 2.609 升到 315/120 = 2.625，安全性提高了（虽然幅度很小）。","p":"eocq_corp_1_42"},{"id":"eoc_corp_2_9","s":"corp","m":2,"q":9,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"固定收益分析中的ESG整合","n":"债券分析中ESG整合的重点是降低下行风险；股票分析则既用来发现机会，也用来防范下行风险。","p":"eocq_corp_2_9"},{"id":"eoc_corp_2_15","s":"corp","m":2,"q":15,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"股权结构的类型","n":"横向持股是指有业务往来的公司（如主要客户或供应商）相互交叉持股；分散持股是股东众多、没有任何单一股东能控制公司。","p":"eocq_corp_2_15"},{"id":"eoc_corp_2_18","s":"corp","m":2,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"ESG的重要性与投资期限","n":"对债权人来说，重要性取决于影响是否落在其投资期限内：工厂改用可再生能源的效果在债务期限之外；收紧原材料采购标准属环境议题，在期限内影响更大，所以 Initiative 3 重要性最高。","p":"eocq_corp_2_18"},{"id":"eoc_corp_3_3","s":"corp","m":3,"q":3,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"用短期利率估算股权成本的偏差","n":"基于短期国债利率的历史ERP通常更高（收益率曲线正常向上倾斜）；目前短期利率又高于长期利率，两个因素都会让长期股权要求回报被高估。","p":"eocq_corp_3_3"},{"id":"eoc_corp_3_7","s":"corp","m":3,"q":7,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"租赁负债的折现率","n":"承租方通常不知道租赁内含利率（需要残值现值和出租人的初始直接成本），所以要用增量借款利率，即同期限抵押借款的利率。","p":"eocq_corp_3_7"},{"id":"eoc_corp_4_5","s":"corp","m":4,"q":5,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"可比公司分析的优点","n":"可比公司法的估值直接来自市场数据，不像DCF那样依赖大量假设；缺点是对市场错误定价很敏感。","p":"eocq_corp_4_5"},{"id":"eoc_corp_4_10","s":"corp","m":4,"q":10,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"多元化折价","n":"多元化折价 = 分部加总估值的企业价值 − 当前交易的企业价值 = 187 − 170 = 17bn，是正数；你把减法方向弄反了。","p":"eocq_corp_4_10"},{"id":"eoc_corp_4_13","s":"corp","m":4,"q":13,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"可比交易分析","n":"取可比交易P/E的中位数（16.7）× 目标公司EPS得出公允收购价，再与实际支付价比较；支付价低于公允价值，说明收购方少付了（underpaid）。","p":"eocq_corp_4_13"},{"id":"eoc_equity_1_13","s":"equity","m":1,"q":13,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"选择绝对估值模型","n":"公司资产大多是无形资产，股利也只是偶尔支付，资产基础法和DDM都不合适；FCFF的适用面最广。","p":"eocq_equity_1_13"},{"id":"eoc_equity_1_23","s":"equity","m":1,"q":23,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"竞争优势与估值倍数","n":"两家水疗连锁都建立并维持了相对竞争对手的优势，都可以用更高的倍数，不只是其中一家。","p":"eocq_equity_1_23"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_4","s":"equity","m":2,"q":4,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"多阶段DDM（终值用倍数法）","n":"第8年末价值 = 17 × 第8年EPS（1.664）= 28.29，要折现8年（得14.49），再加上D1–D8的现值1.74，合计约16.24。","p":"eocq_equity_2_4"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_10","s":"equity","m":2,"q":10,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"Gordon模型下的回报分解","n":"股票定价合理时，总回报 = 要求回报率（7.35%）；总回报 = 股息率 + 增长率（3.5%），所以股息率为3.85%。","p":"eocq_equity_2_10"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_22","s":"equity","m":2,"q":22,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"合理前瞻P/E","n":"P0/E1 = (1 − b)/(r − g) = 派息率 / (r − g)；用派息率0.60和题中的r、g计算，约17.1。","p":"eocq_equity_2_22"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_23","s":"equity","m":2,"q":23,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"用合理P/E判断是否高估","n":"合理前瞻P/E = 0.8/(0.07 − 0.03) = 20，实际前瞻P/E = 10/0.50 = 20，两者相等，说明定价合理。","p":"eocq_equity_2_23"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_24","s":"equity","m":2,"q":24,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"Gordon模型的适用条件","n":"公司回购股票时，只要分析师能就回购的影响合理调整股利增长率，Gordon模型仍然可以用，所以是 Report 2。","p":"eocq_equity_2_24"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_33","s":"equity","m":2,"q":33,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"多阶段DDM计算","n":"逐年按各阶段的增长率推算股利，在最后一年算终值，再全部按要求回报率折现求和（约71.03）；起点是2019年末的股利3.15，第一年就要乘以(1 + g)。","p":"eocq_equity_2_33"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_36","s":"equity","m":2,"q":36,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"可持续派息率","n":"g = b × ROE：0.036 = (1 − 派息率) × 0.083，解得派息率约56.6%。","p":"eocq_equity_2_36"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_43","s":"equity","m":2,"q":43,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"DCF模型的输入选择","n":"资本支出远大于经营现金流、未来几年FCF为负时，用剩余收益模型更合适。","p":"eocq_equity_2_43"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_44","s":"equity","m":2,"q":44,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"Gordon模型要用D1","n":"V0 = D0 × (1 + g)/(r − g) = D1/(r − g) = 2 × 1.05 / 0.05 = 42；你直接用了D0，得到40。","p":"eocq_equity_2_44"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_45","s":"equity","m":2,"q":45,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"PVGO","n":"P0 = E1/r + PVGO；零增长价值要用下一年盈利E1（不是过去的盈利）除以r，股价减去它就是PVGO，约7。","p":"eocq_equity_2_45"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_58","s":"equity","m":2,"q":58,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"判断公司的增长阶段","n":"名义GDP增速 = 实际增速3.7% + 通胀2% = 5.7%；公司的增速与之接近，属于成熟阶段；超常增长阶段的增速应明显高于经济的名义增速。","p":"eocq_equity_2_58"},{"id":"eoc_equity_2_59","s":"equity","m":2,"q":59,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"估值结果与投资决策","n":"用过去五年股利算出增长率 (2.53/1.89)^(1/4) − 1 ≈ 7.56%，代入模型得内在价值，与市价相差不到1美元，所以不加入组合。","p":"eocq_equity_2_59"},{"id":"eoc_equity_3_12","s":"equity","m":3,"q":12,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"两阶段FCFE模型","n":"先算当年FCFE = 净利润 + 非现金费用 − 营运资本投资 − 固定资产投资 + 净借款 = 2,264，用CAPM求股权要求回报率，再按两阶段增长分别折现。","p":"eocq_equity_3_12"},{"id":"eoc_equity_3_36","s":"equity","m":3,"q":36,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"估值的敏感性分析","n":"比较每个输入在高、低估计下的估值区间，区间最宽的（股权要求回报率）就是估值最敏感的变量。","p":"eocq_equity_3_36"},{"id":"eoc_equity_3_37","s":"equity","m":3,"q":37,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"固定增长FCFF与WACC","n":"情景1下FCFF以4.5%固定增长，企业价值 = FCFF1/(WACC − g)；WACC要包含税后债务、优先股和普通股三部分。两个选项只差一点，计算时要保留足够的小数位。","p":"eocq_equity_3_37"},{"id":"eoc_equity_3_61","s":"equity","m":3,"q":61,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"EBITDA 作为FCFE的代理","n":"EBITDA没有扣除资本支出，不适合作为FCFE的代理，这个理由成立；但他的第二个理由不成立。","p":"eocq_equity_3_61"},{"id":"eoc_equity_3_62","s":"equity","m":3,"q":62,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"FCFE中的非现金项目调整","n":"两项都是增加了利润的非现金收益（重组费用转回5m + 另一项2m），都要从净利润中扣除，合计减少7m；你把转回的5m加了回去。","p":"eocq_equity_3_62"},{"id":"eoc_equity_3_65","s":"equity","m":3,"q":65,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"由FCFF求FCFE","n":"FCFE = FCFF − 利息 × (1 − t) + 净借款；长期债务减少200是净还款：500 − 186 × 0.68 − 200 ≈ 174；你把净借款的符号弄反了。","p":"eocq_equity_3_65"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_11","s":"equity","m":4,"q":11,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"市销率","n":"P/S = 每股价格 / 每股销售额 = 37.23 / (67.44bn ÷ 1.6388bn = 41.15) ≈ 0.90。","p":"eocq_equity_4_11"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_12","s":"equity","m":4,"q":12,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"周期性公司的估值","n":"周期性行业的公司应使用标准化（周期中段）盈利来估值，以消除盈利随周期波动的影响。","p":"eocq_equity_4_12"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_15","s":"equity","m":4,"q":15,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"PEG 比率","n":"PEG = P/E ÷ 预期盈利增长率（百分数）；因为近期发生了收购，P/E要用前瞻盈利计算；算出的PEG说明定价合理。","p":"eocq_equity_4_15"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_18","s":"equity","m":4,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"合理前瞻P/E","n":"P0/E1 = (D1/E1)/(r − g) = (2.91/6.00)/(0.15 − 0.06) ≈ 5.4。","p":"eocq_equity_4_18"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_19","s":"equity","m":4,"q":19,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"市净率","n":"每股账面价值要用普通股权益 = 股东权益总额 − 优先股价值，再除以普通股股数；不扣除优先股会得到2.0。","p":"eocq_equity_4_19"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_21","s":"equity","m":4,"q":21,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"同业P/E的调和平均","n":"同业前瞻P/E的调和平均约5.5；公司前瞻P/E = 50/6.00 ≈ 8.3，高于同业，所以相对高估。","p":"eocq_equity_4_21"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_22","s":"equity","m":4,"q":22,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"用平均ROE法求标准化EPS","n":"标准化EPS = 最近一个完整周期（2016–2019）的平均ROE（约13.1%）× 当前每股（普通股）账面价值。","p":"eocq_equity_4_22"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_24","s":"equity","m":4,"q":24,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"基础EPS（underlying EPS）","n":"摊薄EPS 0.81 − 非经常性法律收益0.04 + 非经常性工厂整合费用0.03 = 0.80；与折旧相关的0.01是经常性的，不调整。P/E = 股价 / 0.80。","p":"eocq_equity_4_24"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_25","s":"equity","m":4,"q":25,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"前瞻PEG","n":"前瞻PEG = 前瞻P/E ÷ 预期增长率（百分数）；Adesivo = 16.18 / 16.67 ≈ 0.97，PEG最低，最有吸引力。","p":"eocq_equity_4_25"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_27","s":"equity","m":4,"q":27,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"Fed模型与Yardeni模型","n":"Fed模型：市场盈利收益率高于10年期国债收益率时股市被低估；Yardeni模型加入了市场五年一致预期盈利增长率，这是Fed模型没有的。两句都对。","p":"eocq_equity_4_27"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_29","s":"equity","m":4,"q":29,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"动量指标","n":"相对强弱指标把股票表现与一组股票或其自身历史比较（Statement 5 正确）；SUE = 未预期盈利 ÷ 过去未预期盈利的标准差，不是分析师预测的标准差，所以 Statement 6 错。","p":"eocq_equity_4_29"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_56","s":"equity","m":4,"q":56,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"加权调和平均P/E","n":"按市值权重对各成分股的E/P（P/E的倒数）加权平均，再取倒数，约10.8；你用的是等权重。","p":"eocq_equity_4_56"},{"id":"eoc_equity_4_61","s":"equity","m":4,"q":61,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"盈利收益率（E/P）的作用","n":"盈利极低、为零或为负时改用E/P，可以避免P/E失去意义，这部分说法对；但E/P并不能处理非经常性项目和经济周期的影响，那部分说法错。","p":"eocq_equity_4_61"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_11","s":"equity","m":5,"q":11,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"价值等于账面价值的含义","n":"V0 = B0 + (ROE − r) × B0 / (r − g)；如果 V0 = B0，就没有剩余收益的贡献，说明ROE等于股权成本。","p":"eocq_equity_5_11"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_12","s":"equity","m":5,"q":12,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"单阶段剩余收益模型","n":"V0 = B0 + B0 × (ROE − r)/(r − g) = 55.81 + 55.81 × 0.02 / 0.015 ≈ 130.22。","p":"eocq_equity_5_12"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_14","s":"equity","m":5,"q":14,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"非经常性项目的处理","n":"重组费用是非经常性项目，不代表未来盈利；预测剩余收益时应把它从净利润中剔除，而不是去调整股权成本。","p":"eocq_equity_5_14"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_15","s":"equity","m":5,"q":15,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"多阶段剩余收益模型（持续因子）","n":"V0 = B0 + 前T−1年RI的现值 + 第T年RI / (1 + r − ω) 再折现；ω是持续因子，终值项的分母是 (1 + r − ω)。","p":"eocq_equity_5_15"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_17","s":"equity","m":5,"q":17,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"剩余收益模型的隐含假设","n":"剩余收益模型用会计利润，隐含假设是利息费用恰当反映了债务资本成本（Statement 2 正确）。","p":"eocq_equity_5_17"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_50","s":"equity","m":5,"q":50,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"市场增加值（MVA）","n":"MVA = 公司市场价值（股权 + 债务）− 总资本的账面价值；只用股权计算会得到260m。","p":"eocq_equity_5_50"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_52","s":"equity","m":5,"q":52,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"账面价值的调整","n":"资产和负债应尽可能调整到公允价值，改变账面权益的是 Adjustment 1；经营租赁资本化时资产和负债同时增加，不影响权益。","p":"eocq_equity_5_52"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_60","s":"equity","m":5,"q":60,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"两阶段剩余收益模型","n":"预期市净率要乘以第一阶段末的账面价值（不是期初的20美元）；算出的内在价值高于市价，所以被低估。","p":"eocq_equity_5_60"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_63","s":"equity","m":5,"q":63,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"违反清洁盈余关系","n":"期末账面价值 = 期初 + 盈利 − 股利，就满足清洁盈余，Item 2 属于这种情况；Item 3 中自主经营子公司按现行汇率法折算，汇兑损益绕过利润表进入OCI，违反清洁盈余。","p":"eocq_equity_5_63"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_64","s":"equity","m":5,"q":64,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"EVA的驱动因素","n":"EVA = NOPAT − 资本成本率 × 总资本；行政效率提升会降低费用、提高NOPAT和EVA（Goal 2），所以最不可能提高EVA的是 Goal 3。","p":"eocq_equity_5_64"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_65","s":"equity","m":5,"q":65,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"剩余收益模型的弱点","n":"利息费用未必反映真实的债务成本，这是剩余收益模型的弱点，你选的说法不对；非经常性项目要调整利润，但不用调整账面价值，因为已经反映在资产价值中。","p":"eocq_equity_5_65"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_66","s":"equity","m":5,"q":66,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"剩余收益的计算","n":"RI = 当年净利润 − 股权成本率 × 期初账面权益；你用了期末权益来算股权费用。","p":"eocq_equity_5_66"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_67","s":"equity","m":5,"q":67,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"剩余收益终值假设的比较","n":"Armishaw：VT = 5.32 / 0.15 = 35.47（永续）；Stack：先把RI按12%（0.20 × 0.60）增长到2024年，再除以 (1 + r − ω)。你漏了按12%增长这一步。","p":"eocq_equity_5_67"},{"id":"eoc_equity_5_69","s":"equity","m":5,"q":69,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"剩余收益模型 vs DDM","n":"在同样的假设下两个模型结果相同（Statement 1 正确）；剩余收益模型并不需要对未来盈利和股利增长做假设，所以 Statement 3 最不准确。","p":"eocq_equity_5_69"},{"id":"eoc_equity_6_2","s":"equity","m":6,"q":2,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"估值目的与控制权溢价","n":"作为收购、重组后再上市的战略买方，会考虑协同控制权溢价；DLOM与他控制并重组公司的策略不一致。","p":"eocq_equity_6_2"},{"id":"eoc_equity_6_5","s":"equity","m":6,"q":5,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"协同 vs 财务控制权溢价","n":"计划与现有组合公司合并以实现协同，应考虑协同控制权溢价，通常高于财务买方的溢价。","p":"eocq_equity_6_5"},{"id":"eoc_equity_6_6","s":"equity","m":6,"q":6,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"上市公司收购私营公司的报价","n":"收购报价通常反映买方收购后将做的改进（如削减费用）；说报价反映私营公司更高的折现率是不对的。","p":"eocq_equity_6_6"},{"id":"eoc_equity_6_10","s":"equity","m":6,"q":10,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"用看跌期权估算DLOM","n":"用基于远期价格的平值看跌期权：远期价 = 29.70 × e^(0.25 × 0.04) ≈ 30，DLOM = 行权价30的看跌期权价值 3.75 ÷ 当前价 29.70 ≈ 12.6%。","p":"eocq_equity_6_10"},{"id":"eoc_equity_6_20","s":"equity","m":6,"q":20,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"私营公司估值方法的选择","n":"行业内私营公司的交易很少且不同期，可比交易法不合适；公司资产可以出售给其他企业再利用，资产基础法最合适。","p":"eocq_equity_6_20"},{"id":"eoc_equity_6_30","s":"equity","m":6,"q":30,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"资本化率","n":"资本化率 = 折现率（WACC）− 长期增长率 = 11% − 5% = 6%；8.5%是ERP加小盘股溢价，不是资本化率。","p":"eocq_equity_6_30"},{"id":"eoc_fi_1_13","s":"fi","m":1,"q":13,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"互换利率的定义","n":"互换利率就是利率互换中固定端的利率，不是两端之差。","p":"eocq_fi_1_13"},{"id":"eoc_fi_1_26","s":"fi","m":1,"q":26,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"骑乘收益率曲线","n":"即期曲线向上倾斜、且预期水平和形状都不变时，买入期限长于投资期的债券（骑乘曲线）的总回报高于期限匹配策略。","p":"eocq_fi_1_26"},{"id":"eoc_fi_1_29","s":"fi","m":1,"q":29,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"反映货币市场风险的利差","n":"MRR–OIS 利差（原 Libor–OIS）衡量货币市场证券的风险和流动性；TED利差是MRR与短期国债利率之差。","p":"eocq_fi_1_29"},{"id":"eoc_fi_1_39","s":"fi","m":1,"q":39,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"财政的供给侧效应","n":"政府赤字下降，债券供给减少，债券收益率更可能下降。","p":"eocq_fi_1_39"},{"id":"eoc_fi_1_69","s":"fi","m":1,"q":69,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"平价利率与自举法","n":"Klopp 对平价利率的描述是对的，错在自举法：自举法是从平价利率曲线逐期推导出即期利率曲线。","p":"eocq_fi_1_69"},{"id":"eoc_fi_1_71","s":"fi","m":1,"q":71,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"传统期限结构理论","n":"Pochettino 正确描述了流动性偏好理论：投资者持有长期债券要求流动性溢价，所以远期利率是预期未来即期利率的有偏估计；Dengler 对纯预期理论的描述有错误。","p":"eocq_fi_1_71"},{"id":"eoc_fi_1_72","s":"fi","m":1,"q":72,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"现代期限结构模型","n":"CIR、Vasicek、Ho–Lee 三个模型的结构相同，都由漂移项和随机项组成；但 Ho–Lee 不是均值回归模型，所以“短期利率都会向长期利率收敛”的说法不对。","p":"eocq_fi_1_72"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_2","s":"fi","m":2,"q":2,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"债券的无套利价格","n":"无套利价值 = 每笔现金流按对应期限的零息即期利率折现后求和（103.7815）；哪个交易所的报价等于这个值，就是无套利价格。","p":"eocq_fi_2_2"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_4","s":"fi","m":2,"q":4,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"二叉树节点上的债券价值","n":"节点价值 = [0.5 × (上节点价值 + 票息) + 0.5 × (下节点价值 + 票息)] / (1 + 该节点利率)，要用该节点右侧相邻的两个节点。","p":"eocq_fi_2_4"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_13","s":"fi","m":2,"q":13,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"二叉树倒推","n":"时间1上节点的价值 = 第2年现金流（100 + 2.5 = 102.5）/ (1 + 该节点利率 2.8853%) ≈ 99.6255；节点价值不含该节点当时支付的票息，你多加了2.5。","p":"eocq_fi_2_13"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_18","s":"fi","m":2,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"蒙特卡洛模拟","n":"增加模拟路径数能提高估计的统计精度，但不能使估值更接近债券真实的基本价值（Statement 4 正确）。","p":"eocq_fi_2_18"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_19","s":"fi","m":2,"q":19,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"可校准拟合收益率曲线的模型","n":"Ho–Lee 是无套利模型，可以校准到与观测的收益率曲线吻合；CIR和Vasicek是均衡模型。","p":"eocq_fi_2_19"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_23","s":"fi","m":2,"q":23,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"利率树的校准","n":"校准利率树用电子表格（如 Excel 的 Solver）就能完成，不需要专门的编程技能，也不昂贵；她在这一点上说错了。","p":"eocq_fi_2_23"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_24","s":"fi","m":2,"q":24,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"无套利市场的条件","n":"无套利原则针对的是无风险证券和组合，不是有风险的，所以 Condition 1 错；价值可加性和无占优这两个条件必须成立。","p":"eocq_fi_2_24"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_32","s":"fi","m":2,"q":32,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"利率树校准的依据","n":"校准取决于波动率假设、利率模型和基准债券的市场价格，而不是被估值债券的价值；对数正态假设是校准过程的一部分。","p":"eocq_fi_2_32"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_37","s":"fi","m":2,"q":37,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"含权债券的估值方法","n":"该债券的现金流依赖利率（含期权），不能用基准即期利率曲线直接估值；二叉树能生成依赖利率的现金流，是合适的方法。","p":"eocq_fi_2_37"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_39","s":"fi","m":2,"q":39,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"用即期利率识别套利","n":"用即期利率（不是平价利率）折现，债券价值约103.4816，低于市价，所以应买入剥离债券（strips）、卖出债券来套利。","p":"eocq_fi_2_39"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_40","s":"fi","m":2,"q":40,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"二叉树的两个作用","n":"利率树在估值中有两个作用：生成依赖利率的现金流，以及提供折现用的利率；Comment 1 与此不符，最不准确。","p":"eocq_fi_2_40"},{"id":"eoc_fi_2_43","s":"fi","m":2,"q":43,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"即期利率法与二叉树应一致","n":"二叉树是基于即期曲线和无套利条件构建的，对无期权债券，两种方法的估值必须相同，与曲线形状无关；结果不同说明模型有误。","p":"eocq_fi_2_43"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_1","s":"fi","m":3,"q":1,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"百慕大式期权","n":"只能在若干个预定日期行权的赎回权属于百慕大式；欧式只能在一个日期行权。","p":"eocq_fi_3_1"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_3","s":"fi","m":3,"q":3,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"利率下降：可赎回 vs 可回售","n":"利率下降时，可赎回债券的上涨空间被赎回权封顶，可回售债券的上涨空间不受限，所以可回售的 Bond #3 上涨潜力更大。","p":"eocq_fi_3_3"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_14","s":"fi","m":3,"q":14,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"内嵌赎回权的价值","n":"赎回权价值 = 普通债券价值 − 可赎回债券价值；先用即期（或远期）利率算出普通债券价值，再减去二叉树得出的可赎回债券价值，约0.8789。","p":"eocq_fi_3_14"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_17","s":"fi","m":3,"q":17,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"无保护期可赎回债券的价格上限","n":"没有赎回保护期、按面值可随时赎回的债券，价格不会超过100。","p":"eocq_fi_3_17"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_20","s":"fi","m":3,"q":20,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"浮动利率债券的有效久期","n":"浮息债的有效久期约等于距下次利率重置的时间；按年重置，所以约为1。","p":"eocq_fi_3_20"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_23","s":"fi","m":3,"q":23,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"二叉树估值含权债券","n":"从末端往回倒推，每个节点按该节点利率折现，并在每个节点检查行权条件（如可赎回时取较小值），正确结果约为面值的99.697%。","p":"eocq_fi_3_23"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_27","s":"fi","m":3,"q":27,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"可转债的风险收益特征","n":"股价远低于转换价（深度价外）时，可转债基本表现为债券，受信用利差影响，几乎不受股价变动影响。","p":"eocq_fi_3_27"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_30","s":"fi","m":3,"q":30,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"无期权债券的单边久期","n":"无期权债券的单边上行久期和单边下行久期大致相等；只有含权债券两者才会明显不同。","p":"eocq_fi_3_30"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_46","s":"fi","m":3,"q":46,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"关键利率久期","n":"对收益率曲线形状变化（变陡或变平）的敏感度要用关键利率久期衡量；单边久期针对的是平行移动。","p":"eocq_fi_3_46"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_48","s":"fi","m":3,"q":48,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"曲线变平对含权债券的影响","n":"曲线变平时，赎回权价值上升，可赎回的 Bond A 涨幅小于普通债券；回售权价值下降，可回售的 Bond B 也比普通债券涨得慢。两者都上涨，但都不如普通债券。","p":"eocq_fi_3_48"},{"id":"eoc_fi_3_53","s":"fi","m":3,"q":53,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"曲线由平变陡对可回售债券的影响","n":"收益率曲线由平变为向上倾斜时，内嵌回售权的价值上升；可回售债券 = 普通债券 + 回售权，所以在 Bond A 价格不变时 Bond C 价格上升。","p":"eocq_fi_3_53"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_12","s":"fi","m":4,"q":12,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"违约情形下的投资回报率","n":"解IRR：1,090 = 60/(1+IRR) + 60/(1+IRR)² + 326.74/(1+IRR)³，其中326.74是第3期的回收额，结果约 −28.38%。","p":"eocq_fi_4_12"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_17","s":"fi","m":4,"q":17,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"相对于政府债的信用利差","n":"先用含违约风险的公允价值（1,101.24）求公司债YTM（3.26%），再求同票息无违约政府债的YTM，两者之差约108 bps。","p":"eocq_fi_4_17"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_18","s":"fi","m":4,"q":18,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"回收率和违约概率同时下降","n":"回收率 30% × 0.75 = 22.5%，违约概率 1.5% × 0.75 = 1.125%；无违约价值（VND）不变，只需重算CVA，公允价值 = VND − CVA ≈ 1,108.40。","p":"eocq_fi_4_18"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_20","s":"fi","m":4,"q":20,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"违约概率下降对浮息债估值的影响","n":"违约概率下降不影响二叉树和VND（1,154.27），也不影响预期敞口、违约损失和折现因子，只有CVA下降（降至22.99）。","p":"eocq_fi_4_20"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_33","s":"fi","m":4,"q":33,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"信用评分与信用评级","n":"Hastings 关于信用评分和信用评级的说法都正确。","p":"eocq_fi_4_33"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_34","s":"fi","m":4,"q":34,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"评级下调情形下的预期回报","n":"一年预期回报 = 收益率带来的收入 − 久期 × 利差变化（利差从0.85%扩大到1.10%）；你漏算了票息收入。","p":"eocq_fi_4_34"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_39","s":"fi","m":4,"q":39,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"汽车ABS","n":"Wong 关于投资者偏好（看重资产池分散化等好处）的说法正确，关于融资成本的说法错误。","p":"eocq_fi_4_39"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_45","s":"fi","m":4,"q":45,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"基准收益率与利差的方向","n":"报告描述的情况会使基准收益率上升、利差扩大；预期通胀上升会推动利差扩大，而不是收窄。","p":"eocq_fi_4_45"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_46","s":"fi","m":4,"q":46,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"评级迁移带来的价格回报","n":"对每一种迁移：价格变化 ≈ −久期（6.5）× 利差变化 × 迁移概率，再求和，约 −0.57%；你没有乘久期。","p":"eocq_fi_4_46"},{"id":"eoc_fi_4_56","s":"fi","m":4,"q":56,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"证券化债务的考虑因素","n":"ABS信用风险的关键之一是资产在存续期内的发起和服务质量，Consideration 2 与此不符，最不准确；超额利差是消费类ABS的主要信用保护（Consideration 1 正确）。","p":"eocq_fi_4_56"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_1","s":"fi","m":5,"q":1,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"CDS的结算方式选择","n":"持有的 Bond 2 价格（面值的50%）高于最便宜可交割债券 Bond 1（40%），回收率按CTD估计为40%；现金结算拿到60%的赔付，还能保留价值50%的债券，比实物交割更有利。","p":"eocq_fi_5_1"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_2","s":"fi","m":5,"q":2,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"信用曲线的形状","n":"向下倾斜的信用曲线表示近期违约概率高于远期，通常出现在短期严重承压的时候。","p":"eocq_fi_5_2"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_7","s":"fi","m":5,"q":7,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"ISDA主协议","n":"CDS交易双方在交易前要签署ISDA主协议，合约条款遵循ISDA的规定；预付款与这项合规要求无关。","p":"eocq_fi_5_7"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_14","s":"fi","m":5,"q":14,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"股票对信用交易","n":"Zega 收到主动收购报价，股价会上涨，所以做多 Zega 股票；Delta 将大幅举债、违约概率上升，所以买入 Delta 的保护。","p":"eocq_fi_5_14"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_19","s":"fi","m":5,"q":19,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"CDS曲线交易","n":"同时持有 CDS 1 和 CDS 2 构成曲线交易（在一个期限买保护、在另一个期限卖保护）；本题的组合表达的是预期信用曲线变平。","p":"eocq_fi_5_19"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_26","s":"fi","m":5,"q":26,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"CDS多空交易","n":"卖出信用改善公司（Webster）的CDS，买入信用恶化公司（Levrom）的CDS；卖出 Levrom 的CDS会因其信用恶化而亏损。","p":"eocq_fi_5_26"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_29","s":"fi","m":5,"q":29,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"单一名称CDS","n":"单一名称CDS通常以特定借款人的高级无担保债务为参考债务，但该借款人同等或更高级别的债务都可以交割；Vasquez 这一点说错了，她对指数CDS的描述是对的。","p":"eocq_fi_5_29"},{"id":"eoc_fi_5_34","s":"fi","m":5,"q":34,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"CDS基差交易","n":"比较债券信用利差和CDS利差：A公司债券利差（85.40 bps）低于CDS利差，应卖出A的CDS保护（做多CDS）并卖空A的债券；B公司的方向相反。","p":"eocq_fi_5_34"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_1","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":1,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"欧洲美元期货与套利","n":"报价只要不等于无套利期货价就存在套利机会（Statement 1）；Statement 2 对报价低于无套利价时如何套利的描述也是对的，两句都正确。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_1"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_3","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":3,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"国债期货的均衡报价","n":"Q0 = (1/CF) × [FV(B0 + AI0) − AI_T − FVCI]：先把全价（含应计利息）按无风险利率复利到期，减去到期时的应计利息，再除以转换因子。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_3"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_5","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":5,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"互换固定利率","n":"r_FIX = (1 − PV_n) / ΣPV_i，其中 PV_i = 1/(1 + R_i × 天数/360)；这样得到的是每期利率，要再乘以每年结算次数年化，约2.20%。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_5"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_6","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":6,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"付固定互换的估值","n":"付固定方价值 = NA × (FS_t − FS_0) × ΣPV_i；先用当前PV因子算出新的互换利率（0.08%），利率下降使付固定方价值为负（−2,980,500），要乘以所有剩余期PV因子之和。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_6"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_9","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":9,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"远期的持有成本套利","n":"持有成本模型价格 = S0 × (1 + r)^T ≈ 250.562，与市场远期价相同，所以不存在套利机会。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_9"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_11","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":11,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"远期合约的期中估值","n":"先算新的无套利远期价：F = (当前股价 − 剩余期内股利现值) × (1 + r)^剩余期 ≈ 243.90；空头价值 = (原远期价 − 新远期价) 折现到当前，约6.65。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_11"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_13","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":13,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"收固定互换的估值","n":"收固定方价值 = NA × (FS_0 − FS_t) × ΣPV_i，剩余两年的PV因子之和为1.967975，FS_t 用当前的均衡互换利率。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_13"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_14","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":14,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"日元互换的均衡利率","n":"按日元即期利率求出四个季度的PV因子，每期利率 = (1 − PV_4)/ΣPV，再乘以4年化，约0.2496%。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_14"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_17","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":17,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"FRA的期中估值","n":"90天后，6×9 FRA 只剩90天到期：先按当前利率算出新的FRA利率，价值 = NA × (FRA_g − FRA_0) × t_m，再按到期限折现到当前，约14,820。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_17"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_18","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":18,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"1×4 FRA 利率","n":"FRA = {[1 + L120 × 120/360] / [1 + L30 × 30/360] − 1} × 360/90 ≈ 0.98%。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_18"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_19","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":19,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"2×5 FRA 利率","n":"同样的公式，用 L60 = 0.82% 和 L150 = 0.94%：FRA = {[1 + L150 × 150/360] / [1 + L60 × 60/360] − 1} × 360/90 ≈ 1.02%。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_19"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_25","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":25,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"股指期货价格","n":"F = S0 × (1 + r)^T − 股利终值：1,935 × 1.012^(145/360) − 3.15 ≈ 1,941；你没有把现货价复利到期。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_25"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_26","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":26,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"股指远期的期中估值","n":"V_t = (F_t − F_0) × e^(−r × (T − t))：用剩余期限 T − t = 0.0833 算出新的远期价，再按剩余期限折现（指数为负）。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_26"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_28","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":28,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"付固定互换价值","n":"价值 = −NA × (FS_0 − FS_t) × ΣPV_i，要乘以所有剩余期PV因子之和（2.8762），不是只乘最后一期的0.9326。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_28"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_34","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":34,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"FRA的期中估值","n":"要先按30天后的期限结构算出剩余期限对应的新FRA利率，再与原FRA利率比较并折现；正确结果为负（约 −10,515），不能直接用原来的利率差。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_34"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_36","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":36,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"股票互换的估值","n":"付固定、收股票：价值 = (S_t / S_0) × NA − 固定利率债券价值；债券价值 = 剩余票息现值 + 本金现值，你没有对本金折现。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_36"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_40","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":40,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"国债期货的转换因子","n":"转换因子不作用于应计利息，它是调整交割时应付金额、使各可交割债券大致等价的系数，所以 Characteristic 2 错。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_40"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_44","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":44,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"利率互换的期中估值","n":"90天后用新的PV因子（0.994505、0.987069、0.972786）算出新的互换利率，价值 = NA × (FS_t − FS_0) × 剩余期PV因子之和，约 −602,250。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_44"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_47","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":47,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"持有成本与持有收益","n":"在套利模型中，借款成本不算持有成本（资金成本已经体现在按无风险利率复利里）；Kang 把借款成本列为持有成本，所以错了。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_47"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_48","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":48,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"股指远期的平仓损失","n":"用当前的现货指数和6个月利率算出新的（反向）远期价，与原远期价之差还要按剩余半年折现；你没有对剩余半年期做调整。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_48"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_50","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":50,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"股票对股票互换","n":"股票对股票互换不需要定价，因为它可以由一个“股票换固定”和一个“固定换股票”的互换复制；Kang 的两点描述都对。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_50"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_54","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":54,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"互换浮动端的结算惯例","n":"浮动利率是期初设定、期末支付：每期结算用的是该期期初观察到的MRR，不是期末的利率。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_54"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_55","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":55,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"用债券复制给互换定价","n":"期初浮动利率债券的价值等于面值；定价是求使互换价值（不是浮动债券价值）为零的固定利率，所以“浮动债券价值为零”不是假设。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_55"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_1_56","s":"deriv","m":1,"q":56,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"货币互换的期中估值","n":"固定对固定货币互换的价值 = 两个固定利率债券现值之差；EUR债券的价值要用60天后的汇率（不是期初汇率）换算成GBP。","p":"eocq_deriv_1_56"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_4","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":4,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"期权套利与复制组合","n":"看涨期权被高估时，卖出看涨期权，同时买入复制组合：买入 h 股股票并借款，h = (c+ − c−)/(S+ − S−)。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_4"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_6","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":6,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"美式看跌期权二叉树","n":"风险中性概率 π = (1 + r − d)/(u − d) = 0.46；在每个节点比较提前行权价值和继续持有价值、取较大值，再往回倒推，约5.15。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_6"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_8","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":8,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"利率期权二叉树","n":"每单位名义本金在第2步的收益 = max(0, 利率 − 行权利率)，用风险中性概率和各节点利率逐步折现回0时点，再乘以名义本金，约6,429。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_8"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_22","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":22,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"一期二叉树模型","n":"期望法是无套利法的一种变形，用的是风险中性概率，而不是投资者对未来股价的预期；她关于“预期未来股价”的说法错误。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_22"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_32","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":32,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"看涨期权被高估时的套利","n":"市价15.28高于公允价值11.90，应卖出看涨期权，并借款买入股票（复制组合）；Laurens 的策略方向反了。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_32"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_40","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":40,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"期权估值的折现率","n":"期望法下，期权价值 = 按风险中性概率计算的期末收益期望值，用无风险利率折现；Franco 对收益的理解对，但折现率说错了。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_40"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_41","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":41,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"利率期权二叉树的起点","n":"节点0的标的是即期利率（1.00%），不是远期利率；平值期权的行权价也等于这个即期利率。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_41"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_42","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":42,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"付款方互换期权","n":"付款方（payer）互换期权防范利率上升，收款方（receiver）互换期权防范利率下降；Weber 描述的是 payer，他是对的。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_42"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_43","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":43,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"Delta对冲","n":"看涨期权 delta = 0.5952，对冲100,000股需卖出 100,000 / 0.5952 ≈ 168,010 份看涨期权；若用看跌期权，需买入 100,000 / |delta_put| 份。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_43"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_45","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":45,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"美式看跌期权的提前行权","n":"在时间1的下跌节点，要比较提前行权价值（K − S）和继续持有的价值，取较大者；你用的是欧式价值。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_45"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_47","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":47,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"动态复制","n":"动态复制是指通过事先计划好的交易，在每个节点都精确复制期权的价值；二叉树是用时间2的期权价值倒推出时间1的价值，不是反过来。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_47"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_51","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":51,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"看跌期权的delta","n":"多头看跌期权的delta为负；期权越深度价内、越接近到期，delta越接近 −1。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_51"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_54","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":54,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"期望法的假设","n":"期望法使用风险中性概率，投资者对标的资产未来走势的看法无关紧要；上涨或下跌的概率不是主观确定的。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_54"},{"id":"eoc_deriv_2_57","s":"deriv","m":2,"q":57,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"用利率期权组合复制FRA","n":"买入利率看涨期权 + 卖出利率看跌期权（行权价都等于当前FRA利率），等同于收浮动、付固定的FRA，用来防范利率上升。","p":"eocq_deriv_2_57"},{"id":"eoc_alt_1_7","s":"alt","m":1,"q":7,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"商品期货的总回报","n":"总回报 = 价格回报 + 展期回报 + 抵押品回报，三部分都要算：价格回报1.387%，展期回报在远月升水时为负，合计约0.85%。","p":"eocq_alt_1_7"},{"id":"eoc_alt_1_14","s":"alt","m":1,"q":14,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"商品期货的总回报","n":"同上：价格回报2.05% + 展期回报（远月升水时为负）+ 抵押品回报，合计约1.46%。","p":"eocq_alt_1_14"},{"id":"eoc_alt_1_27","s":"alt","m":1,"q":27,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"商品指数的加权方式","n":"产量加权指数对能源的配置很重，客户想限制能源敞口，应选等权重指数。","p":"eocq_alt_1_27"},{"id":"eoc_alt_1_30","s":"alt","m":1,"q":30,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"对冲压力假说","n":"期货曲线向上倾斜（contango）意味着消费者的套期保值需求（买入期货）多于生产者，即消费者过剩。","p":"eocq_alt_1_30"},{"id":"eoc_alt_1_32","s":"alt","m":1,"q":32,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"存储理论","n":"需要定期存储的商品，远期价格应更高以弥补存储成本（contango），这与存储理论一致。","p":"eocq_alt_1_32"},{"id":"eoc_alt_1_36","s":"alt","m":1,"q":36,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"展期回报与持仓方向","n":"市场处于contango（曲线向上倾斜）时，做多会产生负的展期回报，卖出期货才能获得正的展期回报；处于backwardation时才应买入。","p":"eocq_alt_1_36"},{"id":"eoc_alt_2_5","s":"alt","m":2,"q":5,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"最大贷款额：LTV与DSCR双重约束","n":"按LTV 65%可贷183.95m，但此时DSCR只有1.62，低于最低要求1.65；按DSCR约束，最大年偿债额 = NOI / 1.65 ≈ 9.45m，再折算出贷款额约180.1m，取两者中较小的那个。","p":"eocq_alt_2_5"},{"id":"eoc_alt_2_8","s":"alt","m":2,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"房地产周期","n":"空置率说明市场处于供给过剩或衰退阶段；Statement 1（衰退期较短、随后复苏）比 Statement 2（直接进入扩张）更准确。","p":"eocq_alt_2_8"},{"id":"eoc_alt_2_15","s":"alt","m":2,"q":15,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"房地产投资的形式","n":"直接买入物业属于私募市场交易：Delphinus 出资是私募房地产股权，Rich 放贷是私募（不是公募）房地产债权。","p":"eocq_alt_2_15"},{"id":"eoc_alt_3_1","s":"alt","m":3,"q":1,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"内部管理的REIT","n":"高管是公司员工，向股东选出的董事会汇报，属于内部管理（自我管理）的REIT；REOC不享有REIT的税收地位。","p":"eocq_alt_3_1"},{"id":"eoc_alt_3_8","s":"alt","m":3,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"两步DDM给REIT估值","n":"先算出前几年的股利，在第4年末用 4.54 / (0.08 − 0.04) ≈ 113.57 算终值，再全部折现，约100.91。","p":"eocq_alt_3_8"},{"id":"eoc_alt_3_13","s":"alt","m":3,"q":13,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"医疗REIT的风险","n":"医疗REIT对经济衰退的抵抗力较强，但受人口结构和政府医疗拨款变化的影响较大。","p":"eocq_alt_3_13"},{"id":"eoc_alt_3_16","s":"alt","m":3,"q":16,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"两步DDM给REIT估值","n":"同理：前期股利的现值 + 终值（按下一年股利 / (r − g)）的现值，约28.76。","p":"eocq_alt_3_16"},{"id":"eoc_alt_3_21","s":"alt","m":3,"q":21,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"AFFO的优缺点","n":"AFFO从FFO中扣除维持性资本支出和租赁费用，更接近经济收益；但这些支出需要估计，存在较大的差异和误差，Annear 在这一点上说错了。","p":"eocq_alt_3_21"},{"id":"eoc_alt_3_22","s":"alt","m":3,"q":22,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"相对估值 vs 净资产价值法","n":"用资本化率由NOI求净资产价值（NAV），不属于基于市场的相对估值法；Factor 3 描述的是相对估值的输入。","p":"eocq_alt_3_22"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_9","s":"alt","m":4,"q":9,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"选择组合中的对冲基金策略","n":"首要约束是合并组合的方差要低于现有组合的90%；在满足约束的策略里，股票市场中性的Sortino比率最高。","p":"eocq_alt_4_9"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_11","s":"alt","m":4,"q":11,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"机会型对冲基金策略","n":"全球宏观和管理期货都是机会型策略，流动性高、可以用高杠杆、收益常呈右偏，两者都符合她的偏好。","p":"eocq_alt_4_11"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_12","s":"alt","m":4,"q":12,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"并购套利的收益","n":"按换股比例（3股Taurus换2股Aqua），22,500股Taurus相当于15,000股Aqua；收益 = 空头所得675,000 − 多头成本450,000 = 225,000。","p":"eocq_alt_4_12"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_14","s":"alt","m":4,"q":14,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"可转债套利","n":"经典做法是买入相对低估的可转债、卖空相对高估的股票；Anderson 关于这笔交易盈利情况的结论是对的，股价上涨并不会让利润更高。","p":"eocq_alt_4_14"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_15","s":"alt","m":4,"q":15,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"人寿保单贴现","n":"对冲基金偏好续保保费较低、退保价值较低、被保险人预期寿命短于保险公司估计的保单；Characteristic 2（保费低）正确。","p":"eocq_alt_4_15"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_19","s":"alt","m":4,"q":19,"y":"","c":"","t":"可转债套利策略的风险（简答题）","n":"这是简答题，平台没有记录你的作答。建议回到平台对照参考答案自己写一遍（涉及卖空、融券等方面的风险）。","p":"eocq_alt_4_19"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_20","s":"alt","m":4,"q":20,"y":"","c":"","t":"选择符合偏好的对冲基金（简答题）","n":"这是简答题，平台没有记录你的作答。考点是全球宏观策略的特点与投资者偏好的匹配，建议回到平台练习。","p":"eocq_alt_4_20"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_21","s":"alt","m":4,"q":21,"y":"","c":"","t":"波动率交易策略的实施路径（简答题）","n":"这是简答题，平台没有记录你的作答。考点是实施波动率交易的几种工具和路径，建议回到平台练习。","p":"eocq_alt_4_21"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_22","s":"alt","m":4,"q":22,"y":"","c":"","t":"多策略基金 vs 组合基金（简答题）","n":"这是简答题，平台没有记录你的作答。考点是多策略基金在资金调配效率和透明度上相对于组合基金的优势，建议回到平台练习。","p":"eocq_alt_4_22"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_23","s":"alt","m":4,"q":23,"y":"","c":"","t":"对冲基金配置比例的选择（简答题）","n":"这是简答题，平台没有记录你的作答。考点是按委员会的约束比较不同配置比例对波动率和夏普/Sortino比率的影响，建议回到平台练习。","p":"eocq_alt_4_23"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_27","s":"alt","m":4,"q":27,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"多策略基金 vs 组合基金","n":"多策略基金通常费用结构对投资者更有利、透明度更高；但一般杠杆更高、收益波动更大，所以关于方差和杠杆的说法不对。","p":"eocq_alt_4_27"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_29","s":"alt","m":4,"q":29,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"并购套利在组合中的作用","n":"并购套利是很好的不相关alpha来源，分散于多笔交易和行业还能进一步降低风险；资本结构套利是在同一公司的债和股之间做多空。","p":"eocq_alt_4_29"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_31","s":"alt","m":4,"q":31,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"用波动率对冲股票敞口","n":"股票和波动率负相关，对冲股票敞口需要做多波动率；Trade 1 是做空波动率，起不到对冲作用。","p":"eocq_alt_4_31"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_34","s":"alt","m":4,"q":34,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"股票类对冲基金的特征","n":"股票市场中性基金通常分散度高、换手率高（Statement 3 正确）；对股市的低beta是多空策略的特征，但不是它吸引人的地方。","p":"eocq_alt_4_34"},{"id":"eoc_alt_4_41","s":"alt","m":4,"q":41,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"因子敞口与市场趋势","n":"要从信用利差扩大中获益，应持有负的信用敞口；波动率上升时需要的是正（不是负）的波动率敞口。","p":"eocq_alt_4_41"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_4","s":"pm","m":1,"q":4,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"实际短期利率的决定因素","n":"实际短期利率与实际GDP增速以及GDP增速的波动率都正相关；两国实际增速相同（都是2.5%），GDP波动率更高的 Country #2 实际利率更高。","p":"eocq_pm_1_4"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_7","s":"pm","m":1,"q":7,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"衰退对收益率曲线的影响","n":"衰退时央行降息，短端利率下降，但对长端的影响较小，原本平坦的曲线会变得向上倾斜。","p":"eocq_pm_1_7"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_16","s":"pm","m":1,"q":16,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"向上倾斜曲线的一种解释","n":"短期债券在经济不好时表现更好（与“坏时期”负相关），投资者愿意为它付溢价、接受更低的回报，所以曲线向上倾斜。","p":"eocq_pm_1_16"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_17","s":"pm","m":1,"q":17,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"曲线向上倾斜不能推出利率预期","n":"曲线向上倾斜可能来自预期加息 + 正风险溢价，也可能是预期利率不变 + 正风险溢价，甚至是预期降息但风险溢价足够大，所以无法确定未来利率方向。","p":"eocq_pm_1_17"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_32","s":"pm","m":1,"q":32,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"商业地产的现值公式","n":"她对分子的描述错了：分子应是未来的租金收入；关于固定名义租金的商业租约折现率的说法是对的。","p":"eocq_pm_1_32"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_34","s":"pm","m":1,"q":34,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"通胀挂钩债券与盈亏平衡通胀率","n":"名义债券与通胀挂钩债券的收益率之差是盈亏平衡通胀率（含通胀风险溢价），Statement 2 正确；Statement 1 把它说成长短期通胀挂钩债之间的利差，不对。","p":"eocq_pm_1_34"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_39","s":"pm","m":1,"q":39,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"经济周期与企业盈利","n":"耐用品制造商的盈利随经济周期波动更大（Observation 3 正确）；理解经济周期对盈利预测、尤其是短期预测非常重要。","p":"eocq_pm_1_39"},{"id":"eoc_pm_1_46","s":"pm","m":1,"q":46,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"短期TIPS利率","n":"短期TIPS代表实际无违约利率，与GDP增速和GDP波动率都正相关；Rutherford 把波动率影响的方向说错了。","p":"eocq_pm_1_46"},{"id":"eoc_pm_2_4","s":"pm","m":2,"q":4,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"基准的选择","n":"基准里缺少很多他想投资的资产，不能代表他的投资方式（Concern 1），这是拒绝该基准最充分的理由。","p":"eocq_pm_2_4"},{"id":"eoc_pm_2_23","s":"pm","m":2,"q":23,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"转移系数（TC）","n":"TC衡量的是事前（预期）风险调整收益与风险调整后主动权重之间的相关性，不是实际收益；两位分析师都说错了。","p":"eocq_pm_2_23"},{"id":"eoc_pm_2_33","s":"pm","m":2,"q":33,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"投资约束与TC","n":"约束越少，转移系数越高，所以约束最少的是TC最高的 Manager 3；Manager 2 是IC最高，不是TC最高。","p":"eocq_pm_2_33"},{"id":"eoc_pm_2_34","s":"pm","m":2,"q":34,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"信息比率","n":"IR = 主动收益 / 主动风险；收益和主动风险最高的组合不一定IR最高，要逐个算比率。","p":"eocq_pm_2_34"},{"id":"eoc_pm_2_45","s":"pm","m":2,"q":45,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"评估主动管理人的标准","n":"在基准相同的情况下，预期信息比率是评估主动管理人的最佳单一标准。","p":"eocq_pm_2_45"},{"id":"eoc_pm_2_48","s":"pm","m":2,"q":48,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"基准选择、增值与业绩归因","n":"Barolo 对基准选择、增值计算和业绩归因的描述都正确。","p":"eocq_pm_2_48"},{"id":"eoc_pm_2_50","s":"pm","m":2,"q":50,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"主动管理基本定律中的广度","n":"广度（BR）是独立投资机会的数量，公式中取其平方根；Barolo 的 Point 3 把广度描述错了。","p":"eocq_pm_2_50"},{"id":"eoc_pm_3_4","s":"pm","m":3,"q":4,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"ETF溢价时的套利","n":"ETF价格高于盘中NAV时，授权参与人买入成分股篮子换取新的ETF份额再卖出，所以会创设新份额；赎回发生在折价的时候。","p":"eocq_pm_3_4"},{"id":"eoc_pm_3_8","s":"pm","m":3,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"ETF买卖价差的决定因素","n":"持续订单流越多价差越窄；流动性提供者的成本和风险越高价差越宽；做市商竞争越激烈价差越窄。Stosur 关于做市商竞争的说法错了。","p":"eocq_pm_3_8"},{"id":"eoc_pm_3_10","s":"pm","m":3,"q":10,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"ETF持有期总成本","n":"总成本 = 管理费按持有期折算（9/12 × 0.32%）+ 往返佣金 + 买卖价差；管理费不能按全年费率算。","p":"eocq_pm_3_10"},{"id":"eoc_pm_3_23","s":"pm","m":3,"q":23,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"ETF在组合管理中的应用","n":"战术交易通常偏好同类资产中交易量最大的ETF；ETF能提供的风险敞口种类比期货市场更丰富，不是相反。","p":"eocq_pm_3_23"},{"id":"eoc_pm_3_27","s":"pm","m":3,"q":27,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"不同类型ETF的风险","n":"Dupuis 对合成ETF风险的描述是对的；最不正确的是对ETN风险的描述（ETN的主要风险是发行人的信用风险）。","p":"eocq_pm_3_27"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_9","s":"pm","m":4,"q":9,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"宏观因子模型的预期收益","n":"宏观因子模型中的因子是“意外”，预期值为零，所以预期收益就是截距项2.58%。","p":"eocq_pm_4_9"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_10","s":"pm","m":4,"q":10,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"主动风险的来源","n":"主动风险来自组合和基准在各因子上敏感度的差异；组合虽然只对GDP有非零敏感度，但基准对其他因子也有敏感度，所以四个因子的意外都会影响主动风险。","p":"eocq_pm_4_10"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_27","s":"pm","m":4,"q":27,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"主动风险平方的因子分解","n":"用方差（不是标准差）分解，分母要包括全部组成部分（含个股特有风险），通胀风险约占25%；16/(16 + 24) 漏掉了其他部分。","p":"eocq_pm_4_27"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_28","s":"pm","m":4,"q":28,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"因子敏感度与投资者的匹配","n":"Fund D 对时间期限风险为正敏感度、对通胀风险为负敏感度；大学基金投资期限长达30年，不太在意时间期限风险，但对通胀风险敏感，所以不合适的原因是通胀风险。","p":"eocq_pm_4_28"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_29","s":"pm","m":4,"q":29,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"APT 中的因子","n":"APT既不规定因子的数量，也不规定因子的具体内容；Quek 说APT规定了因子数量，这点错了。","p":"eocq_pm_4_29"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_33","s":"pm","m":4,"q":33,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"主动收益的因子贡献","n":"每个因子的贡献 = (组合敏感度 − 基准敏感度) × 因子收益，比较各因子的贡献大小；价值因子的贡献最大，Cerra 正确。","p":"eocq_pm_4_33"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_38","s":"pm","m":4,"q":38,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"主动风险来源的解读","n":"Kwon 对各组合表现的解读都正确，例如 Gangwon 组合75%的主动风险来自选股。","p":"eocq_pm_4_38"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_41","s":"pm","m":4,"q":41,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"多因子模型的应用","n":"TIA 把证券的预期收益与所属行业指数比较来选股、构建组合，属于组合构建，不是收益或风险归因。","p":"eocq_pm_4_41"},{"id":"eoc_pm_4_49","s":"pm","m":4,"q":49,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"主动收益的分解","n":"主动收益 = Σ(组合敏感度 − 基准敏感度) × 因子收益 + 选股（残差）带来的主动收益；Wilson 对主动收益的描述最不准确，对跟踪误差分解的描述是对的。","p":"eocq_pm_4_49"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_3","s":"pm","m":5,"q":3,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"VaR的正确表述","n":"VaR表示在5%的交易日里，损失至少为650万；“95%的时间损失不超过650万”暗含95%的日子都有损失，表述不准确。","p":"eocq_pm_5_3"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_7","s":"pm","m":5,"q":7,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"VaR零突破却大额亏损","n":"过去一年的市场波动低于回溯期，VaR被高估；组合可能每天都在VaR限额以内，却天天接近限额地亏损。这是VaR对波动率环境变化的局限。","p":"eocq_pm_5_7"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_8","s":"pm","m":5,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"历史情景模拟的输入","n":"模拟金融危机对现有债券组合的影响，应使用期限相近债券的历史收益率，而不是历史价格，因为决定债券定价的主要是收益率。","p":"eocq_pm_5_8"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_10","s":"pm","m":5,"q":10,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"盈余风险（Surplus at Risk）","n":"盈余风险是VaR的一种应用，估计在给定置信水平下（通常一年）资产可能落后负债多少。","p":"eocq_pm_5_10"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_12","s":"pm","m":5,"q":12,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"压力测试与完全重估","n":"信用利差极端变化的压力测试中，敏感度指标（线性近似）不准确，应对证券做完全重估。","p":"eocq_pm_5_12"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_16","s":"pm","m":5,"q":16,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"VaR的局限","n":"VaR只关注左尾损失，忽略了右尾的潜在收益；VaR被视为前瞻性指标，不像夏普比率那样是回顾性的。","p":"eocq_pm_5_16"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_26","s":"pm","m":5,"q":26,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"固定收益组合的风险指标","n":"组合的固定收益敞口很大，久期是固收投资最主要的敏感度指标，应补充考察。","p":"eocq_pm_5_26"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_27","s":"pm","m":5,"q":27,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"VaR的含义","n":"VaR衡量的是最小预期损失（在给定概率下损失至少是多少），不是最大损失，所以 Statement 1 正确；VaR衡量的是损失，不是组合波动率。","p":"eocq_pm_5_27"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_30","s":"pm","m":5,"q":30,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"Gamma 的含义","n":"Gamma 是delta随标的价格变化的变化率（二阶导数），不反映波动率的变化；反映波动率敏感度的是vega。Flaherty 对gamma的说法错了。","p":"eocq_pm_5_30"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_32","s":"pm","m":5,"q":32,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"尾部风险与资本要求","n":"做多信用、同时卖出保险和期权收取权利金的另类收益策略有显著的尾部风险和潜在资本要求；只买期权的策略最大损失有限。","p":"eocq_pm_5_32"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_36","s":"pm","m":5,"q":36,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"相对VaR","n":"衡量相对基准的落后程度用事前跟踪误差（即相对VaR）；盈余风险是养老金衡量资产落后负债的指标。","p":"eocq_pm_5_36"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_41","s":"pm","m":5,"q":41,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"风险管理政策的类型","n":"5天、1%、1000万的VaR限额属于风险预算；政策中没有情景限额（对特定情景下的估计损失设上限）。","p":"eocq_pm_5_41"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_42","s":"pm","m":5,"q":42,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"VaR是最小损失","n":"VaR表示的是最小损失，不能说这项政策会把5天损失限制在2%（1000万 / 5亿）以内，实际最大损失可能大得多；VaR可以用金额或百分比表示。","p":"eocq_pm_5_42"},{"id":"eoc_pm_5_47","s":"pm","m":5,"q":47,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"不同机构的风险度量重点","n":"银行的风险度量关注流动性、偿付能力和资本充足；传统资产管理人关注投资表现（如事前跟踪误差）。Hextall 的说法正确。","p":"eocq_pm_5_47"},{"id":"eoc_pm_6_13","s":"pm","m":6,"q":13,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"蒙特卡洛模拟中的相关性","n":"九个因子里有六个相互相关，不能对每个因子单独建模，应设定多元分布同时模拟。","p":"eocq_pm_6_13"},{"id":"eoc_pm_6_18","s":"pm","m":6,"q":18,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"收益分布的形状","n":"分布更平坦意味着尾部更厚、极端结果更多、标准差更高，而不是极端结果更少。","p":"eocq_pm_6_18"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_1_6","s":"ethics","m":1,"q":6,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"III(C) 适当性","n":"处于顾问关系时，必须结合客户的整体组合来判断投资是否适当；“客户利益优先于自身利益”属于 III(A) 忠诚、审慎与谨慎。","p":"eocq_ethics_1_6"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_1_8","s":"ethics","m":1,"q":8,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"IV(A) 对雇主的忠诚","n":"不得在与雇佣相关的事务上剥夺雇主利用其技能和能力的权利；不接受影响独立性的礼物属于 I(B)。","p":"eocq_ethics_1_8"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_1_9","s":"ethics","m":1,"q":9,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"V(B) 与客户的沟通","n":"必须在投资分析和建议中区分事实与观点；确保业绩展示公平、准确、完整属于 III(D)。","p":"eocq_ethics_1_9"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_1","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":1,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"判断是否违规：无违规","n":"第一个情境里没有违规的证据，会议前的讨论本身不构成违规。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_1"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_3","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":3,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"V(B) 简略形式的建议","n":"Policy 2 关于在社交媒体中使用简略版建议的做法不完全符合 V(B)（使用简略形式时，应让客户能获得完整的分析和背景信息）；Policy 1 和 Policy 3 都符合 V(B)。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_3"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_5","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":5,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"VII(A) CFA项目参与者的行为","n":"两人透露的考试相关信息都不属于保密的CFA项目信息，所以都没有违规。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_5"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_6","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":6,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"III(D) 业绩展示","n":"他只是根据对类似投资的研究陈述了历史回报，最相关的是业绩展示准则；他并没有了解双胞胎的投资目标和约束，谈不上符合适当性。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_6"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_8","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":8,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"VI(A) 利益冲突披露","n":"他与 Wilder 的关系不需要披露，所以没有违反 VI(A)；但他违反了 I(A) 法律知识（必须理解并遵守所有适用的法律法规）。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_8"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_20","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":20,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"薪酬安排是否违规","n":"O’Connor 关于年终奖金池和兼职分析师政策的做法都没有违反准则。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_20"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_23","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":23,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"III(B) 公平对待","n":"Kostecka 最不可能违反的是公平对待；他违反的是 V(B)（例如没有区分事实与观点）。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_23"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_30","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":30,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"III(B) 公平对待的推荐程序","n":"大宗交易中所有参与账户获得相同成交价和佣金率等建议，都符合公平对待的推荐程序。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_30"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_35","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":35,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"I(B) 接受礼品","n":"按题中情境，接受这六份礼品不会危及他的独立性和客观性，所以不违规。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_35"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_41","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":41,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"IV(C) 监督者的责任","n":"Recommendation 1 不足以满足监督者责任的要求（监督者必须采取合理措施防止和发现违规）；其他建议是充分的。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_41"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_44","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":44,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"VI(B) 交易优先级的推荐程序","n":"按推荐程序，公司应向客户披露其员工个人交易政策（至少在客户要求时提供）；Northside 把这套政策保密，不符合推荐程序。IPO限制是符合推荐程序的。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_44"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_45","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":45,"y":"C","c":"B","t":"VI(B) vs III(E)","n":"LaRue 违反了 III(E) 保密（泄露了客户信息），但没有违反 VI(B) 交易优先级。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_45"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_48","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":48,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"收到投诉后的正确做法","n":"最佳做法是先咨询公司的证券律师；通知当地CFA协会不是最好的选择。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_48"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_49","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":49,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"IV(A) 对雇主的忠诚","n":"Ong 有责任保护所在公司及合伙人的利益，在承接可能与公司竞争的项目前，应先与合伙人沟通。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_49"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_51","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":51,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"维护市场诚信","n":"应要求服务提供商在交易时优先考虑投资者的利益；要求所有重大信息24小时内公开反而可能损害投资者（并非所有重大信息都应公开）。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_51"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_52","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":52,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"I(C) 与 Standard V","n":"Ngyue 同时违反了 Standard I（例如遗漏关键人员信息，构成 I(C) 虚假陈述）和 Standard V。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_52"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_55","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":55,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"I(A) 法律知识","n":"新法规必须在政府规定的期限内落实，只做年度审查可能来不及；应建立能及时获取法规变化信息的程序。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_55"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_56","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":56,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"III(B) 公平对待","n":"Policy 2 规定以员工为受益人的客户账户不与其他客户账户同时交易，会使这些客户处于不利地位，违反公平对待。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_56"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_57","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":57,"y":"C","c":"A","t":"判断是否违规：无违规","n":"按题中信息，Duffy 在午餐会上没有违反任何准则，包括对雇主的义务。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_57"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_59","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":59,"y":"A","c":"C","t":"IV(A) 和 I(B) 同时违反","n":"Tilton 与 Duffy 达成互利安排、每天给她提供评论，违反 IV(A) 忠诚；同时也违反了 I(B) 独立性与客观性。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_59"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_61","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":61,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"I(A) 法律知识","n":"那条评论不正确，不能用 Standard I(A) 来支持它的说法。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_61"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_62","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":62,"y":"B","c":"A","t":"III(E) 保密","n":"Kovi 说出了正在被监管机构调查的人的名字，违反 III(E) 保密；Merin 定期查看CFA官网的处分信息并不违规。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_62"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_66","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":66,"y":"B","c":"C","t":"III(C) 适当性","n":"他对 Montfill 的情况做了合理了解，但在还没收到HR部门问卷回复、信息不全时就给出资产配置建议，违反适当性。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_66"},{"id":"eoc_ethics_2_67","s":"ethics","m":2,"q":67,"y":"A","c":"B","t":"VI(C) 推荐费","n":"他会在建议书中披露推荐费安排，所以最不可能违反 VI(C)；但如果声称在所有国家都有直接经验，就是不诚实，属于不当行为。","p":"eocq_ethics_2_67"}],"questions":[{"id":"eocq_quant_2_6","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Priya Nair regresses annual stock returns of 80 retailers on inventory days (X1) and net debt-to-EBITDA (X2). Based on theory, she expects returns to be negatively related to leverage and wants to test whether the evidence supports that expectation. The most appropriate null and alternative hypotheses for the coefficient on X2 are:","options":{"A":"H0: b2 = 0 versus Ha: b2 ≠ 0.","B":"H0: b2 ≤ 0 versus Ha: b2 > 0.","C":"H0: b2 ≥ 0 versus Ha: b2 < 0."},"answer":"C","explanation":"要检验“预期为负”这一方向性判断，应做单尾检验：把希望证明的结论（b2 < 0）放在备择假设，把相反方向（含等号）放在原假设，即 H0: b2 ≥ 0 vs Ha: b2 < 0。t 统计量显著为负（小于左尾临界值）才拒绝 H0。\n· H0: b2 = 0 vs Ha: b2 ≠ 0：这是双尾检验的写法，只检验是否显著不为零，不体现预期方向。\n· H0: b2 ≤ 0 vs Ha: b2 > 0：方向写反了，这是检验正相关时的设定。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_2_7","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst estimates ROA (in %) = b0 + 1.25 × ln(Total assets, $ billions) + b2 × Asset turnover. Firm X has total assets of $8 billion and Firm Y has $2 billion; their asset turnover ratios are identical. The model's predicted difference between Firm X's and Firm Y's ROA is closest to:","options":{"A":"1.73 percentage points","B":"2.24 percentage points","C":"7.50 percentage points"},"answer":"A","explanation":"其他自变量相同，ROA 之差 = 斜率 × 自变量之差。自变量是 ln(资产)，所以：\nΔROA = 1.25 × [ln(8) − ln(2)] = 1.25 × ln(8/2) = 1.25 × 1.3863 = 1.73 个百分点\n· 7.50：直接用资产的算术差 6 乘系数，忽略了自变量是对数形式。\n· 2.24：取了算术差的对数 ln(6)，而对数之差应是 ln(比值)。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_2_8","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A portfolio manager regresses monthly portfolio excess returns on three factors: market excess return, a value factor, and a momentum factor. She expects each factor to be positively related to portfolio excess returns and wants to test each expectation separately. The most appropriate hypotheses for each factor coefficient bj are:","options":{"A":"H0: bj ≤ 0 versus Ha: bj > 0.","B":"H0: b1 = b2 = b3 = 0 versus Ha: at least one bj ≠ 0.","C":"H0: bj ≥ 0 versus Ha: bj < 0."},"answer":"A","explanation":"对每个因子分别检验“正相关”的预期，应设单尾检验：H0: bj ≤ 0 vs Ha: bj > 0，t 值显著为正时拒绝 H0。\n· H0: bj ≥ 0 vs Ha: bj < 0：方向写反了，是检验负相关的设定。\n· H0: b1 = b2 = b3 = 0：这是 F 检验的联合原假设，检验整体显著性，不能逐个检验系数的方向。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_2_13","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A regression of quarterly fund returns on 4 independent variables uses 50 observations. The ANOVA output shows:\n| Source | Sum of squares |\n| Regression | 0.0186 |\n| Residual | 0.0310 |\n| Total | 0.0496 |\nThe F-statistic for the test of overall significance is closest to:","options":{"A":"6.75","B":"18.00","C":"27.00"},"answer":"A","explanation":"F = MSR / MSE = (RSS / k) ÷ [SSE / (n − k − 1)]\nMSR = 0.0186 / 4 = 0.004650\nMSE = 0.031 / (50 − 4 − 1) = 0.000689\nF = 0.004650 / 0.000689 = 6.75\n· 18.00：分子用了总平方和 SST，应使用回归平方和 RSS。\n· 27.00：回归平方和没有除以自变量个数 k。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_3_2","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Marco Ruiz regresses a company's quarterly sales growth on its own value lagged one quarter and on quarterly GDP growth. The Breusch–Godfrey test statistic exceeds the critical value at the 5% level. The most likely consequence is that:","options":{"A":"the coefficient estimates remain consistent, and only the standard errors are understated.","B":"the coefficient estimates are inconsistent, and the standard errors are unreliable.","C":"neither the coefficients nor the standard errors are affected, because the BG test detects heteroskedasticity rather than serial correlation."},"answer":"B","explanation":"BG 统计量超过临界值 → 拒绝“无序列相关”的原假设，残差存在序列相关。由于自变量中含有因变量的滞后项，滞后项与相关的误差项相关，系数估计不一致（无效）；同时标准误被低估、t 值被高估，统计推断也不可靠。\n· 系数仍一致、只有标准误偏低：这只适用于自变量中没有因变量滞后项的情形，本题含滞后因变量。\n· BG 检验的是序列相关，不是异方差（异方差用 BP 检验）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_4_4","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst regresses a portfolio's monthly returns over 10 years on 11 monthly dummy variables (December omitted). Results: R² = 0.09, adjusted R² = −0.01, the p-value of the F-statistic is 0.47, and none of the dummy coefficients is significant at the 5% level (the largest, for January, has a t-statistic of 1.31). The analyst's best conclusion is that the portfolio's returns:","options":{"A":"show little evidence of monthly seasonality.","B":"show a significant January effect, because January has the largest dummy coefficient.","C":"show strong monthly seasonality, because all 11 monthly dummies are included and R² is positive."},"answer":"A","explanation":"判断季节性要看虚拟变量整体和个别的显著性：F 检验 p 值 0.47 不显著，调整 R² 为负，11 个月份虚拟变量都不显著，说明各月平均收益与 12 月无显著差异，存在月度季节性的可能性很低。\n· R² 为正只是因为加入了 11 个变量，调整 R² 为负说明解释力甚至不足以弥补自由度损失，不能证明季节性。\n· 1 月系数最大但 t = 1.31 不显著，系数大小本身不代表显著。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 4 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_4_9","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A logistic regression estimates the probability that a firm is acquired within a year: ln[p/(1 − p)] = -3.10 + 0.05 × P/E -0.85 × Leverage. The sample means are P/E = 18 and Leverage = 0.60. Holding leverage at its mean, the change in the estimated probability of acquisition when P/E rises from 18 to 19 is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.30%","B":"5.00%","C":"5.13%"},"answer":"A","explanation":"逻辑回归系数是对数几率的变化，不是概率的变化，必须分别代入计算概率：\nz(P/E=18) = –3.1 + 0.05 × 18 + (–0.85) × 0.6 = –2.7100 → p = 1/(1 + e^2.7100) = 0.0624\nz(P/E=19) = –2.6600 → p = 0.0654\nΔp = 0.0654 − 0.0624 = 0.30%\n· 5.00%：把系数直接当成概率变化。\n· 5.13%：e^b − 1 是几率（odds）的变化率，不是概率的变化。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_4_11","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Two logistic regression models are estimated on the same sample to predict whether a bond is downgraded. Model A has a log-likelihood of -612.35 and Model B has a log-likelihood of -608.92. Based only on this information, which model fits the data better?","options":{"A":"Model A, because the log-likelihood behaves like the sum of squared errors, so a lower value indicates a better fit.","B":"Model B, because its log-likelihood is higher (closer to zero).","C":"Model A, because its log-likelihood has the larger absolute value."},"answer":"B","explanation":"对数似然值总是 ≤ 0，越大（越接近 0）说明模型给观测数据赋予的概率越高，拟合越好。–608.92 > –612.35，所以 Model B 更好。\n· 绝对值更大意味着对数似然更小（更负），拟合更差。\n· 对数似然不是误差平方和，方向正好相反：越大越好。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_5_1","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst fits a linear trend model to 120 months of a company's share price (t = 1 to 120): ŷt = 45.20 + 0.35t. Using the model, the forecast of the share price two months after the end of the sample is closest to:","options":{"A":"$87.20","B":"$87.55","C":"$87.90"},"answer":"C","explanation":"样本最后一期是 t = 120，样本外第 2 个月对应 t = 122：\nŷ = 45.2 + 0.35 × 122 = 87.90\n· 87.55：用了 t = 121，这只是样本外第 1 个月。\n· 87.20：用了 t = 120，是样本最后一期的拟合值，不是预测。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 1 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_5_2","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A log-linear trend model is estimated on 96 quarters of a firm's sales (t = 1 to 96): ln(Sales_t) = 2.850 + 0.012t, with sales in $ millions. The forecast of sales for the first quarter after the sample is closest to:","options":{"A":"$4.01 million","B":"$55.37 million","C":"$56.04 million"},"answer":"B","explanation":"样本外第 1 季度 t = 97：\nln ŷ = 2.85 + 0.012 × 97 = 4.0140\nŷ = e^4.0140 = 55.37\n· 4.01：只算到了 ln(销售额)，没有取指数还原。\n· 56.04：用了 t = 98，期数取错了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_5_6","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An AR(1) model is estimated with 144 monthly observations. The first four autocorrelations of the residuals are:\n| Lag | Autocorrelation |\n| 1 | 0.050 |\n| 2 | -0.190 |\n| 3 | 0.120 |\n| 4 | 0.215 |\nUsing a critical t-value of 1.98, the number of residual autocorrelations that are statistically significant, and the implication for the model, is:","options":{"A":"0 lags significant; the AR(1) model is correctly specified.","B":"2 lags significant; the AR(1) model is misspecified.","C":"4 lags significant; the AR(1) model is misspecified."},"answer":"B","explanation":"残差自相关的标准误 = 1/√T = 1/√144 = 0.0833\nt = 自相关 / 标准误：lag1 = 0.60，lag2 = –2.28，lag3 = 1.44，lag4 = 2.58\n|t| > 1.98 的有 2 个，残差存在序列相关，AR(1) 模型设定有误（可考虑加入更多滞后项或季节滞后）。\n· 4 个：标准误用了 1/T 而不是 1/√T，t 值被放大，所有滞后都显得显著。\n· 0 个：直接用自相关系数与 t 临界值比较，没有除以标准误。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_5_29","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"To investigate a commodity price series x_t, an analyst estimates Δx_t = b0 + b1Δx_(t−1) + ε_t, where Δx_t = x_t − x_(t−1). Neither b0 nor b1 is significantly different from zero, and the residuals show no significant autocorrelation. The analyst should most likely conclude that the original series x_t:","options":{"A":"is a random walk with a drift, because it had to be first-differenced.","B":"is a random walk with a unit root and is not covariance stationary.","C":"is covariance stationary, because the residuals of the differenced model are uncorrelated."},"answer":"B","explanation":"差分后的序列 Δx_t 截距、斜率都不显著且误差无序列相关，说明 Δx_t 只是白噪声：x_t = x_(t−1) + ε_t，即原序列是（无漂移的）随机游走，有单位根，不是协方差平稳的；差分后的序列才是平稳的，可以用来建模。\n· 残差不相关只说明差分后的模型设定合理，原序列 x_t 本身仍不平稳。\n· 有漂移的随机游走要求截距 b0 显著不为零，本题 b0 不显著。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_5_34","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst regresses each company's sales (y) on industry sales (x) and runs Dickey–Fuller and Engle–Granger tests:\n| Company | y has unit root? | x has unit root? | Cointegrated? |\n| Alder | Yes | No | — |\n| Birch | Yes | Yes | No |\n| Cedar | Yes | Yes | Yes |\nFor which company can the regression coefficients most reliably be used to estimate the long-term relationship between y and x?","options":{"A":"Birch","B":"Cedar","C":"Alder"},"answer":"B","explanation":"两个序列都有单位根但彼此协整时，存在长期均衡关系，回归残差平稳，系数可以解释长期关系 → Cedar。\n· Alder：只有一个序列有单位根，回归结果不可靠（伪回归风险）。\n· Birch：两个都有单位根但不协整，残差不平稳，回归是伪回归，系数无意义。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_5_69","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Dickey–Fuller tests indicate that a currency's daily exchange rate follows a random walk without drift. An analyst nevertheless estimated an AR(1) model, x_t = 0.05 + 0.97x_(t−1). The rate today is 1.82, and its sample mean is 1.40. The best forecast of tomorrow's exchange rate is:","options":{"A":"1.40, the sample mean.","B":"1.82, today's value.","C":"1.67, the mean-reverting level implied by the AR(1) estimates."},"answer":"B","explanation":"随机游走 x_t = x_(t−1) + ε_t，误差期望为 0，所以下一期的最佳预测就是当期值 1.82。\n· 1.67：b0/(1 − b1) 是协方差平稳 AR(1) 的均值回归水平；随机游走 b1 = 1，没有有限的均值回归水平，不能用 AR(1) 估计。\n· 1.40：随机游走不平稳，没有固定均值，样本均值不能作为预测。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 69 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_2","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A data scientist is choosing techniques to reduce overfitting in models that predict corporate bond spreads. Which of the following is least appropriate as a regularization technique?","options":{"A":"A LASSO regression with the penalty parameter λ set to zero","B":"A LASSO regression with λ selected by cross-validation","C":"Pruning a classification and regression tree"},"answer":"A","explanation":"LASSO 的目标函数 = SSE + λ × Σ|b|。λ = 0 时惩罚项消失，模型等同于 OLS，没有任何正则化效果，所以最不合适。\n· 剪枝通过删除对分类贡献小的节点来降低模型复杂度，本身就是一种正则化。\n· 交叉验证选出的正 λ 会压缩甚至剔除部分系数，是标准的正则化做法。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_7","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A credit model has an in-sample error rate of 2% but a validation-sample error rate of 24%. Which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"The model exhibits low bias and high variance error; adding a penalty term to the objective function would help.","B":"The model exhibits high bias and low variance error, indicating it is underfit.","C":"The model is overfit because a penalty term was added to its objective function."},"answer":"A","explanation":"训练集误差很低、验证集误差很高 → 低偏差、高方差 → 过拟合，模型学到了训练数据中的噪声，难以推广。正则化（在目标函数中加入惩罚项）通过限制复杂度来减少过拟合。\n· 高偏差、低方差是欠拟合的特征，训练误差本身就会很高。\n· 惩罚项是减少过拟合的手段，不会导致过拟合。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_14","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst building a model to forecast earnings surprises has 60 candidate features, many of which are highly correlated with one another. The technique most appropriate for addressing this issue is:","options":{"A":"k-means clustering.","B":"ensemble learning.","C":"principal components analysis."},"answer":"C","explanation":"特征之间高度相关时，用主成分分析（PCA）把它们转换成少数几个互不相关的主成分，实现降维。\n· 集成学习是把多个模型的预测组合起来提高准确率，不处理特征间的相关性。\n· k-means 是把观测值分组的聚类方法，不是对特征降维。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_15","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A colleague proposes using a support vector machine (SVM) to predict each firm's enterprise value-to-EBITDA multiple, a continuous variable, from 15 financial features. The proposal is most likely inappropriate because:","options":{"A":"an SVM is an unsupervised algorithm and cannot use labeled data.","B":"an SVM is a linear classifier suited to a categorical (binary) target, whereas the target here is continuous.","C":"an SVM cannot be applied when there are more than two features."},"answer":"B","explanation":"SVM 是监督学习中的线性分类器，寻找把两类样本分开的最大间隔超平面，目标变量应是分类变量（通常为二元）。EV/EBITDA 是连续变量，属于回归问题，所以问题出在目标变量类型。\n· SVM 是监督学习，需要带标签的数据。\n· SVM 可以处理多维特征（在 n 维空间中找超平面），特征数不是问题。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_18","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement best describes k-fold cross-validation?","options":{"A":"A single fixed validation sample is held out, and the model is retrained k times on different subsets of the training data.","B":"The test sample is split into k parts so that the final out-of-sample error can be estimated k times.","C":"The training and validation data are combined and randomly split into k parts; in each of k rounds, a different part serves as the validation sample and the remaining k − 1 parts are used for training."},"answer":"C","explanation":"k 折交叉验证：把训练集与验证集合并、随机打乱后分成 k 份，每轮用其中 1 份做验证、k − 1 份训练，共 k 轮，每份都轮流当一次验证集，最后取 k 次验证误差的平均值，以降低样本划分带来的偏差。\n· 只用一个固定验证集与 k 折交叉验证的本质（需要 k 个不同的验证样本）相矛盾。\n· 测试集要留到最后评估一次，不参与交叉验证。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_24","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A bank builds a model to predict whether a credit card customer will close the account in the next year. The data set includes Churn_Flag (1 = closed, 0 = open), Tenure_Months, Monthly_Spend, and Num_Complaints. In this model, Churn_Flag is best described as the:","options":{"A":"feature.","B":"hyperparameter.","C":"target variable."},"answer":"C","explanation":"模型要预测的变量就是目标变量（target，即因变量/标签）：Churn_Flag。\n· 特征（feature）是用来解释和预测目标的自变量，如 Tenure_Months、Monthly_Spend 等。\n· 超参数是建模前由研究者设定的参数（如树的深度、k 值），不是数据中的变量。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 24 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_25","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A lender currently uses a k-nearest neighbor (KNN) model to classify loan applicants as 'approve' or 'decline'. Management now wants a model that outputs each applicant's estimated probability of default, and a large set of historical loans labeled as defaulted or not is available. The most appropriate choice is:","options":{"A":"the existing KNN model, because it already uses labeled data to classify applicants.","B":"k-means clustering, because it groups applicants with similar characteristics.","C":"a supervised learning model that can produce a continuous output, such as a random forest."},"answer":"C","explanation":"需求变了：要输出的是违约概率（连续值），而且有带标签的历史数据，所以应选能输出连续值的监督学习模型，如随机森林（可输出各类别的概率估计）。\n· 现有 KNN 用于分类，输出的是“批准/拒绝”这样的类别，不是题目要求的概率。\n· k-means 是无监督学习，不使用标签，也不能直接给出违约概率。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 25 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_6_26","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A chart of a classification model's decision boundary shows a highly irregular, jagged boundary that correctly separates every observation in the training data, including several apparent outliers. The model is most likely:","options":{"A":"a good fit, because it achieves zero in-sample error.","B":"underfit, because the boundary is not a straight line.","C":"overfit, and likely to generalize poorly to new data."},"answer":"C","explanation":"边界极不规则、把训练集每个点（包括离群点）都分对，说明模型把噪声当成了规律 → 过拟合，样本外预测能力差。\n· 欠拟合表现为边界过于简单，训练误差本身就较高。\n· 样本内误差为零恰恰是过拟合的信号，不代表能推广到新数据。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_7_5","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"During data preparation, an analyst creates a new variable, Years_Since_Founding, from each company's existing Founding_Date variable. This transformation is best described as:","options":{"A":"aggregation.","B":"extraction.","C":"conversion."},"answer":"B","explanation":"从已有变量中提取/计算出新变量（由成立日期算出成立年数）属于 extraction。\n· Aggregation 是把两个或多个相关变量合并成一个变量。\n· Conversion 是把变量转换为合适的数据类型（如把文本转为数值、把类别变量转为编码）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 7 第 5 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_7_7","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst is cleansing the sentence: \"Q3 margin rose 4.2% to $1.8 billion?\" taken from earnings call transcripts. The most appropriate treatment of punctuation is to:","options":{"A":"remove all punctuation, including % and $, because punctuation carries no information.","B":"keep all punctuation unchanged and remove stop words at this stage instead.","C":"remove most punctuation but replace meaningful symbols such as % and $ with annotation tokens (e.g., /percentSign/, /dollarSign/)."},"answer":"C","explanation":"文本清洗时，多数标点可以删除；但 %、$、问号等对分析有意义的符号应替换成标注 token 保留下来，不能一律删除。\n· 一律删除会丢失百分比、货币等有用信息。\n· 停用词是在文本整理（wrangling/预处理）阶段去除的，而且标点本身也需要处理，不能全部保留。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 7 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_7_11","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"During exploratory analysis of a text corpus for sentiment classification, an analyst wants to prune noisy tokens from the vocabulary. The tokens most likely to be removed are those with:","options":{"A":"the highest chi-square statistics with respect to the sentiment classes.","B":"very high and very low term frequency across the corpus.","C":"mid-range term frequency across the corpus."},"answer":"B","explanation":"噪声特征主要集中在词频分布的两端：极高频词（类似停用词，在各类文档中都出现）和极低频词（稀有词，难以泛化），按 TF 剔除两端。\n· 卡方统计量用于特征选择，卡方值高说明该词与类别关联强，应保留而不是删除。\n· 中等词频的词通常最具区分度，是要保留的。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 7 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_7_32","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following steps is least likely to be performed during the text cleansing stage of a text-based big data project?","options":{"A":"Replacing numbers with a /number/ token","B":"Removing stop words","C":"Removing HTML tags"},"answer":"B","explanation":"文本清洗（cleansing）处理原始文本：去除 HTML 标签、多数标点、多余空格，把数字替换为 /number/ 等。去除停用词、词干提取、小写化等属于文本整理（wrangling/预处理）阶段，在 token 化之后进行。\n· 去除 HTML 标签：是清洗阶段的典型步骤。\n· 数字替换为 /number/：也是清洗阶段的步骤。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 7 第 32 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_7_34","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A default classification model labels a borrower as 'default' if the predicted probability of default exceeds 0.55. For a particular borrower, the predicted probability is 0.38, and the borrower subsequently defaults. This outcome is best described as a:","options":{"A":"Type I error (false positive).","B":"true negative.","C":"Type II error (false negative)."},"answer":"C","explanation":"预测概率 0.38 低于阈值 0.55，模型预测“不违约”（negative），但实际违约（positive）→ 假阴性 = Type II error。\n· Type I error 是假阳性：模型预测违约但实际未违约。\n· 真阴性要求预测不违约且实际也未违约。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 7 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_7_35","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A fraud detection model produces the following confusion matrix on 1,000 validation observations, in which fraud cases are a small minority:\n| | Actual fraud | Actual not fraud |\n| Predicted fraud | 180 | 25 |\n| Predicted not fraud | 40 | 755 |\nGiven the unequal class distribution, the most appropriate overall performance measure is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.85 (F1 score)","B":"0.88 (precision)","C":"0.94 (accuracy)"},"answer":"A","explanation":"精确率 P = TP/(TP + FP) = 180/205 = 0.8780\n召回率 R = TP/(TP + FN) = 180/220 = 0.8182\nF1 = 2PR/(P + R) = 0.85\n类别不平衡时，accuracy 会被数量多的负类主导，F1 兼顾精确率和召回率，更合适。\n· 0.94：accuracy = (TP + TN)/N，在类别不平衡时会高估模型表现。\n· 0.88：精确率只反映一个方面，没有考虑漏判（FN）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 7 第 35 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_quant_7_38","subject":"EOC · 数量 Quantitative Methods","subjectKey":"eoc_quant","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst converts a categorical feature, Sector, which takes 11 possible values, into 11 separate binary (0/1) variables so that it can be used by a machine learning model. This technique is called:","options":{"A":"named entity recognition.","B":"tokenization.","C":"one-hot encoding."},"answer":"C","explanation":"把一个多取值的类别变量拆成多个 0/1 虚拟变量，就是 one-hot encoding。\n· NER（命名实体识别）是识别文本中的人名、机构、地点等实体。\n· Tokenization 是把文本切分成单词/词元（token）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 7 第 38 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_10","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The NOK/EUR spot rate is 11.5200 and the one-year forward points are +210 (forward rate 11.5410). Assuming covered interest rate parity holds, which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"The EUR interest rate is lower than the NOK interest rate.","B":"The NOK trades at a forward premium, so the NOK interest rate is lower than the EUR interest rate.","C":"The EUR interest rate is higher than the NOK interest rate, because the EUR trades at a forward premium."},"answer":"A","explanation":"NOK/EUR 中 NOK 是计价货币、EUR 是基础货币。抛补利率平价：F = S × (1 + i_NOK)/(1 + i_EUR)。\n远期点为正，F = 11.5410 > S = 11.5200，说明 (1 + i_NOK)/(1 + i_EUR) > 1，即 i_EUR < i_NOK。EUR 远期升水，正是为了抵消 EUR 较低的利率。\n· EUR 远期升水对应的是 EUR 利率更低，而不是更高；高息货币远期贴水。\n· 远期点为正说明基础货币 EUR 升水、NOK 贴水，不是 NOK 升水。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_18","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A country with a floating exchange rate runs persistently large fiscal deficits financed by issuing government bonds. According to the portfolio balance approach, the long-run effect on its currency is most likely to:","options":{"A":"depreciate, because the rising stock of government debt leads global investors to demand higher returns or sell the country's assets.","B":"appreciate, because higher real interest rates attract sustained capital inflows.","C":"depreciate, because the fiscal expansion immediately lowers domestic interest rates."},"answer":"A","explanation":"资产组合平衡法（长期）：持续财政赤字靠发债融资，政府债务不断累积，全球投资者持有该国资产比例过高、担心可持续性，会要求更高回报或抛售，最终导致货币贬值。触发因素是政府债务增加。\n· 实际利率上升吸引资本流入、货币升值是 Mundell–Fleming 模型的短期结论，不是长期影响。\n· 扩张性财政推高而不是压低利率，而且这条理由与资产组合平衡机制无关。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_20","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst monitors an emerging market for signs of an impending currency crisis. Which of the following conditions is least likely to be observed in the period leading up to such a crisis?","options":{"A":"A real exchange rate substantially above its average during tranquil periods","B":"A sharp increase in foreign exchange reserves","C":"Rapid growth in broad money relative to bank reserves"},"answer":"B","explanation":"货币危机的典型前兆：外汇储备大幅下降、实际汇率显著高于平稳期均值（本币高估）、广义货币增速上升、通胀上升、贸易条件恶化、资本流入激增后逆转等。外汇储备大幅增加与危机前的表现相反，最不可能出现。\n· 实际汇率高于平稳期均值：本币高估，是危机前常见信号。\n· 广义货币增长加快：也是常见预警信号。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 20 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_21","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A country runs current account deficits year after year, causing its net external liabilities to grow steadily. Eventually, its real exchange rate must fall substantially so that the external debt burden becomes sustainable, and this adjustment pins down the long-run equilibrium exchange rate. This mechanism is best described as the:","options":{"A":"flow supply/demand channel.","B":"debt sustainability channel.","C":"portfolio balance channel."},"answer":"B","explanation":"债务可持续性渠道：持续经常账户逆差使外债不断累积，债务到一定程度后货币必须大幅（实际）贬值，以缩小逆差、恢复债务可持续，这决定了长期均衡汇率。\n· 资产组合平衡渠道强调财富从逆差国转移到顺差国，投资者组合中逆差国资产占比过高后要求更高回报或减持。\n· 流量供求渠道讲的是进出口带来的外汇供求变化。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 21 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_23","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The CHF/AUD spot rate is 0.5850. One-year interest rates are 1.0% for the CHF and 4.1% for the AUD. If uncovered interest rate parity holds, the expected CHF/AUD spot rate in one year is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.5676","B":"0.5850","C":"0.6030"},"answer":"A","explanation":"UIP 成立时预期即期汇率 = 远期汇率 = S × (1 + i_计价)/(1 + i_基础)。CHF/AUD 中 CHF 是计价货币（分子），AUD 是基础货币（分母）：\nE(S) = 0.585 × 1.010/1.041 = 0.5676\n高息货币 AUD 预期贬值。\n· 0.6030：分子分母写反了，相当于预期高息货币升值。\n· 0.5850：假设汇率不变（随机游走），与 UIP 不符。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_26","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The USD/EUR spot rate is quoted at 1.0842/1.0846. The 90-day interest rates (actual/360) are 4.30% for the USD and 2.60% for the EUR. The 90-day forward points (in pips, based on the spot mid-rate) are closest to:","options":{"A":"+45.6","B":"+45.8","C":"+46.1"},"answer":"B","explanation":"S_mid = (1.0842 + 1.0846)/2 = 1.0844\n远期点 = S_mid × (i_P − i_B) × (天数/360) ÷ (1 + i_B × 天数/360)\n= 1.0844 × (0.043 − 0.026) × 90/360 ÷ (1 + 0.026 × 90/360) = 0.004579 → +45.8 点\n· +46.1：漏了分母 (1 + i_B × 天数/360)。\n· +45.6：分母用了计价货币 USD 的利率，应该用基础货币 EUR 的利率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_36","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ninety days ago, an exporter sold EUR 10 million forward for 180-day delivery at USD/EUR 1.0950. Today the USD/EUR spot rate is 1.0780/1.0782, the 90-day forward points are +18.0/+19.5 pips, and the 90-day USD interest rate is 4.20% (actual/360). The mark-to-market value of the exporter's forward position is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD 146,957","B":"USD 150,421","C":"USD 166,254"},"answer":"A","explanation":"卖出 EUR 远期的头寸要通过买入同一到期日的 EUR 远期来对冲，买入要付 offer 价：\n对冲远期价 = 1.0782 + 19.5/10,000 = 1.08015\n到期净现金流 = (1.095 − 1.08015) × 10,000,000 = 148,500\n折现：÷ (1 + 0.042 × 90/360) = 146,957\n· 150,421：用了 bid 价（1.07980），卖出头寸平仓需要买入，应用 offer。\n· 166,254：只用了即期 offer 价，没有加上远期点。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_41","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Interbank quotes are JPY/USD 149.80/149.84 and USD/EUR 1.0850/1.0852. A dealer quotes JPY/EUR 162.52/162.60. Ignoring transaction costs, which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Buy EUR from the dealer at 162.60 and sell EUR in the interbank market at 162.606 for a profit.","B":"No triangular arbitrage opportunity exists.","C":"Sell EUR to the dealer at 162.52 and buy EUR in the interbank market at 162.533 for a profit."},"answer":"B","explanation":"银行间隐含交叉汇率 JPY/EUR：bid = 149.8 × 1.085 = 162.533，offer = 149.84 × 1.0852 = 162.606。\n套利条件：交易商 bid > 银行间 offer，或交易商 offer < 银行间 bid。\n交易商 bid 162.52 < 银行间 offer 162.606；交易商 offer 162.6 > 银行间 bid 162.533，两个条件都不满足，无套利机会。\n· 在银行间卖出 EUR 只能拿到 bid 162.533，不是 offer 162.606；以 162.6 买入再以 162.533 卖出会亏损。\n· 以 162.52 卖给交易商、再以银行间 offer 162.606（不是 bid）买回，同样亏损。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 41 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_44","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A country with high capital mobility and a floating exchange rate launches a large, sustained expansionary fiscal program financed by debt, while monetary policy is unchanged. The most likely path of its currency is to:","options":{"A":"appreciate in the short run and depreciate in the long run.","B":"depreciate in the short run and appreciate in the long run.","C":"appreciate in both the short run and the long run."},"answer":"A","explanation":"短期看 Mundell–Fleming：资本高度流动时，扩张性财政推高利率，吸引资本流入，货币升值。\n长期看资产组合平衡法：赤字持续、政府债务累积，投资者要求更高回报或抛售，货币贬值。所以是先升后贬。\n· 先贬后升：短期和长期方向都弄反了。\n· 一直升值：忽略了长期债务累积带来的贬值压力。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 44 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_46","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The INR/USD spot rate is 83.20 and the EUR/USD spot rate is 0.9200. One-year interest rates are 6.50% for the INR and 2.75% for the EUR. The one-year INR/EUR forward rate is closest to:","options":{"A":"79.34","B":"86.24","C":"93.74"},"answer":"C","explanation":"1) 先求交叉即期汇率：USD/EUR = 1/0.92 = 1.08696\n   INR/EUR = INR/USD × USD/EUR = 83.2 × 1.08696 = 90.4348\n2) 再求远期：F = 90.4348 × 1.0650/1.0275 = 93.74\n· 86.24：直接用 INR/USD 即期汇率套 INR 和 EUR 的利率，没有先算交叉汇率。\n· 79.34：直接乘了 EUR/USD，没有先取倒数，USD 没有抵消。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 46 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_51","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The proposition that the difference in nominal interest rates between two countries is fully explained by the difference in their expected inflation rates is best described as:","options":{"A":"the international Fisher effect.","B":"relative purchasing power parity.","C":"uncovered interest rate parity."},"answer":"A","explanation":"国际费雪效应：各国实际利率相等时，名义利差 = 预期通胀差。\n· 相对 PPP 讲的是汇率变动 = 通胀差，是一价定律在货币层面的应用，涉及价格水平和汇率，而不是利差。\n· 非抛补利率平价讲的是预期汇率变动 = 名义利差。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 51 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_53","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The SEK/GBP spot rate is 13.40. Annualized six-month interest rates are 2.25% for the SEK and 4.75% for the GBP. If uncovered interest rate parity holds, the expected SEK/GBP spot rate in six months is closest to:","options":{"A":"13.0802","B":"13.2364","C":"13.5656"},"answer":"B","explanation":"E(S) = S × (1 + i_SEK × 0.5)/(1 + i_GBP × 0.5)，计价货币 SEK 的利率放分子：\n= 13.4 × 1.01125/1.02375 = 13.2364\n· 13.5656：分子分母写反了。\n· 13.0802：用了年利率，没有按 6 个月调整期限。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 53 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_54","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about bid–offer spreads in the foreign exchange market is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Dealers tend to quote wider spreads to clients with weaker credit quality.","B":"Spreads are typically narrower for exotic currency pairs than for major currency pairs.","C":"Spreads are typically widest when the London and New York trading sessions overlap, because order flow is heaviest."},"answer":"A","explanation":"影响客户买卖价差的因素：银行间价差、交易规模、客户关系与信用等级等。客户信用越差，交易商承担的对手方风险越大，报价价差越宽。\n· 伦敦与纽约同时开市的重叠时段流动性最好，价差最窄，而不是最宽。\n· 冷门货币对流动性差，价差比主要货币对更宽。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 54 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_55","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Six months ago, a US importer bought GBP 5 million forward for one-year delivery at USD/GBP 1.2650. Today the all-in six-month USD/GBP forward rate is 1.2480/1.2484, and the six-month USD interest rate is 4.80% (actual/360). The mark-to-market value of the importer's forward position is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD −85,000","B":"USD −83,008","C":"USD −81,107"},"answer":"B","explanation":"买入 GBP 远期的头寸要通过卖出同到期的 GBP 远期来对冲，卖出用 bid = 1.248。\n到期净现金流 = (1.248 − 1.265) × 5,000,000 = –85,000\n折现到今天：÷ (1 + 0.048 × 180/360) = –83,008（GBP 走弱，多头亏损）\n· –85,000：漏了折现，这是到期时的金额。\n· –81,107：按整年利率折现，剩余期限只有 180 天。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 55 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_1_57","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Country P runs persistent current account deficits while Country Q runs matching surpluses. Investors in Q accumulate a growing share of P's assets in their portfolios; eventually they demand higher returns on, or reduce their holdings of, P's assets, causing P's currency to depreciate. This mechanism is best described as the:","options":{"A":"flow supply/demand channel.","B":"portfolio balance channel.","C":"debt sustainability channel."},"answer":"B","explanation":"资产组合平衡渠道：经常账户逆差使逆差国资产不断流入顺差国投资者手中，组合中该资产占比过高后，投资者要求更高回报或减持，导致逆差国货币贬值。\n· 流量供求渠道讲的是贸易收支（进出口）带来的外汇供求变化。\n· 债务可持续性渠道强调外债累积到一定程度后，汇率必须大幅贬值以恢复债务可持续。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 57 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_3","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Over a very long investment horizon, the growth rate of a country's aggregate equity market value is most likely driven by:","options":{"A":"a continuously rising price-to-earnings multiple.","B":"the growth rate of GDP.","C":"a continuously rising share of corporate earnings in GDP."},"answer":"B","explanation":"股市总市值 = GDP × (盈利/GDP) × (P/E)。长期看，盈利/GDP 和 P/E 都不可能无限上升或下降，它们的长期增长贡献趋于零，所以股市长期表现主要由 GDP 增长驱动。\n· 盈利占 GDP 比重不可能一直上升，劳动收入停滞会压制需求和劳动供给。\n· P/E 也不可能无限扩张，长期贡献趋于零。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_11","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Country A launches a national program to fund research and patented production processes, while Country B uses the same amount of spending to build additional factories with existing technology. In a neoclassical framework, which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Country A's program raises total factor productivity and shifts the per capita production function upward, whereas Country B's spending moves along the existing function and faces diminishing marginal returns.","B":"Country B's factories shift the per capita production function upward, whereas Country A's program only moves the economy along the existing function.","C":"Both programs shift the per capita production function upward by the same amount."},"answer":"A","explanation":"研发和专利代表技术进步（TFP 提高），使整条人均生产函数上移，在相同人均资本下产出更高，能持续提高增长。建工厂只是资本深化，沿着原有生产函数移动，会遇到资本边际报酬递减。\n· 资本深化不会让生产函数上移，两者效果不同。\n· 把两者的作用弄反了。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_17","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In Country Z, corporate profits have risen to 14% of GDP, far above their 50-year average of 9%. Over the long run, the profit share of GDP is most likely to:","options":{"A":"continue rising indefinitely as companies become more efficient.","B":"decline toward a more sustainable level.","C":"remain permanently at 14%, because a structural shift has occurred."},"answer":"B","explanation":"利润/GDP 不可能一直上升：利润份额过高意味着劳动收入份额被压缩，劳动收入停滞会压制消费需求和劳动供给，也会引发政治压力，长期会回落。\n· 无限上升意味着劳动收入趋于零，不可持续。\n· 远高于长期均值的水平难以永久维持，长期趋向回落。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_18","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Economists raise their estimate of a country's potential GDP growth rate. All else equal, the country's equilibrium real interest rates are most likely to be:","options":{"A":"lower, because faster growth increases the supply of savings.","B":"higher, because consumers who expect faster income growth are less willing to defer consumption.","C":"unaffected, because real interest rates are determined solely by monetary policy."},"answer":"B","explanation":"潜在 GDP 增长更快 → 未来收入增长更快 → 消费者更愿意现在消费、不愿推迟消费（储蓄意愿下降），要求更高的实际利率。同时更快的增长也提高了投资回报。\n· 方向反了：更快的增长通常降低而不是提高当期储蓄意愿。\n· 长期均衡实际利率与经济增长前景密切相关，不只由货币政策决定。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_24","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about convergence of per capita income across countries is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Under club convergence, only countries that join the 'club' by having appropriate institutions and policies converge toward the income level of the richest countries.","B":"Club convergence requires countries to have the same saving rates, population growth rates, and production functions.","C":"Under conditional convergence, all countries converge to the same income level regardless of their saving and population growth rates."},"answer":"A","explanation":"俱乐部趋同：只有具备相应制度条件（开放、产权保护、法治等）的“俱乐部”成员国，人均收入才会向最富国家收敛；不具备条件的国家会继续落后，但可以通过制度改革加入俱乐部。\n· 要求储蓄率、人口增长率和生产函数都相同的是条件趋同，不是俱乐部趋同。\n· 条件趋同恰恰以储蓄率、人口增长率等条件相同为前提，条件不同的国家不会收敛到同一水平。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 24 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_25","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"According to the neoclassical growth model, removing barriers to international capital flows is most likely to:","options":{"A":"cause capital to flow from developing to developed countries, because returns are highest where capital is abundant.","B":"permanently raise the steady-state growth rate of all countries by forcing the least efficient firms out of business.","C":"cause capital to flow to developing countries where the marginal product of capital is higher, accelerating their capital accumulation and convergence."},"answer":"C","explanation":"新古典模型：资本稀缺的发展中国家资本边际产出更高，开放后资本从发达国家流向发展中国家，后者资本存量增长更快，加速收敛；但长期稳态增长率仍由外生技术进步决定。\n· 开放带来“优胜劣汰”、选择效应、永久提高增长率，是内生增长模型的观点。\n· 资本充裕处边际产出低，资本应流向资本稀缺的国家，方向反了。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 25 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_26","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"For an economy, total factor productivity grows at 1.2% per year, the capital stock grows at 4.0%, and the labor input grows at 0.8%. Capital's share of output is 0.35. Using the Solow growth accounting framework, the growth rate of potential GDP is closest to:","options":{"A":"3.12%","B":"3.40%","C":"4.08%"},"answer":"A","explanation":"ΔY/Y = ΔA/A + α × ΔK/K + (1 − α) × ΔL/L\n= 1.2 + 0.35 × 4.0 + 0.65 × 0.8 = 3.12%\n· 3.40%：劳动增速没有乘以 (1 − α)。\n· 4.08%：把资本份额 α 和劳动份额 (1 − α) 用反了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_29","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement is most consistent with endogenous growth theory?","options":{"A":"There is no steady-state growth rate, so an increase in the saving and investment rate can permanently raise the economy's growth rate.","B":"Diminishing marginal returns to capital at the economy-wide level eventually return the growth rate to its steady state.","C":"The long-run growth rate of output per worker depends only on the exogenous rate of technological progress."},"answer":"A","explanation":"内生增长模型：研发、人力资本等投资有正外部性，整体经济层面资本的边际报酬不递减（规模报酬不变或递增），因此没有稳态增长率，储蓄和投资率上升可以永久提高增长率。\n· 长期增长只取决于外生技术进步是新古典（Solow）模型的结论。\n· 资本边际报酬递减、增长回到稳态也是新古典模型的特征。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_econ_2_36","subject":"EOC · 经济 Economics","subjectKey":"eoc_econ","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst makes two statements about resource-rich economies:\nStatement 1: \"The 'Dutch disease' occurs when a boom in natural resource exports causes the domestic currency to depreciate, which erodes the competitiveness of the manufacturing sector.\"\nStatement 2: \"Resource-rich countries reliably grow faster than resource-poor countries, because resource revenues automatically finance productive investment.\"\nWhich statement(s) is (are) correct?","options":{"A":"Statement 1 only.","B":"Statement 2 only.","C":"Neither statement is correct."},"answer":"C","explanation":"· 说法 1 错误：荷兰病是资源出口旺盛导致本币升值（而不是贬值），使制造业等其他可贸易部门失去竞争力。\n· 说法 2 错误：资源丰富并不保证更快增长（资源诅咒），资源收入可能被浪费，并挤压制造业和制度建设。\n所以两条都不正确。\n· “只有说法 1 正确”：没有发现汇率方向写错了。\n· “只有说法 2 正确”：忽略了资源诅咒现象。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_3","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"On 1 January, Halvorsen AG buys a newly issued five-year bond at par for EUR 8,000,000. The bond pays an annual coupon of 5.0%. At 31 December, the bond's fair value is EUR 8,150,000. If Halvorsen classifies the bond at fair value through profit or loss (FVPL) rather than at amortized cost, the interest income it reports for the year is closest to:","options":{"A":"EUR 400,000","B":"EUR 407,500","C":"EUR 550,000"},"answer":"A","explanation":"按面值买入，实际利率 = 票面利率，没有折溢价摊销，所以无论摊余成本还是 FVPL，利息收入都等于票息：\n利息收入 = 8,000,000 × 5.0% = 400,000\nFVPL 下公允价值变动 150,000 单独作为未实现利得计入损益，不属于利息收入。\n· 550,000：把公允价值变动也算进了利息收入。\n· 407,500：用期末公允价值乘票面利率；票息按面值计算。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_9","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Brightwater Inc. holds an investment in Lumen Co. An analyst restates Brightwater's results as if the investment were accounted for under (i) the equity method and (ii) the acquisition method (full consolidation). Net income attributable to Brightwater's shareholders is identical in both cases. Brightwater's net profit margin will most likely be highest under:","options":{"A":"the equity method, because the investee's revenue is not included in the investor's revenue.","B":"the acquisition method, because consolidating the investee adds its net income to the investor's net income.","C":"neither method, because net profit margin is identical when net income attributable to the parent is the same."},"answer":"A","explanation":"权益法只在利润表中用一行“应占联营企业利润”确认投资收益，被投资方的收入不进入投资方收入；并表则把子公司 100% 的收入和费用逐项并入。分子（归属母公司净利润）相同或接近，而权益法下分母（收入）最小，所以净利率最高。\n· 并表并不会让归属母公司的净利润更高，反而大幅增加了收入（分母），净利率更低。\n· 净利润相同不代表净利率相同，两种方法下的收入差别很大。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_11","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ostrava Holdings acquires 100% of Pilsen Ltd. at the start of the year. For the year, Ostrava (excluding Pilsen) reports revenue of 5,200 and operating income of 520; Pilsen reports revenue of 2,400 and operating income of 168. There are no intercompany transactions. Ostrava's consolidated operating margin is closest to:","options":{"A":"8.50%","B":"9.05%","C":"10.00%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"并表后营业利润率 = (母公司营业利润 + 子公司营业利润) / (母公司收入 + 子公司收入)\n= (520 + 168) / (5,200 + 2,400) = 688 / 7,600 = 9.05%\n子公司营业利润率 7.0% 低于母公司 10.0%，并表后整体利润率被拉低。\n· 10.00%：只是母公司自身（或权益法下）的营业利润率，没有并入子公司。\n· 8.50%：对两个利润率做简单平均，没有按收入加权。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_15","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Kestrel Corp. owns 65% of the voting shares of Wren Ltd. and controls it. This year Kestrel's stand-alone revenue is USD 2,300 million and Wren's revenue is USD 1,150 million, with no intercompany sales. Kestrel's consolidated revenue is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD 2,300 million","B":"USD 3,048 million","C":"USD 3,450 million"},"answer":"C","explanation":"取得控制即按收购法并表，子公司收入 100% 并入，与持股比例无关；少数股东的份额只在净利润和权益中单独列示（NCI）。\n合并收入 = 2,300 + 1,150 = 3,450\n· 3,048：按 65% 持股比例并入，这是比例合并的做法，不适用于控制。\n· 2,300：只计母公司收入，相当于按权益法处理，但有控制就必须并表。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_17","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Fjord Energy and an unrelated partner each own 50% of Polar JV, a joint venture over which they share joint control. Polar JV reports revenue of NOK 900 million for the year. Under IFRS, the amount of Polar JV's revenue included in Fjord's consolidated revenue is closest to:","options":{"A":"NOK 0 million","B":"NOK 450 million","C":"NOK 900 million"},"answer":"A","explanation":"IFRS 11 规定合营企业（joint venture）必须用权益法（US GAAP 一般也用权益法）。权益法只在利润表中用一行确认“应占合营企业净利润”，不把合营企业的收入、费用逐项并入，所以合并收入中来自 Polar JV 的部分为 0。\n· 450：按 50% 比例并入收入，是比例合并法，IFRS 对合营企业已不允许。\n· 900：全额并入，只有取得控制（子公司）时才这样做。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_21","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Marlow Retail sells USD 400 million of its customer receivables to a special purpose entity (SPE) that it created and controls. The SPE funds the purchase by issuing bonds to outside investors. Compared with not doing the transaction, Marlow's consolidated financial statements will most likely show:","options":{"A":"a gain on sale of receivables in revenue, with the SPE's bonds kept off the consolidated balance sheet.","B":"no change in consolidated revenue or in consolidated accounts receivable, with the SPE's bonds reported as consolidated debt.","C":"lower accounts receivable and higher cash flow from operations, because the receivables have been sold."},"answer":"B","explanation":"公司控制该 SPE，IFRS 和 US GAAP 都要求并表。母公司把应收账款“卖”给 SPE 属于集团内部交易，合并时抵消：应收账款仍留在合并资产负债表上，收入不会增加，SPE 发行的债券作为合并负债列示——效果等同于用应收账款抵押借款。\n· 应收账款减少、经营现金流增加只在真正出售给不并表的第三方时才成立。\n· 内部交易不能确认出售利得，SPE 的债务也不能表外处理。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 21 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_28","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under IFRS, Sorrento SpA acquires 75% of Capri Srl for EUR 1,260 million. At the acquisition date, the fair value of Capri as a whole is EUR 1,680 million, the fair value of Capri's identifiable net assets is EUR 1,400 million, and their book value is EUR 1,100 million. If Sorrento uses the partial goodwill method, the non-controlling interest reported at acquisition is closest to:","options":{"A":"EUR 275 million","B":"EUR 350 million","C":"EUR 420 million"},"answer":"B","explanation":"部分商誉法：NCI = NCI 持股比例 × 子公司可辨认净资产公允价值 = 25% × 1,400 = 350\n（商誉 = 1,260 − 75% × 1,400 = 210，只含母公司那部分商誉）\n· 420：按子公司整体公允价值计算，是全部商誉法（US GAAP 必须用，IFRS 可选）。\n· 275：用了可辨认净资产的账面价值；收购日应按公允价值计量。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 28 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_30","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Galena Corp. owns 70% of Basalt Inc. Under the equity method, Galena reports long-term debt of 720 and total equity of 1,600. Basalt reports long-term debt of 380 and equity of 900; the fair values of Basalt's net assets equal their book values and there is no goodwill. If Galena instead consolidates Basalt, its long-term debt-to-equity ratio (with total equity including non-controlling interest) is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.45","B":"0.59","C":"0.69"},"answer":"B","explanation":"并表后长期负债 = 720 + 380 = 1,100（子公司负债 100% 并入）\n总权益 = 母公司权益 1,600 + NCI 30% × 900 = 1,600 + 270 = 1,870\n长期负债/权益 = 1,100 / 1,870 = 0.59\n· 0.69：负债并入了，但权益中漏加 NCI。\n· 0.45：是权益法下的比率（不并入子公司负债），也是三者中最低的。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 30 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_33","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Tarn Ltd. acquired 80% of Lys SA for a price equal to 80% of the fair value of Lys's identifiable net assets, so no goodwill arises under either goodwill method. Net income attributable to Tarn's shareholders is 190 under every method. Beginning total equity is 1,520 under the equity method and 1,900 (including NCI) under the acquisition method. Return on beginning total equity is most likely:","options":{"A":"the same under the full and partial goodwill methods, and higher under the equity method.","B":"the same under all three methods, because net income attributable to the parent is identical.","C":"lowest under the full goodwill method, because NCI is always measured at the subsidiary's full fair value."},"answer":"A","explanation":"ROE = 归属母公司净利润 / 期初总权益。三种方法下分子都是 190。\n两种并表方法下，权益都包含 NCI；本题没有商誉，全部商誉法和部分商誉法下的 NCI 相同，期初权益都是 1,900：ROE = 190/1,900 = 10.0%\n权益法下权益不含 NCI：ROE = 190/1,520 = 12.5%，更高。\n· 分子相同不代表 ROE 相同，分母（期初权益）在权益法下更小。\n· 全部商誉法下 NCI 包含其应占商誉，通常权益更大、ROE 更低；但本题没有商誉，两种并表方法结果相同。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 33 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_41","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor accounts for a 30% stake in an associate using the equity method. The fair value of the investment has fallen below its carrying amount, and the decline is judged not to be temporary. Which statement is most accurate under IFRS and US GAAP?","options":{"A":"Under both standards, the impairment loss is recognized in other comprehensive income until the investment is sold.","B":"Under both standards, the investment is written down and the impairment loss is recognized in profit or loss.","C":"Under both standards, an impairment is recognized only up to the amount of goodwill embedded in the investment; any excess is not recognized."},"answer":"B","explanation":"权益法投资发生减值（IFRS：存在客观减值证据；US GAAP：公允价值下跌且非暂时性），两种准则都要求把投资账面价值减记到可收回金额/公允价值，减值损失计入利润表。权益法下投资中的商誉不单独做减值测试，而是把整个投资作为一项资产测试。\n· 减值损失进损益，不是先放在 OCI。\n· 减值不以内含商誉为限；对于现金产出单元，减值先冲减商誉，超出部分还要按比例分摊到该单元的其他资产，而不是忽略。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 41 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_42","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Corvid Machinery is considering raising funds by transferring its lease receivables to a bankruptcy-remote special purpose entity that it controls; the SPE would issue notes backed by the receivables. Compared with borrowing directly against the receivables, this structure would most likely:","options":{"A":"raise the borrowing cost, because noteholders would have no direct claim on the receivables.","B":"lower the borrowing cost, while Corvid's consolidated financial statements would look the same as if it had borrowed directly.","C":"lower the borrowing cost and remove the related debt from Corvid's consolidated balance sheet."},"answer":"B","explanation":"SPE 与公司破产隔离，即使 Corvid 破产，SPE 的债权人对应收账款有直接、优先的索取权，信用风险更低，所以融资成本可能下降。但公司控制该 SPE，IFRS 和 US GAAP 都要求并表，合并报表与直接用应收账款抵押借款时相同。\n· 贷款人恰恰对应收账款有直接追索权，所以成本更低而不是更高。\n· 并表后 SPE 的债务仍在合并资产负债表上，不能表外化。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 42 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_49","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under IFRS 9, Aldgate Insurance buys a portfolio of investment-grade bonds whose cash flows are solely payments of principal and interest. Management states that the bonds will be sold whenever the company needs liquidity and that it actively manages them on a fair value basis. The classification that is least appropriate for these bonds is:","options":{"A":"amortized cost.","B":"fair value through profit or loss.","C":"fair value through other comprehensive income."},"answer":"A","explanation":"摊余成本要求业务模式是“持有以收取合同现金流”（hold to collect）。管理层打算在需要流动性时随时出售，且按公允价值管理，不满足该业务模式，所以摊余成本最不合适。\n· FVPL：按公允价值管理和评价的组合可以（也通常应当）分类为 FVPL。\n· FVOCI：业务模式为“既收取合同现金流又出售”时可用，比摊余成本更贴近“需要时出售”的意图。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 49 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_1_54","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Delta Components is an 80%-owned subsidiary of Ridgeway Motors. During the year, Delta's revenue of USD 640 million consisted entirely of parts sold to Ridgeway. The percentage of Delta's revenue reflected in Ridgeway's consolidated revenue is closest to:","options":{"A":"0%","B":"80%","C":"100%"},"answer":"A","explanation":"Delta 的收入全部来自卖给母公司 Ridgeway，属于集团内部交易，合并时全额抵消（与持股比例无关），合并利润表中只反映集团对外部客户的销售。所以反映比例为 0%。\n· 80%：按持股比例保留，内部交易抵消不按比例。\n· 100%：子公司对外销售才会 100% 并入，对母公司的销售要抵消。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 54 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_7","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Norland Paper's defined benefit obligation (DBO) is EUR 2,400 million with a duration of 14. Plan assets are EUR 2,100 million, of which EUR 1,200 million are long-term bonds with a duration of 12; the remaining assets are equities, assumed unaffected. If the discount rate and bond yields both fall by 50 basis points, the change in the plan's funded status (plan assets minus DBO) is closest to:","options":{"A":"EUR −240 million","B":"EUR −168 million","C":"EUR −96 million"},"answer":"C","explanation":"用久期近似：ΔDBO = −D × Δy × DBO = −14 × (–0.005) × 2,400 = +168\nΔ债券资产 = −12 × (–0.005) × 1,200 = +72\nΔ融资状况 = Δ资产 − ΔDBO = 72 − 168 = –96\n利率下降使 DBO 增加，但长久期债券同时升值，部分抵消，所以融资状况恶化幅度小于 DBO 的增加。\n· −168：只考虑了 DBO 增加，忽略了计划资产的升值。\n· −240：把债券价格方向弄反了，利率下降时债券升值而不是贬值。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_8","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under IFRS, Ashby plc reports the following for its defined benefit plan this year (GBP millions): current service cost 260, past service cost from a plan amendment 90, net interest expense 45, and remeasurement losses 70. Assuming the company presents only service cost within operating expenses, the pension amount included in operating expenses is closest to:","options":{"A":"GBP 260 million","B":"GBP 350 million","C":"GBP 395 million"},"answer":"B","explanation":"IFRS 下养老金成本分三部分：服务成本（当期服务成本 + 过去服务成本）和净利息计入损益，重新计量计入 OCI。\n营业费用中的部分 = 服务成本 = 260 + 90 = 350\n净利息 45 通常单独列示（如财务费用），重新计量 70 进 OCI。\n· 395：把净利息也算进营业费用了。\n· 260：漏了过去服务成本；IFRS 下过去服务成本立即计入损益。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_9","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under US GAAP, Bexley Inc. reports the following for its defined benefit plan in the first year after a plan amendment (USD millions): current service cost 140, interest cost 95, expected return on plan assets 210, actual return on plan assets 180, past service cost arising this year 60, and actuarial losses arising this year 35. No amortization of prior OCI amounts occurs this year. The pension cost recognized in profit or loss is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD 25 million","B":"USD 55 million","C":"USD 85 million"},"answer":"A","explanation":"US GAAP 计入损益的养老金成本 = 当期服务成本 + 利息成本 − 计划资产预期回报 + 摊销项（本题为 0）\n= 140 + 95 − 210 = 25\n本年产生的过去服务成本 60 和精算损失 35 先计入 OCI，以后再摊销进损益。\n· 85：把过去服务成本直接计入损益，这是 IFRS 的做法。\n· 55：用实际回报代替预期回报；US GAAP 损益中用的是预期回报。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_10","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst is forecasting next year's IFRS pension cost for Morrow AG. At the end of this year, the DBO is EUR 6,800 million and plan assets are EUR 5,300 million. Next year, current service cost is expected to be EUR 240 million and a plan amendment will create past service cost of EUR 60 million. The discount rate is 4.5%. The forecast pension cost recognized in profit or loss next year is closest to:","options":{"A":"EUR 307.5 million","B":"EUR 367.5 million","C":"EUR 606.0 million"},"answer":"B","explanation":"IFRS 损益中的养老金成本 = 服务成本 + 净利息\n服务成本 = 240 + 60 = 300\n净利息 = 折现率 × 期初净养老金负债 = 4.5% × (6,800 − 5,300) = 4.5% × 1,500 = 67.5\n合计 = 300 + 67.5 = 367.5\n· 606.0：净利息用 DBO 全额计算，忘了扣除计划资产。\n· 307.5：漏了过去服务成本。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_13","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Quillon Software grants restricted stock units (RSUs) to employees. During the year, 1.10 million RSUs vested from a grant whose grant-date fair value was USD 38.50 per unit, and 0.06 million unvested RSUs from another grant (grant-date fair value USD 40.00) were forfeited. Quillon's share price at year-end is USD 51.00.\n| Item | Units (m) | Grant-date FV (USD) |\n| Vested | 1.10 | 38.50 |\n| Forfeited | 0.06 | 40.00 |\nThe net RSU compensation expense arising from these vesting and forfeiture events is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD 39.95 million","B":"USD 42.35 million","C":"USD 53.04 million"},"answer":"A","explanation":"RSU 费用按授予日公允价值计量，之后股价变化不影响费用：\n费用 = 已归属 RSU × 授予日公允价值 − 被没收 RSU × 其授予日公允价值\n= 1.10 × 38.50 − 0.06 × 40.00 = 42.35 − 2.40 = 39.95\n· 53.04：用当前股价 51.00 计量，股权结算的 RSU 不按当前股价重估。\n· 42.35：没有冲回被没收 RSU 之前确认的费用。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_15","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under US GAAP, Larkspur Corp. granted 200,000 RSUs with a grant-date fair value of USD 30.00 each; cumulative compensation expense recognized is therefore USD 6.00 million. The RSUs vest when the share price is USD 41.00, and the tax deduction equals the market value of the shares at vesting. The tax rate is 25%. The effect of the excess tax benefit on income tax expense (USD millions; negative = decrease) is closest to:","options":{"A":"−2.05","B":"−0.55","C":"+0.55"},"answer":"B","explanation":"税前扣除额 = 200,000 × 41.00 = 8.20m；已确认费用 = 6.00m\n超额税收利益（windfall）= (8.20 − 6.00) × 25% = 0.55m\nUS GAAP（ASU 2016-09）下 windfall 计入利润表，减少所得税费用，所以影响为 −0.55。\n· +0.55：方向反了，超额扣除带来的是税收利益，所得税费用下降。\n· −2.05：用全部扣除额乘税率，这是总的税收利益，其中 1.50 已随费用确认，只有超出部分才是 windfall。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_16","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Mirabel SA reports pre-tax income of EUR 120 million and its statutory tax rate is 25%, with no other permanent or temporary differences. This year it realizes an excess tax benefit of EUR 1.8 million on share-based awards (the tax deduction exceeded cumulative compensation expense). Under IFRS, Mirabel's effective tax rate is closest to:","options":{"A":"23.5%","B":"25.0%","C":"26.5%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"IFRS（IAS 12）下，超出已确认费用部分对应的税收利益直接计入权益，不减少利润表中的所得税费用：\n所得税费用 = 120 × 25% = 30.0，ETR = 25.0%\nUS GAAP 下 windfall 冲减所得税费用：(30.0 − 1.8) / 120 = 23.5%，所以 IFRS 下 ETR 更高。\n· 23.5%：这是 US GAAP 的处理。\n· 26.5%：把税收利益当成增加所得税费用，方向反了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 16 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_21","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Kinsale Foods is deciding between discount rates of 4.60% and 5.25% to measure its defined benefit obligation; the plan is underfunded. Compared with using 4.60%, using 5.25% at the measurement date will most likely result in:","options":{"A":"a lower DBO and lower total liabilities on the balance sheet.","B":"no change in total liabilities, because the effect of a discount rate change is recognized only in other comprehensive income.","C":"a higher net pension liability, because a higher rate increases the present value of promised benefits."},"answer":"A","explanation":"DBO 是未来福利的现值，折现率越高，现值越低。计划资产不受该假设影响，所以净养老金负债（DBO − 计划资产）下降，资产负债表上的总负债更低。\n· 折现率提高是降低而不是提高现值。\n· IFRS 下精算损益（重新计量）计入 OCI，但资产负债表上的净负债照样变化；OCI 只是损益的列报位置，不是“不影响负债”。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 21 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_22","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following changes in actuarial assumptions for a defined benefit plan would most likely increase a company's reported net income?","options":{"A":"A decrease in the assumed rate of future compensation increases.","B":"An increase in the assumed life expectancy of plan participants.","C":"A decrease in the discount rate used to measure the obligation."},"answer":"A","explanation":"预期加薪率降低 → 按最终工资计算的未来福利减少 → DBO 和当期服务成本下降 → 养老金费用减少，净利润上升。\n· 折现率降低使 DBO 和服务成本上升，通常增加养老金成本，对利润不利。\n· 预期寿命延长意味着支付年限更长，DBO 和服务成本上升，利润下降。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 22 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_25","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Cobalt Pharma values its employee stock options at the grant date using an option pricing model. Holding all else constant, which change in a valuation input would most likely reduce the compensation expense reported for the options?","options":{"A":"A longer expected option term.","B":"A higher risk-free interest rate.","C":"A higher expected dividend yield."},"answer":"C","explanation":"员工期权是看涨期权：股息率越高，持有期内股价因派息而下降越多，看涨期权价值越低 → 授予日公允价值越低 → 期权费用越低，利润越高。\n· 无风险利率上升会提高看涨期权价值，费用增加。\n· 预期期限越长，期权的时间价值越大，费用增加。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 25 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_26","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst values Halden Steel using a free cash flow to the firm model and subtracts the present value of the net pension deficit from enterprise value, treating it as debt. The company's forecast operating expenses include both the service cost and the net interest cost of its defined benefit plan. To avoid double counting, the analyst should most appropriately:","options":{"A":"keep both costs in the forecast cash flows, because each represents a real economic cost of the pension plan.","B":"remove the net interest cost from the forecast cash flows but keep the service cost as an operating expense.","C":"remove both the service cost and the net interest cost from the forecast cash flows."},"answer":"B","explanation":"净利息反映的是养老金赤字随时间推移产生的“利息”（折现的时间价值），本质上类似债务利息。既然已把净养老金负债现值当作债务从企业价值中扣除，再在 FCF 中扣除净利息就重复计算了，应把净利息从 FCF 中去掉。服务成本是员工当期提供服务产生的经营性成本，应保留。\n· 服务成本属于经营成本，去掉会高估 FCF。\n· 两者都保留会导致净利息被重复扣除，低估公司价值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_2_28","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Selkirk Robotics reports a net loss of USD 54 million and has 72 million weighted average common shares outstanding. It also has 4.0 million unvested RSUs and 2.5 million employee stock options with an exercise price of USD 24; the average share price was USD 40. Selkirk's diluted EPS is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD −0.75","B":"USD −0.71","C":"USD −0.69"},"answer":"A","explanation":"公司报告净亏损时，任何潜在普通股（包括未归属的股权激励、价内期权）加入分母都会使每股亏损变小，属于反稀释，必须排除。\n稀释 EPS = 基本 EPS = −54 / 72 = –0.75\n· –0.71：把未归属 RSU 计入了分母；亏损时它们是反稀释的。\n· –0.69：把 RSU 和全部期权（未用库存股法，且本应排除）都计入了分母。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 28 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_2","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Tula Industries, a US parent that presents in USD, owns a Mexican subsidiary that operates independently and whose functional currency is the Mexican peso (MXN). The subsidiary has borrowed EUR 50 million from a European bank. To prepare Tula's consolidated statements, the subsidiary's financial statements should most likely be converted into USD using the:","options":{"A":"temporal method, because the subsidiary's loan is denominated in a currency other than MXN.","B":"current rate method, because the subsidiary's functional currency is MXN rather than USD.","C":"temporal method, because the parent's presentation currency is USD."},"answer":"B","explanation":"折算方法取决于子公司的功能货币与母公司列报货币的关系：子公司功能货币是当地货币（MXN）而非 USD → 用现行汇率法折算；若功能货币是母公司列报货币，才用时态法重新计量。\nEUR 贷款是子公司层面的外币交易：先在子公司账上按 MXN 重新计量，汇兑损益计入子公司损益，不改变折算方法的选择。\n· 贷款币种不决定折算方法。\n· 母公司列报货币是 USD 本身不足以使用时态法，关键是子公司的功能货币是否为 USD。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_8","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Vasco Group (IFRS reporter, presentation currency EUR) has a subsidiary in a country whose annual inflation rates over the past three years were 26%, 28% and 30%. Which combination of cumulative three-year inflation and translation approach is most appropriate?","options":{"A":"84.0%; the economy is not hyperinflationary, so apply the current rate method without restatement","B":"109.7%; restate the statements for local inflation, then translate all amounts at the current exchange rate","C":"109.7%; remeasure the statements using the temporal method"},"answer":"B","explanation":"三年累计通胀 = (1+0.26)(1+0.28)(1+0.3) − 1 = 109.7%，超过 100%，属于恶性通胀经济。\nIFRS（IAS 29 + IAS 21）：先用当地一般物价指数重述子公司报表（非货币性项目按指数重述，净货币性头寸的购买力损益计入净利润），再把所有项目按期末现行汇率折算成列报货币。\n· 84.0%：把三年通胀简单相加，应按复利累乘。\n· 时态法是 US GAAP 对恶性通胀子公司的处理（视同功能货币为母公司列报货币），不是 IFRS 的做法。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_14","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Corvina SA (IFRS, presentation currency USD) has a subsidiary in a hyperinflationary economy. The subsidiary bought land for a warehouse site for LC 4,800,000 when the general price index was 100 and the exchange rate was LC 6.0/USD. At the current balance sheet date, the price index is 235 and the exchange rate is LC 18.0/USD. The land's carrying amount in Corvina's consolidated balance sheet is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD 266,667","B":"USD 626,667","C":"USD 800,000"},"answer":"B","explanation":"IFRS 下恶性通胀子公司：先用物价指数重述非货币性资产，再按期末现行汇率折算。\n重述后 = 4,800,000 × 235/100 = LC 11,280,000\n折算 = 11,280,000 / 18.0 = USD 626,667\n· 800,000：按历史汇率折算未重述的金额，是 US GAAP 时态法的结果。\n· 266,667：直接用现行汇率折算未重述的金额，资产价值被严重低估——这正是 IAS 29 要求先重述的原因。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_22","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Brennan Corp. (presentation currency USD) translates its foreign subsidiary, whose functional currency is the local currency (LC), using the current rate method. The subsidiary began the year with net assets of LC 50 million, earned net income of LC 6 million evenly during the year, and paid no dividends. Exchange rates (USD per LC) were 1.25 at the beginning of the year, 1.20 on average and 1.15 at year-end. The translation adjustment for the year (USD millions) is closest to:","options":{"A":"−5.30","B":"−5.00","C":"+5.30"},"answer":"A","explanation":"现行汇率法：期末净资产按期末汇率折算，期初净资产按期初汇率、当期净利润按平均汇率折算，差额计入权益中的 CTA。\n期末净资产 = 56 × 1.15 = 64.40\n期初 + 利润 = 50 × 1.25 + 6 × 1.2 = 62.50 + 7.20 = 69.70\n折算调整 = 64.40 − 69.70 = –5.30（外币贬值 + 净资产敞口 → 负的调整，从 CTA 中扣减）\n· +5.30：符号反了，LC 贬值时净资产敞口产生折算损失。\n· −5.00：只计算了期初净资产的汇率变化，漏了当期利润（按平均汇率入账、按期末汇率折算）的部分。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 22 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_36","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under the temporal method, the subsidiary of Arlo Manufacturing has a net monetary liability position of LC 30 million. The parent wants to reduce the subsidiary's balance sheet exposure to exchange rate changes. Which action would most likely achieve this?","options":{"A":"Selling LC 30 million of fixed assets for cash.","B":"Issuing LC 30 million of bonds and using the proceeds to buy marketable securities carried at fair value.","C":"Using LC 30 million of cash to purchase inventory carried at cost."},"answer":"A","explanation":"时态法下，按现行汇率折算的是货币性资产/负债（以及按公允价值计量的项目），敞口 = 净货币性资产（或负债）。目前为净货币性负债 30m。\n出售固定资产（按历史汇率折算的非货币性资产）换成现金（货币性资产），净货币性负债减少 30m，敞口被抵消。\n· 发行债券（现行汇率）买入按公允价值计量的有价证券（也按现行汇率），两边同时增加，净敞口不变。\n· 用现金买按成本计量的存货（历史汇率），货币性资产减少，净货币性负债反而扩大到 60m。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_42","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Thistle Air, a UK airline that reports in GBP, earns almost all of its revenue in GBP from UK customers. Its largest costs, jet fuel and aircraft leases, are priced in USD. If the USD strengthens significantly against the GBP, Thistle's operating profit will most likely:","options":{"A":"be unaffected, because exchange rate changes are recognized in other comprehensive income.","B":"increase, because a stronger USD raises the GBP value of its revenue.","C":"decrease, because its USD-denominated fuel and lease costs rise in GBP terms while revenue is largely unaffected."},"answer":"C","explanation":"收入主要以 GBP 计价，美元升值对收入影响很小；燃油和租赁成本以 USD 计价，美元升值后换算成 GBP 的成本上升，营业利润下降。\n· 收入是 GBP，不会因美元升值而增加。\n· 这是经营层面的交易性汇率影响，直接反映在营业成本中，不是现行汇率法下进入 OCI 的折算差额。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 42 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_55","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Pinewood Inc. (presentation currency USD) owns a foreign subsidiary whose selling prices are set mainly by competition in the US market and which is financed largely with intercompany USD advances; its functional currency is therefore the USD. Throughout the year, the subsidiary's balance sheet (in LC millions) was unchanged: monetary assets 15, nonmonetary assets carried at historical cost 65, and monetary liabilities 55. The LC moved from USD 0.80 to USD 0.72 during the year. The foreign exchange gain or loss reported in Pinewood's consolidated net income (USD millions) is closest to:","options":{"A":"−3.20","B":"−2.00","C":"+3.20"},"answer":"C","explanation":"子公司功能货币为 USD（= 母公司列报货币）→ 用时态法重新计量，重新计量损益计入净利润。\n时态法敞口 = 净货币性负债 = 55 − 15 = 40\nLC 贬值 0.08，净货币性负债的美元价值下降 → 利得 = 40 × 0.08 = 3.20\n· −2.00：按现行汇率法以净资产 25 为敞口算出的折算损失，而且现行汇率法下应进 OCI 而非净利润。\n· −3.20：方向反了；外币贬值时净货币性负债产生利得。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 55 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_56","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Grayson Corp. (presentation currency USD) wants to evaluate the managers of its Canadian subsidiary, whose functional currency is the CAD. The subsidiary's revenue translated into USD was 4,600 million last year and 4,890 million this year. The average exchange rate was USD 0.780/CAD last year and USD 0.765/CAD this year. The subsidiary's revenue growth that is most relevant for evaluating its managers is closest to:","options":{"A":"4.3%","B":"6.3%","C":"8.4%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"评价子公司管理层应看其功能货币（CAD）口径，剔除汇率影响。把 USD 收入按各期平均汇率换回 CAD：\n去年 = 4,600 / 0.78 = CAD 5,897.4m；今年 = 4,890 / 0.765 = CAD 6,392.2m\n增长率 = 6,392.2 / 5,897.4 − 1 = 8.4%\n· 6.3%：USD 口径增速，混入了 CAD 贬值的影响。\n· 4.3%：换回 CAD 时乘了汇率而不是除以汇率（汇率标价方向用反了）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 56 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_57","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Harlan Inc. (presentation currency USD) translates its Canadian subsidiary using the current rate method. During the year, the subsidiary's net assets were constant at CAD 80 million, of which net monetary assets were CAD 30 million. The CAD depreciated from USD 0.76 to USD 0.73. The effect of the translation on Harlan's other comprehensive income (USD millions) is closest to:","options":{"A":"−2.40","B":"−0.90","C":"+2.40"},"answer":"A","explanation":"现行汇率法下的敞口是净资产（所有资产和负债都按现行汇率折算）。\nCAD 贬值 → 净资产的美元价值下降 → 折算损失计入 OCI（CTA）：\n80 × (0.73 − 0.76) = –2.40\n· −0.90：用净货币性资产作敞口，那是时态法（且时态法的损益进净利润，不进 OCI）。\n· +2.40：方向反了，外币贬值 + 净资产敞口为正 → 损失。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 57 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_3_61","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Norrby AB, a Swedish parent, is taxed in Sweden on its worldwide profits with a credit for foreign taxes paid (the credit cannot exceed the Swedish tax on those profits). Pre-tax profits (SEK millions) are: Sweden 410; a South American subsidiary taxed locally at 15%, 260; and a German subsidiary taxed locally at 30%, 180. If the Swedish tax rate is cut from 22.0% to 20.6%, the increase in group net income is closest to:","options":{"A":"SEK 5.74 million","B":"SEK 9.38 million","C":"SEK 11.90 million"},"answer":"B","explanation":"全球征税 + 外国税收抵免：利润的实际税率 = max(当地税率, 瑞典税率)。\n瑞典本地利润：税率下降 1.4 个百分点 → 节税 410 × 0.014 = 5.74\n南美子公司（15% < 瑞典税率）：需在瑞典补税到瑞典税率，降税也减少补税 → 260 × 0.014 = 3.64\n德国子公司（30% > 瑞典税率）：无需补税，不受影响。\n合计 = 9.38\n· 5.74：只算了瑞典本地利润，漏了低税率子公司的补税减少。\n· 11.90：把高税率的德国子公司也算进去了，它的税负由德国税率决定。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 61 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_7","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst reviews the following data for Elmstead Bank:\n| Metric | 2023 | 2024 | 2025 |\n| Average 1-day 99% VaR (EUR m) | 48 | 41 | 35 |\n| Stressed VaR (EUR m) | 112 | 98 | 86 |\n| CET1 ratio (%) | 12.1 | 11.8 | 12.4 |\n| Leverage ratio (%) | 5.2 | 4.9 | 5.0 |\nThe conclusion best supported by the data is that:","options":{"A":"the bank's exposure to market risk has decreased over the period.","B":"the bank's capital adequacy has improved consistently over the period.","C":"the bank's market risk has increased, because stressed VaR exceeds VaR in every year."},"answer":"A","explanation":"VaR 从 48 降到 35、压力 VaR 从 112 降到 86，两个指标三年持续下降，说明交易组合的市场风险暴露和敏感度在降低。\n· 资本指标并未一致改善：CET1 比率 12.1→11.8→12.4 先降后升，杠杆率 5.2→5.0 仍低于期初。\n· 压力 VaR 按定义采用压力期的市场数据，本来就高于普通 VaR；应看趋势，两者都在下降。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_9","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Selected capital data for Harbourside Bank (USD billions):\n| Item | 2024 | 2025 |\n| CET1 capital | 52 | 58 |\n| Additional Tier 1 capital | 8 | 6 |\n| Tier 2 capital | 14 | 9 |\n| Risk-weighted assets | 420 | 445 |\nFrom 2024 to 2025, the bank's capital adequacy is best described as:","options":{"A":"mixed, because the CET1 and Tier 1 ratios rose while the total capital ratio fell.","B":"improved, because CET1 capital increased in absolute terms.","C":"deteriorated, because total capital declined relative to risk-weighted assets."},"answer":"A","explanation":"逐一计算资本 / 风险加权资产：\n2024: CET1 12.38%，Tier 1 14.29%，总资本 17.62%\n2025: CET1 13.03%，Tier 1 14.38%，总资本 16.40%\nCET1 和 Tier 1 比率上升，总资本比率下降，方向不一致 → “mixed”。\n· 资本充足要看比率而不是绝对额，风险加权资产也在增长。\n· 只看总资本比率会忽略 CET1 和 Tier 1 的改善，结论片面。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_11","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Data for Calder Savings Bank (GBP millions):\n| Item | 2024 | 2025 |\n| Impaired loans | 310 | 270 |\n| Loans past due but not impaired | 820 | 1050 |\n| Allowance for loan losses | 205 | 262 |\nThe increase in the allowance for loan losses is most likely attributable to:","options":{"A":"a reduction in the bank's lending to higher-risk borrowers.","B":"the growth in loans that are past due but not impaired.","C":"the growth in impaired loans."},"answer":"B","explanation":"计算增长率：逾期未减值贷款 +28.0%，减值准备 +27.8%，已减值贷款 –12.9%。\n减值准备几乎与“逾期但未减值”资产同比例增长（预期这些贷款可能转为减值），所以是它驱动了准备的增加。\n· 已减值贷款实际在下降，不可能驱动准备增加。\n· 减少高风险贷款会降低而不是提高所需的减值准备。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_13","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In addition to its CAMELS analysis, an analyst reviews other factors for Westmarch Bank. Which observation would most likely support a positive assessment of the bank's outlook?","options":{"A":"The bank's deposits have become increasingly concentrated in a single metropolitan area.","B":"The bank's net defined benefit pension liability has declined steadily over the past three years.","C":"The bank's commitments to unconsolidated structured entities have grown faster than its total assets."},"answer":"B","explanation":"净设定受益计划负债属于 CAMELS 之外需关注的因素（类似表外/或有负债）。它持续下降，说明这方面对资本和现金流的潜在压力在减小，支持正面评价。\n· 对未并表结构化主体的承诺增长过快，意味着表外风险上升，是负面信号。\n· 存款集中于单一地区增加了集中度风险，也是负面信号。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_15","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"For Garnet Property & Casualty Insurance, losses were 410 and 425, loss adjustment expenses were 52 and 50, and net premiums earned were 760 and 810 in Years 1 and 2, respectively. The change in the loss and loss adjustment expense ratio from Year 1 to Year 2 most likely indicates that:","options":{"A":"the insurer earned higher returns on its investment portfolio.","B":"the insurer's estimates of the risk it assumes when pricing policies became more accurate.","C":"the insurer became more efficient at acquiring and administering policies."},"answer":"B","explanation":"损失及损失调整费用率 = (损失 + LAE) / 已赚净保费\n第 1 年 = (410 + 52) / 760 = 60.8%；第 2 年 = (425 + 50) / 810 = 58.6%\n该比率下降说明承保质量改善：定价时对所承担风险的估计更准确。\n· 获客和管理保单的效率看的是承保费用率（underwriting expense ratio），整体看综合成本率。\n· 投资回报与该比率无关，它只衡量承保损失。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_18","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Over two years, the notional amount of Ravel Bank's freestanding credit derivatives held for trading fell from EUR 18 billion to EUR 4 billion. The most likely effect of this change is:","options":{"A":"lower volatility of reported earnings, because fair value changes on freestanding derivatives are recognized in profit or loss each period.","B":"no effect on earnings volatility, because derivatives are reported only as off-balance-sheet notional amounts.","C":"lower volatility of other comprehensive income only, because fair value changes on these derivatives are recorded in OCI."},"answer":"A","explanation":"独立（freestanding、非套期）衍生品按公允价值计量，公允价值变动每期直接计入损益（交易收益）。敞口大幅下降，交易收益乃至净利润的波动性随之降低。\n· 未指定为现金流套期的衍生品，其公允价值变动不进 OCI。\n· 衍生品以公允价值在表内列示，名义本金只是披露口径，其公允价值变动会影响利润。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_19","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Tamsin Bank funds itself mainly with short-term deposits and holds mostly long-term fixed-rate mortgages. An economist expects short-term interest rates to rise sharply while long-term rates remain broadly unchanged. If this occurs, Tamsin's net interest margin will most likely:","options":{"A":"widen, because higher interest rates increase the yield on its assets.","B":"remain unchanged, because both its assets and liabilities are interest-bearing.","C":"narrow, because the cost of its liabilities will rise faster than the yield on its assets."},"answer":"C","explanation":"银行短借长贷：负债（短期存款）很快按新利率重新定价，资产（长期固定利率按揭）收益率基本不变。短端利率上升 → 融资成本上升快于资产收益 → 净息差收窄。\n· 长期固定利率资产不会随短端利率迅速重新定价。\n· 资产和负债都计息，但重新定价的期限不同，这正是利率风险的来源。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 19 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_20","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Bellweather Bank moves a large amount of surplus cash into reverse repurchase agreements, backed by government securities, that mature within 30 days. Which Basel III measure is most directly affected by this decision?","options":{"A":"The net stable funding ratio, which compares available stable funding with required stable funding over a 30-day horizon.","B":"The total capital ratio, which compares total capital with total (unweighted) assets.","C":"The liquidity coverage ratio, which compares high-quality liquid assets with expected net cash outflows over a 30-day stress period."},"answer":"C","explanation":"LCR = 高流动性资产（HQLA）/ 30 天压力情景下的预期净现金流出。30 天内到期、以国债为抵押的逆回购属于 30 天窗口内的高流动性头寸，直接影响 LCR。\n· NSFR 衡量的是一年期（不是 30 天）的可用稳定资金 / 所需稳定资金。\n· 总资本比率的分母是风险加权资产，不是未加权总资产；且该决策主要是流动性问题。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 20 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_25","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following statements about types of financial institutions is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Credit unions, cooperative banks and mutual banks are deposit-taking institutions owned by their members rather than by outside shareholders.","B":"Mortgage banks are member-owned institutions that mainly accept deposits from their members.","C":"Mutual banks are owned by shareholders and primarily originate, sell and service mortgages."},"answer":"A","explanation":"信用社、合作银行和互助银行（mutual banks）都是由会员（存款人/借款人）所有的吸收存款机构，而不是由外部股东所有。\n· 主要发放、出售和服务按揭并参与证券化的是抵押贷款银行（mortgage banks），且互助银行并非股东所有。\n· 抵押贷款银行一般不以吸收会员存款为主，也不是会员所有。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 25 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_26","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the Basel III liquidity requirements is most accurate?","options":{"A":"The liquidity coverage ratio requires enough high-quality liquid assets to cover expected net cash outflows over a 30-day stress scenario.","B":"The liquidity coverage ratio requires stable funding sufficient to meet liquidity needs over a one-year horizon.","C":"The net stable funding ratio requires available stable funding to be at least equal to required stable funding over a 90-day horizon."},"answer":"A","explanation":"Basel III 的两个流动性指标：\nLCR：HQLA ≥ 30 天压力情景下的预期净现金流出。\nNSFR：可用稳定资金 ≥ 所需稳定资金，期限为一年。\n· NSFR 的期限是一年，不是 90 天。\n· 一年期稳定资金是 NSFR 的内容，把两者混淆了。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_28","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst is assessing the adequacy of a bank's allowance for loan losses. Which of the following ratios is least useful for this purpose?","options":{"A":"Allowance for loan losses to net income.","B":"Provision for loan losses to net loan charge-offs.","C":"Allowance for loan losses to non-performing loans."},"answer":"A","explanation":"评估贷款损失准备是否充足常用：准备 / 不良贷款、准备 / 净冲销、拨备 / 净冲销——都把准备与实际或潜在的贷款损失对比。\n准备 / 净利润把信用损失的储备与盈利水平比较，与贷款组合的风险无直接关系，没有分析意义。\n· 准备 / 不良贷款衡量准备对问题贷款的覆盖程度，很有用。\n· 拨备 / 净冲销衡量当期计提是否足以弥补实际核销，也很有用。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 28 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_29","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following is most accurately described as a key change introduced by Basel III?","options":{"A":"An increase in the minimum proportion of risk-weighted assets that must be funded with common equity capital.","B":"A requirement that banks report earnings quality metrics to regulators each quarter.","C":"Replacing risk-weighted capital requirements entirely with a single ratio of capital to total assets."},"answer":"A","explanation":"Basel III 的核心改进之一是提高资本质量和数量：提高普通股权益（CET1）占风险加权资产的最低比例，并增加资本留存缓冲等；同时引入 LCR、NSFR 两项流动性要求和杠杆率。\n· 盈利质量不是 Basel III 的监管指标。\n· 杠杆率是对风险加权资本要求的补充（backstop），不是替代。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_36","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Amberley Bank is a regional bank that lends almost exclusively to households and small businesses in one domestic region and has negligible foreign currency assets or liabilities. Which non-CAMELS factor is least relevant to an analysis of Amberley?","options":{"A":"Currency exchange rate exposure.","B":"The bank's stated mission of concentrating its lending in one region.","C":"Contingent liabilities arising from pending litigation."},"answer":"A","explanation":"非 CAMELS 因素要结合银行自身业务判断相关性。Amberley 只服务本国区域客户，几乎没有外币资产负债，所以汇率敞口最不相关。\n· 银行使命（集中于某一地区）决定了其地域集中度风险和增长前景，是相关的。\n· 诉讼带来的或有负债可能影响资本，对任何银行都相关。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_37","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Kittering Life Insurance reports fixed income investment income of 96 for the year, earned on bonds, loans and term deposits. Balances at the beginning and end of the year were: bonds 1,600 and 1,700; loans 240 and 280; term deposits 120 and 100. The return on Kittering's fixed income assets is closest to:","options":{"A":"4.62%","B":"4.75%","C":"5.82%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"固定收益资产包括债券、贷款和存款，分母用平均余额：\n平均余额 = 1,650 + 260 + 110 = 2,020\n回报率 = 96 / 2,020 = 4.75%\n· 5.82%：分母只用了债券平均余额，漏了贷款和存款。\n· 4.62%：用了期末余额而不是平均余额。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 37 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_40","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the regulation and reporting of insurance companies is most accurate?","options":{"A":"US insurers are regulated primarily by a federal agency and report to it under US GAAP.","B":"US insurers report to state regulators using statutory accounting rules, and there is no single global regulatory standard for insurers.","C":"Insurance regulation is harmonized globally under the Basel III framework."},"answer":"B","explanation":"美国保险公司主要受各州监管，向州监管机构按法定会计规则（statutory accounting）报告，法定会计比 GAAP 更保守、侧重偿付能力；全球也没有统一的保险监管标准（不像银行有 Basel 框架）。\n· 美国保险业以州监管为主，监管报告用法定会计而非 US GAAP。\n· Basel III 针对银行，不适用于保险公司。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 40 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_42","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"For Halvard Bank (in thousands), earnings before tax were 64,300 last year and 87,100 this year, and loan loss provisions were 11,900 last year and 6,250 this year. The proportion of the increase in earnings before tax attributable to the change in loan loss provisions is closest to:","options":{"A":"6.5%","B":"7.2%","C":"24.8%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"要用变化量对比变化量：\nEBT 增加 = 87,100 − 64,300 = 22,800\n拨备减少 = 11,900 − 6,250 = 5,650\n贡献 = 5,650 / 22,800 = 24.8%\n· 7.2%：用的是拨备水平 / EBT 水平，不是变化量。\n· 6.5%：分子是变化量，分母却用了 EBT 水平。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 42 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_4_44","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A bank funds itself with short-term deposits and makes long-term loans, earning the spread between long-term and short-term interest rates. This value-creating activity is best described as:","options":{"A":"maturity transformation.","B":"contractual maturity mismatch.","C":"credit risk transfer."},"answer":"A","explanation":"银行把短期负债（存款）转化为长期资产（贷款），赚取长短期利差，这种创造价值的方式叫期限转换（maturity transformation）。\n· 合同期限错配是期限转换的结果（并带来流动性风险），不是这一活动的名称。\n· 信用风险转移是指用 CDS、证券化等把信用风险转给他人，与短借长贷无关。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 44 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_5_1","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst reviews the financial reports of Orchid Apparel. Which of the following is most likely a warning sign that reported earnings are overstated?","options":{"A":"A shortening of the estimated useful lives of the company's depreciable assets.","B":"A decline in sales returns and allowances as a percentage of revenue.","C":"Revenue growth substantially above that of peer companies without a clear competitive explanation."},"answer":"C","explanation":"收入增速显著高于同业、又没有合理的竞争优势解释，是收入可能被提前确认、高估或不可持续的典型预警信号。\n· 缩短折旧年限会增加折旧费用、降低利润，是保守做法。\n· 折扣和退货的增加（而不是减少）才是预警信号，可能说明渠道塞货或产品质量问题。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 1 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_5_28","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Dunmore Telecom changes its accounting so that discounts offered to acquire new customers, previously expensed as incurred, are now capitalized as an intangible asset and amortized. Compared with expensing, this change will most likely result in:","options":{"A":"higher cash flow from operations and a lower debt-to-assets ratio.","B":"no change in cash flow from operations and a lower debt-to-assets ratio.","C":"higher cash flow from operations and a higher debt-to-assets ratio."},"answer":"A","explanation":"资本化后，相关现金流出被归入投资活动（购置无形资产），不再全部计入经营活动，经营现金流增加。资产负债表上多了一项资产，负债不变，所以负债/资产下降。\n· 资产增加而负债不变，D/A 只会下降不会上升。\n· 现金流的分类改变了：费用化时整笔流出在经营活动，资本化后移到投资活动，CFO 会变化。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 28 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_5_29","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under IFRS, Severn Media wrote down a licensing intangible asset in 2024 and reversed the write-down in 2026 when conditions improved. Compared with what they would have been without the write-down, Severn's 2025 net profit margin and return on assets are most likely:","options":{"A":"both understated.","B":"both overstated.","C":"overstated for net profit margin but understated for return on assets."},"answer":"B","explanation":"2024 年减记后，2025 年无形资产账面价值偏低 → 摊销费用偏低 → 2025 年净利润偏高；同时总资产偏低。\n净利率 = 净利润 / 收入：分子偏高 → 高估。\nROA = 净利润 / 总资产：分子偏高、分母偏低 → 高估。\n· 总资产偏低只会让 ROA 更高，不会被低估。\n· 减值损失影响的是 2024 年利润，不是 2025 年；2025 年因摊销减少利润反而被高估。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_5_30","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Using the Altman Z-score model, an analyst computes Z-scores for Lockton Freight of 1.97 for 2024 and 2.29 for 2025. The analyst's most appropriate conclusion is that Lockton's probability of bankruptcy:","options":{"A":"is now low, because the score has increased.","B":"remains uncertain, because the score is still within the zone of ignorance.","C":"is high, because the score is below 3.0."},"answer":"B","explanation":"Altman Z = 1.2×(营运资本/总资产) + 1.4×(留存收益/总资产) + 3.3×(EBIT/总资产) + 0.6×(权益市值/负债账面值) + 1.0×(收入/总资产)\n2024: Z = 1.2×0.12 + 1.4×0.15 + 3.3×0.07 + 0.6×0.55 + 1.0×1.05 = 1.97\n2025: Z = 1.2×0.14 + 1.4×0.18 + 3.3×0.09 + 0.6×0.7 + 1.0×1.15 = 2.29\n判断标准：Z > 3.0 破产概率低；Z < 1.81 破产概率高；1.81–3.0 为不确定区间（zone of ignorance）。两年都在不确定区间，所以结论是“仍不确定”。\n· 分数上升不等于进入低风险区，要看所处区间。\n· 低于 3.0 但高于 1.81 不是高风险，只有低于 1.81 才是。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 30 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_6_2","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Five-way DuPont components for Fenwick Tools:\n| Component | 2023 | 2024 | 2025 |\n| Tax burden | 0.75 | 0.75 | 0.75 |\n| Interest burden | 0.90 | 0.90 | 0.90 |\n| EBIT margin | 0.080 | 0.086 | 0.093 |\n| Asset turnover | 1.20 | 1.26 | 1.31 |\n| Financial leverage | 2.10 | 1.95 | 1.85 |\nThe conclusion best supported by this analysis is that ROE:","options":{"A":"rose because of higher operating profitability and efficiency, but would have risen more had financial leverage not declined.","B":"fell because the declining financial leverage outweighed the gains in margin and turnover.","C":"rose mainly because the company increased its financial leverage."},"answer":"A","explanation":"ROE = 税负 × 利息负担 × EBIT 利润率 × 资产周转率 × 财务杠杆\n2023: ROE = 0.75×0.9×0.08×1.2×2.1 = 13.61%\n2024: ROE = 0.75×0.9×0.086×1.26×1.95 = 14.26%\n2025: ROE = 0.75×0.9×0.093×1.31×1.85 = 15.21%\nEBIT 利润率和资产周转率持续上升，但财务杠杆从 2.1 降到 1.85，抵消了部分改善。若杠杆保持 2.1，2025 年 ROE 将为 17.27%。\n· 杠杆是下降的，不是 ROE 上升的原因。\n· ROE 实际上从 13.61% 升至 15.21%，并没有下降。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_6_6","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Wexford plc reports under IFRS and classifies interest paid as a financing cash flow and taxes paid as an operating cash flow. This year, cash flow from operations was 1,520, interest paid was 140, income taxes paid were 380, and operating profit (EBIT) was 1,000. To compare cash generation with EBIT on a consistent basis, the ratio of adjusted operating cash flow to operating profit is closest to:","options":{"A":"1.52","B":"1.90","C":"2.04"},"answer":"B","explanation":"EBIT 是息税前的，所以要把 CFO 调整为“息税前”口径：加回已在 CFO 中扣除的利息和税款。\n该公司按 IFRS 把利息归入筹资活动，CFO 中未扣利息，只需加回已付税款：\n(1,520 + 380) / 1,000 = 1.90\n· 2.04：又加回了利息，但利息并未在 CFO 中扣除，重复加回。\n· 1.52：没有加回已付税款，与息税前的 EBIT 不可比。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_6_8","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst is completing a DuPont analysis for Corran Chemicals. For the most recent year, revenue was 9,600, total asset turnover (revenue / total assets) was 1.60, and total liabilities were 3,400. Corran's financial leverage ratio (total assets / total equity) is closest to:","options":{"A":"1.31","B":"1.76","C":"2.31"},"answer":"C","explanation":"总资产 = 收入 / 资产周转率 = 9,600 / 1.6 = 6,000\n权益 = 总资产 − 总负债 = 6,000 − 3,400 = 2,600\n财务杠杆 = 总资产 / 权益 = 6,000 / 2,600 = 2.31\n· 1.31：算成了负债/权益（D/E），DuPont 中的杠杆是总资产/权益（= 1 + D/E）。\n· 1.76：用总资产除以负债，分母用错了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_6_12","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst wants to determine whether Pemberton Foods' growth over the past five years came mainly from acquisitions. Which balance sheet trend provides the strongest evidence of an acquisition-driven strategy?","options":{"A":"Large increases in goodwill and identifiable intangible assets.","B":"Large increases in property, plant and equipment.","C":"Large increases in cash and short-term investments."},"answer":"A","explanation":"商誉只在收购其他企业时产生（支付对价超过可辨认净资产公允价值的部分），收购还会带来可辨认无形资产（客户关系、品牌等）。商誉和无形资产大幅增加是并购扩张最直接的证据。\n· PP&E 增加也可能来自内生扩张（自建产能），不能单独证明并购。\n· 现金增加与并购没有必然联系，甚至可能说明没有大额收购支出。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_6_13","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ravensworth Group reports consolidated net income of 860 (before allocation to non-controlling interests). This includes income from associates accounted for using the equity method of 95; net income attributable to non-controlling interests is 70. An analyst wants to isolate net income generated by operations under management's direct control. That amount is closest to:","options":{"A":"695","B":"765","C":"790"},"answer":"B","explanation":"联营企业（权益法）只是有重大影响，管理层无法直接控制其经营，应剔除；而少数股东损益来自公司控制的子公司，其经营仍在管理层控制之内，不应剔除。\n= 860 − 95 = 765\n· 695：把归属少数股东的净利润也剔除了，但控股子公司在管理层控制之内。\n· 790：剔除了少数股东损益却没剔除联营企业收益，正好反了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fsa_6_18","subject":"EOC · 财报 Financial Statement Analysis","subjectKey":"eoc_fsa","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Working capital data for Ashgrove Electronics (use COGS for both inventory and payables days, 365-day year):\n| Item | Year 1 | Year 2 |\n| Revenue | 7,300 | 7,900 |\n| COGS | 5,110 | 5,600 |\n| Inventory | 840 | 1,105 |\n| Accounts receivable | 900 | 960 |\n| Accounts payable | 560 | 600 |\nThe change in Ashgrove's cash conversion cycle is best explained by:","options":{"A":"a longer cycle, driven mainly by the company paying its suppliers much more slowly.","B":"a shorter cycle, driven mainly by faster collection of receivables.","C":"a longer cycle, driven mainly by an increase in days of inventory on hand."},"answer":"C","explanation":"CCC = 存货天数 + 应收天数 − 应付天数\nYear 1: DIO 60.0 + DSO 45.0 − DPO 40.0 = 65.0 天\nYear 2: DIO 72.0 + DSO 44.4 − DPO 39.1 = 77.3 天\nCCC 延长了 12.3 天，主要来自存货天数增加 12.0 天；应收天数略降，应付天数基本稳定（付款甚至略快）。\n· 付款变慢会缩短而不是延长 CCC，而且应付天数实际略有下降。\n· 应收天数只小幅下降，CCC 整体是延长的。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_3","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Halvorsen Tools declares a 10% stock dividend, and its competitor Brightwater Inc. completes a 2-for-1 stock split. Assuming all else is equal, which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Brightwater's share price and EPS both fall by half, so its P/E ratio is unchanged.","B":"Brightwater's P/E ratio falls, because the split reduces EPS by more than it reduces the share price.","C":"Halvorsen's share price rises, because shareholders receive additional shares at no cost."},"answer":"A","explanation":"股票股利和拆股都只是把同一块“蛋糕”切成更多份：公司总市值、总盈利不变。\n拆股 2-for-1：股数翻倍 → 股价减半、EPS 减半 → P/E = 价格/EPS 不变。\n10% 股票股利：股数增加 10% → 每股价格约降为原来的 1/1.1，同样不改变 P/E。\n· “股票股利使股价上升”：错，其他条件不变时股数增加只会让每股价格下降，股东总财富不变。\n· “拆股使 P/E 下降”：错，股价和 EPS 同比例下降，比率不变。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_6","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Norrland Paper has 20 million shares outstanding and total book value of equity of $500 million. Its shares trade at $40.00. The company uses $80 million of cash to repurchase shares at the market price. Book value per share after the repurchase is closest to:","options":{"A":"$21.00","B":"$23.33","C":"$27.78"},"answer":"B","explanation":"回购股数按市价计算：80m / 40.00 = 2.0m 股\n回购后 BVPS = (原账面权益 − 回购金额) / (原股数 − 回购股数)\n= (500m − 80m) / (20m − 2.0m) = 23.33\n（原 BVPS = 25.00；市价高于账面价值，回购会使 BVPS 下降。）\n· $27.78：股数减少了，但忘了账面权益也要减去回购支出的现金。\n· $21.00：扣减了权益，但没有减少流通股数。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_12","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor owns 80,000 shares of Castellan Foods, which trade at $52.00 just before going ex-dividend. The company pays a cash dividend of $2.00 per share, and the investor reinvests the entire dividend in additional shares at the ex-dividend price. Assume dividends and capital gains are not taxed and there are no other information effects. After reinvestment, the investor's total shareholding is closest to:","options":{"A":"82,963 shares","B":"83,077 shares","C":"83,200 shares"},"answer":"C","explanation":"税率为零时，除息日股价下跌金额正好等于股利：P_ex = 52.00 − 2.00 = 50.00\n股利总额 = 80,000 × 2.00 = 160,000\n可买新股 = 160,000 / 50.00 = 3,200 股；合计 = 83,200 股\n· 83,077 shares：用除息前价格 52.00 买入，忽略了除息后股价下跌。\n· 82,963 shares：误以为除息后股价上升了股利金额，方向反了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_15","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following factors is most likely associated with a company having a low dividend payout ratio?","options":{"A":"Poor growth prospects and few positive-NPV investment opportunities.","B":"High flotation costs on new equity issues.","C":"A tax regime in which dividends are taxed at a lower rate than capital gains."},"answer":"B","explanation":"新股发行成本（flotation costs）越高，外部股权融资越贵，公司越倾向于把盈利留存下来满足投资需求 → 派息率低。\n· 增长前景差、缺乏正 NPV 项目：公司没有好的再投资机会，应把现金还给股东 → 派息率高。\n· 股利税率低于资本利得税率：股东更偏好股利 → 派息率高。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_16","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Kestrel Logistics paid a dividend of $0.80 per share last year. It expects EPS of $5.00 this year, has a target payout ratio of 30%, and closes the gap between its current and target dividend using an adjustment factor of 0.25. Using the gradual adjustment (target payout) model, the expected dividend per share this year is closest to:","options":{"A":"$0.975","B":"$1.175","C":"$1.500"},"answer":"A","explanation":"预期股利 = 上期股利 + (预期 EPS × 目标派息率 − 上期股利) × 调整系数\n= 0.80 + (5.00 × 0.30 − 0.80) × 0.25\n= 0.80 + (1.50 − 0.80) × 0.25 = 0.975\n· $1.500：一步调整到目标股利，忽略了调整系数（相当于调整系数 = 1）。\n· $1.175：把调整系数乘在目标股利上而不是乘在“差额”上，没有减去上期股利。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 16 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_17","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Over the past eight years, Marrow Utilities' EPS has ranged from $1.90 to $3.40, but management has paid $1.20 per share every year and says it will raise the dividend only when it is confident that higher long-run earnings are sustainable. This approach is best described as a:","options":{"A":"residual dividend policy.","B":"stable dividend policy.","C":"constant dividend payout ratio policy."},"answer":"B","explanation":"稳定股利政策：在长期盈利前景没有改变时，保持每股股利平稳（甚至多年不变），只有确信长期盈利上升时才提高股利。\n· 固定派息率政策：每年按盈利的固定比例派息，股利会随 EPS 波动，与本题每年 1.20 不变不符。\n· 剩余股利政策：先满足资本预算的权益需求，剩下的才分红，股利会随投资机会和盈利大幅波动。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_18","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ostrander Labs has net income of $6.0 million and 2.4 million shares outstanding. It uses surplus cash to repurchase 400,000 shares at $40.00 per share. The company's after-tax cost of debt is 5%, but the surplus cash currently earns no return. Assuming total earnings are unaffected by the repurchase, EPS after the repurchase is closest to:","options":{"A":"$2.50","B":"$2.60","C":"$3.00"},"answer":"C","explanation":"用于回购的现金本来就没有收益，所以总盈利不变：\nEPS = 6.0m / (2.4m − 0.4m) = 6.0m / 2.0m = 3.00\n· $2.50：这是回购前的 EPS，忽略了股数减少。\n· $2.60：错误地按 5% 的税后债务成本扣减了“放弃的收益” 800,000；题设现金无收益、也没有借债，总盈利不应扣减。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_24","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The board of Pellworth Chemicals wants a repurchase method that lets management buy shares opportunistically over the next two years, stepping in whenever the share price falls sharply, without committing to a specific price, quantity, or date. The method that best meets this objective is a:","options":{"A":"open market repurchase program.","B":"Dutch auction tender offer.","C":"fixed price tender offer."},"answer":"A","explanation":"公开市场回购：公司可以在授权额度内自主决定何时、以什么价格、买多少，股价下跌时可灵活入场托市，也没有必须买完的义务，灵活性最高。\n· 固定价格要约回购：价格、数量和截止日期事先确定，一次性完成，不能在两年内随行情灵活买入。\n· 荷兰式拍卖：在价格区间内征集股东报价、确定最低成交价，也是在特定时间内一次性完成，同样缺乏持续托市的灵活性。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 24 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_25","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A cash dividend and a share repurchase of the same total amount will most likely have equivalent effects on shareholders' wealth when:","options":{"A":"the two distributions are taxed identically and convey the same information to the market.","B":"the repurchase is financed with new debt rather than surplus cash.","C":"the repurchase is executed at a price below the shares' intrinsic value."},"answer":"A","explanation":"现金股利与等额回购对股东财富等价的前提：分配的现金相同、税负相同、信息含量相同（以市价回购）。只要税负或信号不同，结果就会不同。\n· 以低于内在价值的价格回购：会在卖出股东与留下股东之间转移财富，不再等价。\n· 举债回购：改变资本结构和财务风险，与“分配相同现金”的前提不符，不是等价条件。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 25 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_32","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst makes three statements comparing a share repurchase with a cash dividend of equal total amount. Which statement is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Both methods distribute cash to every shareholder in proportion to the shares held.","B":"Announcing a repurchase authorization does not obligate the company to buy back any shares, whereas a declared dividend must be paid.","C":"A repurchase gives management more flexibility than a regular dividend over the timing and amount of the distribution."},"answer":"A","explanation":"最不准确的是“两种方式都按持股比例把现金分给每位股东”：现金股利确实按比例分给所有股东，但回购只有卖出股票的股东拿到现金，留下的股东持股比例上升。\n· “宣布回购不构成义务、已宣告股利必须支付”：正确，回购授权只是上限，可以不执行。\n· “回购比常规股利更灵活”：正确，回购在时间和金额上都可以灵活调整，不会像削减股利那样释放负面信号。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 32 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_35","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Fenwick Marine has debt of $300 million and equity of $1,000 million. A bond covenant requires its debt-to-equity ratio to stay at or below 40%. The board is considering a $150 million share repurchase, financed either entirely with cash on hand or entirely with new borrowing. Which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Both financing choices would breach the covenant, because any repurchase reduces equity.","B":"Neither financing choice would breach the covenant, because the repurchase is smaller than existing debt.","C":"Only the debt-financed repurchase would breach the covenant."},"answer":"C","explanation":"回购都会使权益减少 150m：\n· 现金回购：D/E = 300 / (1,000 − 150) = 35.3% ≤ 40%，不违约。\n· 举债回购：债务增加、权益减少，D/E = (300 + 150) / 850 = 52.9% > 40%，违约。\n· “两种都违约”：现金回购虽然减少了权益，但 D/E 只升到 35.3%，仍在上限内。\n· “两种都不违约”：是否违约要看回购后的比率，而不是回购金额与债务的大小比较；举债回购后 D/E 达 52.9%。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 35 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_36","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Tamsin Holdings sells its packaging division, which accounted for about 40% of its assets, and distributes the entire after-tax proceeds to shareholders as a one-time cash payment. This distribution is best described as a:","options":{"A":"regular cash dividend.","B":"liquidating dividend.","C":"special dividend."},"answer":"B","explanation":"公司出售部分业务（或清算），把所得返还给股东，属于清算股利（liquidating dividend），实质是返还资本。\n· 特别股利：在常规股利之外不定期额外派发，资金一般来自经营产生的超额现金，而不是出售业务。\n· 常规现金股利：按固定周期（季度/年度）持续派发，不是一次性的。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_38","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following statements about stock dividends is least accurate?","options":{"A":"All else equal, a stock dividend does not change the company's total market value.","B":"A stock dividend does not change any shareholder's proportional ownership of the company.","C":"Shareholders typically owe income tax on the market value of the additional shares they receive."},"answer":"C","explanation":"最不准确：股票股利一般不需缴税（股东只是持有了更多股数，成本基础被摊薄，并没有收到现金）。\n· “不改变持股比例”：正确，所有股东按相同比例获得新股。\n· “不改变公司总市值”：正确，只是把同一块“蛋糕”切得更小，股价按比例下降。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 38 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_39","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following statements about share repurchase methods is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Greenmail is the repurchase of a potential acquirer's shares at a discount to the market price.","B":"In a fixed price tender offer, the company offers to buy a stated number of shares at a fixed price, typically above the current market price.","C":"A Dutch auction lets the company determine the lowest price at which it can buy back the desired number of shares."},"answer":"A","explanation":"最不准确：绿邮（greenmail）是公司以高于市价的溢价（premium）从潜在收购方手中回购股票，换取其放弃收购，不是折价。\n· 固定价格要约回购：正确，事先确定价格和数量，通常相对市价有溢价。\n· 荷兰式拍卖：正确，股东在价格区间内报价，公司选取能买够目标数量的最低价格。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 39 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_1_42","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Selected data for Arbuckle Retail (in $ millions):\n| | Year 1 | Year 2 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Net income | 380 | 400 |\n| Dividends paid | 145 | 152 |\nThe Year 2 dividend coverage ratio and the change in dividend safety from Year 1 to Year 2 are closest to:","options":{"A":"0.380x; dividend safety decreased","B":"2.500x; dividend safety decreased","C":"2.632x; dividend safety increased slightly"},"answer":"C","explanation":"股利覆盖率 = 净利润 / 已付股利\nYear 1：380 / 145 = 2.621x\nYear 2：400 / 152 = 2.632x\n覆盖率上升（虽然幅度很小），说明股利安全性略有提高；对应的派息率从 38.16% 降到 38.00%。\n· 2.500x：用了 Year 1 的净利润除以 Year 2 的股利，口径错配。\n· 0.380x：算的是派息率（股利/净利润），是覆盖率的倒数；派息率下降反而意味着安全性提高。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 42 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_2_9","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Compared with ESG integration in equity analysis, ESG integration in fixed-income analysis most likely places greater emphasis on:","options":{"A":"identifying and limiting downside risk.","B":"estimating the effect of ESG factors on the issuer's long-term earnings growth.","C":"identifying upside opportunities that could increase expected cash flows."},"answer":"A","explanation":"债券持有人的收益有上限（本息），主要担心的是违约和信用恶化，所以债券分析中 ESG 整合的重点是识别和降低下行风险；股票分析则既用 ESG 发现机会（上行），也防范下行风险。\n· 发掘上行机会：这是股票分析中 ESG 整合的重要用途，对债权人价值有限。\n· 长期盈利增长：股东分享增长带来的剩余收益，债权人不分享，这不是债券分析的重点。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_2_15","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Corvane Steel owns 14% of the shares of Delmar Automotive, its largest customer, and Delmar owns 11% of Corvane. The cross-holding between Corvane and Delmar is best described as an example of:","options":{"A":"dispersed ownership.","B":"horizontal ownership.","C":"vertical (pyramid) ownership."},"answer":"B","explanation":"横向持股（horizontal ownership）：有业务往来的公司（如主要客户、供应商）之间相互交叉持股。Corvane 与其最大客户 Delmar 互相持股，正属于此类。\n· 分散持股：股东众多、没有任何单一股东能对公司施加控制；它描述的是股东分布，而本题的特征是两家有业务往来的公司之间 11%–14% 的战略性交叉持股。\n· 纵向（金字塔）持股：控股股东通过多层公司链条控制下层公司，不是双向交叉持股。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_2_18","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A fund holds bonds of Rissel Packaging that mature in three years. The company announces three initiatives:\n| Initiative | Description |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Convert its main plant to renewable energy; cost savings expected to begin in Year 6 |\n| 2 | Publish an annual diversity report beginning next year |\n| 3 | Tighten raw-material sourcing standards immediately to avoid regulatory fines expected within 18 months |\nFrom the bondholders' perspective, the initiative with the greatest ESG materiality is most likely:","options":{"A":"Initiative 1.","B":"Initiative 3.","C":"Initiative 2."},"answer":"B","explanation":"对债权人来说，ESG 因素是否重要取决于其影响能否在投资期限（3 年）内影响发行人的偿债能力。Initiative 3 涉及环境议题，可避免 18 个月内的监管罚款，直接影响期限内的现金流和信用风险，重要性最高。\n· Initiative 1：节约成本要到第 6 年才开始，落在债券到期之后，对债权人重要性低。\n· Initiative 2：只是信息披露，对期限内的现金流和违约风险影响很小。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_3_3","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"To estimate a company's long-term cost of equity, an analyst adds a historical equity risk premium measured relative to Treasury bill returns to the current Treasury bill yield. Historically the yield curve has been upward sloping, but the curve is currently inverted. The analyst's estimate of the long-term required return on equity is most likely:","options":{"A":"unbiased.","B":"understated.","C":"overstated."},"answer":"C","explanation":"两个因素都使估计偏高：\n1) 正常情况下收益率曲线向上倾斜，短期国债收益率低于长期国债，所以相对短期国债测算的历史 ERP 更大；\n2) 目前曲线倒挂，当前短期利率高于长期利率。\n用“更大的 ERP + 更高的短期利率”去估算长期股权要求回报 → 高估。正确做法是长期国债收益率 + 相对长期国债测算的 ERP。\n· understated：方向反了，两个偏差都向上。\n· unbiased：只有期限匹配（长期利率配长期 ERP）才无偏。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_3_7","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Halberd Retail is recognizing a new five-year store lease on its balance sheet. It does not know the residual value the lessor expects or the lessor's initial direct costs. The discount rate Halberd should most likely use to measure the lease liability is the:","options":{"A":"company's weighted average cost of capital.","B":"rate implicit in the lease, computed from the lease payments alone.","C":"rate Halberd would pay on a five-year collateralized borrowing."},"answer":"C","explanation":"租赁负债应按租赁内含利率折现；但内含利率需要知道出租人预期的残值现值和初始直接成本，承租人通常无法得知，所以使用增量借款利率，即承租人以类似资产作抵押、借入相同期限资金的利率。\n· 仅用租金算内含利率：缺少残值和初始直接成本，无法正确计算内含利率。\n· WACC：反映整个公司的风险和资本结构（含股权），不是有担保借款的成本，会高估折现率、低估租赁负债。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_4_5","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following is most likely an advantage of comparable company analysis relative to discounted cash flow analysis when valuing a target?","options":{"A":"The valuation automatically includes the takeover premium paid in recent acquisitions.","B":"The valuation is insensitive to market mispricing of the comparable companies.","C":"The valuation is derived directly from current market data rather than from many assumptions about future cash flows."},"answer":"C","explanation":"可比公司法的优点：估值直接来自可比公司的市场价格（市场数据），不像 DCF 那样依赖大量关于未来现金流、增长率、折现率的假设。\n· 对错误定价不敏感：恰恰相反，如果可比公司整体被高估/低估，估值也会随之偏差，这是它的主要缺点。\n· 自动包含收购溢价：可比公司的价格是少数股权交易价格，不含控制权溢价；包含溢价的是可比交易法。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 5 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_4_10","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst values the three segments of Alder Group on a stand-alone basis (enterprise values, $ billions): Industrial 84, Healthcare 62, Consumer 51. Alder's market capitalization is $150 billion and its net debt is $28 billion. The diversification discount is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD –19 billion","B":"USD 19 billion","C":"USD 47 billion"},"answer":"B","explanation":"分部加总（SOTP）企业价值 = 84 + 62 + 51 = 197bn\n当前企业价值 = 市值 + 净债务 = 150 + 28 = 178bn\n多元化折价 = SOTP 估值 − 当前交易的企业价值 = 197 − 178 = 19bn（正数，说明市场对集团整体打了折扣）\n· USD –19 billion：减法方向反了。\n· USD 47 billion：用了股权市值而不是企业价值，口径不一致（分部是 EV，要加上净债务）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_corp_4_13","subject":"EOC · 公司 Corporate Issuers","subjectKey":"eoc_corp","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Recent acquisitions of comparable companies were completed at P/E multiples of 14.2, 18.9, 16.1, 15.4, 17.3. Bexley Corp. has just acquired Winton Ltd., whose EPS is $3.20, for $49.00 per share. Using the median comparable transaction multiple, the fair acquisition price per share and the most appropriate conclusion are closest to:","options":{"A":"$45.44; Bexley overpaid","B":"$51.52; Bexley underpaid","C":"$51.52; Bexley overpaid"},"answer":"B","explanation":"可比交易 P/E 排序：14.2, 15.4, 16.1, 17.3, 18.9，中位数 = 16.1\n公允收购价 = 16.1 × 3.20 = 51.52\n实际支付 49.00 < 公允价值 51.52 → 收购方少付了（underpaid），对收购方股东有利。\n· $51.52; overpaid：数算对了，但结论方向反了；支付价低于公允价值是少付。\n· $45.44; overpaid：用了最低倍数 14.2 而不是中位数。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_1_13","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Lumora Software derives most of its value from internally developed code, customer relationships, and brand, with few tangible assets. It has paid a dividend only twice in the past ten years, and its capital structure is expected to change as it adds debt. Which absolute valuation approach is most appropriate?","options":{"A":"A dividend discount model.","B":"An asset-based valuation approach.","C":"A free cash flow to the firm (FCFF) model."},"answer":"C","explanation":"正确答案是 FCFF 模型。公司价值主要来自无形资产，资产基础法很难可靠地估计这些资产的价值；股利只是偶尔支付，与盈利能力没有稳定关系，DDM 也不合适。FCFF 不依赖股利政策，资本结构变化时也适用，适用面最广。\n· DDM：只适合有稳定派息、且股利与盈利能力相关的公司。\n· 资产基础法：适合以有形资产为主、资产易于按市价估值的公司，无形资产占主导时不适用。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_1_23","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Two regional fitness-club chains, Pulse and Stride, have each built strong local brands and long-term site leases that competitors cannot easily replicate, and both have sustained above-industry margins for many years. When applying the market-multiple approach, an analyst would most likely conclude that:","options":{"A":"both chains may justify higher valuation multiples than their competitors.","B":"neither chain should receive a higher multiple, because competitive advantages are always competed away.","C":"only the chain with the larger current market share may justify a higher multiple."},"answer":"A","explanation":"两家公司都建立并维持了相对竞争对手的优势（品牌 + 难以复制的长期租约），这样的公司都可以享有比同业更高的估值倍数。\n· 只看市场份额更大的一家：竞争优势不是只能属于份额最大的公司，两家都具备可持续的优势。\n· 优势一定被竞争消除：可持续的竞争优势正是支持更高倍数的理由，不能一概否定。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_4","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Kestrel Foods earned EPS of $1.20 last year. An analyst expects EPS to grow at 8% per year for the next 8 years, with a constant payout ratio of 25%. At the end of year 8, the stock is expected to trade at a P/E of 14.0 times year-8 EPS. The required return on equity is 11%. The value per share today is closest to:","options":{"A":"$13.49","B":"$15.62","C":"$33.22"},"answer":"B","explanation":"第 t 年 EPS = 1.2 × 1.08^t，股利 = 0.25 × EPS\n第 8 年 EPS = 2.2211，终值 V8 = 14.0 × 2.2211 = 31.0956\n终值现值 = 31.0956 / 1.11^8 = 13.4932\nD1–D8 的现值合计 = 2.1258\nV0 = 2.1258 + 13.4932 = 15.62\n· $33.22：终值没有折现 8 年，直接加上了第 8 年末的价格。\n· $13.49：只算了终值的现值，漏掉了前 8 年股利的现值。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 4 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_10","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Harlow Utilities has a beta of 1.10. The risk-free rate is 3.0% and the equity risk premium is 4.5%. Dividends are expected to grow at a constant 4.0% per year, and the analyst believes the stock is fairly priced. Using the Gordon growth model, the expected dividend yield (D1/P0) is closest to:","options":{"A":"3.80%","B":"3.95%","C":"7.95%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"CAPM：r = 3.0% + 1.1 × 4.5% = 7.95%\n定价合理时，预期总回报 = 要求回报率；Gordon 模型下总回报 = D1/P0 + g\nD1/P0 = r − g = 7.95% − 4.0% = 3.95%\n· 7.95%：这是总回报（要求回报率），没有减去增长率。\n· 3.80%：这是 D0/P0（又除了一次 1 + g），题目问的是前瞻股息率 D1/P0。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_22","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Corvane Industries has a dividend payout ratio of 60% and a sustainable return on equity of 12%. Its required return on equity is 8.3%. Assuming the Gordon growth model applies, Corvane's justified forward P/E is closest to:","options":{"A":"11.43","B":"17.14","C":"17.97"},"answer":"B","explanation":"g = b × ROE = (1 − 0.6) × 0.12 = 4.80%\n合理前瞻 P/E = P0/E1 = 派息率 / (r − g) = 0.6 / (0.083 − 0.048) = 17.14\n· 17.97：这是合理的滚动（trailing）P/E，多乘了 (1 + g)。\n· 11.43：分子用了留存率 b，而不是派息率 1 − b。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 22 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_23","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Bellmont Retail trades at $24.00. Its trailing EPS was $1.55 and its forecast EPS for next year is $1.60. The company pays out 75% of earnings, dividends are expected to grow at 3% indefinitely, and the required return is 8%. Based on a comparison of the justified and actual forward P/E, Bellmont's shares are most likely:","options":{"A":"undervalued.","B":"overvalued.","C":"fairly valued."},"answer":"C","explanation":"合理前瞻 P/E = 派息率 / (r − g) = 0.75 / (0.08 − 0.03) = 15.00\n实际前瞻 P/E = 股价 / E1 = 24.0 / 1.6 = 15.00\n两者相等，说明股票定价合理。\n· 高估：如果误用滚动 EPS，P/E = 24.0/1.55 = 15.48，会高于合理前瞻 P/E 而误判为高估；前瞻 P/E 必须与前瞻 P/E 比较。\n· 低估：实际 P/E 并不低于合理 P/E，没有低估的依据。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_24","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Analyst A writes: \"The Gordon growth model cannot be applied to Ferrowind because the company returns cash through share repurchases as well as dividends.\" Analyst B writes: \"The Gordon growth model can still be applied to Ferrowind provided the dividend growth rate is adjusted to reflect the effect of the repurchases.\" Ferrowind is a mature company with stable dividends. Which analyst's statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Analyst B's statement.","B":"Analyst A's statement.","C":"Neither statement, because repurchases have no effect on dividend growth."},"answer":"A","explanation":"回购不会自动让 Gordon 模型失效。只要公司处于稳定增长阶段，并且分析师能就回购对每股股利增长的影响做出合理调整（回购减少股数，可能提高每股股利增长率），Gordon 模型仍然适用。\n· Analyst A：把回购当成使用 Gordon 模型的绝对障碍，说法过于绝对。\n· 两者都不对：回购会减少流通股数，确实可能影响每股股利的增长，因此需要调整增长率。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 24 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_33","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Tamsin Chemicals paid a dividend of $2.40 at the end of 2025. Dividends are expected to grow at 12% in each of 2026 and 2027, at 8% in 2028, and at 4% per year thereafter. The required return is 9%. The value per share at the end of 2025 is closest to:","options":{"A":"$53.33","B":"$57.72","C":"$59.73"},"answer":"C","explanation":"起点是刚支付的 D0 = 2.4，第一年就要乘以 (1 + g)：\nD1 = 2.6880，D2 = 3.0106，D3 = 3.2514，D4 = 3.3815\n2028 年末终值 V3 = D4 / (r − g) = 3.3815 / (0.09 − 0.04) = 67.6292\nV0 = D1/1.09 + D2/1.09² + (D3 + V3)/1.09³ = 59.73\n· $53.33：把 D0 直接当成 2026 年的股利，第一年没有乘以 (1 + g)。\n· $57.72：终值用了 D3/(r − g)，应该用下一年的股利 D4。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 33 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_36","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Norland Packaging has a net profit margin of 5%, total asset turnover of 1.10, and financial leverage (assets/equity) of 2.00. An analyst expects its sustainable growth rate to be 4.2%. The dividend payout ratio consistent with this growth rate is closest to:","options":{"A":"23.6%","B":"38.2%","C":"61.8%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"杜邦分解：ROE = 0.05 × 1.1 × 2.0 = 11.0%\ng = b × ROE → b = 0.042 / 0.110 = 38.18%\n派息率 = 1 − b = 61.8%\n· 38.2%：这是留存率 b，不是派息率。\n· 23.6%：ROE 漏乘了财务杠杆（只用了 ROA = 5.5%）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_43","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Vantrex Mining pays no dividends. Over the next five years, its planned capital expenditures far exceed its operating cash flow, so both FCFF and FCFE are expected to be negative, although the company is expected to be profitable. Which valuation model is most appropriate?","options":{"A":"A free cash flow to equity model.","B":"A dividend discount model.","C":"A residual income model."},"answer":"C","explanation":"公司不派息，DDM 无从使用；未来几年 FCF 为负，FCFE/FCFF 模型的价值几乎全部压在遥远的终值上，可靠性很差。公司有盈利、有账面价值，剩余收益模型用会计账面价值和盈利，在 FCF 为负时仍然适用。\n· FCFE 模型：FCF 预计连续为负，不适合。\n· DDM：公司不支付股利，也不适合。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 43 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_44","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ostrava Water just paid an annual dividend of $1.60. Dividends are expected to grow at 4.5% per year indefinitely, and the required return is 8.5%. The value of the stock today is closest to:","options":{"A":"$40.00","B":"$41.80","C":"$43.68"},"answer":"B","explanation":"V0 = D1 / (r − g) = D0 × (1 + g) / (r − g) = 1.6 × 1.045 / (0.085 − 0.045) = 41.80\n· $40.00：直接用了刚支付的 D0，没有推算下一期股利 D1。\n· $43.68：多乘了一次 (1 + g)，用了 D2。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 44 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_45","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Granby Tools trades at $44.00. Its EPS over the past year was $3.00, EPS for next year is forecast at $3.24, and the company pays out 50% of earnings. The required return on equity is 9%. The present value of growth opportunities (PVGO) per share is closest to:","options":{"A":"$8.00","B":"$10.67","C":"$26.00"},"answer":"A","explanation":"P0 = E1/r + PVGO\n零增长价值 = E1 / r = 3.24 / 0.09 = 36.00\nPVGO = 44.0 − 36.00 = 8.00\n· $10.67：零增长价值用了过去一年的 E0，应该用下一年的 E1。\n· $26.00：用股利 D1 而非盈利 E1 计算零增长价值；无增长时公司会把全部盈利派发，应以 E1 计算。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 45 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_58","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An economy is expected to grow at 2.8% in real terms with inflation of 2.2%. Delmont Brewing's earnings and dividends have been growing at about 5.3% per year and are expected to continue at that pace, with a stable payout ratio and ROE close to its cost of equity. Delmont is most likely in the:","options":{"A":"transition phase.","B":"mature phase.","C":"growth phase."},"answer":"B","explanation":"名义 GDP 增速 ≈ 实际增速 + 通胀 = 2.8% + 2.2% = 5.0%\n公司增速 5.3% 与经济名义增速接近，派息率稳定，ROE 接近股权成本，属于成熟阶段。\n· 增长阶段：超常增长阶段的增速应明显高于经济的名义增速；你可能只拿实际增速 2.8% 做比较。\n· 过渡阶段：过渡期的特征是增速逐步下滑、资本支出下降、派息率上升，题中增速已经稳定。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 58 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_2_59","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A fund adds a stock to its portfolio only if its Gordon growth model value exceeds the market price by at least $1.00. Halvard Mills paid annual dividends of $1.40, $1.52, $1.60, $1.71, and $1.83 in 2021 through 2025, respectively. The analyst estimates long-term dividend growth as the compound annual growth rate over this period. The required return is 10.5% and the stock trades at $54.19. The intrinsic value and the decision are closest to:","options":{"A":"$38.64; do not add the stock","B":"$54.74; do not add the stock","C":"$69.84; add the stock"},"answer":"B","explanation":"2021 到 2025 年共 5 个股利、4 个增长期：g = (1.83/1.4)^(1/4) − 1 = 6.93%\nV0 = D0 × (1 + g)/(r − g) = 1.83 × 1.0693 / (0.105 − 0.0693) = 54.74\n内在价值比市价 54.19 只高 0.55 美元，不到 1 美元，所以不加入组合。\n· $38.64：增长期数用了 5，应该是 4（5 个数据点之间只有 4 个间隔）。\n· $69.84：用总增长率除以 4 的简单平均（7.68%）代替复合增长率，高估了 g 和价值，从而错误地加入组合。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 59 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_3_12","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"For the most recent year, Pellam Logistics reported net income of $1,850 million, depreciation of $620 million, investment in working capital of $140 million, fixed capital investment of $780 million, and net borrowing of $210 million. It has 400 million shares outstanding. FCFE is expected to grow at 10% for 3 years and at 4% thereafter. The stock's beta is 1.20, the risk-free rate is 3.5%, and the equity risk premium is 5%. The value per share is closest to:","options":{"A":"$74.36","B":"$94.42","C":"$97.67"},"answer":"C","explanation":"FCFE0 = NI + 非现金费用 − 营运资本投资 − 固定资产投资 + 净借款 = 1,850 + 620 − 140 − 780 + 210 = 1,760\nCAPM：r = 3.5% + 1.2 × 5% = 9.5%\nFCFE1–3 = 1,936.0、2,129.6、2,342.6\n第 3 年末终值 = FCFE4 / (r − g) = 2,436.3 / (0.095 − 0.04) = 44,295.7\n全部折现后股权价值 = 39,066.3 百万，每股 = 97.67\n· $74.36：净借款的符号反了（应加上，减成了 FCFE0 = 1,340）。\n· $94.42：终值用了 FCFE3/(r − g)，应使用下一年的 FCFE4。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_3_36","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst values Rivenhall Media with a single-stage FCFE model using base-year FCFE of $2.50 per share, a required return of 9%, and a growth rate of 4% (base value $52.00). For sensitivity analysis she uses these ranges: required return 8%–10%, growth rate 3.5%–4.5%, and base-year FCFE ±15%. The valuation is most sensitive to:","options":{"A":"the required return on equity.","B":"the long-term FCFE growth rate.","C":"the base-year FCFE."},"answer":"A","explanation":"基准价值 = 2.5 × 1.04 / (0.09 − 0.04) = 52.00\n每次只改变一个输入，其余保持基准值：\nThe required return on equity：8.0%–10.0% → 43.33 至 65.00，区间宽度 21.67\nThe long-term FCFE growth rate：3.5%–4.5% → 47.05 至 58.06，区间宽度 11.01\nThe base-year FCFE：$2.125–$2.875 (±15%) → 44.20 至 59.80，区间宽度 15.60\n区间最宽的是「The required return on equity」，估值对它最敏感。\n· The long-term FCFE growth rate：区间宽度只有 11.01，比 21.67 窄；不能只看输入本身变动的百分比大小。\n· The base-year FCFE：区间宽度只有 15.60，比 21.67 窄；不能只看输入本身变动的百分比大小。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_3_37","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ashdown Power's capital structure at market values is: debt $400 million (pretax cost 6.0%), preferred stock $100 million (cost 7.0%), and common equity $1,500 million (cost 10.5%). The tax rate is 25%. FCFF for the year just ended was $150 million and is expected to grow at 4.5% indefinitely. The value of the firm is closest to:","options":{"A":"$3,183 million","B":"$3,309 million","C":"$3,389 million"},"answer":"C","explanation":"WACC = 0.20 × 6.0% × (1 − 0.25) + 0.05 × 7.0% + 0.75 × 10.5% = 9.125%\nFCFF1 = 150.0 × 1.045 = 156.75\n企业价值 = FCFF1 / (WACC − g) = 156.75 / (0.09125 − 0.045) = 3,389.2\n（WACC − g 很小，计算时要保留足够小数位。）\n· $3,183：债务成本没有做税后调整（WACC = 9.425%）。\n· $3,309：漏掉了优先股，只用债务和普通股计算 WACC（9.237%）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 37 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_3_61","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst rejects EBITDA as a proxy for Corbel Systems' FCFE, giving two reasons. Reason 1: \"EBITDA does not reflect the cash the company must spend on capital expenditures.\" Reason 2: \"EBITDA understates FCFE because depreciation has already been deducted in computing it.\" Which of the analyst's reasons is valid?","options":{"A":"Reason 1 only.","B":"Both reasons.","C":"Reason 2 only."},"answer":"A","explanation":"Reason 1 成立：EBITDA 没有扣除资本支出（也没有扣营运资本投资），不能代表可分配给股东的现金流，这是它不适合做 FCFE 代理的主要原因。\nReason 2 不成立：EBITDA 是扣除折旧摊销之前的利润，折旧并没有被扣除。\n· 只有 Reason 2：Reason 2 本身是错的。\n· 两个都对：Reason 2 对 EBITDA 的定义理解错误。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 61 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_3_62","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Wexley Hotels reported net income of $84 million, which includes a $6 million gain from reversing a restructuring provision recorded in a prior year and a $3 million unrealized fair value gain on investment property. Neither gain generated cash. Depreciation was $30 million, fixed capital investment $40 million, working capital investment $8 million, and net borrowing $10 million. FCFE is closest to:","options":{"A":"$67 million","B":"$76 million","C":"$79 million"},"answer":"A","explanation":"两项都是增加了利润的非现金收益，都要从净利润中扣除：\nFCFE = 84 + 30 − 6 − 3 − 40 − 8 + 10 = 67\n· $79：把重组准备转回的 6 加了回去；转回是非现金收益，应扣除。\n· $76：两项非现金收益都没有调整。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 62 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_3_65","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Marlowe Shipping's FCFF for the year is $620 million. Interest expense was $210 million, the tax rate is 30%, and long-term debt decreased by $150 million during the year (no other debt changes). FCFE is closest to:","options":{"A":"$260 million","B":"$323 million","C":"$623 million"},"answer":"B","explanation":"FCFE = FCFF − 利息 × (1 − t) + 净借款\n长期债务减少 150 是净还款，净借款 = –150\nFCFE = 620 − 210 × 0.70 − 150 = 323\n· $623：净借款的符号反了，把还款当成了借款。\n· $260：利息没有做税后调整，应减 147 而不是 210。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 65 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_11","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Quillan Apparel's share price is $52.40. Annual sales were $18.6 billion, there are 425 million shares outstanding, and net debt is $4.0 billion. Quillan's price-to-sales ratio is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.84","B":"1.20","C":"1.41"},"answer":"B","explanation":"每股销售额 = 18.6 bn / 0.425 bn = 43.76\nP/S = 52.4 / 43.76 = 1.20\n· 0.84：算成了倒数 S/P。\n· 1.41：这是 EV/Sales，把净债务也计入了分子；P/S 只用股权价值。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_12","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst is applying a P/E multiple to value Brannock Steel, whose earnings swing sharply with the business cycle. The economy is currently near a cyclical peak. To reduce the effect of the cycle on the valuation, the analyst should most likely base the P/E on:","options":{"A":"normalized (mid-cycle) EPS.","B":"next year's consensus forecast EPS.","C":"the most recent trailing EPS."},"answer":"A","explanation":"周期性公司的盈利随经济周期大幅波动，估值时应使用标准化（周期中段）EPS，例如历史平均 EPS 或平均 ROE × 当前每股账面价值。\n· 最近的滚动 EPS：处于周期顶部时盈利偏高，P/E 偏低，会误导估值。\n· 下一年预测 EPS：同样受当前周期位置影响，不能消除周期波动。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_15","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Holloway Brands completed a large acquisition at the start of this year. Its share price is $45.00; trailing EPS (pre-acquisition) was $2.00, and forecast EPS for this year, including the acquired business, is $2.50. Expected long-term EPS growth is 18% per year. The analyst regards a PEG of 1.0 as fair value. The appropriate PEG ratio and conclusion are:","options":{"A":"0.72; undervalued","B":"1.00; fairly valued","C":"1.25; overvalued"},"answer":"B","explanation":"近期发生了大型收购，滚动 EPS 不能反映合并后的盈利能力，应使用前瞻 EPS：\n前瞻 P/E = 45.0 / 2.5 = 18.00\nPEG = P/E ÷ 预期增长率（百分数）= 18.00 / 18 = 1.00，等于 1.0，定价合理。\n· 1.25：用了收购前的滚动 EPS（P/E = 22.5）。\n· 0.72：把收购带来的一次性 EPS 跳升（25%）当成了长期增长率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_18","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"For next year, Sorrel Insurance is expected to pay a dividend of $1.85 on EPS of $4.40. The required return is 12% and long-term growth is 5%. Sorrel's justified forward P/E is closest to:","options":{"A":"6.01","B":"6.31","C":"8.28"},"answer":"A","explanation":"合理前瞻 P/E = (D1/E1) / (r − g) = (1.85/4.4) / (0.12 − 0.05) = 0.4205 / 0.07 = 6.01\n· 6.31：多乘了 (1 + g)，这是滚动 P/E 的公式。\n· 8.28：分子用了留存率而不是派息率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_19","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Cardew Bank reports total shareholders' equity of $1,800 million, which includes $300 million of preferred stock. It has 75 million common shares outstanding trading at $36.00. Cardew's price-to-book ratio is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.56","B":"1.50","C":"1.80"},"answer":"C","explanation":"每股账面价值 = (股东权益总额 − 优先股) / 普通股股数 = (1,800 − 300) / 75 = 20.00\nP/B = 36.0 / 20.00 = 1.80\n· 1.50：没有扣除优先股，每股账面价值高估为 24.00。\n· 0.56：算成了倒数 B/P。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 19 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_21","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"| Peer | Forward P/E |\n| Peer 1 | 4.0 |\n| Peer 2 | 5.0 |\n| Peer 3 | 6.5 |\n| Peer 4 | 12.0 |\nTavish Motors trades at $38.00 with forecast EPS of $6.00. Using the harmonic mean of the peers' forward P/Es as the benchmark, the benchmark value and Tavish's relative valuation are:","options":{"A":"5.82; Tavish is relatively overvalued","B":"6.88; Tavish is relatively undervalued","C":"5.82; Tavish is relatively undervalued"},"answer":"A","explanation":"调和平均 = n / Σ(1/PE) = 4 / (1/4 + 1/5 + 1/6.5 + 1/12) = 5.82\nTavish 前瞻 P/E = 38.0 / 6.0 = 6.33 > 5.82，相对同业高估。\n· 6.88：这是算术平均，受 12.0 这个极端值拉高；用它会得出低估的结论。\n· 5.82 但低估：P/E 高于基准意味着相对高估，方向判断反了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 21 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_22","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ellery Cement's ROE over its most recent complete business cycle (2021–2024) was 15.8%, 9.4%, 11.2%, and 16.0%. Current total shareholders' equity is $2,400 million, including $200 million of preferred stock, and there are 110 million common shares outstanding. Using the method of average return on equity, normalized EPS is closest to:","options":{"A":"$2.62","B":"$2.86","C":"$3.20"},"answer":"A","explanation":"平均 ROE = (15.8% + 9.4% + 11.2% + 16.0%) / 4 = 13.10%\n当前每股普通股账面价值 = (2,400 − 200) / 110 = 20.00\n标准化 EPS = 13.10% × 20.00 = 2.62\n· $2.86：账面价值没有扣除优先股。\n· $3.20：只用了最近一年的 ROE，没有取整个周期的平均。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 22 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_24","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Dunmore Plastics reported diluted EPS of $1.47. This figure includes a non-recurring gain from a legal settlement of $0.06 per share, a non-recurring plant-integration charge of $0.05 per share, and $0.03 per share of additional depreciation on a new production line that will continue in future years. The share price is $29.20. The P/E based on underlying earnings is closest to:","options":{"A":"19.60","B":"19.73","C":"20.00"},"answer":"C","explanation":"基础 EPS = 摊薄 EPS − 非经常性收益 + 非经常性费用 = 1.47 − 0.06 + 0.05 = 1.46\n新生产线的折旧会持续发生，属于经常性项目，不调整。\nP/E = 29.2 / 1.46 = 20.00\n· 19.60：把经常性的折旧 0.03 也加回了（EPS = 1.49）。\n· 19.73：两项非经常性项目的调整方向反了（EPS = 1.48）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 24 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_25","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"| Company | Price | Trailing EPS | Forecast EPS | Expected growth |\n| Alder | 42.00 | 2.73 | 3.00 | 10% |\n| Birchwood | 54.00 | 2.50 | 3.00 | 20% |\n| Cedarline | 30.00 | 2.29 | 2.50 | 9% |\nBased on the forward PEG ratio, the most attractive stock is:","options":{"A":"Birchwood","B":"Cedarline","C":"Alder"},"answer":"A","explanation":"前瞻 PEG = 前瞻 P/E ÷ 预期增长率（百分数），越低越有吸引力：\nAlder：42.00/3.00 = 14.00，PEG = 14.00/10 = 1.400\nBirchwood：54.00/3.00 = 18.00，PEG = 18.00/20 = 0.900\nCedarline：30.00/2.50 = 12.00，PEG = 12.00/9 = 1.333\nBirchwood 的 PEG 最低，最有吸引力。\n· Alder：PEG = 1.400，高于 Birchwood。\n· Cedarline：PEG = 1.333，高于 Birchwood；它只是前瞻 P/E 最低，但没有考虑增长率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 25 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_27","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Statement 1: \"Under the Fed model, the equity market is viewed as overvalued when the market's forward earnings yield is below the yield on 10-year Treasury bonds.\" Statement 2: \"Unlike the Fed model, the Yardeni model incorporates the consensus five-year earnings growth forecast for the market.\" Which statement is correct?","options":{"A":"Statement 1 only.","B":"Both statements.","C":"Statement 2 only."},"answer":"B","explanation":"Statement 1 正确：Fed 模型比较市场前瞻盈利收益率（E/P）与 10 年期国债收益率；E/P 低于国债收益率时股市被高估，高于时被低估。\nStatement 2 正确：Yardeni 模型 CEY = CBY − b × LTEG + 残差，引入了市场五年一致预期盈利增长率 LTEG，这是 Fed 模型没有的。\n· 只有 Statement 1 / 只有 Statement 2：两句都正确。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 27 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_29","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Statement 1: \"A relative strength indicator compares a stock's performance during a period either with its own past performance or with the performance of a group of stocks.\" Statement 2: \"For a given earnings surprise, a company whose past earnings surprises have been very volatile will have a higher standardized unexpected earnings (SUE) score.\" Which statement is correct?","options":{"A":"Statement 1 only.","B":"Statement 2 only.","C":"Both statements."},"answer":"A","explanation":"Statement 1 正确：相对强弱指标把股票的表现与其自身历史或一组股票比较。\nStatement 2 错误：SUE = 未预期盈利 ÷ 过去未预期盈利（预测误差）的标准差。过去的意外越波动，分母越大，同样的意外得到的 SUE 越低，而不是越高。\n· 只有 Statement 2：Statement 2 的方向错了。\n· 两句都对：同上，Statement 2 不成立。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_56","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"| Stock | Index weight (market cap) | P/E |\n| W | 40% | 8.0 |\n| X | 30% | 12.0 |\n| Y | 20% | 16.0 |\n| Z | 10% | 25.0 |\nThe P/E of this capitalization-weighted index, calculated as a weighted harmonic mean, is closest to:","options":{"A":"10.93","B":"12.50","C":"12.87"},"answer":"A","explanation":"加权调和平均 = 1 / Σ(w_i × E/P_i)：先按市值权重对各成分股的 E/P 加权，再取倒数。\n0.4/8 + 0.3/12 + 0.2/16 + 0.1/25 = 0.09150\n指数 P/E = 1 / 0.09150 = 10.93\n· 12.87：用的是等权重的调和平均，没有按市值加权。\n· 12.50：这是加权算术平均，会高估指数 P/E。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 56 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_4_61","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst states: \"Ranking stocks by earnings yield (E/P) rather than P/E (1) keeps the measure meaningful when a company's EPS is very small, zero, or negative, and (2) removes the distortions caused by non-recurring items and by the business cycle.\" The analyst is correct with respect to:","options":{"A":"point (2) only.","B":"point (1) only.","C":"both points."},"answer":"B","explanation":"(1) 正确：EPS 接近零或为负时 P/E 会变得极大或没有意义，E/P 仍然可以排序比较。\n(2) 错误：E/P 只是 P/E 的倒数，分子仍是同样的盈利，非经常性项目和周期波动的影响依然存在，需要使用基础盈利或标准化盈利才能处理。\n· 只有 (2)：(2) 不成立。\n· 两点都对：E/P 并不能消除非经常性项目和周期的影响。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 61 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_11","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Using a single-stage residual income model, an analyst finds that the intrinsic value of Orwell Insurance equals its current book value per share. This result most likely implies that Orwell's:","options":{"A":"expected ROE equals its cost of equity.","B":"expected growth rate in residual income is zero.","C":"payout ratio is 100%."},"answer":"A","explanation":"V0 = B0 + (ROE − r) × B0 / (r − g)。若 V0 = B0，则剩余收益的现值为零，即 ROE = r：公司赚取的回报恰好等于股权成本，不创造超额价值。\n· 增长率为零：g = 0 时只要 ROE ≠ r，仍有 (ROE − r) × B0 / r 的剩余收益价值。\n· 派息率 100%：派息政策本身不会让剩余收益消失。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_12","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Thornbury Bank has a current book value per share of $42.50. Its ROE is expected to remain 13% indefinitely, its cost of equity is 10%, and residual income is expected to grow at 6% per year. Using a single-stage residual income model, the value per share is closest to:","options":{"A":"$31.87","B":"$55.25","C":"$74.38"},"answer":"C","explanation":"V0 = B0 + B0 × (ROE − r) / (r − g) = 42.5 + 42.5 × (0.13 − 0.1) / (0.1 − 0.06) = 42.5 + 31.8750 = 74.38\n· $55.25：分母用了 r，忽略了剩余收益的增长（相当于 g = 0）。\n· $31.87：只算了剩余收益的现值，漏加了当前账面价值 B0。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_14","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ingleby Corp's latest net income was reduced by a large restructuring charge that management describes as non-recurring. When forecasting residual income, the analyst should most appropriately:","options":{"A":"increase the cost of equity to reflect the additional risk signaled by the restructuring.","B":"exclude the restructuring charge from the earnings used to forecast future residual income.","C":"treat the charge as recurring, because it was reported in net income under the clean surplus relation."},"answer":"B","explanation":"非经常性项目不代表未来的持续盈利能力，预测剩余收益时应从净利润中剔除，以免低估未来的剩余收益。\n· 提高股权成本：重组费用是对利润的一次性调整，与股权成本（风险）无关，不应通过改变折现率处理。\n· 当成经常性：会把一次性损失外推到未来，低估公司价值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_15","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Fenwick Media has a current book value per share of $30.00. Forecast residual income per share for years 1, 2, and 3 is $2.40, $2.70, and $3.00. After year 3, residual income is expected to fade with a persistence factor of 0.60. The cost of equity is 10%. The value per share is closest to:","options":{"A":"$36.67","B":"$38.92","C":"$39.37"},"answer":"C","explanation":"V0 = B0 + Σ(t=1..T−1) RI_t/(1+r)^t + RI_T / [(1 + r − ω)(1 + r)^(T−1)]\n前两年 RI 现值 = 2.4/1.10 + 2.7/1.10² = 4.4132\n终值项 = 3.0 / [(1 + 0.1 − 0.6) × 1.10²] = 4.9587\nV0 = 30.0 + 4.4132 + 4.9587 = 39.37\n· $38.92：终值项多折现了一期（用了 (1 + r)^T）。\n· $36.67：只算了三年的 RI，忽略了第 3 年后以持续因子衰减的剩余收益。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_17","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Because the residual income model is based on accounting earnings, one of its implicit assumptions is that:","options":{"A":"book value per share equals market price per share.","B":"interest expense appropriately reflects the cost of debt capital.","C":"dividends grow at a constant rate indefinitely."},"answer":"B","explanation":"剩余收益 = 净利润 − 股权资本成本。净利润已经扣除了利息费用，所以模型隐含假设利息费用恰当地反映了债务资本的成本。\n· 股利永续固定增长：这是 Gordon 模型的假设，剩余收益模型不依赖股利。\n· 账面价值等于市价：模型正是要估计市价相对账面价值的溢价，并不需要这个假设。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_50","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Brisco Telecom has a market capitalization of $1,450 million and debt with a market value of $600 million. The book value of its equity is $900 million and the book value of its debt is $580 million. Brisco's market value added (MVA) is closest to:","options":{"A":"$550 million","B":"$570 million","C":"$1,150 million"},"answer":"B","explanation":"MVA = 公司市场价值（股权 + 债务）− 总资本的账面价值\n= (1,450 + 600) − (900 + 580) = 570\n· $550：只用了股权（市值 − 股权账面价值）。\n· $1,150：分子含债务，但分母只减了股权账面价值，口径不一致。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 50 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_52","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst makes two adjustments to Halsey Group's balance sheet before applying a residual income model. Adjustment 1: an equity investment carried at a historical cost of $40 million is restated to its fair value of $55 million. Adjustment 2: a lease previously kept off the balance sheet is capitalized, recognizing a right-of-use asset and an equal lease liability of $30 million. Which adjustment(s) change Halsey's book value of equity?","options":{"A":"Adjustment 2 only.","B":"Both adjustments.","C":"Adjustment 1 only."},"answer":"C","explanation":"账面权益 = 资产 − 负债。\nAdjustment 1：资产增加 15m，负债不变，权益增加 15m。\nAdjustment 2：资产和负债同时增加 30m，相互抵消，权益不变。\n· 只有 Adjustment 2：租赁资本化不影响权益。\n· 两者都改变：同上，Adjustment 2 对权益没有影响。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 52 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_60","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Linford Brands has a current book value per share of $24.00. ROE (on beginning book value) is expected to be 15% for each of the next 3 years, with a payout ratio of 40%. The cost of equity is 11%. At the end of year 3, the stock is expected to trade at 1.40 times book value. The stock currently trades at $31.00. The intrinsic value per share is closest to:","options":{"A":"$33.57","B":"$35.64","C":"$58.36"},"answer":"B","explanation":"清洁盈余逐年推算账面价值：B1 = 26.1600，B2 = 28.5144，B3 = 31.0807\nRI_t = (ROE − r) × B_(t−1)：0.9600、1.0464、1.1406，现值合计 2.5481\n终值溢价 = (P/B − 1) × B3 = (1.4 − 1) × 31.0807 = 12.4323，折现 = 9.0904\nV0 = 24.0 + 2.5481 + 9.0904 = 35.64，高于市价 31.0，股票被低估。\n· $33.57：终值溢价用了期初账面价值 24.0，应乘第一阶段末的 B3。\n· $58.36：终值用了 P/B × B3 的全部价格，没有减去 B3，账面价值被重复计算。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 60 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_63","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following items reported by Marsden Holdings most likely violates the clean surplus relation?","options":{"A":"Ending book value equal to beginning book value plus net income minus dividends declared.","B":"Remeasurement gains on an integrated foreign subsidiary remeasured using the temporal method.","C":"Translation gains on a self-contained foreign subsidiary translated using the current rate method."},"answer":"C","explanation":"清洁盈余关系：期末账面价值 = 期初账面价值 + 净利润 − 股利。凡是绕过利润表、直接进入权益（OCI）的项目都违反清洁盈余。\n现行汇率法下的折算差额计入 OCI，不经过净利润，违反清洁盈余。\n· 时态法下的重新计量损益计入净利润，满足清洁盈余。\n· 期末 = 期初 + 盈利 − 股利，这正是清洁盈余关系本身。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 63 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_64","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Kilburn Manufacturing sets three goals. Goal 1: sell idle equipment that contributes nothing to operating profit. Goal 2: reduce administrative expenses through process automation, with no change in capital employed. Goal 3: expand into new product lines expected to earn a return on capital below the company's WACC. Which goal is least likely to increase Kilburn's economic value added (EVA)?","options":{"A":"Goal 3.","B":"Goal 2.","C":"Goal 1."},"answer":"A","explanation":"EVA = NOPAT − WACC × 总资本。\nGoal 1：出售闲置资产，总资本下降而 NOPAT 不变，资本费用减少，EVA 上升。\nGoal 2：行政费用下降，NOPAT 上升，资本不变，EVA 上升。\nGoal 3：新项目回报率低于 WACC，新增的 NOPAT 小于新增资本的成本，EVA 下降。\n· Goal 1、Goal 2 都会提高 EVA，所以最不可能提高 EVA 的是 Goal 3。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 64 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_65","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following is most accurately described as a weakness of the residual income model?","options":{"A":"Its use of accounting income assumes that interest expense appropriately reflects the cost of debt capital.","B":"It requires book value to be adjusted for every non-recurring item that is removed from forecast earnings.","C":"It cannot be applied to companies that do not pay dividends or have negative free cash flow."},"answer":"A","explanation":"剩余收益模型的弱点包括：会计数据可能被操纵；需要大量调整；需要清洁盈余关系成立或做相应调整；模型使用会计利润，隐含假设利息费用恰当反映了债务成本，而这未必成立。\n· 账面价值随非经常性项目调整：非经常性项目只需调整预测利润，不需要调整账面价值，因为其影响已经反映在资产价值中。\n· 不能用于不派息或 FCF 为负的公司：恰恰相反，这正是剩余收益模型的优点。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 65 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_66","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Pomeroy Foods began the year with shareholders' equity of $850 million. During the year it earned net income of $120 million and paid dividends of $40 million. Its cost of equity is 11%. Pomeroy's residual income for the year is closest to:","options":{"A":"$17.7 million","B":"$22.1 million","C":"$26.5 million"},"answer":"C","explanation":"RI = 净利润 − 股权成本率 × 期初账面权益 = 120 − 0.11 × 850 = 26.5\n· $17.7：股权资本费用用了期末权益 930（= 850 + 120 − 40）。\n· $22.1：用了期初和期末的平均权益。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 66 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_67","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Residual income per share for Pryor Chemicals in 2026 is $4.80. An analyst expects residual income in 2027 to grow at the company's sustainable growth rate (ROE 18%, retention ratio 0.55) and then to fade with a persistence factor of 0.70. The cost of equity is 12%. The value at the end of 2026 of all residual income from 2027 onward is closest to:","options":{"A":"$11.43","B":"$12.56","C":"$40.00"},"answer":"B","explanation":"可持续增长率 g = ROE × b = 0.18 × 0.55 = 9.9%\nRI_2027 = 4.8 × 1.099 = 5.2752\n2026 年末价值 = RI_2027 / (1 + r − ω) = 5.2752 / (1 + 0.12 − 0.7) = 12.56\n· $11.43：漏了先按 9.9% 把 RI 增长到 2027 年这一步，直接用了 2026 年的 RI。\n· $40.00：把 RI 当成永续不变（ω = 1），用了 RI/r，忽略了持续因子。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 67 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_5_69","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Statement 1: \"Under consistent assumptions, the residual income model and the dividend discount model produce the same intrinsic value.\" Statement 2: \"The residual income model tends to recognize value earlier than the dividend discount model because a large part of value is current book value.\" Statement 3: \"Unlike the dividend discount model, the residual income model can be used only when the analyst forecasts a constant dividend growth rate.\" Which statement is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Statement 2.","B":"Statement 3.","C":"Statement 1."},"answer":"B","explanation":"Statement 1 正确：理论上在一致的假设下，两种模型的估值相同。\nStatement 2 正确：剩余收益模型的价值很大一部分来自当前账面价值，价值确认更早，对终值的依赖更小。\nStatement 3 最不准确：剩余收益模型不需要假设股利增长，即使公司不派息也能使用。\n· Statement 1、Statement 2 都是正确的说法。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 69 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_6_2","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Oakridge Industrial, a strategic buyer, plans to acquire 100% of a private competitor, combine and restructure the operations, and later take the combined business public. In valuing the target, Oakridge should most likely:","options":{"A":"include a control premium reflecting the synergies it expects to realize.","B":"apply a discount for lack of control, because the target is privately held.","C":"apply a discount for lack of marketability, because the target's shares are not publicly traded."},"answer":"A","explanation":"估值目的决定估值方法。战略买方收购 100% 控制权并整合重组，会考虑协同带来的控制权溢价。\n· DLOM：买方将控制并重组公司、之后再上市，流动性折价与这一策略不一致。\n· DLOC：买方取得的是控制权，不存在缺乏控制权的问题。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_6_5","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A private equity firm is bidding for Tremont Labs and intends to merge it with a company it already owns to eliminate overlapping costs and cross-sell products. Relative to a bid based solely on Tremont's standalone improvements, the value most likely includes a:","options":{"A":"discount for lack of control, because the bidder is a financial investor.","B":"synergistic control premium, typically larger than a financial buyer's premium.","C":"financial control premium, because the bidder is a private equity firm."},"answer":"B","explanation":"虽然买方是私募基金，但它计划与现有投资组合公司合并以实现协同，应考虑协同控制权溢价，通常高于只基于目标公司独立改善的财务买方溢价。\n· 财务控制权溢价：买方身份不是关键，关键是能否实现协同。\n· DLOC：买方取得控制权，不适用缺乏控制权折价。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 5 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_6_6","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A publicly traded company is negotiating to acquire a privately held supplier. The acquirer's offer price most likely reflects:","options":{"A":"operating improvements, such as cost reductions, that the acquirer expects to make after the acquisition.","B":"a higher discount rate than for a public company, because the target is private.","C":"the target's standalone value less a discount for lack of marketability."},"answer":"A","explanation":"收购报价通常反映买方收购后能实现的改进（如削减费用、整合采购），因为这些改进的价值由买方实现。\n· 更高的折现率：被收购后目标成为上市公司的一部分，买方通常用自身的资本成本，不会因为目标原本私营而在报价中反映更高的折现率。\n· DLOM：收购整个公司的控制权，股份流动性折价不适用。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_6_10","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Shares of Wynford Labs will be subject to a six-month resale restriction. The shares are valued at $58.81 on a marketable basis, and the continuously compounded risk-free rate is 4%. Six-month European put prices on the shares are:\n| Exercise price | Put value |\n| 58.81 | 6.79 |\n| 60.00 | 7.44 |\nUsing an at-the-money put based on the forward price, the discount for lack of marketability is closest to:","options":{"A":"11.55%","B":"12.40%","C":"12.65%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"远期价 = 58.81 × e^(0.04 × 0.5) = 60.00，所以使用行权价 60.00 的看跌期权。\nDLOM = 看跌期权价值 / 当前价 = 7.44 / 58.81 = 12.65%\n· 11.55%：用了以现价为行权价的看跌期权，应以远期价为行权价。\n· 12.40%：分母用了远期价，应除以当前股价。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_6_20","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst is valuing Ashgrove Quarries, a private company. Transactions in private quarry companies are rare and occurred several years apart, and no public companies have a comparable business mix. Ashgrove's equipment and land could readily be sold to other businesses and redeployed. The most appropriate valuation approach is most likely the:","options":{"A":"guideline transactions method.","B":"asset-based approach.","C":"guideline public company method."},"answer":"B","explanation":"行业内私营公司交易很少且不同期，可比交易法缺少可靠的数据；没有可比的上市公司，可比上市公司法也不合适。公司资产可以出售给其他企业重新利用，资产价值容易可靠地估计，资产基础法最合适。\n· 可比交易法：交易稀少、时间不一致，倍数不可靠。\n· 可比上市公司法：没有业务可比的上市公司。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 20 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_equity_6_30","subject":"EOC · 权益 Equity Valuation","subjectKey":"eoc_equity","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst values Fenmore Dental, a private company, using the capitalized cash flow method on FCFF. She estimates the cost of equity with a build-up method: risk-free rate 3.5%, equity risk premium 5.5%, small-company premium 3.0%, and company-specific risk premium 1.5%. The pretax cost of debt is 7.0%, the tax rate is 25%, and the target debt weight is 30%. FCFF is expected to grow at 4.0% indefinitely. The capitalization rate is closest to:","options":{"A":"7.03%","B":"8.50%","C":"11.03%"},"answer":"A","explanation":"股权成本（累加法）= 3.5% + 5.5% + 3.0% + 1.5% = 13.5%\nWACC = 0.3 × 7.0% × (1 − 0.25) + 0.70 × 13.5% = 11.025%\n资本化率 = 折现率（WACC）− 长期增长率 = 11.025% − 4.0% = 7.03%\n· 8.50%：只是 ERP + 小盘股溢价，并不是资本化率。\n· 11.03%：这是折现率本身，没有减去增长率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 30 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_1_13","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A treasurer enters a five-year interest rate swap in which she pays a fixed rate and receives MRR. In the term structure context, the swap rate on this contract is best described as:","options":{"A":"the difference between the fixed rate and the current MRR on the floating leg.","B":"the spread of the swap's fixed rate over the yield on a five-year government bond.","C":"the fixed rate on the swap's fixed leg, set so that the swap has zero value at initiation."},"answer":"C","explanation":"互换利率（swap rate）就是利率互换固定端的利率，在合约开始时使互换价值为零（固定端现值 = 浮动端现值）。各期限的互换利率构成互换曲线。\n· 固定利率与 MRR 之差：这是两端利率之差，不是互换利率本身。\n· 相对国债收益率的利差：这是互换利差（swap spread），不是互换利率。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_1_26","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A portfolio manager has a two-year investment horizon. The government spot curve is upward sloping, and she expects its level and shape to remain unchanged over the next two years. Compared with buying a two-year bond and holding it to maturity, buying a five-year bond and selling it in two years will most likely produce a total return that is:","options":{"A":"higher, because the bond rolls down the curve and is sold at a lower yield than it was bought at.","B":"lower, because the five-year bond must be sold before maturity, creating price risk that reduces expected return.","C":"the same, because under a stable curve all bonds earn the same return over the horizon."},"answer":"A","explanation":"骑乘收益率曲线（riding the yield curve）：曲线向上倾斜且预期水平、形状都不变时，买入期限长于投资期的债券，随着时间推移债券“滑”到曲线更短、收益率更低的位置，卖出时价格上升，总回报高于期限匹配策略。\n· 回报相同：只有在曲线水平、或远期利率能准确预测未来即期利率时才成立；本题假设曲线形状不变，远期利率高估了未来即期利率。\n· 回报更低：曲线不变时卖出价会因收益率下降而上升，不会因为提前卖出而降低预期回报。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_1_29","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst wants a single spread that is widely viewed as an indicator of the risk and liquidity of money market securities. The most appropriate spread is the:","options":{"A":"MRR–OIS spread.","B":"swap spread, the difference between the 10-year swap rate and the 10-year government yield.","C":"TED spread, the difference between MRR and the yield on a 10-year government bond."},"answer":"A","explanation":"MRR–OIS 利差（原 Libor–OIS 利差）= 银行间无担保拆借利率 − 隔夜指数互换利率，被视为货币市场证券风险和流动性的指标。\n· TED 利差：定义错了，TED 利差是 MRR 与短期国债（T-bill）利率之差，而不是与10年期国债之差；它更多衡量整体经济中的信用风险。\n· 互换利差：衡量的是长期限互换利率相对国债的信用/流动性溢价，不是货币市场的指标。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_1_39","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A government announces spending cuts that are expected to reduce its budget deficit substantially over the next three years. Holding other factors constant, the supply-side effect of this policy on government bond yields is most likely to:","options":{"A":"decrease yields, because the government will issue fewer bonds.","B":"increase yields, because lower government spending raises the risk premium investors demand.","C":"leave yields unchanged, because fiscal policy affects only short-term money market rates."},"answer":"A","explanation":"财政政策的供给侧效应：赤字下降 → 政府发债减少 → 债券供给减少 → 价格上升、收益率下降。反之赤字扩大会推高收益率。\n· 收益率上升：方向反了，赤字下降减少供给，压低而非推高收益率。\n· 不变：财政赤字直接影响各期限国债的供给，并不只作用于货币市场利率。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 39 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_1_69","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Annual-pay government par rates are 1.00% (1 year), 2.50% (2 years), and 3.60% (3 years). Using bootstrapping, the three-year spot rate is closest to:","options":{"A":"3.600%","B":"3.660%","C":"5.979%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"自举法：从平价利率曲线逐期推出即期利率，每一步都用前面已经求出的即期利率折现票息。\nz1 = 1.000%\n1 = 0.025 / (1 + z1) + (1 + 0.025) / (1 + z2)² → z2 = 2.5190%\n1 = 0.036 / (1 + z1) + 0.036 / (1 + z2)² + (1 + 0.036) / (1 + z3)³ → z3 = 3.660%\n· 5.979%：这是2年后开始的1年期远期利率 (1 + z3)³ / (1 + z2)² − 1，不是3年期即期利率。\n· 3.600%：直接把3年期平价利率当成即期利率；曲线向上倾斜时即期利率高于平价利率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 69 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_1_71","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under the liquidity preference theory of the term structure, forward rates are best described as:","options":{"A":"biased estimates of expected future spot rates, because they include a liquidity premium that increases with maturity.","B":"unrelated to expected future spot rates, because each maturity segment's yield is set only by its own supply and demand.","C":"unbiased estimates of expected future spot rates, because investors are risk neutral."},"answer":"A","explanation":"流动性偏好理论：投资者持有长期债券承担更大的价格风险，要求流动性溢价，因此远期利率 = 预期未来即期利率 + 流动性溢价，是有偏估计；即使预期利率不变，曲线也可能向上倾斜。\n· 无偏估计：这是纯预期理论的观点。\n· 与预期即期利率无关：这是市场分割理论的观点。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 71 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_1_72","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst compares the Cox–Ingersoll–Ross (CIR), Vasicek, and Ho–Lee models of the short-term interest rate. Which of her statements is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Each model describes the change in the short rate as the sum of a drift term and a random (volatility) term.","B":"In all three models, the short-term rate is pulled toward a long-run mean level.","C":"In the CIR model, interest rate volatility increases with the level of interest rates."},"answer":"B","explanation":"三个模型结构相同：dr = 漂移项 + 随机项。CIR 和 Vasicek 是均值回归的均衡模型（CIR 的波动率项含 √r，利率越高波动越大；Vasicek 波动率为常数）；Ho–Lee 是无套利模型，漂移项 θ_t 随时间变化以拟合当前曲线，不是均值回归模型。所以“三者都向长期均值收敛”最不准确。\n· 漂移项 + 随机项：准确描述了三个模型的共同结构。\n· CIR 波动率随利率水平上升：准确，σ√r 项决定了这一点。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 72 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_2","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A three-year, 4.5% annual-coupon government bond trades on several exchanges at slightly different prices. Government spot rates are 1.8% (1 year), 2.3% (2 years), and 2.9% (3 years); the corresponding par rates are 1.8000%, 2.2943%, and 2.8781%. The arbitrage-free price of the bond per 100 of par is closest to:","options":{"A":"104.5345","B":"104.6317","C":"104.6936"},"answer":"B","explanation":"无套利价值 = 每笔现金流按对应期限的零息即期利率折现后求和：\n4.5/1.018 + 4.5/1.023² + 104.5/1.029³ = 104.6317\n哪个交易所报价等于这个值，就是无套利价格。\n· 104.5345：所有现金流都用3年期即期利率折现，忽略了前两期应使用更低的即期利率。\n· 104.6936：用平价利率折现各期现金流；平价利率是附息债的收益率，不是零息折现率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_4","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A three-year, 3.5% annual-coupon option-free bond (par 100) is valued with the following calibrated binomial interest rate tree (one-year rates, top row = highest rate):\n| Time 0 | Time 1 | Time 2 |\n| 1.2000% | 2.1598% | 3.6442% |\n|  | 1.6000% | 2.6997% |\n|  |  | 2.0000% |\nThe value of the bond at the upper node at Time 1 is closest to:","options":{"A":"98.1992","B":"101.6252","C":"102.4130"},"answer":"B","explanation":"先求 Time 2 节点价值：V = (100 + 3.5) / (1 + r)\n  HH = 99.8609，HL = 100.7793，LL = 101.4706\nTime 1 上节点只用其右侧相邻的 HH 和 HL：\nV_H = [0.5 × (99.8609 + 3.5) + 0.5 × (100.7793 + 3.5)] / (1 + 2.1598%) = 101.6252\n· 102.4130：用了 HL 和 LL，这两个节点是 Time 1 下节点的后继，不与上节点相连。\n· 98.1992：倒推时漏加了 Time 2 支付的票息。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 4 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_13","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A two-year, 3.0% annual-coupon option-free bond (par 100) is valued with a binomial tree. The one-year rate is 1.50% at Time 0; at Time 1 the rates are 3.4120% (upper node) and 2.5277% (lower node). The value of the bond at the upper node at Time 1 is closest to:","options":{"A":"99.6016","B":"101.4778","C":"102.6016"},"answer":"A","explanation":"Time 1 上节点的价值 = 第2年现金流 / (1 + 该节点利率)\n= (100 + 3.0) / (1 + 3.4120%) = 99.6016\n节点价值不含该节点当时支付的票息；Time 1 的票息在向 Time 0 倒推时才加上。\n· 102.6016：把 Time 1 支付的票息 3.0 也加进了节点价值，倒推到 Time 0 时会重复计算。\n· 101.4778：用 Time 0 的利率折现，应使用该节点自己的利率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_18","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst values a mortgage-backed security using Monte Carlo simulation and increases the number of simulated interest rate paths from 500 to 5,000. Which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"The estimated value converges to the security's true fundamental value as the number of paths increases.","B":"The statistical precision of the estimated value improves, but the estimate does not necessarily move closer to the security's true fundamental value.","C":"Monte Carlo values cannot be made consistent with the benchmark yield curve, so more paths only add noise."},"answer":"B","explanation":"蒙特卡洛模拟：增加路径数会降低估计值的标准误、提高统计精度，但模型估值是否接近真实价值取决于利率模型和假设是否正确，路径多不能消除模型误差。\n· 收敛到真实基本价值：混淆了统计精度与模型准确性。\n· 不能与基准曲线一致：可以通过加入漂移调整项，使模拟路径给基准债券的定价等于市价（校准）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_19","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst needs a term structure model whose parameters can be calibrated so that model bond prices exactly match today's observed yield curve. The model she should most likely choose is the:","options":{"A":"Ho–Lee model.","B":"Vasicek model.","C":"Cox–Ingersoll–Ross model."},"answer":"A","explanation":"Ho–Lee 是无套利模型，用随时间变化的漂移项 θ_t 校准，使模型价格与当前观测的收益率曲线完全吻合。\n· CIR：均衡模型，参数少，一般无法完全拟合观测曲线。\n· Vasicek：同样是均衡模型，由宏观假设推出曲线，不保证拟合观测值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 19 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_23","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A junior analyst makes three statements about calibrating a binomial interest rate tree. Which statement is least accurate?","options":{"A":"The tree is calibrated so that it values on-the-run benchmark bonds at their observed market prices.","B":"Adjacent one-period forward rates at the same time step are linked by the multiplier e^(2σ) under the lognormal assumption.","C":"Calibration requires specialized programming skills and expensive software, so it is impractical for most analysts."},"answer":"C","explanation":"校准利率树用电子表格（如 Excel 的 Solver 反复试算）就能完成，不需要专门编程，也不昂贵，所以第一句最不准确。\n· 相邻节点利率相差 e^(2σ)：准确，这是对数正态模型的设定。\n· 使基准债券的模型价值等于市价：准确，这正是校准的目标，保证树是无套利的。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_24","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following is least likely a principle underlying arbitrage-free valuation?","options":{"A":"Two risky securities with the same expected return must trade at the same price.","B":"The value of a portfolio equals the sum of the values of its component securities.","C":"A risk-free security that pays more than another in every state of the world must have a higher price."},"answer":"A","explanation":"无套利原则针对无风险证券和组合，两个必须成立的条件是：价值可加性（组合价值 = 各部分价值之和）和占优原则（在所有状态下支付更多的无风险资产价格更高）。\n· 价值可加性：是无套利原则之一。\n· 占优原则：是无套利原则之一。\n期望收益相同的有风险证券并不要求价格相同，所以这条最不可能是无套利原则。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 24 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_32","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The calibration of a binomial interest rate tree to the benchmark yield curve least likely depends on the:","options":{"A":"market price of the specific bond that the analyst intends to value with the tree.","B":"market prices of the benchmark bonds.","C":"assumed volatility of interest rates."},"answer":"A","explanation":"校准取决于：利率波动率假设、利率模型（如对数正态）和基准债券的市场价格。被估值债券本身的价格/价值是校准完成后才用树算出来的，不是校准的输入。\n· 波动率假设：决定相邻节点间距，必须先设定。\n· 基准债券市价：校准要求树给基准债券的定价等于其市价。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 32 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_37","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst must value a ten-year corporate bond that the issuer can call at par on any coupon date after year 3. The most appropriate approach is to:","options":{"A":"use a calibrated binomial interest rate tree and check the call condition at each node.","B":"discount the promised cash flows at the bond's yield to worst.","C":"discount the promised cash flows at the benchmark spot rates plus a spread."},"answer":"A","explanation":"可赎回债券的现金流依赖未来利率（利率低时会被赎回），不能用固定的承诺现金流折现。二叉树能生成依赖利率的现金流，并在每个节点检查是否行权，是合适的方法。\n· 用即期利率折现承诺现金流：隐含假设现金流固定，忽略了赎回权。\n· 用最差收益率折现：同样只用一条固定现金流路径，不反映利率波动对期权价值的影响。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 37 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_39","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A three-year, 6.0% annual-coupon government bond trades at 107.37 per 100 par. Government spot rates are 1.0%, 2.2%, and 3.5% for years 1–3; the corresponding par rates are 1.0000%, 2.1869%, and 3.4413%. Government strips trade at prices consistent with the spot rates. The arbitrage strategy is most likely to:","options":{"A":"sell the bond and buy strips that replicate its cash flows, earning about 0.08 per 100 par.","B":"do nothing, because the bond's price lies between its values based on spot and par rates.","C":"buy the bond and sell strips that replicate its cash flows, earning about 0.09 per 100 par."},"answer":"A","explanation":"用即期利率（不是平价利率）折现：V = 6.0/1.01 + 6.0/1.022² + 106.0/1.035³ = 107.2910\n市价 107.37 高于无套利价值 → 债券被高估：卖出债券，用 107.2910 买入复制其现金流的剥离债券，锁定 0.08。\n· 买债券、卖剥离债券：用平价利率折现得到 107.4554，误以为债券被低估；平价利率不能用来折现单笔现金流。\n· 不操作：无套利价值只有一个（即期利率法），市价偏离它就存在套利。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 39 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_40","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"When an analyst values a bond with an embedded option using a binomial interest rate tree, the tree's two roles are best described as:","options":{"A":"supplying discount rates only, because the bond's cash flows are fixed in advance.","B":"generating interest-rate-contingent cash flows and supplying the interest rates used to discount them.","C":"estimating the issuer's default probability and supplying the benchmark par curve."},"answer":"B","explanation":"利率树在估值中有两个作用：①生成依赖利率的现金流（如在哪些节点会被赎回/回售）；②提供各节点折现用的利率。\n· 估计违约概率：利率树针对的是基准利率，不估计发行人违约概率。\n· 只提供折现率：含权债券的现金流随利率路径变化，并不固定。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 40 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_2_43","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst values a four-year option-free government bond two ways: by discounting at benchmark spot rates she obtains 102.36, and with a binomial tree that she believes is calibrated to the same spot curve she obtains 101.92. The curve is upward sloping. The most likely explanation is that:","options":{"A":"the difference reflects the upward slope of the curve, which causes tree-based values to be lower.","B":"the difference reflects the value of interest rate volatility, which the spot-rate method ignores.","C":"the tree is not correctly calibrated or there is a computational error, because the two methods must give the same value."},"answer":"C","explanation":"二叉树是根据即期曲线和无套利条件构建的，对无期权债券，两种方法的估值必须完全相同，与曲线形状和波动率假设无关。结果不同说明树没有校准好或计算有误。\n· 曲线向上倾斜：曲线形状不影响两种方法的一致性。\n· 波动率价值：无期权债券的现金流不依赖利率路径，波动率只影响含权债券的期权价值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 43 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_1","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A 12-year bond can be called by the issuer at par, but only on each annual coupon date beginning in year 5. The embedded call option is best described as:","options":{"A":"Bermudan-style.","B":"European-style.","C":"American-style."},"answer":"A","explanation":"只能在若干个预定日期（如每个付息日）行权的期权是百慕大式。\n· 欧式：只能在一个日期行权。\n· 美式：在赎回保护期结束后的任何时间都可以行权。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 1 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_3","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Two bonds from the same issuer have identical coupons, maturities, and credit quality. Bond X is callable at par and Bond Y is putable at par. If interest rates decline sharply, the bond with greater price upside is most likely:","options":{"A":"neither, because bonds with the same coupon and maturity have the same price sensitivity.","B":"Bond X, because the issuer's call option gains value when rates fall.","C":"Bond Y, because the put does not limit price appreciation when rates fall."},"answer":"C","explanation":"利率下降时，赎回权价值上升，可赎回债券价格被赎回价“封顶”（负凸性），上涨空间有限；回售权价值下降但价格不受上限约束，可回售债券像普通债券一样上涨。\n· Bond X：赎回权升值对发行人有利、对投资者不利，可赎回债券 = 普通债券 − 赎回权，所以涨得更少。\n· 一样：内嵌期权不同，价格敏感度不同。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_14","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A three-year, 2.5% annual-coupon bond (par 100) is callable at par at Time 1 and Time 2. The benchmark spot rates are 1.5000%, 1.8065%, and 2.0765% for years 1–3, and the calibrated tree (15% volatility, top row = highest rate) is:\n| Time 0 | Time 1 | Time 2 |\n| 1.5000% | 2.4297% | 3.4620% |\n|  | 1.8000% | 2.5647% |\n|  |  | 1.9000% |\nThe value of the embedded call option per 100 par is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.1425","B":"0.4659","C":"2.7240"},"answer":"B","explanation":"赎回权价值 = 普通债券价值 − 可赎回债券价值\n普通债券（用即期利率）：2.5/1.015000 + 2.5/1.018065² + 102.5/1.020765³ = 101.2462\n可赎回债券（二叉树倒推，Time 1、Time 2 每个节点取 min(计算值, 100)）= 100.7803\n赎回权 = 101.2462 − 100.7803 = 0.4659\n· 0.1425：只在 Time 2 检查赎回，漏掉 Time 1 节点的行权条件。\n· 2.7240：在节点上把“节点价值 + 当期票息”与赎回价 100 比较，高估了被赎回的情形；赎回价应与不含当期票息的节点价值比较。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_17","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A bond is callable at par at any time, with no call protection period. Interest rates have fallen well below its coupon rate. The bond's price is most likely:","options":{"A":"well below 100, because the call option reduces the value of the bond.","B":"well above 100, reflecting the present value of its above-market coupons.","C":"close to, and not materially above, 100."},"answer":"C","explanation":"没有赎回保护期、随时可按面值赎回的债券，价格不会明显超过100：一旦价格高于100，发行人会立即赎回，投资者只能得到100。\n· 远高于100：这是普通债券的情况，忽略了赎回权对价格的封顶。\n· 远低于100：利率远低于票息时，债券价值接近被赎回价100，而不是远低于面值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_20","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A five-year floating-rate note pays MRR plus a fixed quoted margin; the coupon resets every 6 months and the last reset was 2 months ago. Ignoring credit-spread changes, its effective duration is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.33","B":"0.50","C":"4.45"},"answer":"A","explanation":"浮息债的票息每期重置到市场利率，利率变化只影响到下次重置前的这一笔票息，因此有效久期 ≈ 距下次重置的时间 = (6 − 2) / 12 = 0.33 年。\n· 0.50：这是完整的重置周期，没有扣除已经过去的 2 个月。\n· 4.45：这是一只5年期4%固定利率债券的修正久期，浮息债不能按到期期限算久期。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 20 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_23","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A three-year, 3.5% annual-coupon bond is callable at par at Time 1 and Time 2. Using the binomial tree below (12% volatility, top row = highest rate), the value of the callable bond as a percentage of par is closest to:\n| Time 0 | Time 1 | Time 2 |\n| 2.0000% | 3.0510% | 4.5250% |\n|  | 2.4000% | 3.5595% |\n|  |  | 2.8000% |","options":{"A":"98.039","B":"101.437","C":"102.113"},"answer":"B","explanation":"从末端往回倒推，每个节点按该节点利率折现，在可赎回节点取 min(计算值, 100)：\nTime 2 节点（低→高）：100.0000，99.9425，99.0194\nTime 1 节点（低→高）：100.0000，99.9320\nTime 0：101.437\n· 102.113：没有在节点检查赎回条件，这是普通债券的价值。\n· 98.039：把节点价值加上当期票息后再与赎回价比较；赎回价应与不含当期票息的节点价值比较。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_27","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A convertible bond's underlying share price has fallen far below the conversion price, so the conversion option is deep out of the money. The convertible's price behavior is most likely:","options":{"A":"similar to that of a straight bond, sensitive mainly to interest rates and credit spreads.","B":"similar to a hybrid, equally sensitive to the share price and to interest rates.","C":"similar to that of the common stock, moving almost one-for-one with the share price."},"answer":"A","explanation":"股价远低于转换价（busted convertible）时，转换期权几乎没有价值，可转债表现得像普通债券，主要受利率和信用利差影响，几乎不受股价变动影响。\n· 像股票：这是转换期权深度价内（股价远高于转换价）时的情况。\n· 混合型：股价接近转换价时才同时对股价和利率敏感。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 27 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_30","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"For a ten-year option-free bond, the one-sided up-duration and one-sided down-duration are most likely:","options":{"A":"very different, with down-duration much smaller because price gains are capped.","B":"approximately equal.","C":"very different, with up-duration much larger because the bond has negative convexity."},"answer":"B","explanation":"无期权债券的价格-收益率关系是平滑的正凸性曲线，单边上行和下行久期大致相等。只有含权债券两者才明显不同：可赎回债券利率下降时涨幅被封顶，下行久期小于上行久期；可回售债券利率上升时跌幅受限，上行久期小于下行久期。\n· 下行久期小得多：描述的是可赎回债券。\n· 负凸性：无期权债券具有正凸性，不是负凸性。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 30 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_46","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A portfolio manager wants to measure how her bond portfolio would respond to a steepening of the yield curve in which short-term rates fall and long-term rates rise. The most appropriate measure is:","options":{"A":"key rate durations.","B":"one-sided up- and down-durations.","C":"effective duration."},"answer":"A","explanation":"关键利率久期衡量对特定期限利率变化的敏感度，可以用来分析曲线形状变化（变陡、变平）。\n· 单边久期：衡量收益率曲线平行上移或下移时的不对称反应，不能刻画形状变化。\n· 有效久期：同样假设基准曲线平行移动。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 46 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_48","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The benchmark yield curve is upward sloping and then flattens because long-term rates fall while short-term rates are unchanged. Compared with an otherwise identical option-free bond, a callable bond and a putable bond will most likely:","options":{"A":"both rise in price, but each by less than the option-free bond.","B":"both rise in price, with the callable bond rising by more than the option-free bond.","C":"both rise in price, with the putable bond rising by more than the option-free bond."},"answer":"A","explanation":"长期利率下降（曲线变平）时普通债券价格上升。\n可赎回债券 = 普通债券 − 赎回权：利率下降使赎回权价值上升，抵消部分涨幅。\n可回售债券 = 普通债券 + 回售权：利率下降使回售权价值下降，同样抵消部分涨幅。\n所以两者都上涨，但都不如普通债券。\n· 可回售涨得更多：回售权价值下降，可回售涨幅更小。\n· 可赎回涨得更多：赎回权价值上升，可赎回涨幅更小。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 48 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_3_53","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The benchmark yield curve changes from flat to upward sloping, and the price of a straight bond (Bond P) is unchanged. A putable bond (Bond Q) has the same issuer, coupon, and maturity as Bond P. The price of Bond Q will most likely:","options":{"A":"decrease, because the value of the embedded put option decreases.","B":"increase, because the value of the embedded put option increases.","C":"remain unchanged, because the straight bond's price is unchanged."},"answer":"B","explanation":"曲线由平变为向上倾斜，远期利率更高，未来利率上升、投资者行使回售权的可能性加大，内嵌回售权价值上升。可回售债券 = 普通债券 + 回售权，普通债券价格不变时可回售债券价格上升。\n· 回售权价值下降：方向反了，向上倾斜的曲线提高回售权价值、降低赎回权价值。\n· 不变：期权价值取决于曲线形状，不只取决于普通债券价格。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 53 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_12","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor buys a three-year, 5% annual-coupon corporate bond (par 1,000) for 1,040.00. In one scenario, the issuer pays the first two coupons and then defaults at Time 3, when the investor recovers 35% of par and receives no final coupon. The investor's rate of return in this scenario is closest to:","options":{"A":"–30.44%","B":"–26.45%","C":"–23.39%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"违约情形下的回报率是现金流的 IRR：\n1,040.00 = 50/(1+IRR) + 50/(1+IRR)² + 350/(1+IRR)³\n第3期只有回收额 35% × 1,000 = 350\nIRR = –26.45%\n· –23.39%：第3期在回收额之外又加了票息，违约时最后一期票息拿不到。\n· –30.44%：只用回收额和买价计算，漏掉了前两期收到的票息。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_17","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A three-year, 4% annual-coupon corporate bond has par value 1,000. Government spot rates are 2.0%, 2.4%, and 2.8% for years 1–3. The annual hazard rate is 2.0%, the recovery rate is 40%, and the CVA calculated from these inputs is 35.16. The bond's credit spread over a default-free government bond with the same coupon and maturity is closest to:","options":{"A":"120 bps","B":"122 bps","C":"124 bps"},"answer":"C","explanation":"1) 无违约价值 VND = 40/1.02 + 40/1.024² + 1,040/1.028³ = 1,034.68\n2) 公允价值 = VND − CVA = 1,034.68 − 35.16 = 999.52 → 公司债 YTM = 4.0173%\n3) 同票息无违约政府债价格 = VND 1,034.68 → 政府债 YTM = 2.7793%\n信用利差 = 4.0173% − 2.7793% = 124 bps\n· 122 bps：用3年期即期利率代替政府债 YTM；附息债的 YTM 是各期即期利率的加权结果，低于3年期即期利率。\n· 120 bps：用 违约概率 × 损失率 近似，没有按题目信息求两个 YTM。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_18","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A four-year, 5% annual-coupon corporate bond has par value 1,000. The government yield curve is flat at 3%. With an annual hazard rate of 2.0% and a recovery rate of 40%, the bond's CVA is 46.77. If both the hazard rate and the recovery rate fall to 80% of their current levels, the bond's fair value is closest to:","options":{"A":"1,021.33","B":"1,031.69","C":"1,036.71"},"answer":"B","explanation":"新参数：违约概率 = 2.0% × 0.8 = 1.60%，回收率 = 40% × 0.8 = 32%\nVND 不受影响：1,074.34\n重算 CVA：敞口_t = 当期现金流 + 后续现金流在 t 的现值；LGD = 敞口 × (1 − 0.32)；POD_t = 0.016 × POS_(t−1)；CVA = Σ LGD × POD × DF = 42.65\n公允价值 = VND − CVA = 1,074.34 − 42.65 = 1,031.69\n· 1,036.71：只调低了违约概率，回收率仍用 40%。\n· 1,021.33：只调低了回收率，违约概率仍用 2.0%。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_20","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst values a risky floating-rate note with a binomial interest rate tree and computes its value assuming no default (VND), the expected exposure and loss given default at each date, and the CVA. If the assumed annual probability of default is lowered and nothing else changes, which of the following will change?","options":{"A":"The VND calculated from the binomial tree.","B":"The expected exposure and the discount factors at each date.","C":"The CVA, and therefore the bond's fair value."},"answer":"C","explanation":"违约概率只进入 CVA 中“预期损失 = LGD × POD”这一步。POD 下降 → 每期预期损失下降 → CVA 下降 → 公允价值 = VND − CVA 上升。\n· VND：由利率树和现金流决定，与违约概率无关。\n· 预期敞口和折现因子：敞口取决于现金流和利率，折现因子取决于无风险利率，都不受违约概率影响。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 20 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_33","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about credit scores and credit ratings is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Both provide an ordinal ranking of credit risk rather than a cardinal estimate of the probability of default.","B":"Credit ratings are designed to change frequently with the business cycle so that they track current default probabilities.","C":"Credit scores are mainly used to assess corporations and sovereign issuers, whereas credit ratings are used for individuals."},"answer":"A","explanation":"信用评分（个人、小企业）和信用评级（公司、主权、ABS）都是序数排序：分数/评级越高违约风险越低，但不直接给出违约概率。\n· 用途说反了：信用评分用于个人和小企业，信用评级用于公司、政府和结构化产品。\n· 评级随经济周期频繁变化：评级机构倾向于“穿越周期”，评级相对稳定，往往滞后于市场。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 33 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_34","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A corporate bond yields 4.20% and has a modified duration of 7.0 and convexity of 60. An analyst expects that over the next year the bond will be downgraded and its credit spread will widen from 0.85% to 1.10%, with no change in benchmark yields. The bond's expected one-year return is closest to:","options":{"A":"–1.73%","B":"2.47%","C":"3.95%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"一年预期回报 ≈ 收益率带来的收入 + 价格变化\n价格变化 ≈ −ModDur × Δspread + ½ × Convexity × (Δspread)²\n= −7.0 × 0.0025 + 0.5 × 60 × 0.0025² = –1.731%\n预期回报 = 4.20% + (–1.731%) = 2.47%\n· –1.73%：只算了价格变化，漏掉了收益率（票息）收入。\n· 3.95%：利差变化没有乘以久期。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_39","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst makes three statements about asset-backed securities collateralized by auto loans. Which statement is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Auto ABS commonly use credit enhancements such as subordination, overcollateralization, and excess spread.","B":"Investors may prefer auto ABS because a large, diversified pool of loans reduces exposure to any single borrower.","C":"Securitizing auto loans typically raises the originator's cost of funding compared with issuing unsecured corporate bonds."},"answer":"C","explanation":"证券化把贷款从发起人资产负债表转移到 SPE，ABS 的信用质量取决于资产池而不是发起人本身，优先级分档往往能获得比发起人更高的评级，所以通常降低融资成本，而不是提高。\n· 资产池分散化：准确，投资者看重大量贷款的分散化好处。\n· 信用增级：准确，汽车 ABS 常用次级分档、超额抵押和超额利差。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 39 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_45","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A research report forecasts higher expected inflation together with a slowing economy and weakening corporate profitability. Holding other factors constant, benchmark government yields and corporate credit spreads will most likely:","options":{"A":"fall and widen, respectively.","B":"rise and widen, respectively.","C":"rise and narrow, respectively."},"answer":"B","explanation":"预期通胀上升 → 投资者要求更高的名义收益率 → 基准收益率上升；经济放缓、企业盈利恶化 → 违约风险上升 → 信用利差扩大。预期通胀上升本身也会推动利差扩大，而不是收窄。\n· 利差收窄：方向反了，经济走弱和通胀上升都使利差扩大。\n· 基准收益率下降：预期通胀上升推高名义基准收益率。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 45 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_46","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An A-rated corporate bond has a modified duration of 6.0. Its one-year rating transition probabilities and the associated changes in its credit spread are:\n| Rating in one year | Probability | Spread change |\n| AA | 2.00% | -0.40% |\n| A (unchanged) | 90.00% | +0.00% |\n| BBB | 6.00% | +0.80% |\n| BB | 1.50% | +2.50% |\n| B | 0.50% | +4.50% |\nIgnoring convexity and coupon income, the bond's expected percentage price change from rating migration is closest to:","options":{"A":"–0.648%","B":"–0.600%","C":"–0.100%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"每种迁移：价格变化 ≈ −久期 × 利差变化，再按迁移概率加权求和：\nAA：−6.0 × (–0.40%) × 2.00% = +0.0480%\nBBB：−6.0 × (+0.80%) × 6.00% = –0.2880%\nBB：−6.0 × (+2.50%) × 1.50% = –0.2250%\nB：−6.0 × (+4.50%) × 0.50% = –0.1350%\n合计 = –0.600%\n· –0.100%：只算了概率加权的利差变化，没有乘久期。\n· –0.648%：只计算了评级下调，漏掉了上调到 AA 带来的价格上涨。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 46 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_4_56","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following considerations in analyzing the credit risk of asset-backed securities is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Because ABS are backed by a pool of assets, the quality of loan origination and servicing over the life of the deal has little effect on their credit risk.","B":"Excess spread is a primary form of credit protection for many consumer ABS.","C":"Subordination and overcollateralization protect senior tranches by absorbing losses first."},"answer":"A","explanation":"ABS 信用分析的关键之一是资产在存续期内的发起和服务质量：发起标准差、服务商催收不力都会直接增加资产池损失，所以“影响很小”最不准确。\n· 超额利差：准确，资产池利息收入超过 ABS 利息和费用的部分可吸收损失，是消费类 ABS 的主要信用保护。\n· 次级与超额抵押：准确，属于内部信用增级，先吸收损失以保护优先级。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 56 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_1","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor holds USD 10 million par of Bond 2 issued by Ralston Corp. and has bought CDS protection of the same notional on Ralston. After a credit event, Bond 2 trades at 52% of par, while the cheapest-to-deliver obligation (Bond 1) trades at 38% of par. If physical settlement would require her to deliver the Bond 2 position she holds, she would most likely prefer:","options":{"A":"physical settlement, delivering Bond 2 and receiving par of USD 10.0 million.","B":"either method, because both pay the same amount once recovery is measured on Bond 2.","C":"cash settlement, receiving USD 6.2 million and keeping Bond 2 (total about USD 11.4 million)."},"answer":"C","explanation":"CDS 回收率按最便宜可交割债券（CTD）估计 = 38%。\n现金结算：赔付 = (1 − 0.38) × 10m = 6.2m，同时保留市值 52% 的 Bond 2（5.2m），合计 11.4m。\n实物交割 Bond 2：只得到面值 10.0m。\n现金结算更有利。\n· 实物交割：交出价值 52% 的债券只换回面值，少了 1.4m。\n· 无差别：回收率按 CTD（38%）而不是按 Bond 2（52%）确定，两种方式结果不同。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 1 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_2","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The CDS spreads on Mercer Holdings are 520 bps at the one-year tenor, 430 bps at three years, and 360 bps at five years. This credit curve most likely indicates that:","options":{"A":"the company faces severe near-term stress, with default probability over the next few years higher than in later years.","B":"the company is a high-quality borrower whose default risk is concentrated in the distant future.","C":"the market expects the company's credit quality to deteriorate over time."},"answer":"A","explanation":"向下倾斜的信用曲线：短期 CDS 利差高于长期，说明近期违约概率高于远期，通常出现在公司短期严重承压时（若挺过近期困难，此后违约风险较低）。\n· 信用质量逐渐恶化：对应的是向上倾斜的信用曲线。\n· 高质量借款人：高质量公司的信用曲线通常平缓向上倾斜，利差水平也远低于此。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 2 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_7","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the documentation of credit default swaps is most accurate?","options":{"A":"An ISDA master agreement is needed only when the CDS involves an upfront payment.","B":"The reference entity must consent to and sign the CDS documentation before the swap can be traded.","C":"Counterparties sign an ISDA master agreement before trading, and the contract terms follow standardized ISDA definitions."},"answer":"C","explanation":"CDS 交易双方在交易前要签署 ISDA 主协议，合约条款（信用事件、结算方式等）遵循 ISDA 的标准定义。\n· 只有预付款时才需要：是否有预付款与这项合规要求无关，所有 CDS 都在 ISDA 框架下交易。\n· 需参考实体同意：参考实体不是 CDS 合约的当事方，无需其同意。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_14","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Zeta Inc. has received an unsolicited cash takeover offer at a large premium from Delmar Corp., which plans to finance the acquisition entirely with new debt. A hedge fund wants to profit from the announcement through an equity-versus-credit trade. The fund would most likely:","options":{"A":"short Zeta shares and sell CDS protection on Delmar.","B":"buy Zeta shares and buy CDS protection on Delmar.","C":"buy Delmar shares and sell CDS protection on Delmar."},"answer":"B","explanation":"被收购方 Zeta 获溢价收购报价 → 股价上涨 → 做多 Zeta 股票；收购方 Delmar 将大幅举债 → 杠杆上升、违约概率上升 → CDS 利差扩大 → 买入 Delmar 的保护。\n· 做空 Zeta、卖 Delmar 保护：两个方向都反了。\n· 卖 Delmar 保护：Delmar 信用恶化时卖保护方亏损。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_19","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A credit manager buys protection on a three-year CDS and sells protection on a ten-year CDS on the same reference entity, with duration-adjusted notionals. The position is best described as a:","options":{"A":"curve trade that profits if the entity's credit curve flattens.","B":"long/short trade that profits if the entity's overall credit quality improves.","C":"curve trade that profits if the entity's credit curve steepens."},"answer":"A","explanation":"曲线交易：在同一参考实体的一个期限买保护、另一个期限卖保护。买短期保护在短期利差上升时获利，卖长期保护在长期利差下降时获利——即短端相对长端上升，曲线变平。\n· 变陡：变陡交易应卖短期保护、买长期保护。\n· 多空交易：多空交易涉及两个不同的参考实体；这里是同一实体不同期限。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 19 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_26","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst expects the credit quality of Wexford Ltd. to improve and that of Larkin plc to deteriorate. To profit from both views using CDS, the analyst should most likely:","options":{"A":"buy protection on Wexford and sell protection on Larkin.","B":"sell protection on Wexford and buy protection on Larkin.","C":"sell protection on both Wexford and Larkin."},"answer":"B","explanation":"多空交易：卖出信用改善公司（Wexford）的保护，其 CDS 利差收窄时获利；买入信用恶化公司（Larkin）的保护，其利差扩大时获利。\n· 买 Wexford 保护、卖 Larkin 保护：方向完全相反。\n· 两者都卖保护：卖出 Larkin 的保护会因其信用恶化而亏损。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_29","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about single-name CDS is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Only debt ranked junior to the reference obligation can be delivered, because its recovery is lowest.","B":"The reference obligation is usually a senior unsecured bond, but any of the borrower's debt ranking equal to or higher than it can be delivered.","C":"Only the specific reference obligation named in the contract can be delivered in physical settlement."},"answer":"B","explanation":"单一名称 CDS 通常以借款人的高级无担保债务为参考债务，但同等或更高级别（pari passu 或更高）的债务都可以交割，买方通常交割其中最便宜的（CTD）。\n· 只能交割指定的参考债务：错误，可交割债务范围更广。\n· 只能交割次级债：错误，次级债不在可交割范围内。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_fi_5_34","subject":"EOC · 固收 Fixed Income","subjectKey":"eoc_fi","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Kestrel Corp.'s five-year, 4.8% annual-coupon bond trades at 101.25, and the five-year government yield is 3.70%. Five-year CDS protection on Kestrel costs 120 bps per year. To exploit the CDS basis, an investor would most likely:","options":{"A":"buy CDS protection on Kestrel and short Kestrel's bond.","B":"sell CDS protection on Kestrel and short Kestrel's bond.","C":"buy CDS protection on Kestrel and buy Kestrel's bond."},"answer":"B","explanation":"债券 YTM：101.25 = Σ 4.8/(1+y)^t + 100/(1+y)^5 → y = 4.515%\n债券信用利差 = 4.515% − 3.70% = 81.5 bps，低于 CDS 利差 120 bps（基差为正）。\n债券相对 CDS 被高估（利差太窄）→ 卖空债券，同时卖出 CDS 保护，基差收敛时获利。\n· 买保护、买债券：适用于债券利差高于 CDS 利差（负基差）的情况。\n· 买保护、卖空债券：两条腿都押注信用恶化，不是基差交易。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_1","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A three-month equity index futures contract is quoted at 1,482.00. Using the carry arbitrage model, a trader computes its no-arbitrage futures price as 1,489.50. Ignoring transaction costs, the trader would most likely capture the mispricing by:","options":{"A":"selling the futures and buying the index with borrowed funds (carry arbitrage).","B":"taking no action, because daily mark-to-market eliminates any futures mispricing.","C":"buying the futures, short selling the index, and lending the proceeds (reverse carry arbitrage)."},"answer":"C","explanation":"正确答案是反向持有套利（reverse carry）。报价 1,482 低于无套利价 1,489.50，说明期货被低估：买入低估的期货，同时卖空现货指数并把所得资金按无风险利率借出，到期用期货买回指数平仓，锁定差额。\n· 持有套利（借钱买现货、卖期货）适用于期货被高估的情况，方向反了。\n· 盯市只改变现金流的时间分布，不会消除定价偏差；只要报价 ≠ 无套利价就有套利机会。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 1 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_3","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A bond is the cheapest-to-deliver into a Treasury futures contract that expires in three months. Its quoted (clean) price is 101.20, accrued interest today is 0.45, and accrued interest at futures expiration will be 1.20. No coupons are paid before expiration. The conversion factor is 0.8650 and the annually compounded risk-free rate is 1.8%. The equilibrium quoted futures price is closest to:","options":{"A":"100.90","B":"116.65","C":"117.52"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Q0 = (1/CF) × [FV(B0 + AI0) − AI_T − FVCI]\n= (1/0.865) × [(101.2 + 0.45) × 1.018^0.25 − 1.2 − 0]\n= (1/0.865) × [102.1044 − 1.2] = 116.65\n· 117.52：只把净价复利再除以 CF，没有处理期初和期末的应计利息。\n· 100.90：算出了期货的全价扣应计，但忘了除以转换因子。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_5","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Current MRR spot rates (30/360, simple interest) are: 90 days 2.40%, 180 days 2.55%, 270 days 2.70%, 360 days 2.85%. The annualized fixed rate on a new one-year interest rate swap with quarterly settlement is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.70%","B":"2.82%","C":"2.85%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"先求各期折现因子 PV_i = 1/(1 + R_i × 天数/360)：\n0.994036 0.987411 0.980152 0.972290\n每期固定利率 = (1 − PV_4) / ΣPV = (1 − 0.972290) / 3.933888 = 0.7044%\n年化 = × 4 = 2.82%\n· 0.70% 是每季度的利率，没有年化。\n· 2.85% 只是一年期即期利率，互换利率是各期折现因子共同决定的。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 5 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_6","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A company entered a pay-fixed interest rate swap with notional JPY 200 million and a fixed rate of 1.50% per period. Three settlement periods remain, and the current present value factors for those periods are 0.9920, 0.9845, and 0.9772. From the company's perspective, the value of the swap is closest to:","options":{"A":"–JPY 4,301,100","B":"–JPY 1,422,973","C":"JPY 4,301,100"},"answer":"A","explanation":"先用当前折现因子求现在的均衡互换利率：FS_t = (1 − 0.9772) / (2.9537) = 0.7719%（每期）\n付固定方价值 = NA × (FS_t − FS_0) × ΣPV = 200,000,000 × (0.007719 − 0.015) × 2.9537 = –4,301,100\n利率下降后付固定方吃亏，价值为负。\n· –1,422,973：只乘了最后一期的折现因子，应乘所有剩余期之和。\n· 4,301,100：符号反了，这是收固定方的价值。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_9","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A non-dividend-paying stock trades at 80.00. The annually compounded risk-free rate is 2.5% and a six-month forward on the stock is quoted at 81.40. Which statement is most accurate?","options":{"A":"A carry arbitrage is available: borrow, buy the stock, and sell the forward.","B":"A reverse carry arbitrage is available: short the stock, lend the proceeds, and buy the forward.","C":"No arbitrage is available because the forward price is within 2% of the spot price."},"answer":"A","explanation":"无套利远期价 = S0 × (1 + r)^T = 80.0 × 1.025^0.5 = 80.994。\n市场报价 81.4 高于它，远期被高估 → 卖出远期，借钱买入股票（持有套利），到期交割股票、还本付息，锁定 81.4 − 80.994 = 0.406。\n· 反向持有套利用于远期被低估的情况。\n· 是否存在套利只看报价是否等于无套利价，和差距百分比无关。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_11","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Three months ago an investor took a short position in a one-year forward contract on a stock at a forward price of 102.00. The stock now trades at 98.50 and will pay a dividend of 1.20 three months from today. The annually compounded risk-free rate is 3%. The value of the short forward position today is closest to:","options":{"A":"–2.45","B":"2.45","C":"2.51"},"answer":"B","explanation":"1) 新的无套利远期价：F_t = (S_t − PV(股利)) × (1 + r)^(T−t)\n   PV(股利) = 1.2 / 1.03^0.25 = 1.1912\n   F_t = (98.5 − 1.1912) × 1.03^0.75 = 99.4902\n2) 空头价值 = (F_0 − F_t) / (1 + r)^(T−t) = (102.0 − 99.4902) / 1.03^0.75 = 2.45\n· 2.51：没有把差额折现到今天。\n· –2.45：这是多头的价值。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_13","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A bank is the receive-fixed party on an interest rate swap with notional $30 million and an annual fixed rate of 3.20%. Two annual settlements remain, and the current present value factors are 0.9710 (year 1) and 0.9405 (year 2). The value of the swap to the bank is closest to:","options":{"A":"–$50,040","B":"$26,178","C":"$50,040"},"answer":"C","explanation":"当前均衡互换利率 FS_t = (1 − 0.9405) / (0.971 + 0.9405) = 3.1127%\n收固定方价值 = NA × (FS_0 − FS_t) × ΣPV = 30,000,000 × (0.032 − 0.031127) × 1.9115 = 50,040\n· 26,178：利率差没有乘以折现因子之和。\n· –50,040：这是付固定方的价值。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_14","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Yen MRR spot rates are 0.15% for 180 days and 0.24% for 360 days (30/360, simple interest). The annualized fixed rate for a new one-year yen swap with semiannual settlement is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.1199%","B":"0.1950%","C":"0.2398%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"PV_180 = 1/(1 + 0.0015 × 0.5) = 0.999251；PV_360 = 1/(1 + 0.0024) = 0.997606\n每期利率 = (1 − 0.997606) / (1.996856) = 0.1199%\n年化 = × 2 = 0.2398%\n· 0.1199% 是半年期的每期利率，没有年化。\n· 0.1950% 只是两个即期利率的简单平均。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_17","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ninety days ago a bank entered a 6 × 9 FRA as the pay-fixed party, with notional $10 million and a fixed rate of 1.20%. Today the 90-day MRR is 1.30% and the 180-day MRR is 1.45% (30/360). The current value of the FRA to the bank is closest to:","options":{"A":"$9,799","B":"$9,838","C":"$9,870"},"answer":"A","explanation":"90 天后原来的 6×9 变成了 3×6 FRA：\n新 FRA 利率 = [(1 + 0.0145×180/360) / (1 + 0.013×90/360) − 1] × 360/90 = 1.5948%\n价值 = NA × (FRA_g − FRA_0) × 90/360 ÷ (1 + L180 × 180/360) = 9,799\n利息差在 FRA 到期日（从现在起 180 天后）结算，所以要用 180 天利率折现。\n· 9,870：没有折现。\n· 9,838：只折现了 90 天，折现期限不对。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_18","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The 30-day MRR is 1.00% and the 120-day MRR is 1.30% (30/360). The no-arbitrage fixed rate on a new 1 × 4 FRA is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.30%","B":"1.15%","C":"1.40%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"1×4 FRA 覆盖第 30 天到第 120 天这 90 天：\nFRA = [(1 + 0.013 × 120/360) / (1 + 0.010 × 30/360) − 1] × 360/90 = 1.40%\n· 0.30%：直接把两个利率相减，不是远期利率。\n· 1.15%：两个即期利率的简单平均，同样不对。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_19","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The 60-day MRR is 1.10% and the 150-day MRR is 1.35% (30/360). The no-arbitrage fixed rate on a new 2 × 5 FRA is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.38%","B":"1.35%","C":"1.51%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"2×5 FRA 覆盖第 60 天到第 150 天：\nFRA = [(1 + 0.0135 × 150/360) / (1 + 0.011 × 60/360) − 1] × 360/90 = 1.51%\n· 0.38%：算出的是 90 天期间的利率，没有乘 360/90 年化。\n· 1.35%：150 天即期利率，不是远期利率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 19 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_25","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A stock index is at 2,500.00. The future value of dividends to be paid on the index over the next 150 days is 6.40, and the annually compounded risk-free rate is 2.0%. Assuming a 360-day year, the no-arbitrage price of a 150-day index futures contract is closest to:","options":{"A":"2,493.60","B":"2,514.31","C":"2,527.11"},"answer":"B","explanation":"F = S0 × (1 + r)^T − FV(股利) = 2,500 × 1.02^(150/360) − 6.4 = 2,514.31\n股利是持有现货的收益（carry benefit），要从现货复利后的价值中减去。\n· 2,493.60：没有把现货按无风险利率复利到期。\n· 2,527.11：把股利加了上去，方向反了。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 25 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_26","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Thirty days ago an investor bought a 90-day forward on an equity index at 4,120.00. The index is now 4,150.00, the continuously compounded risk-free rate is 4.0%, and the continuously compounded dividend yield is 1.5%. Assuming a 360-day year, the value of the long forward position today is closest to:","options":{"A":"47.01","B":"47.33","C":"55.46"},"answer":"A","explanation":"剩余期限 T − t = 60/360 = 0.1667\nF_t = S_t × e^((rc − γ)(T − t)) = 4,150 × e^(0.025 × 0.1667) = 4,167.3277\nV_t = (F_t − F_0) × e^(−rc(T − t)) = (4,167.3277 − 4,120) × e^(−0.04 × 0.1667) = 47.01\n· 47.33：没有折现。\n· 55.46：用了全部 90 天而不是剩余的 60 天。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_28","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor is the pay-fixed party on a swap with notional $50 million and an annual fixed rate of 1.85%. Three annual payments remain. The current equilibrium swap rate for that maturity is 2.30%, and the present value factors are 0.9830, 0.9612, and 0.9375. The value of the swap to the investor is closest to:","options":{"A":"–$648,383","B":"$210,938","C":"$648,383"},"answer":"C","explanation":"付固定方价值 = NA × (FS_t − FS_0) × ΣPV = 50,000,000 × (0.023 − 0.0185) × 2.8817 = 648,383\n利率上升，付固定方受益，价值为正。\n· 210,938：只乘了最后一期的折现因子 0.9375。\n· –648,383：符号反了（收固定方的价值）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 28 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_34","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Thirty days ago a firm entered a 3 × 6 FRA as the pay-fixed (long) party at 2.10% on a notional of $5 million. Today the 60-day MRR is 1.70% and the 150-day MRR is 1.85% (30/360). The value of the FRA to the firm is closest to:","options":{"A":"–$1,938","B":"–$1,929","C":"$1,929"},"answer":"B","explanation":"30 天后原来的 3×6 变成 2×5：新 FRA 利率 = [(1 + 0.0185×150/360) / (1 + 0.017×60/360) − 1] × 4 = 1.9445%\n价值 = NA × (FRA_g − FRA_0) × 90/360 ÷ (1 + L150 × 150/360) = –1,929\n利率下降，新 FRA 利率低于原来的 2.10%，付固定方价值为负。\n· 1,929：符号反了。\n· –1,938：用 60 天利率折现，折现期限不对；结算发生在 150 天后。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_36","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A fund entered a swap to receive the return on an equity index and pay a fixed rate of 0.50% per quarter on a notional of $40 million. The index was 2,000 at the last reset and is 2,180 today. Three quarterly payments remain, with present value factors 0.9950, 0.9890, and 0.9820. The value of the swap to the fund is closest to:","options":{"A":"–$3,726,800","B":"$3,006,800","C":"$3,726,800"},"answer":"C","explanation":"收股票端价值 = (S_t / S_0) × NA = (2,180/2,000) × 40,000,000 = 43,600,000\n付固定端 = 固定利率债券价值 = 票息 200,000 × ΣPV(2.9660) + 本金 40,000,000 × 0.982 = 39,873,200\n互换价值 = 43,600,000 − 39,873,200 = 3,726,800\n· 3,006,800：本金没有折现。\n· –3,726,800：站在了付股票收固定一方。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_40","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the conversion factor in a Treasury bond futures contract is most accurate? The conversion factor:","options":{"A":"adjusts the invoice price so that bonds with different coupons and maturities are roughly equivalent for delivery.","B":"is applied to accrued interest so that the short receives a standardized amount of interest at delivery.","C":"makes the choice of which bond to deliver irrelevant, so there is no cheapest-to-deliver bond."},"answer":"A","explanation":"转换因子是对交割时发票价格的调整，使不同票息、期限的可交割债券大致等价。\n· 它不作用于应计利息：发票价 = 期货报价 × CF + 应计利息，应计利息是单独加上的。\n· 转换因子只是近似调整，现实中仍然存在最便宜可交割债券（CTD）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 40 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_44","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ninety days ago a company entered a one-year pay-fixed swap with quarterly settlement, notional $100 million, and an annualized fixed rate of 2.80% (30/360). The current present value factors for the three remaining quarterly settlements are 0.9950, 0.9880, and 0.9780. The value of the swap to the company is closest to:","options":{"A":"$42,046","B":"$127,300","C":"$509,200"},"answer":"B","explanation":"每期（季度）的新互换利率 FS_t = (1 − 0.978) / 2.9610 = 0.7430%\n原互换的每期固定利率 = 2.80% / 4 = 0.7000%\n价值 = NA × (FS_t − FS_0) × ΣPV（用每期利率）= 127,300\n· 509,200：把利率年化后再乘 ΣPV，相当于多乘了 4。\n· 42,046：只乘了最后一期的折现因子。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 44 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_47","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In the carry arbitrage model for pricing a forward on a physical commodity, which item is least likely to be treated as a separate carry cost added to the spot price?","options":{"A":"Storage costs","B":"Insurance costs","C":"Interest on funds borrowed to buy the commodity"},"answer":"C","explanation":"借钱买现货的资金成本已经体现在把现货按无风险利率复利到期（FV）这一步，不再作为单独的持有成本加进去。\n存储费和保险费是持有实物的成本（carry costs），要加到现货价值上；股利、利息、便利收益则是持有收益（carry benefits），要减去。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 47 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_48","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Six months ago an investor entered a one-year long forward on 10,000 units of an equity index at 3,000.00. The index is now 2,880.00, it pays no dividends, and the annually compounded risk-free rate is 2.0%. If the investor offsets the position today with a new six-month forward, the present value of the loss is closest to:","options":{"A":"904,426","B":"913,426","C":"1,200,000"},"answer":"A","explanation":"反向平仓用的新远期价 = 2,880 × 1.02^0.5 = 2,908.6574\n到期时每单位亏损 = 3,000 − 2,908.6574 = 91.3426\n现值 = 91.3426 × 10,000 / 1.02^0.5 = 904,426\n· 913,426：没有对剩余半年折现。\n· 1,200,000：直接用现货价，没有算新的远期价，也没有折现。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 48 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_50","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst states: \"An equity-for-equity swap does not need to be priced at initiation.\" The statement is best described as:","options":{"A":"incorrect, because the fixed rate must be solved so that the swap's value at initiation is zero.","B":"correct, because the swap can be replicated by an equity-for-fixed swap and a fixed-for-equity swap, so no fixed rate needs to be solved for.","C":"incorrect, because the two equity returns must be scaled by their betas at initiation."},"answer":"B","explanation":"股票对股票互换两端都是股票收益，没有需要求解的固定利率。它等价于“收股票 A、付固定”加上“收固定、付股票 B”，两个固定端相互抵消，所以期初不需要定价。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 50 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_54","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A one-year plain vanilla swap has semiannual settlement and a fixed rate of 3.0%. Six-month MRR (annualized) is 2.6% at initiation and 3.4% at month 6. The net payment received by the pay-fixed party at the month-6 settlement, per unit of notional, is closest to:","options":{"A":"–0.0020","B":"0.0000","C":"0.0020"},"answer":"A","explanation":"浮动利率在期初设定、期末支付：第 6 个月的结算用的是期初（第 0 个月）观察到的 MRR 2.6%。\n付固定方净收 = (MRR_0 − 固定利率) × 0.5 = (0.026 − 0.03) × 0.5 = –0.0020（即净支付 0.002）\n· 0.0020：错用了第 6 个月观察到的 3.4%，那个利率要到第 12 个月才结算。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 54 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_55","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"When a plain vanilla interest rate swap is priced at initiation by replicating it with bonds, which of the following is not an assumption of the approach?","options":{"A":"The value of the floating-rate bond at initiation equals zero.","B":"The swap's value at initiation equals zero.","C":"The value of the floating-rate bond at initiation equals its par value."},"answer":"A","explanation":"用债券复制：付固定互换 = 多头浮动利率债 + 空头固定利率债。期初浮动利率债的价值等于面值（利率按市场重置）；定价就是求一个固定利率，使固定利率债的价值也等于面值，从而互换价值为零。\n所以“浮动利率债价值为零”不是假设，为零的是互换的价值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 55 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_1_56","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Sixty days ago a company entered a fixed-for-fixed currency swap to receive GBP and pay EUR, with notionals of GBP 4.3 million and EUR 5.0 million (exchange rate at initiation 0.8600 GBP/EUR). Today the value of a GBP fixed-rate bond is 1.0120 per GBP 1 of par, the value of a EUR fixed-rate bond is 1.0050 per EUR 1 of par, and the spot rate is 0.8450 GBP/EUR. The value of the swap to the company in GBP is closest to:","options":{"A":"GBP 30,100","B":"GBP 105,475","C":"GBP 124,822"},"answer":"B","explanation":"互换价值（GBP）= 收到的 GBP 债券价值 − 支付的 EUR 债券价值按今天汇率换成 GBP\n= 4,300,000 × 1.012 − 5,000,000 × 1.005 × 0.845 = 105,475\n· 30,100：用了期初汇率 0.86，应使用今天的汇率。\n· 124,822：这是以 EUR 计价的价值，单位不对。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 56 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_4","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A stock trades at 50.00; in one period it will be either 60.00 or 40.00. The risk-free rate per period is 3%. A one-period European call with an exercise price of 50.00 trades at 6.40. To exploit the mispricing, an arbitrageur should write the call and:","options":{"A":"buy 0.50 shares and borrow 19.42.","B":"short 0.50 shares and lend 19.42.","C":"buy 0.50 shares and lend 19.42."},"answer":"A","explanation":"h = (c⁺ − c⁻)/(S⁺ − S⁻) = (10 − 0)/(60 − 40) = 0.50\n复制组合 = 买 h 股 + 借入 PV(h × S⁻ − c⁻) = 0.50 × 40 / 1.03 = 19.42\n模型价 c = 0.50 × 50 − 19.42 = 5.58 < 市价 6.40，看涨期权被高估：卖出看涨期权，同时买入复制组合（买股票并借款）。\n· 卖空股票并放贷是复制空头看涨期权的组合，方向反了。\n· 买股票的同时应借款而不是放贷。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 4 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_6","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A stock trades at 40.00. In each of two periods it moves up by a factor of 1.25 or down by a factor of 0.80; the risk-free rate is 2% per period. The value of a two-period American-style put with an exercise price of 42.00 is closest to:","options":{"A":"2.00","B":"5.08","C":"5.49"},"answer":"C","explanation":"风险中性概率 π = (1.02 − 0.80)/(1.25 − 0.80) = 0.4889\n第 2 期看跌期权价值：0.00、2.00、16.40\n第 1 期上涨节点（S = 50）：继续持有 1.0022，立即行权 0 → 1.0022\n第 1 期下跌节点（S = 32）：继续持有 9.1765，立即行权 10 → 取较大者 10.0000（提前行权）\n第 0 期：[0.4889 × 1.0022 + 0.5111 × 10.0000] / 1.02 = 5.49\n· 5.08：欧式价值，没有在下跌节点比较提前行权。\n· 2.00：只是今天立即行权的价值。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_8","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An interest rate call option has a notional of $1,000,000 and an exercise rate of 2.50%; its payoff at Time 2 is max(0, rate − 2.50%) × notional. The one-period rates in a binomial tree (each move has probability 0.5) are: Time 0: 2.50%; Time 1: 3.60% (up), 2.00% (down); Time 2: 5.00%, 3.00%, 1.50%. The value of the option today is closest to:","options":{"A":"$8,258","B":"$8,328","C":"$8,750"},"answer":"A","explanation":"第 2 期收益（每 1 元名义本金）：0.0250、0.0050、0.0000\n第 1 期上节点：0.5 × (0.025 + 0.005) / 1.036 = 0.014479\n第 1 期下节点：0.5 × (0.005 + 0.000) / 1.020 = 0.002451\n第 0 期：0.5 × (0.014479 + 0.002451) / 1.025 = 0.008258 → × 1,000,000 ≈ 8,258\n要用每个节点自己的利率逐期往回折现。\n· 8,328：都用第 0 期利率折现了两期。\n· 8,750：只算了期望收益，没有折现。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_22","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A colleague says: \"In the one-period binomial model, an option's value depends on investors' expectations of the stock's future price, so the expectations approach gives a different value from the no-arbitrage approach.\" The colleague is:","options":{"A":"incorrect, because both approaches use risk-neutral probabilities and give the same value, so investors' expectations of the future stock price do not matter.","B":"incorrect only about the two approaches giving different values; option value does depend on expected stock returns.","C":"correct, because the expectations approach uses investors' estimated probabilities of up and down moves."},"answer":"A","explanation":"期望法是无套利法的变形：用由 u、d、r 推出的风险中性概率计算期末收益的期望值，再按无风险利率折现，结果与构建无套利复制组合完全相同。投资者对股价走势的主观预期不影响期权价值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 22 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_32","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A one-year call option trades at $9.80, while a binomial model gives a fair value of $8.15. The most appropriate no-arbitrage strategy is to:","options":{"A":"sell the call, buy the hedge ratio of shares, and borrow at the risk-free rate.","B":"sell the call and lend the premium received at the risk-free rate.","C":"buy the call, short the hedge ratio of shares, and lend at the risk-free rate."},"answer":"A","explanation":"看涨期权市价高于公允价值 → 卖出被高估的期权，同时买入它的复制组合（买入 h 股股票 + 按无风险利率借款），锁定价差。\n· 买入看涨期权的组合适用于期权被低估的情况。\n· 只卖期权、不做对冲不是无套利策略，会承担股价上涨的风险。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 32 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_40","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under the expectations approach to valuing a European option, the expected terminal payoff is calculated with risk-neutral probabilities and then discounted at the:","options":{"A":"weighted average cost of capital of the issuer.","B":"risk-free rate.","C":"investor's required return on the underlying stock."},"answer":"B","explanation":"期望法：期权价值 = PV[按风险中性概率计算的期末收益期望值]，折现率是无风险利率。风险已经通过风险中性概率处理掉了，不能再用股票要求回报率或 WACC 折现。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 40 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_41","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In a two-step binomial model used to value an at-the-money interest rate call option, the value of the underlying at Node 0 is the current one-period spot rate of 1.40%, while the implied one-period forward rate one period from now is 1.75%. The exercise rate of the at-the-money option is:","options":{"A":"1.75%, equal to the forward rate one period from now.","B":"1.40%, equal to the spot rate at Node 0.","C":"1.575%, the average of the spot and forward rates."},"answer":"B","explanation":"利率二叉树中节点 0 的标的值就是当前的即期利率；平值期权的行权利率等于这个标的值（1.40%），不是远期利率，也不是两者的平均。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 41 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_42","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A company plans to borrow at a floating rate in one year and wants to protect itself against rising interest rates by locking in a maximum fixed rate through a swap. The most appropriate instrument is a:","options":{"A":"payer swaption, giving the right to enter a swap paying fixed and receiving floating.","B":"receiver swaption, giving the right to enter a swap receiving fixed and paying floating.","C":"short position in a payer swaption."},"answer":"A","explanation":"利率上升时，有权进入“付固定、收浮动”互换的付款方（payer）互换期权会增值，正好对冲浮动利率借款的成本上升。\n· 收款方（receiver）互换期权防范的是利率下降。\n· 卖出 payer 互换期权会在利率上升时亏损，方向反了。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 42 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_43","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A portfolio manager holds 50,000 shares of a stock and wants to delta hedge the position with call options. Each call is on one share and has a delta of 0.625. The manager should:","options":{"A":"sell 31,250 calls.","B":"buy 80,000 calls.","C":"sell 80,000 calls."},"answer":"C","explanation":"需要的期权数量 = 股票头寸的 delta ÷ 每份期权的 delta = 50,000 / 0.625 = 80,000\n多头股票 delta 为正，看涨期权 delta 也为正，所以要卖出看涨期权来抵消。\n· 31,250：把 delta 乘到了股数上，应当相除。\n· 买入看涨期权会增加 delta，而不是对冲。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 43 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_45","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"For a two-period put on a non-dividend-paying stock with an exercise price of 55.00, the risk-neutral probability of an up move is 0.46 and the risk-free rate is 2% per period. At Time 1, the stock is 45.00 at the down node, where the European put value is 8.90; the put value at the up node is 0.80. The value of the American-style put at Time 0 is closest to:","options":{"A":"5.07","B":"5.65","C":"9.80"},"answer":"B","explanation":"美式期权在下跌节点要比较：立即行权 55 − 45 = 10.00，继续持有 8.90 → 取 10.00\n第 0 期价值 = [0.46 × 0.8 + 0.54 × 10.00] / 1.02 = 5.65\n· 5.07：用了下跌节点的欧式价值，忽略了提前行权。\n· 9.80：只折现了下跌节点的价值，没有按概率加权。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 45 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_47","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In the context of a two-period binomial option valuation model, dynamic replication most accurately refers to:","options":{"A":"computing option values at Time 2 from the option values at Time 1 using the no-arbitrage approach.","B":"rebalancing a portfolio of the underlying and borrowing or lending at each node so that it exactly matches the option's value at every node.","C":"holding a fixed number of shares bought at Time 0 until expiration."},"answer":"B","explanation":"动态复制：在每个节点按新的对冲比率调整股票和借贷头寸，使组合价值在每个节点都与期权价值完全一致。\n· 二叉树是用第 2 期的期权价值倒推第 1 期，不是反过来。\n· 静态持有固定股数不能在多期中复制期权，因为对冲比率会变化。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 47 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_51","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor holds a long put that moves deeper into the money as expiration approaches. The put's delta will move closer to:","options":{"A":"0.","B":"+1.","C":"−1."},"answer":"C","explanation":"多头看跌期权的 delta 在 −1 到 0 之间。越深度价内、越临近到期，期权越像空头股票，delta 越接近 −1；深度价外时接近 0。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 51 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_54","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In the expectations approach to valuing European options in a binomial model, the probabilities of up and down moves are:","options":{"A":"investors' subjective estimates of the likelihood of each move.","B":"historical frequencies of up and down moves in the underlying.","C":"risk-neutral probabilities derived from the up factor, down factor, and risk-free rate."},"answer":"C","explanation":"期望法用风险中性概率 π = (1 + r − d)/(u − d)，由 u、d 和无风险利率决定。投资者对标的未来走势的主观判断、历史涨跌频率都与期权定价无关。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 54 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_deriv_2_57","subject":"EOC · 衍生 Derivatives","subjectKey":"eoc_deriv","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A company buys an interest rate call option and sells an interest rate put option with the same notional, expiration, and an exercise rate equal to the current FRA rate. The combined position is equivalent to a:","options":{"A":"long interest rate cap.","B":"receive-floating, pay-fixed FRA.","C":"receive-fixed, pay-floating FRA."},"answer":"B","explanation":"多头利率看涨 + 空头利率看跌（行权利率 = FRA 利率）：利率高于行权利率时收到差额，低于时支付差额，与收浮动、付固定的 FRA 完全相同，用来防范利率上升。\n· 收固定、付浮动的 FRA 对应多头看跌 + 空头看涨。\n· 利率上限（cap）只有多头看涨的部分，没有卖出看跌期权的义务。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 57 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_1_7","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Three months ago, a fund bought a crude oil futures contract at 82.40, fully collateralized with T-bills yielding 2.0% annualized. Just before expiration the contract trades at 83.55, and the fund rolls into the next contract, priced at 84.00. The fund's total return for the three-month period is closest to:","options":{"A":"1.36%","B":"1.40%","C":"2.43%"},"answer":"A","explanation":"总回报 = 价格回报 + 展期回报 + 抵押品回报\n价格回报 = (83.55 − 82.40) / 82.40 = 1.396%\n展期回报 = (到期合约价 − 新合约价) / 到期合约价 = (83.55 − 84.00) / 83.55 = –0.539%（远月升水/contango，为负）\n抵押品回报 = 2.0% × 3/12 = 0.500%\n合计 = 1.36%\n· 1.40%：只算了价格回报，漏掉了展期回报和抵押品回报。\n· 2.43%：展期回报符号弄反；contango 下以更高价格买入新合约，展期回报为负。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_1_14","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor holds a fully collateralized long position in a copper futures contract purchased two months ago at 61.20. The collateral earns 3.0% annualized. At the end of the two months the contract is near expiry at 62.45, and the investor rolls into the next contract at 62.95. The total return over the two months is closest to:","options":{"A":"1.24%","B":"1.74%","C":"2.54%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"价格回报 = (62.45 − 61.20) / 61.20 = 2.042%\n展期回报 = (62.45 − 62.95) / 62.45 = –0.801%（contango，为负）\n抵押品回报 = 3.0% × 2/12 = 0.500%\n总回报 = 2.042% + (–0.801%) + 0.500% = 1.74%\n· 1.24%：漏掉了抵押品（T-bill）的利息收入。\n· 2.54%：漏掉了展期回报；远月升水时展期回报为负，会拉低总回报。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_1_27","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A client wants broad commodity exposure through an index but insists that energy should not dominate the allocation. The index weighting method that best meets the client's requirement is most likely:","options":{"A":"weighting by the value of world production.","B":"weighting by futures market liquidity (trading volume).","C":"equal weighting of the index constituents."},"answer":"C","explanation":"等权重指数给每种商品相同的权重，能限制能源的配置比例。\n· 按产量（产值）加权：原油、天然气等能源产值最大，能源占比往往超过一半，与客户要求相反。\n· 按流动性加权：能源期货（尤其原油）交易量最大，同样会使能源权重很高。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 27 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_1_30","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Under the hedging pressure hypothesis, an upward-sloping (contango) futures curve for a commodity most likely indicates that:","options":{"A":"consumers' demand to hedge by buying futures exceeds producers' demand to hedge by selling futures.","B":"producers' demand to hedge by selling futures exceeds consumers' demand to hedge by buying futures.","C":"storage costs for the commodity exceed its convenience yield."},"answer":"A","explanation":"对冲压力假说：当消费者的套期保值需求（买入期货锁定成本）大于生产者的卖出套保需求时，期货价格被推高到预期现货价之上，曲线向上倾斜（contango）；生产者对冲压力占优时则为 backwardation。\n· 生产者卖出套保占优：会压低期货价格，形成 backwardation，方向反了。\n· 存储成本高于便利收益：这是存储理论（theory of storage）对 contango 的解释，不是对冲压力假说。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 30 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_1_32","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Natural gas must be held in costly storage facilities, and inventories are currently ample. Futures prices for delivery in later months are well above the spot price. This pattern is most consistent with the:","options":{"A":"theory of storage, because futures prices must compensate holders for storage costs that exceed the convenience yield.","B":"hedging pressure hypothesis, because producers' short hedging exceeds consumers' long hedging.","C":"insurance theory, which predicts that futures prices are set below the expected future spot price."},"answer":"A","explanation":"存储理论：期货价格 = 现货价格 + 存储成本 − 便利收益。需要持续存储、库存充足（便利收益低）的商品，远期价格应更高以补偿存储成本，形成 contango，与题述一致。\n· 对冲压力假说中生产者卖出套保占优：会导致 backwardation（期货低于现货），与题述相反。\n· 保险理论（正常贴水）：预测期货价格低于预期未来现货价，即 backwardation，同样不符。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 32 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_1_36","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The futures curve for soybeans is in contango and is expected to remain so. A trader who wants to earn a positive roll return should most likely:","options":{"A":"buy futures now and switch to a short position only after the curve moves into contango.","B":"sell (short) soybean futures and roll the short position.","C":"buy (go long) soybean futures and roll the long position."},"answer":"B","explanation":"contango 时远月价格高于近月：多头展期是“卖低买高”，展期回报为负；空头展期是“买回低价近月、卖出高价远月”，获得正的展期回报。只有在 backwardation 时做多才有正的展期回报。\n· 做多并展期：contango 下展期回报为负。\n· 先做多、等进入 contango 再做空：曲线现在就处于 contango，此时做多立即产生负的展期回报。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_2_5","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A lender will finance an office property appraised at $240 million with expected first-year NOI of $14.5 million. The loan terms require a maximum loan-to-value ratio of 65% and a minimum debt service coverage ratio of 1.25x. The loan carries a 6% interest rate with annual payments, fully amortizing over 25 years. The maximum loan amount is closest to:","options":{"A":"$148.3 million","B":"$156.0 million","C":"$193.3 million"},"answer":"A","explanation":"两个约束都要满足，取较小者。\n1) LTV 约束：240m × 65% = 156.0m\n   年偿债常数 = r / [1 − (1+r)^−n] = 0.078227，此时 DSCR = 14.5 / (156.0 × 0.078227) = 1.188x < 1.25x，不满足。\n2) DSCR 约束：最大年偿债额 = 14.5m / 1.25 = 11.60m；贷款额 = 11.60m / 0.078227 = 148.3m\n最大贷款额 = min(156.0, 148.3) = 148.3m\n· $156.0 million：只看了 LTV，没有检查 DSCR 是否达标。\n· $193.3 million：把最大偿债额只当作利息（除以利率），忽略了本金摊还。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 5 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_2_8","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In a regional industrial property market, vacancy rates have peaked well above their long-run average after several years of falling rents, and almost no new construction is under way. The phase the market is most likely to enter next is:","options":{"A":"recovery, in which vacancies begin to decline and rents stabilize before new construction resumes.","B":"hypersupply, in which new completions push vacancy rates further above average.","C":"expansion, in which rising rents immediately trigger a wave of new construction."},"answer":"A","explanation":"房地产周期：recovery → expansion → hypersupply → recession。空置率见顶、租金已连续下跌、几乎没有新开工，说明市场处于衰退末期，下一阶段是复苏：空置率开始回落、租金企稳，新建项目尚未大量启动。\n· 直接进入扩张：需要先经过复苏，空置率回到正常水平、租金上涨后才会刺激新建。\n· 供给过剩：发生在扩张之后、大量新项目竣工时；目前几乎没有在建项目，不可能出现新的供给冲击。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_2_15","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Orsolya Fund buys a shopping center outright from a developer, and Pemberton Bank provides a mortgage loan directly to the buyer of a separate warehouse. These investments are best classified, respectively, as:","options":{"A":"private real estate equity and public real estate debt.","B":"private real estate equity and private real estate debt.","C":"public real estate equity and private real estate debt."},"answer":"B","explanation":"直接买入物业、直接发放抵押贷款都是私下协商的交易，属于私募市场：\n· 直接持有物业 = 私募房地产股权；直接发放抵押贷款 = 私募房地产债权。\n· “public real estate debt”：公募房地产债权指 MBS 等可公开交易的证券，银行直接放贷不属于此类。\n· “public real estate equity”：公募房地产股权指 REIT、REOC 的股票，直接买入整个物业不属于此类。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_3_1","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Lindqvist Properties distributes more than 90% of its taxable income and is exempt from corporate income tax on distributed income. Its senior executives are employees of the company and report to a board of directors elected by shareholders. Lindqvist is best described as a(n):","options":{"A":"internally managed REIT.","B":"externally managed REIT.","C":"real estate operating company (REOC)."},"answer":"A","explanation":"高管是公司自己的员工、向股东选出的董事会汇报，属于内部管理（自我管理）的 REIT；同时满足派息要求并享受税收优惠，所以是 REIT 而不是 REOC。\n· 外部管理 REIT：由外部管理公司按合同收费管理，高管不是 REIT 的员工。\n· REOC：不享受 REIT 的税收地位，也没有强制派息要求，与本题“免公司所得税、派息超过 90%”不符。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 1 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_3_8","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst forecasts dividends per share for Harrow Logistics REIT of $3.10, $3.35, $3.60, and $3.85 for Years 1 to 4. After Year 4, dividends are expected to grow at 4% per year indefinitely. The required return is 8.5%. The value per share is closest to:","options":{"A":"$70.47","B":"$73.03","C":"$75.50"},"answer":"C","explanation":"两步 DDM：\n1) 前 4 年股利现值 = 3.10/1.085^1 + 3.35/1.085^2 + 3.60/1.085^3 + 3.85/1.085^4 = 11.2993\n2) 第 4 年末终值 = D5 / (r − g) = 3.85 × 1.04 / (0.085 − 0.04) = 88.9778\n   终值现值 = 88.9778 / 1.085^4 = 64.2041\n价值 = 11.2993 + 64.2041 = 75.50\n· $73.03：终值用了 D4 而不是下一年股利 D5 = D4 × (1 + g)。\n· $70.47：第 4 年末的终值被多折现了一年（按第 5 年折现）。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_3_13","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Compared with REITs in most other property sectors, health care REITs are most sensitive to:","options":{"A":"economic recessions, because occupancy is highly cyclical.","B":"demographic trends and changes in government health care funding.","C":"growth in consumer spending and retail sales."},"answer":"B","explanation":"医疗 REIT（养老院、医疗办公楼、医院等）的需求主要由人口老龄化驱动，收入很大程度依赖政府医疗拨款/报销，因此对人口结构和政府医疗政策变化最敏感；它们对经济衰退的抵抗力相对较强。\n· 衰退、入住率周期性强：医疗需求刚性，抗衰退能力强，这更像酒店或写字楼 REIT 的特征。\n· 消费支出和零售销售：这是购物中心等零售 REIT 的主要驱动因素。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_3_16","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Fairlie Residential REIT just paid an annual dividend of $1.60 per share. Dividends are expected to grow at 6% per year for the next 3 years and at 3% per year thereafter. The required return is 9%. Using a two-step dividend discount model, the value per share is closest to:","options":{"A":"$29.07","B":"$29.80","C":"$56.53"},"answer":"B","explanation":"D1–D3 = 1.6960, 1.7978, 1.9056\n前 3 年股利现值 = 4.5406\n第 3 年末终值 = D4 / (r − g2) = 1.9056 × 1.03 / (0.09 − 0.03) = 32.7132，现值 = 25.2606\n价值 = 4.5406 + 25.2606 = 29.80\n· $29.07：终值用了 D3 而不是下一年股利 D4。\n· $56.53：直接用第一阶段 6% 的增长率套单阶段戈登模型，忽略了增长率会降到 3%。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 16 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_3_21","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following statements about adjusted funds from operations (AFFO) is least accurate?","options":{"A":"AFFO is generally a better approximation of a REIT's economic earnings than FFO.","B":"AFFO adjusts FFO by subtracting recurring capital expenditures and leasing costs and removing straight-line rent effects.","C":"Because its adjustments are standardized, AFFO is calculated consistently across REITs and analysts."},"answer":"C","explanation":"最不准确：AFFO 中的维持性资本支出、租赁费用等需要估计，没有统一标准，不同 REIT 和分析师算出的 AFFO 差异和误差都较大。\n· “AFFO 从 FFO 中扣除维持性资本支出和租赁费用、调整直线法租金”：正确，这正是 AFFO 的定义。\n· “AFFO 比 FFO 更接近经济收益”：正确，它考虑了维持物业运营所需的支出。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 21 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_3_22","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst is preparing a market-based relative valuation of Quarrystone REIT. Which input is least likely to be used in this valuation?","options":{"A":"Net operating income capitalized at a market cap rate to estimate net asset value per share.","B":"Price-to-AFFO multiples of comparable REITs.","C":"Price-to-FFO multiples of REITs with similar property types and growth prospects."},"answer":"A","explanation":"用资本化率把 NOI 资本化得到物业价值、再扣负债求每股 NAV，属于以资产为基础的净资产价值法（NAV approach），不是基于市场倍数的相对估值。\n· P/FFO：最常用的 REIT 相对估值倍数之一。\n· P/AFFO：同样是相对估值倍数，比较可比 REIT 的定价。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 22 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_9","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investment committee will move 20% of a portfolio (standard deviation 12%) into one hedge fund strategy. Its primary constraint is that the combined portfolio's variance must be less than 90% of the current portfolio's variance; among strategies that satisfy the constraint, it prefers the highest Sortino ratio.\n| Strategy | Std. dev. | Correlation with portfolio | Sortino ratio |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Equity market neutral | 6% | 0.10 | 1.10 |\n| Global macro | 16% | 0.55 | 1.45 |\n| Long/short equity | 12% | 0.80 | 1.25 |\nThe committee should most likely select:","options":{"A":"Equity market neutral.","B":"Global macro.","C":"Long/short equity."},"answer":"A","explanation":"组合方差 = (1−w)²σp² + w²σh² + 2w(1−w)ρσpσh，w = 0.20；上限 = 0.90 × 0.0144 = 0.012960\nEquity market neutral：0.009590 < 上限，满足\nGlobal macro：0.013619 ≥ 上限，不满足\nLong/short equity：0.013478 ≥ 上限，不满足\n满足约束的只有 Equity market neutral，因此选它（Sortino 1.10）。\n· Global macro.：Sortino 最高（1.45），但组合方差超过上限，违反首要约束。\n· Long/short equity.：与现有组合相关性高（0.80），组合方差同样超过上限。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_11","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A client wants hedge fund strategies that offer high liquidity, can employ substantial leverage, and tend to produce right-skewed returns. The pair of strategies that best matches these preferences is:","options":{"A":"distressed securities and merger arbitrage.","B":"global macro and managed futures.","C":"fixed-income arbitrage and convertible bond arbitrage."},"answer":"B","explanation":"全球宏观和管理期货都属于机会型（opportunistic）策略：主要交易流动性很高的期货、外汇、利率等工具，可用高杠杆，收益常呈右偏（趋势或宏观转折时大幅获利）。\n· 固定收益套利、可转债套利：相对价值策略，收益通常左偏（“捡硬币”式小赚、危机时大亏），流动性在压力时期较差。\n· 困境证券、并购套利：事件驱动策略，困境证券流动性差；并购套利收益左偏（交易失败时损失大）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 11 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_12","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Brightline Corp. offers 5 of its shares for every 4 shares of Corvo Inc. A merger arbitrage fund buys 20,000 Corvo shares at $30.00 and short sells the corresponding number of Brightline shares at $28.00. When the deal closes, Brightline trades at $26.00, and the fund uses the shares it receives to cover its short position. Ignoring dividends and transaction costs, the fund's profit is closest to:","options":{"A":"USD –134,000","B":"USD 50,000","C":"USD 100,000"},"answer":"C","explanation":"按换股比例：20,000 股 Corvo × 5/4 = 25,000 股 Brightline，所以卖空 25,000 股。\n交易完成后用换得的 25,000 股 Brightline 归还卖空，两边头寸完全对冲，收盘价 26.00 不影响结果：\n利润 = 卖空所得 − 多头成本 = 25,000 × 28.00 − 20,000 × 30.00 = 700,000 − 600,000 = 100,000\n· USD 50,000：只算了多头腿（换得的股票按 26.00 计价），漏掉了空头腿的收益。\n· USD –134,000：把换股比例弄反（按 4/5 换股），换得的股票不足以平掉空头，还要按 26.00 补买差额。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_14","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A manager believes that the convertible bonds of Talbot Energy are undervalued relative to its common stock. The classic convertible bond arbitrage trade is most likely to:","options":{"A":"buy the convertible bonds and short sell an appropriate (delta-hedged) number of Talbot shares.","B":"buy both the convertible bonds and Talbot shares to benefit fully from a rising share price.","C":"short sell the convertible bonds and buy Talbot shares."},"answer":"A","explanation":"经典可转债套利：买入相对低估的可转债，同时按 delta 卖空相对高估的股票，赚取定价偏差、票息和波动率带来的收益，而不是押注股价方向；股价上涨时可转债的收益大体被空头股票的损失抵消，利润不会因此明显增加。\n· 卖空可转债、买入股票：方向反了，这是在可转债被高估时才做的反向交易。\n· 同时买入两者：这是方向性做多，失去了套利对冲的含义。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 14 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_15","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A hedge fund specializing in life settlements is evaluating policies to purchase. The policy most attractive to the fund most likely has:","options":{"A":"low ongoing premium payments, a high surrender value, and an insured whose life expectancy is longer than the insurer estimated.","B":"low ongoing premium payments, a low surrender value, and an insured whose life expectancy is shorter than the insurer estimated.","C":"high ongoing premium payments, a low surrender value, and an insured whose life expectancy is shorter than the insurer estimated."},"answer":"B","explanation":"人寿保单贴现：基金买入保单、继续交保费，被保险人去世时领取保额。理想保单：\n1) 续保保费低——持有成本低；\n2) 退保价值低——原保单持有人更愿意以较低价格卖给基金；\n3) 被保险人预期寿命短于保险公司估计——更早拿到赔付。\n· 保费高：持有成本高，降低回报。\n· 退保价值高、寿命长于预期：卖方可以直接退保拿高价，基金买入价更高；被保险人活得更久意味着要交更多保费、更晚拿到赔付。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 15 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_19","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the risks of a convertible bond arbitrage strategy is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Because the position is delta hedged, it has no meaningful exposure to credit risk or liquidity risk.","B":"Its main risk is an increase in implied volatility, which reduces the value of the long convertible position.","C":"Difficulty borrowing the stock, recall of borrowed shares, or a short squeeze can disrupt the short hedge, and liquidity can dry up in stressed markets."},"answer":"C","explanation":"可转债套利的主要风险：卖空端——融券困难、借券被召回、轧空（short squeeze）、融券费用上升，可能被迫平仓；此外还有信用风险（发行人违约）、流动性风险（危机时可转债流动性枯竭、被迫折价卖出）以及杠杆放大损失。\n· “delta 对冲后没有信用和流动性风险”：delta 只对冲股价变动，可转债的信用风险、流动性风险仍然存在，2008 年就是典型例子。\n· “隐含波动率上升是主要风险”：多头可转债内含看涨期权，波动率上升反而使其增值；真正不利的是波动率下降。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 19 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_20","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An endowment wants a hedge fund allocation that takes directional positions on macroeconomic themes across currencies, rates, equities, and commodities, invests mainly in liquid instruments, and offers a right-skewed return profile, accepting that returns may be lumpy. The strategy that best fits is most likely:","options":{"A":"equity market neutral.","B":"merger arbitrage.","C":"global macro."},"answer":"C","explanation":"全球宏观策略：自上而下判断宏观经济主题，跨货币、利率、股票、商品做方向性交易，主要使用流动性很高的工具，收益常呈右偏，但波动大、收益不均匀（lumpy），与该捐赠基金的偏好完全匹配。\n· 股票市场中性：只在股票内部做多空、追求接近零的 beta，不做跨资产的宏观方向性押注，收益分布也不以右偏为特征。\n· 并购套利：事件驱动、收益左偏（交易失败时损失大），与偏好右偏相反。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 20 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_21","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A volatility trader expects realized volatility of an equity index to exceed current implied levels and wants exposure to volatility without having to delta-hedge continuously. The instrument that best achieves this is most likely a:","options":{"A":"long variance swap position on the index.","B":"long position in index futures.","C":"short straddle on the index."},"answer":"A","explanation":"实施波动率交易的路径包括：delta 对冲的期权（如买入跨式并持续对冲）、VIX 期货/期权、方差互换和波动率互换。方差互换的收益 = 名义金额 × (实现方差 − 方差执行价)，直接获得对实现波动率的敞口，无需自己做 delta 对冲。\n· 做多指数期货：这是对指数价格方向的敞口，不是波动率敞口。\n· 卖出跨式：是做空波动率，与“预期实现波动率上升”的观点相反。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 21 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_22","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Relative to a fund of funds, a multi-strategy hedge fund most likely offers the advantage of:","options":{"A":"a lower risk that losses in one strategy affect the returns of other strategies.","B":"faster and more efficient reallocation of capital across strategies, with greater transparency into underlying positions.","C":"lower leverage and therefore lower return volatility."},"answer":"B","explanation":"多策略基金在同一机构内由不同团队运作多个策略，管理层能看到全部头寸（透明度高），可以迅速在策略之间调配资金；组合基金需要从外部基金赎回再申购，受锁定期、赎回通知期限制，调配慢、透明度低。\n· 一个策略的亏损不影响其他策略：恰恰相反，多策略基金存在净额结算风险（netting risk），亏损策略的业绩报酬问题和损失会由全体投资者承担。\n· 杠杆更低、波动更小：多策略基金通常使用更高杠杆，收益波动可能更大。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 22 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_23","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A committee is deciding what share of its portfolio (expected return 7.0%, standard deviation 11.0%) to allocate to a hedge fund strategy with expected return 6.0%, standard deviation 7.0%, and correlation 0.30 with the portfolio. The risk-free rate is 2.0%. The committee requires the combined portfolio's expected return to be at least 6.75% and, subject to that, wants the highest Sharpe ratio. Considering allocations of 10%, 20%, and 30%, the committee should most likely choose:","options":{"A":"10%","B":"20%","C":"30%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"组合期望收益 = (1−w)E_p + wE_h；σ = √[(1−w)²σp² + w²σh² + 2w(1−w)ρσpσh]；Sharpe = (E − rf)/σ\nw = 10%：E = 6.90%，σ = 10.132%，Sharpe = 0.4836\nw = 20%：E = 6.80%，σ = 9.316%，Sharpe = 0.5152\nw = 30%：E = 6.70%，σ = 8.567%，Sharpe = 0.5486（收益低于下限，不满足）\n满足收益下限的方案中 Sharpe 最高的是 20%。\n· 30%：Sharpe 最高，但期望收益 6.70% 低于委员会要求的 6.75%。\n· 10%：期望收益最高，但满足约束后应比较 Sharpe，它的 Sharpe 低于 20% 方案。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_27","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An adviser makes three statements comparing multi-strategy hedge funds with funds of funds. Which statement is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Multi-strategy funds' fee structures are typically more favorable to investors than the two layers of fees charged by funds of funds.","B":"Multi-strategy funds typically use less leverage than funds of funds and therefore have lower return variance.","C":"Multi-strategy funds typically provide the manager with greater transparency into the underlying positions than funds of funds."},"answer":"B","explanation":"最不准确：多策略基金通常使用更高的杠杆，收益方差往往更大，而不是更小。\n· 费用结构对投资者更有利：正确，组合基金有两层费用（底层基金 + 组合基金），多策略基金一般只有一层（虽然要注意净额结算风险）。\n· 透明度更高：正确，多策略基金的管理层能看到所有内部团队的头寸。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 27 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_29","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about merger arbitrage as part of a hedge fund portfolio is most accurate?","options":{"A":"It can provide a source of alpha with low correlation to other strategies, and spreading positions across many deals and industries further reduces risk.","B":"It involves taking offsetting long and short positions in the debt and equity securities of the same company.","C":"Its returns remain uncorrelated with equity markets even during severe market declines."},"answer":"A","explanation":"并购套利的收益主要取决于具体交易能否完成，是较好的低相关 alpha 来源；把头寸分散到多笔交易和多个行业，可进一步降低单一交易失败的影响。\n· 同一公司债和股之间做多空：这是资本结构套利（capital structure arbitrage）的描述。\n· 市场暴跌时也不相关：危机时融资困难、交易被取消的概率上升，并购套利的损失会与股市同步，相关性上升（收益左偏）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_31","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A manager with a large long equity portfolio wants to use volatility instruments to hedge against a sharp market sell-off. Which trade is most appropriate?","options":{"A":"Write out-of-the-money put options on the equity index.","B":"Sell VIX futures.","C":"Buy VIX call options."},"answer":"C","explanation":"股票收益与波动率负相关：市场大跌时波动率飙升。要对冲多头股票敞口，需要做多波动率，例如买入 VIX 看涨期权。\n· 卖出 VIX 期货：做空波动率，大跌时波动率上升会造成亏损，与股票损失叠加。\n· 卖出虚值看跌期权：同样是做空波动率（和做空下跌风险），大跌时损失放大，起不到对冲作用。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 31 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_34","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Compared with other equity hedge fund strategies, equity market neutral funds most likely:","options":{"A":"hold highly diversified long and short portfolios with high turnover.","B":"hold concentrated portfolios with low turnover and a significant net long market exposure.","C":"use little or no leverage because the spreads they capture are large."},"answer":"A","explanation":"股票市场中性：通过多空配对把市场 beta、行业等因子敞口压到接近零，持仓高度分散、换手率高（依赖量化模型频繁调仓）；由于捕捉到的定价偏差很小，通常要借助杠杆放大收益。\n· 集中持仓、低换手、显著净多头：这是基本面多空（fundamental long/short）或偏多策略的特征，不是市场中性。\n· 几乎不用杠杆：市场中性的单笔收益很薄，一般需要较高杠杆。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_alt_4_41","subject":"EOC · 另类 Alternative Investments","subjectKey":"eoc_alt","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A hedge fund manager expects credit spreads to widen sharply and equity market volatility to rise over the next quarter. To benefit from both views, the fund should most likely hold:","options":{"A":"a negative credit exposure and a positive volatility exposure.","B":"a negative credit exposure and a negative volatility exposure.","C":"a positive credit exposure and a positive volatility exposure."},"answer":"A","explanation":"信用利差扩大时，承担信用风险（正的信用敞口，如做多高收益债）会亏损，应持有负的信用敞口（如买入 CDS 保护、做空信用）。\n波动率上升时，应持有正的波动率敞口（如做多期权/方差互换）。\n· 正的信用敞口：利差扩大会造成损失，方向反了。\n· 负的波动率敞口：做空波动率，在波动率上升时亏损。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 41 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_4","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An economist compares two economies with stable inflation:\n| Economy | Trend real GDP growth | Volatility of real GDP growth |\n| Arland | 2.5% | 1.0% |\n| Belmar | 2.5% | 2.2% |\nAll else equal, which economy most likely has the higher real short-term default-free interest rate?","options":{"A":"Neither, because real rates depend only on trend real GDP growth, which is identical.","B":"Belmar, because the real rate is positively related to the volatility of real GDP growth.","C":"Arland, because lower growth volatility makes its economy more attractive to savers and raises its real rate."},"answer":"B","explanation":"实际短期无违约利率与实际 GDP 增速、以及 GDP 增速的波动率都正相关。两国趋势增速都是 2.5%，Belmar 的波动率 2.2% 高于 Arland 的 1.0%：经济越不确定，投资者越需要更高的实际回报才愿意推迟消费、持有储蓄，所以 Belmar 实际利率更高。\n· Arland：把波动率的影响方向说反了，波动率越低实际利率越低。\n· Neither：忽略了波动率这一决定因素，实际利率不只取决于趋势增速。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 4 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_7","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The government yield curve in a developed economy is currently flat. Economists now expect the economy to enter a recession, and the central bank is widely expected to respond by cutting its policy rate. The yield curve will most likely:","options":{"A":"shift down in parallel and remain flat, because all maturities respond equally to the policy rate.","B":"become upward sloping, because short-term yields fall by more than long-term yields.","C":"become inverted, because long-term yields fall by more than short-term yields."},"answer":"B","explanation":"衰退时央行降息，短端收益率直接跟随政策利率大幅下降；长端收益率反映的是更长期的预期和期限溢价，受影响较小。短端降得多、长端降得少 → 原本平坦的曲线变成向上倾斜（变陡）。\n· 倒挂：方向反了，降息主要压低的是短端。\n· 平行下移：政策利率对短端的影响远大于长端，不是等幅变动。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_16","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following explanations for a persistently upward-sloping yield curve is most consistent with the view that investors demand compensation for assets that pay off poorly in bad economic times?","options":{"A":"Short-dated bonds tend to perform relatively well in bad times, so investors accept lower expected returns on them than on long-dated bonds.","B":"Short-dated bonds carry more reinvestment risk, so investors demand higher yields on them than on long-dated bonds.","C":"Long-dated bonds are better hedges against bad times, so investors accept lower expected returns on them than on short-dated bonds."},"answer":"A","explanation":"资产在“坏时期”回报越好（与坏时期负相关、可以对冲消费下降），投资者越愿意为它付溢价、接受更低的预期回报。如果短期债券在经济不好时表现更好，它的收益率就更低，长期债券需要正的期限溢价 → 曲线向上倾斜。\n· 长期债券是更好的对冲：若如此，长端收益率更低，曲线会向下倾斜，与题干矛盾。\n· 短期债券要求更高收益率：同样会推出向下倾斜的曲线，且不是基于“坏时期回报”的解释。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 16 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_17","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst observes that the government yield curve is upward sloping and concludes: 'The market must expect short-term interest rates to rise.' The analyst's conclusion is best described as:","options":{"A":"invalid, because an upward-sloping curve implies that the market expects short-term rates to fall.","B":"not necessarily valid, because an upward slope is consistent with expected short rates rising, staying flat, or even falling if the term premium is large enough.","C":"valid, because an upward-sloping curve always implies that expected future short-term rates exceed the current short-term rate."},"answer":"B","explanation":"长期收益率 ≈ 预期未来短期利率的平均 + 期限风险溢价。曲线向上倾斜可能是：预期加息 + 正溢价；预期利率不变 + 正溢价；甚至预期降息但风险溢价足够大。所以仅凭斜率无法判断未来利率方向。\n· valid：只有在期限溢价为零（纯预期理论）时才成立，现实中风险溢价通常为正。\n· 预期降息：只是可能性之一，同样不能确定。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 17 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_32","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst makes two statements about valuing commercial real estate with a present value model:\nStatement 1: The numerator of the model consists of expected changes in the property's appraised value rather than rental income.\nStatement 2: Because many commercial leases fix nominal rents for long periods, the discount rate applied to those cash flows behaves much like a bond's, including a term premium, a premium for tenant credit risk, and an illiquidity premium.\nWhich statement(s) is (are) correct?","options":{"A":"Statement 2 only.","B":"Statement 1 only.","C":"Both Statements 1 and 2."},"answer":"A","explanation":"商业地产现值 = Σ 未来租金收入（及期末价值）/ (1 + 折现率)^t，分子的核心是未来租金收入，不是估值变动，Statement 1 错。\n长期固定名义租金的租约使现金流像债券：折现率包含实际无风险利率、预期通胀、期限溢价、租户信用溢价，以及地产缺乏流动性带来的流动性溢价，Statement 2 对。\n· Statement 1 only：分子描述错误。\n· Both：Statement 1 不正确。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 32 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_34","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The 10-year nominal government bond yields 4.35%, the 10-year inflation-linked government bond yields 1.60%, and the 2-year inflation-linked government bond yields 0.90%. The 10-year breakeven inflation rate is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.70%","B":"2.75%","C":"3.45%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"盈亏平衡通胀率 = 同期限名义债券收益率 − 通胀挂钩债券收益率 = 4.35% − 1.60% = 2.75%（其中包含预期通胀和通胀风险溢价）。\n· 0.70%：这是长短期通胀挂钩债券之间的利差，反映的是实际利率期限结构，不是通胀补偿。\n· 3.45%：期限不匹配，用 10 年名义收益率减去了 2 年通胀挂钩收益率。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_39","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the business cycle and corporate earnings is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Earnings of durable goods manufacturers tend to fluctuate more over the cycle than those of consumer staples producers, and understanding the cycle is especially important for short-term earnings forecasts.","B":"Earnings of durable goods manufacturers tend to be less cyclical than average because their products have long useful lives.","C":"The business cycle matters little for short-term earnings forecasts because earnings track long-run trend GDP growth."},"answer":"A","explanation":"经济下行时消费者会推迟购买汽车、家电等耐用品，所以耐用品制造商的收入和盈利随周期波动更大；必需消费品需求稳定，周期性弱。盈利在短期内对周期非常敏感，因此判断周期阶段对短期盈利预测尤其重要。\n· 耐用品周期性弱：正相反，耐用品购买可以推迟，周期性更强。\n· 周期对短期预测不重要：长期盈利趋势跟随 GDP，但短期波动主要由周期驱动。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 39 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_1_46","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An economist states that the yield on short-term default-free inflation-indexed government bonds represents the real risk-free rate. If both the expected trend growth rate of real GDP and the volatility of real GDP growth increase, this yield will most likely:","options":{"A":"fall, because greater growth uncertainty leads investors to accept lower real returns on safe assets.","B":"rise, because the real risk-free rate is positively related to both real GDP growth and its volatility.","C":"be indeterminate, because higher growth raises the real rate while higher volatility lowers it."},"answer":"B","explanation":"短期通胀挂钩国债收益率 ≈ 实际无违约利率，它与实际 GDP 增速正相关、与 GDP 增速的波动率也正相关。两者同时上升 → 收益率上升。\n· fall：把波动率的影响方向说反了。\n· indeterminate：同样误以为波动率与实际利率负相关，两个因素其实方向一致。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 46 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_2_4","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A small-cap value manager is offered a broad large-cap index as his performance benchmark. He raises three concerns: (1) many of the stocks he expects to buy are not in the index; (2) the index has returned less than his target return over the past five years; (3) the index's constituent weights change over time. Which concern provides the strongest reason to reject the benchmark?","options":{"A":"Concern 1, because the benchmark does not represent the manager's investment universe and approach.","B":"Concern 2, because a benchmark should have historical returns at least equal to the manager's target return.","C":"Concern 3, because a valid benchmark must have constant constituent weights."},"answer":"A","explanation":"好的基准应当能代表管理人的投资方式：涵盖他实际会投资的证券、事先确定、可投资。基准里缺少大量他想买的股票，说明基准与其投资风格不匹配，这是拒绝该基准最充分的理由。\n· Concern 2：基准的历史收益高低不是选择标准，基准是用来衡量增值的参照，而不是收益目标。\n· Concern 3：市值加权指数的权重随价格变化是正常的，不影响基准的有效性。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 4 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_2_23","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In the fundamental law of active management, the transfer coefficient (TC) is best described as the cross-sectional correlation between:","options":{"A":"the forecasted active returns and the realized active returns.","B":"the realized risk-adjusted active returns and the risk-weighted active weights.","C":"the forecasted (ex ante) risk-adjusted active returns and the risk-weighted active weights."},"answer":"C","explanation":"TC = COR(μ_i/σ_i, Δw_i σ_i)：事前（预期）风险调整主动收益与风险调整主动权重之间的相关性，衡量预测转化为组合头寸的程度，约束越多 TC 越低。\n· 实际收益与主动权重：TC 是事前概念，不涉及实际收益。\n· 预测收益与实际收益的相关性：这是信息系数 IC 的定义。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_2_33","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investment committee reviews three active equity managers:\n| Manager | IC | TC | Breadth |\n| Manager 1 | 0.08 | 0.45 | 400 |\n| Manager 2 | 0.12 | 0.30 | 100 |\n| Manager 3 | 0.06 | 0.85 | 64 |\nWhich manager is most likely operating under the fewest portfolio constraints?","options":{"A":"Manager 2","B":"Manager 3","C":"Manager 1"},"answer":"B","explanation":"约束（如禁止卖空、行业权重上限）越少，预测越能充分转化为主动权重，转移系数 TC 越高。Manager 3 的 TC = 0.85 最高，约束最少。\n预期 IR = TC × IC × √BR：Manager 1 = 0.720；Manager 2 = 0.360；Manager 3 = 0.408\n· Manager 2：IC 最高说明预测能力最强，但与约束多少无关。\n· Manager 1：预期 IR 最高（0.720）主要来自广度，并不代表约束最少。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 33 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_2_34","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The benchmark is expected to return 7.0%. Three active portfolios have the following expectations:\n| Portfolio | Expected return | Active risk |\n| Pinto | 8.8% | 3.0% |\n| Quill | 10.2% | 6.4% |\n| Rowan | 8.1% | 1.6% |\nThe highest expected information ratio among the three portfolios is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.50","B":"0.60","C":"0.69"},"answer":"C","explanation":"IR = 主动收益 / 主动风险 = (R_P − R_B) / σ_A：\nPinto: (8.8 − 7.0) / 3.0 = 0.600\nQuill: (10.2 − 7.0) / 6.4 = 0.500\nRowan: (8.1 − 7.0) / 1.6 = 0.687\n最高的是 Rowan，IR = 0.69。\n· 0.50：Quill 的主动收益和主动风险都最高，但比率最低，不能只看收益。\n· 0.60：Pinto 的 IR，低于 Rowan。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 34 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_2_45","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A pension fund is choosing among several active managers who are all measured against the same benchmark. The best single criterion for evaluating and ranking them is the managers':","options":{"A":"expected active returns.","B":"expected information ratios.","C":"expected active risks, with the lowest preferred."},"answer":"B","explanation":"在基准相同的情况下，预期信息比率（主动收益 / 主动风险）是评估主动管理人的最佳单一标准：IR 最高的管理人可以通过调整主动风险规模（与基准组合混合或加杠杆）实现最高的风险调整后主动收益。\n· 预期主动收益：没有考虑为此承担的主动风险。\n· 主动风险最低：风险低不代表单位风险的增值高，主动风险规模可以通过与基准混合任意调整。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 45 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_2_48","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A consultant makes three statements:\nStatement 1: A valid benchmark should be investable, specified in advance, and consistent with the manager's investment approach.\nStatement 2: The value added of an active portfolio equals the sum of each security's active weight multiplied by its return.\nStatement 3: For a multi-asset-class portfolio, value added can be decomposed into an asset allocation component (asset class active weights × benchmark asset class returns) and a security selection component (portfolio asset class weights × active returns within each class).\nWhich statement(s) is (are) correct?","options":{"A":"Statements 1, 2, and 3.","B":"Statements 1 and 2 only.","C":"Statements 1 and 3 only."},"answer":"A","explanation":"1) 基准应可投资、事先确定、与投资方式一致 → 正确。\n2) 增值 R_A = R_P − R_B = Σ Δw_i × R_i（主动权重之和为零）→ 正确。\n3) 多资产组合：R_A = Σ Δw_j × R_B,j（资产配置）+ Σ w_P,j × R_A,j（类内选券）→ 正确。\n· Statements 1 and 2 only：漏掉了正确的业绩归因分解。\n· Statements 1 and 3 only：Σ 主动权重 × 证券收益正是增值的定义，Statement 2 也正确。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 48 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_2_50","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An active manager covers 50 stocks and updates an independent return forecast for each stock every quarter. Her information coefficient is 0.05, her transfer coefficient is 0.60, and she targets active risk of 4.0%. Using the fundamental law of active management, her expected active return is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.85%","B":"1.70%","C":"2.83%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"广度 BR = 每年独立投资决策的数量 = 50 × 4 = 200，公式中取平方根。\nE(R_A) = TC × IC × √BR × σ_A = 0.6 × 0.05 × √200 × 4.0% = 0.6 × 0.05 × 14.142 × 4.0% = 1.70%\n· 0.85%：把广度当作股票数量 50，忽略了每季度一次的独立预测。\n· 2.83%：漏乘了转移系数 TC，这是无约束组合的结果。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 50 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_3_4","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"During the trading day, a fixed-income ETF trades at a price noticeably above its intraday NAV. Authorized participants are most likely to respond by:","options":{"A":"selling the underlying basket short and buying ETF shares, which reduces the number of ETF shares outstanding.","B":"buying the underlying basket of bonds, delivering it to the fund in exchange for new ETF shares, and selling those shares in the market.","C":"buying ETF shares in the market and redeeming them with the fund for the underlying basket of bonds."},"answer":"B","explanation":"ETF 溢价（价格 > iNAV）：授权参与人买入较便宜的成分证券篮子，交给基金创设新份额，再以较高价格卖出 ETF 份额获利。新份额的供给把价格压回 NAV，ETF 份额增加。\n· 买 ETF 再赎回：这是折价时的套利操作。\n· 卖空成分篮子、买 ETF：同样是针对折价的方向，而且创设/赎回机制中份额应增加而非减少。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 4 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_3_8","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following would most likely widen the bid–ask spread of an ETF?","options":{"A":"Greater competition among market makers in the ETF.","B":"Higher costs and risks for liquidity providers in hedging the ETF, for example because the underlying securities are less liquid.","C":"Greater ongoing order flow in the ETF's shares."},"answer":"B","explanation":"ETF 买卖价差的决定因素：持续订单流越多 → 做市商可以直接撮合买卖，价差越窄；流动性提供者对冲的成本和风险越高（成分证券流动性差、交易时间不重叠等）→ 价差越宽；做市商之间竞争越激烈 → 价差越窄。\n· 做市商竞争加剧：会压缩价差，而不是扩大。\n· 订单流增加：同样会使价差收窄。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_3_10","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An investor plans to hold an equity ETF for 7 months. The ETF's annual management fee is 0.28%. She pays a commission of 0.03% on both the purchase and the sale, and the ETF's quoted bid–offer spread is 0.12% (half of the spread is paid on each trade). Her total holding-period cost is closest to:","options":{"A":"0.253%","B":"0.343%","C":"0.460%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"总成本 = 管理费 × 持有期 + 往返佣金 + 买卖价差（买卖各付一半，合计一个完整价差）\n= 0.28% × 7/12 + 2 × 0.03% + 0.12% = 0.1633% + 0.06% + 0.12% = 0.343%\n· 0.460%：管理费按全年 0.28% 计算，没有按 7 个月折算。\n· 0.253%：只算了单边交易成本（一次佣金和半个价差），持有期结束时还要卖出。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_3_23","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the use of ETFs in portfolio management is most accurate?","options":{"A":"For short-term tactical positions, managers typically prefer the most heavily traded ETF in an asset category, even if its expense ratio is not the lowest.","B":"Futures markets offer a wider range of risk exposures than ETFs, which limits the usefulness of ETFs for tactical positioning.","C":"For short-term tactical positions, managers typically prefer the ETF with the lowest expense ratio, regardless of its trading volume."},"answer":"A","explanation":"战术交易持有期短，交易成本（价差、冲击成本）远比管理费重要，所以通常选择同类资产中交易量最大、流动性最好的 ETF。ETF 覆盖的资产类别、行业、风格、国家等风险敞口种类比期货市场丰富得多，这正是 ETF 适合战术配置的原因之一。\n· 最低费率：费率对长期持有者更重要，短期交易应优先考虑流动性。\n· 期货敞口更丰富：说反了，ETF 提供的敞口种类比期货更多。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_3_27","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An adviser makes three statements about the risks of exchange-traded products. Which statement is least accurate?","options":{"A":"ETNs carry little credit risk because they are backed by a segregated portfolio of the underlying securities.","B":"ETFs that lend out portfolio securities face counterparty risk, which is typically mitigated by collateral.","C":"Synthetic ETFs that obtain index exposure through total return swaps expose investors to the counterparty risk of the swap providers."},"answer":"A","explanation":"ETN 是发行人（通常是银行）的无担保债务票据，不持有标的资产，主要风险就是发行人的信用风险，所以“ETN 几乎没有信用风险”最不正确。\n· 合成 ETF：通过互换获得指数收益，面临互换交易对手风险，表述正确。\n· 证券出借：借券人可能违约，基金通过收取抵押品来缓释，表述正确。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 3 第 27 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_9","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst estimates the following macroeconomic factor model for a stock: R = 3.10% + 1.40F_GDP − 0.80F_INF + ε, where F_GDP and F_INF are surprises in GDP growth and inflation. Consensus forecasts are GDP growth of 2.5% and inflation of 2.0%; the analyst personally expects 3.0% GDP growth and 2.4% inflation but acknowledges that markets price the consensus. The stock's expected return is closest to:","options":{"A":"3.10%","B":"3.48%","C":"5.00%"},"answer":"A","explanation":"宏观因子模型中的因子是“意外”（实际值 − 预期值），按定义其预期值为零，ε 的预期值也为零，所以预期收益就是截距 a = 3.10%。\n· 5.00%：把预测的 GDP 和通胀水平当作因子值代入（3.1 + 1.4 × 2.5 − 0.8 × 2.0），因子应是意外而不是水平。\n· 3.48%：代入了个人预测与共识之差作为意外（3.1 + 1.4 × 0.5 − 0.8 × 0.4），这只是在该情景实现时的收益，不是预期收益。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_10","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A four-factor macroeconomic model uses surprises in GDP growth, inflation, interest rates, and credit spreads. A portfolio has a nonzero sensitivity only to the GDP factor, while its benchmark has nonzero sensitivities to all four factors. Surprises in which factors would contribute to the portfolio's active risk?","options":{"A":"All four factors.","B":"The GDP factor only.","C":"Inflation, interest rate, and credit spread factors only."},"answer":"A","explanation":"主动风险来自组合与基准在各因子上敏感度的差异 (b_P − b_B)。组合只对 GDP 有敏感度，但基准对四个因子都有敏感度：在通胀、利率、信用利差上，b_P − b_B = 0 − b_B ≠ 0；GDP 上只要两者敏感度不同也有差异。所以四个因子的意外都会影响主动风险。\n· 只有 GDP：只看了组合自身的敏感度，忽略了基准。\n· 只有其他三个：只有当组合与基准对 GDP 的敏感度恰好相同时才成立，题目没有这样的条件。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_27","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A fund's active risk squared is decomposed into the following contributions (in %²):\n| Source | Contribution to active risk squared |\n| Inflation | 14.4 |\n| Time horizon | 9.6 |\n| Business cycle | 4.0 |\n| Active specific | 12.0 |\nThe proportion of the fund's active risk squared attributable to the inflation factor is closest to:","options":{"A":"30.7%","B":"36.0%","C":"60.0%"},"answer":"B","explanation":"主动风险平方 = 主动因子风险 + 主动特有风险，用方差分解，分母要包括全部组成部分：\n总计 = 14.4 + 9.6 + 4.0 + 12.0 = 40.0\n通胀占比 = 14.4 / 40.0 = 36.0%\n· 60.0%：14.4 / (14.4 + 9.6)，分母漏掉了商业周期和个股特有部分。\n· 30.7%：先开方再按标准差分解，标准差不可相加，应按方差分解。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 27 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_28","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A university endowment has a 30-year horizon and spending commitments that rise with inflation. It is considering Fund K, whose sensitivities relative to the market are:\n| Factor | Fund K | Market |\n| Confidence risk | 0.20 | 0.25 |\n| Time horizon risk | 0.85 | 0.60 |\n| Inflation risk | −0.60 | −0.35 |\n| Business cycle risk | 1.05 | 1.00 |\nFund K is most likely unsuitable for the endowment because of its:","options":{"A":"more negative sensitivity to inflation risk.","B":"business cycle risk sensitivity being close to the market's.","C":"higher positive sensitivity to time horizon risk."},"answer":"A","explanation":"Fund K 对通胀风险的敏感度（−0.60）比市场（−0.35）更负：通胀意外上升时 Fund K 受损更大，而大学基金的支出随通胀上升，对通胀风险很敏感，因此这是不合适的原因。\n· 时间期限风险：大学基金投资期限长达 30 年，能够承受短期内投资者长期风险偏好变化带来的波动，较高的正敏感度不是主要顾虑。\n· 商业周期风险：与市场基本一致，不构成不合适的理由。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 28 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_29","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the arbitrage pricing theory (APT) is most accurate?","options":{"A":"The APT specifies neither the number of factors nor the identity of the factors.","B":"The APT specifies the number of factors but not their identity.","C":"The APT requires the market portfolio to be one of the priced factors."},"answer":"A","explanation":"APT 只假设收益由一个多因子模型生成、资产组合充分分散以及不存在套利机会，既不规定因子的数量，也不规定因子是什么。\n· 规定了因子数量：错误，因子数量由使用者自行决定。\n· 必须包含市场组合：这是 CAPM 的结论，APT 不需要市场组合。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 29 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_33","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst attributes a portfolio's active return using a four-factor model:\n| Factor | Portfolio sensitivity | Benchmark sensitivity | Factor return |\n| Market | 1.05 | 1.00 | 6.0% |\n| Size | 0.35 | 0.10 | -1.2% |\n| Value | 0.60 | 0.15 | 2.4% |\n| Momentum | 0.20 | 0.05 | 3.0% |\nThe largest contribution to active return from any single factor is closest to:","options":{"A":"1.08%","B":"1.53%","C":"6.30%"},"answer":"A","explanation":"每个因子对主动收益的贡献 = (组合敏感度 − 基准敏感度) × 因子收益：\nMarket: (1.05 − 1.00) × 6.0% = 0.30%\nSize: (0.35 − 0.10) × –1.2% = –0.30%\nValue: (0.60 − 0.15) × 2.4% = 1.08%\nMomentum: (0.20 − 0.05) × 3.0% = 0.45%\n最大的是 Value 因子，1.08%。\n· 1.53%：这是四个因子贡献的合计（主动因子收益），不是单个因子。\n· 6.30%：只用了组合敏感度 × 因子收益（市场因子），忽略了基准敏感度。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 33 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_38","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The Hanul equity portfolio has active risk of 4.0% and active factor risk of 2.0% (both expressed as standard deviations). The proportion of the portfolio's active risk squared attributable to security selection is closest to:","options":{"A":"25%","B":"50%","C":"75%"},"answer":"C","explanation":"主动风险平方 = 主动因子风险平方 + 主动特有风险平方（选股）\n主动特有风险平方 = 4.0² − 2.0² = 16 − 4 = 12\n选股占比 = 12 / 16 = 75%\n· 50%：1 − 2.0/4.0，用标准差直接相减，标准差不可加。\n· 25%：这是因子（风格偏离）部分的占比，不是选股部分。","qtype":"calc","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 38 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_41","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A research team uses a multifactor model to estimate each security's expected return, compares it with the expected return of the security's industry index, and overweights securities with the most attractive expected returns relative to their industries. This application of the model is best described as:","options":{"A":"portfolio construction.","B":"risk attribution.","C":"return attribution."},"answer":"A","explanation":"用多因子模型估计证券预期收益、与所属行业指数比较来挑选证券并决定权重，是在事前构建组合，属于组合构建（portfolio construction）。\n· 收益归因：事后分析已实现主动收益来自哪些因子和选股。\n· 风险归因：分析主动风险来自哪些因子敞口和个股特有风险，也不涉及选股决策。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 41 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_4_49","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst makes three statements about multifactor models. Which statement is least accurate?","options":{"A":"Active return equals the sum of the portfolio's factor sensitivities multiplied by the factor returns; security selection does not contribute to active return.","B":"Active return can be decomposed into the sum of (portfolio sensitivity − benchmark sensitivity) × factor return, plus a security selection component.","C":"Active risk squared equals active factor risk plus active specific risk."},"answer":"A","explanation":"主动收益 = Σ(b_P,k − b_B,k) × F_k + 选股（残差）带来的主动收益。应当用组合与基准敏感度之差，并且选股部分也会贡献主动收益，所以第一种说法最不准确。\n· 主动风险平方 = 主动因子风险 + 主动特有风险：跟踪误差的方差分解，表述正确。\n· 敏感度差 × 因子收益 + 选股：正是主动收益的正确分解。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 4 第 49 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_3","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A trading desk reports a one-day 1% VaR of €4.2 million. Which interpretation is most accurate?","options":{"A":"The largest loss the desk can incur on any single day is €4.2 million.","B":"On 1% of trading days, the desk is expected to lose at least €4.2 million.","C":"The desk will lose no more than €4.2 million on 99% of trading days."},"answer":"B","explanation":"VaR 是最小损失：在 1% 的交易日里，损失至少为 €4.2 百万。\n· “99% 的日子损失不超过 4.2”：暗含 99% 的日子都有损失，而大多数日子可能是盈利的，表述不准确，CFA 推荐的说法是“1% 的日子损失至少为 X”。\n· 最大损失：VaR 不是最大损失，尾部的损失可能远大于 VaR。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_7","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Over the past year a fund's daily 5% VaR was never exceeded, yet the fund lost a large amount over the year. Volatility during the year was much lower than in the lookback period used to estimate VaR. The most likely explanation is that:","options":{"A":"the losses must have come from a few days on which losses far exceeded VaR, a tail risk that VaR ignores.","B":"zero exceedances shows the VaR model was understating risk, so the confidence level should be lowered.","C":"VaR was overstated because of the higher lookback volatility, so the fund could lose amounts just below the VaR estimate on many days without any exceedance."},"answer":"C","explanation":"回溯期波动率高于过去一年，VaR 被高估；组合可以每天都在 VaR 以内、但持续接近该水平地亏损，累积起来亏损很大，却没有一次突破。这说明 VaR 对波动率环境变化的反应有局限，也说明 VaR 不衡量累计损失。\n· 少数几天大额亏损：与“零突破”矛盾，若有单日损失超过 VaR 就会记为突破。\n· 零突破说明低估风险：正好相反，5% VaR 一年应有约 12–13 次突破，零突破说明 VaR 偏保守（高估）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 7 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_8","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A risk manager wants to use a historical scenario to estimate how the current government bond portfolio would perform if the 2008 financial crisis were repeated. The most appropriate input is the crisis-period:","options":{"A":"price changes of the bonds the portfolio actually held in 2008.","B":"price changes of the specific bonds currently in the portfolio.","C":"changes in yields of bonds with maturities similar to those of the bonds currently held."},"answer":"C","explanation":"债券价格主要由收益率决定，而且债券的剩余期限会随时间缩短，当前持有的很多债券在危机时期可能尚未发行或期限完全不同。应把危机期间期限相近债券的收益率变化施加到当前持仓上，再重新定价。\n· 2008 年实际持有债券的价格变化：反映的是当时的组合，不是现在的组合。\n· 当前债券的历史价格：很多债券当时不存在，或者当时期限不同，价格变化不可比。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_10","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A defined benefit pension plan wants to estimate, at a 95% confidence level, how much its assets could underperform its liabilities over the next year. The measure best suited to this purpose is:","options":{"A":"ex ante tracking error relative to a market benchmark.","B":"conditional VaR of the asset portfolio.","C":"surplus at risk."},"answer":"C","explanation":"盈余风险（surplus at risk）是 VaR 的一种应用：把资产和负债一起建模，估计在给定置信水平下（通常一年）资产可能落后负债多少。\n· 资产组合的 CVaR：只看资产本身的尾部损失，没有考虑负债。\n· 事前跟踪误差：衡量的是相对市场基准的落后（相对 VaR），不是相对负债。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 10 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_12","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A risk manager is stress testing a portfolio of high-yield bonds and credit derivatives for a scenario in which credit spreads widen by 600 bps. To estimate the portfolio's loss, the manager should most appropriately:","options":{"A":"multiply each position's spread duration by the 600 bp spread change.","B":"fully reprice each security under the stressed spreads.","C":"scale the portfolio's one-day historical VaR by the square root of the scenario horizon."},"answer":"B","explanation":"敏感度指标（久期、利差久期等）是线性近似，只适用于小幅变动；在极端利差变动下，凸性和非线性（尤其是含衍生品的头寸）使近似误差很大，应对每个证券做完全重估。\n· 利差久期 × 利差变动：线性近似在 600 bp 的极端情景下严重失真。\n· 按 √T 放大 VaR：VaR 基于正常市场分布，不能代替特定极端情景下的估值。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 12 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_16","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about value at risk is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Like the Sharpe ratio, VaR is primarily a backward-looking measure of realized risk-adjusted performance.","B":"VaR captures the full magnitude of losses beyond the VaR threshold.","C":"VaR focuses on the left tail of the return distribution and ignores the potential gains in the right tail."},"answer":"C","explanation":"VaR 只关注左尾损失，忽略了右尾潜在收益，所以单独使用会让人只看到风险、看不到回报。\n· 与夏普比率一样是回顾性的：VaR 被视为前瞻性的风险指标（估计未来可能的损失），夏普比率才是基于历史业绩的。\n· 反映超过阈值的全部损失：VaR 只给出阈值，不说明尾部损失有多大，这是 CVaR 的作用。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 16 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_26","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A multi-asset fund holds 70% of its assets in investment-grade bonds and 30% in equities, with no derivatives. Its current risk report shows only equity beta and portfolio VaR. The additional measure the risk manager should most likely add to the report is:","options":{"A":"vega.","B":"duration.","C":"a second equity beta measured against a global index."},"answer":"B","explanation":"组合有 70% 的固定收益敞口，久期是固收投资最主要的敏感度指标（利率变动对价格的影响），应补充考察。\n· vega：衡量期权对波动率的敏感度，组合没有衍生品，意义不大。\n· 另一个股票 beta：股票只占 30%，已有 beta，没有覆盖最大的利率风险来源。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 26 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_27","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst makes two statements about VaR:\nStatement 1: A monthly 5% VaR of $3 million indicates that losses of at least $3 million are expected in 5% of months.\nStatement 2: VaR is a measure of the volatility of portfolio returns.\nWhich statement(s) is (are) correct?","options":{"A":"Both Statements 1 and 2.","B":"Statement 2 only.","C":"Statement 1 only."},"answer":"C","explanation":"VaR 是给定概率下的最小预期损失：在 5% 的月份里损失至少 $3 百万，Statement 1 正确。VaR 衡量的是损失（左尾分位数），不是组合收益的波动率（标准差），Statement 2 错误。\n· Statement 2 only：把 VaR 与波动率混为一谈，而 Statement 1 是对的。\n· Both：Statement 2 不正确。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 27 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_30","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which statement about the gamma of an option position is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Gamma measures how much the option's value changes for a change in the volatility of the underlying.","B":"Gamma measures how much the option's delta changes for a change in the price of the underlying.","C":"Gamma measures how much the option's delta changes for a change in implied volatility."},"answer":"B","explanation":"Gamma 是期权价值对标的价格的二阶导数，即 delta 随标的价格变化的变化率，反映 delta 线性近似的误差。\n· 对波动率的敏感度：那是 vega。\n· delta 对隐含波动率的变化：不是 gamma 的定义，gamma 与波动率变化无关。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 30 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_32","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which of the following alternative return strategies most likely has the greatest tail risk and potential capital requirement?","options":{"A":"A strategy that buys both out-of-the-money puts and calls on an equity index.","B":"A strategy that is long high-yield credit and sells equity index puts and insurance-like protection to collect premiums.","C":"A strategy that holds Treasury bills and buys out-of-the-money equity index calls."},"answer":"B","explanation":"做多信用、卖出期权和保险性保护来收取权利金的策略，平时收益稳定，但在危机时信用和卖出期权会同时巨亏，具有显著的左尾风险和潜在资本（保证金）要求。\n· 国库券 + 买看涨期权：最大损失仅限于权利金。\n· 买入看跌和看涨期权：只买期权，最大损失有限（已付权利金），没有尾部风险。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 32 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_36","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A long-only equity manager wants to estimate how far her fund might fall behind its benchmark index over the next year. The most appropriate measure is:","options":{"A":"ex ante tracking error (relative VaR).","B":"surplus at risk.","C":"absolute VaR of the fund."},"answer":"A","explanation":"衡量相对基准的落后程度，用事前跟踪误差，也称相对 VaR。\n· 盈余风险：养老金等机构衡量资产落后负债的指标，不是相对基准。\n· 绝对 VaR：衡量组合本身的损失，不反映与基准的偏离。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 36 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_41","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A hedge fund's risk policy states: (1) the fund's 10-day 1% VaR may not exceed $25 million, and this amount is allocated across the trading desks; (2) no single issuer may exceed 4% of NAV. Which type of risk constraint does the policy most likely lack?","options":{"A":"A scenario limit.","B":"A risk budget.","C":"A position limit."},"answer":"A","explanation":"(1) 10 天、1%、$25 百万的 VaR 上限并分配给各交易台，属于风险预算；(2) 单一发行人不超过 4% 属于头寸限额。政策中没有对特定情景（如利率骤升 200 bp）下的估计损失设上限，即缺少情景限额。\n· 风险预算：VaR 限额本身就是风险预算。\n· 头寸限额：单一发行人上限就是头寸限额。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 41 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_42","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A fund with $400 million in assets adopts a 5-day 1% VaR limit of $12 million. A board member says: 'This policy limits our 5-day losses to 3% of assets.' The board member's statement is most accurately described as:","options":{"A":"incorrect, because VaR is a minimum loss in the tail; in the worst 1% of 5-day periods, losses could be much larger than 3%.","B":"incorrect, because VaR can be expressed only in currency units, not as a percentage of assets.","C":"correct, because when VaR is expressed as a percentage of assets it caps the loss at 3%."},"answer":"A","explanation":"VaR 表示最小损失：在 1% 的 5 天区间里，损失至少为 $12 百万（12/400 = 3%），实际最大损失可能大得多，所以不能说政策把 5 天损失限制在 3% 以内。\n· correct：把 VaR 当成最大损失，错误。\n· 只能用金额表示：VaR 既可以用金额，也可以用占资产的百分比表示。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 42 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_5_47","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Which pairing of institution type and primary risk measurement focus is most accurate?","options":{"A":"Bank: liquidity, solvency, and capital adequacy; traditional long-only asset manager: investment performance relative to a benchmark, such as ex ante tracking error.","B":"Bank and traditional long-only asset manager: both primarily surplus at risk relative to liabilities.","C":"Bank: ex ante tracking error relative to a benchmark; traditional long-only asset manager: capital adequacy and leverage."},"answer":"A","explanation":"银行的风险度量关注流动性缺口、偿付能力、杠杆和资本充足；传统资产管理人关注投资表现，如事前跟踪误差、相对基准的风险。\n· 对调：跟踪误差是资产管理人的重点，资本充足是银行的重点。\n· 都用盈余风险：盈余风险主要用于养老金等有明确负债的机构。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 5 第 47 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_6_13","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An analyst builds a Monte Carlo simulation of a factor portfolio driven by nine factors. Six of the nine factors are significantly correlated with one another. The analyst should most appropriately:","options":{"A":"specify a multivariate distribution for the factors, including their correlations, and simulate them jointly.","B":"model each factor's distribution separately and draw from each independently.","C":"drop the six correlated factors and simulate only the three uncorrelated ones."},"answer":"A","explanation":"因子之间相关时，单独对每个因子建模、独立抽样会丢失相关结构，低估或高估组合风险。应设定包含相关性（协方差矩阵）的多元分布，同时模拟所有因子。\n· 独立抽样：忽略了六个因子之间的相关性。\n· 删除相关因子：丢掉了大部分风险来源，模拟结果严重失真。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 13 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_pm_6_18","subject":"EOC · 组合 Portfolio Management","subjectKey":"eoc_pm","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Two strategies have simulated return distributions with similar means. Strategy B's distribution is noticeably flatter than Strategy A's, with more probability mass far from the mean. Compared with Strategy A, Strategy B most likely has:","options":{"A":"fewer extreme outcomes, because returns are spread more evenly across the range.","B":"a lower standard deviation, because a flatter distribution has a less pronounced peak.","C":"a higher standard deviation and more frequent extreme outcomes."},"answer":"C","explanation":"分布更平坦、更多概率落在远离均值的位置，意味着尾部更厚、极端结果更多、标准差更高，风险更大。\n· 极端结果更少：说反了，平坦分布在尾部的概率更大。\n· 标准差更低：峰值低说明结果更分散，标准差更高而不是更低。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 6 第 18 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_1_6","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Lena Park, CFA, is the discretionary adviser to Harlow Ortiz, whose diversified portfolio is mostly in investment-grade bonds and large-cap equities. Park proposes adding a 5% position in a volatile frontier-market equity fund. On its own the fund exceeds Ortiz's stated risk tolerance, but Park shows that the overall portfolio's risk remains within his limits after the addition. The obligation to evaluate the fund in the context of Ortiz's total portfolio arises most directly from:","options":{"A":"Standard III(A) Loyalty, Prudence, and Care, because it requires placing the client's interests before her own.","B":"Standard V(A) Diligence and Reasonable Basis, because it requires a thorough analysis of each security.","C":"Standard III(C) Suitability."},"answer":"C","explanation":"III(C) 适当性明确要求：处于顾问关系时，必须结合客户的整体组合来判断某项投资是否适当，单个资产风险高不等于不适当。\n· III(A)：“客户利益优先于自身利益”是 III(A) 忠诚、审慎与谨慎的核心，不是“从整体组合角度判断适当性”的出处。\n· V(A)：要求研究和建议有合理依据，针对的是分析过程，不是把投资放到客户整体组合中检验。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_1_8","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"During onboarding at Calder Asset Management, new analyst Dana Ruiz, CFA, asks the compliance officer what Standard IV(A) Loyalty requires of her. Which of the following statements is most accurate?","options":{"A":"She must act for the benefit of her employer and not deprive it of the advantage of her skills and abilities in matters related to her employment.","B":"She must decline any gift or benefit that could reasonably be expected to compromise her independence and objectivity.","C":"She must obtain her employer's written consent before undertaking any outside activity, whether or not it competes with the firm."},"answer":"A","explanation":"IV(A) 对雇主的忠诚：在与雇佣相关的事务上，必须为雇主利益行事，不得剥夺雇主利用其技能和能力的权利，不得泄露机密或损害雇主。\n· 拒绝影响独立性的礼物：这是 I(B) 独立性与客观性的要求，不是 IV(A)。\n· 任何外部活动都需书面同意：IV(A) 并不禁止所有外部活动；只有与雇主构成竞争或冲突的活动才需事先沟通并获得同意。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_1_9","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In a research note sent to clients of Ostrava Capital, analyst Petr Hanak, CFA, writes: 'Brightline Foods will grow earnings by 25% next year and its share price will double.' The statement reflects his own forecast, but the note presents it without any qualification. Hanak's note most directly conflicts with which Standard?","options":{"A":"Standard V(B) Communication with Clients and Prospective Clients.","B":"Standard III(D) Performance Presentation.","C":"Standard III(B) Fair Dealing."},"answer":"A","explanation":"V(B) 要求在投资分析和建议中区分事实与观点。Hanak 把自己的预测当作确定的事实陈述，违反 V(B)。\n· III(D)：要求业绩展示公平、准确、完整，针对的是历史业绩的展示，而不是研究报告中的预测表述。\n· III(B)：关注的是对不同客户公平地传播建议和执行交易，与事实/观点不分无关。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 1 第 9 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_1","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Before Tuesday's investment committee meeting at Fenwick Partners, portfolio managers Aisha Bello, CFA, and Rory Quinn, CFA, chat in the hallway about whether the committee might downgrade Tessaro Mining. They share preliminary views but agree to wait for the committee's decision. Neither trades in Tessaro or mentions the discussion to anyone outside the firm. Did Bello and Quinn most likely violate the Standards?","options":{"A":"Yes, they violated Standard II(A) Material Nonpublic Information by discussing a possible downgrade before it was announced.","B":"No.","C":"Yes, they violated Standard III(B) Fair Dealing by discussing a possible rating change before it was disseminated to clients."},"answer":"B","explanation":"没有违规。会议前同事之间对可能的评级变化进行内部讨论本身不构成违规；他们没有交易、没有向外透露，也没有让任何客户提前获得信息。\n· III(B)：只有在把建议变化选择性地透露给部分客户、或据此提前为部分账户交易时才涉及公平对待，内部讨论不算。\n· II(A)：两人既没有据此交易，也没有引导他人交易；尚未形成的内部观点讨论不构成违规。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 1 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_3","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Marlow Research is adopting three policies for analysts who use social media:\nPolicy 1: Any post containing an investment recommendation must include a link to the full research report.\nPolicy 2: Because of character limits, analysts may post one-line buy or sell calls without referring clients to any supporting analysis.\nPolicy 3: Full research reports must describe the principal risks of each recommendation.\nWhich policy is least consistent with Standard V(B) Communication with Clients and Prospective Clients?","options":{"A":"Policy 3","B":"Policy 2","C":"Policy 1"},"answer":"B","explanation":"V(B) 允许以简略形式（如社交媒体短帖）传达建议，但必须让客户能够获得完整的分析和背景信息（如附上报告链接）。Policy 2 只发一句买卖结论且不提供任何获取完整分析的途径，不符合 V(B)。\n· Policy 1：附上完整报告链接，正是使用简略形式时的合规做法。\n· Policy 3：在报告中披露主要风险，是 V(B) 的明确要求，完全符合。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 3 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_5","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"The day after sitting for the CFA Level II exam, candidate Wen Zhao posts on her blog that the exam was harder than she expected and that time pressure was intense. Another candidate, Felix Adeyemi, tells a study group that he prepared by allocating his study time according to the topic weights published by CFA Institute and found the testing center well organized. Which candidate(s) most likely violated Standard VII(A) Conduct as Participants in CFA Institute Programs?","options":{"A":"Both candidates","B":"Neither candidate","C":"Zhao only"},"answer":"B","explanation":"两人都没有违规。VII(A) 禁止透露保密的考试信息，例如具体考题、考到或没考到的具体主题、公式等。对考试难度、时间压力的一般感受，以及 CFA 协会公开发布的主题权重，都不属于保密的 CFA 项目信息。\n· Zhao only：“比预期难、时间紧”只是个人总体感受，没有透露任何具体考试内容。\n· Both candidates：Adeyemi 提到的主题权重是公开信息，备考方法和考场体验也不涉及保密内容。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 5 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_6","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"At a family gathering, Tomas Lindqvist, CFA, is asked by twin sisters about a private real estate fund they are considering. Without asking about their financial situation or objectives, he tells them that, based on his research, similar funds have historically returned about 9% per year. Which Standard is most relevant in evaluating Lindqvist's statement?","options":{"A":"Standard III(C) Suitability, because his comments establish that the fund is suitable for the twins.","B":"Standard VI(A) Disclosure of Conflicts.","C":"Standard III(D) Performance Presentation."},"answer":"C","explanation":"他只是根据对类似投资的研究陈述了历史回报，最相关的是 III(D) 业绩展示：凡是传达业绩信息，都应做到公平、准确、完整。\n· III(C)：他根本没有了解双胞胎的投资目标和约束，谈不上做了适当性判断，题中情境也不是在判断建议是否适当。\n· VI(A)：题中没有任何利益冲突的信息。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 6 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_8","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Keiko Mori, CFA, an equity analyst at Sakura Research, lives next door to Harold Wilder, a manager at an unrelated logistics company that Mori does not cover; they occasionally talk at neighborhood events and have no business or financial dealings. Last quarter Mori began distributing her reports to investors in a new jurisdiction without registering, as a recently enacted local rule requires, because she never checked the rules there. Which Standard(s) did Mori most likely violate?","options":{"A":"Standard I(A) Knowledge of the Law only","B":"Both Standard I(A) and Standard VI(A)","C":"Standard VI(A) Disclosure of Conflicts only"},"answer":"A","explanation":"只违反 I(A) 法律知识：成员必须理解并遵守所有适用的法律法规，她在新的司法管辖区分发报告却没有了解当地注册要求。与邻居 Wilder 的普通关系不会合理地影响她的独立性和客观性，不需要披露。\n· VI(A) only：与无关公司的邻居没有业务或财务往来，不构成需要披露的利益冲突。\n· Both：同上，VI(A) 没有违反，只有 I(A)。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 8 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_20","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Siobhan Brennan, CFA, director of research at Kestrel Advisors, introduces two policies. First, a year-end bonus pool funded by the firm will be allocated to analysts based on the firm's profitability and each analyst's evaluated contribution, including compliance record. Second, part-time analysts may do outside work for businesses that do not compete with Kestrel, provided they notify the firm in advance. Do Brennan's policies most likely violate the Standards?","options":{"A":"No, neither policy violates the Standards.","B":"Yes, the bonus pool violates Standard IV(B) Additional Compensation Arrangements.","C":"Yes, the part-time analyst policy violates Standard IV(A) Loyalty."},"answer":"A","explanation":"都不违规。\n· IV(B)：针对的是来自雇主以外的第三方（如客户）的额外报酬安排；雇主自己发放的年终奖金池不属于 IV(B) 的范围。\n· IV(A)：兼职员工可以从事不与雇主竞争的外部工作，事先通知雇主即符合忠诚要求，并不违反 IV(A)。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 20 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_23","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"After a brief conversation at an industry conference, Pavel Novak, CFA, writes a report stating that 'the Halden–Ravik merger will be approved and Halden shares will rise 30%.' He does no further research. The report is released to all of his firm's clients at the same time through its standard distribution system. Which Standard is Novak least likely to have violated?","options":{"A":"Standard V(A) Diligence and Reasonable Basis.","B":"Standard V(B) Communication with Clients and Prospective Clients.","C":"Standard III(B) Fair Dealing."},"answer":"C","explanation":"报告同时发给所有客户，不存在偏向部分客户的问题，因此最不可能违反 III(B) 公平对待。\n· V(B)：把个人预测（合并获批、股价上涨 30%）当作事实陈述，没有区分事实与观点，违反 V(B)。\n· V(A)：仅凭会议上的一次简短交谈就下结论，没有进一步研究，缺乏合理依据，违反 V(A)。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 23 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_30","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Corvid Investment Management is revising its trade allocation procedures. Which proposed procedure is most consistent with the recommended procedures for Standard III(B) Fair Dealing?","options":{"A":"Partially filled orders are allocated first to the accounts paying the highest management fees.","B":"Portfolio managers may execute trades for their own discretionary accounts before the client block order is placed.","C":"For block trades, all participating client accounts receive the same execution price and are charged the same commission rate."},"answer":"C","explanation":"III(B) 推荐程序要求公平分配交易：大宗交易中所有参与账户获得相同的成交价和佣金率，部分成交时按比例分配。\n· 按管理费高低优先分配：偏向高费率客户，损害其他客户，不符合公平对待。\n· 投资经理先为自己交易：抢在客户之前交易，既不公平也违反 VI(B) 交易优先级。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 30 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_35","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Over the past year, Ines Duarte, CFA, a portfolio manager at Lisbon Wealth Partners, received six gifts from long-standing clients: two holiday food baskets, a bottle of wine, a book, a pair of theater tickets, and a handwritten thank-you card with a small gift voucher. All were modest in value, given in appreciation of past service, and she reported each one to her employer as firm policy requires. Did Duarte most likely violate the Standards by accepting the gifts?","options":{"A":"Yes, Standard IV(B) Additional Compensation Arrangements, because she did not obtain written consent from all parties before accepting each gift.","B":"Yes, Standard I(B) Independence and Objectivity, because all client gifts must be declined.","C":"No."},"answer":"C","explanation":"不违规。客户出于感谢赠送的价值不高的礼物，不太可能危及她的独立性和客观性；她也按公司政策向雇主报告了。\n· I(B)：准则并不要求拒绝一切礼物，只需拒绝可能合理地影响独立性和客观性的礼物；来自客户的小额感谢礼通常不会。\n· IV(B)：针对与未来业绩挂钩的额外报酬安排，需获得书面同意；对过去服务的小额感谢礼只需向雇主披露即可。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 35 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_41","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A consultant gives three recommendations to Omar Haddad, CFA, the newly appointed chief investment officer of Pinecrest Capital, to help him meet his supervisory responsibilities:\nRecommendation 1: Distribute the compliance manual to employees when they are hired and rely on employees to report their own violations.\nRecommendation 2: Review employees' personal trading reports at least quarterly.\nRecommendation 3: On learning of a possible violation, promptly investigate and restrict the employee's activities until the matter is resolved.\nWhich recommendation is least adequate for meeting Standard IV(C) Responsibilities of Supervisors?","options":{"A":"Recommendation 2","B":"Recommendation 1","C":"Recommendation 3"},"answer":"B","explanation":"IV(C) 要求监督者采取合理措施防止和发现违规。Recommendation 1 只是入职时发一份手册、依赖员工自报违规，既没有持续培训也没有检测机制，不足以满足要求。\n· Recommendation 2：定期审查个人交易报告是发现违规的合理监控措施。\n· Recommendation 3：发现可能违规后及时调查并限制相关员工活动，正是监督者应有的做法。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 41 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_44","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Northgate Investors adopts three personal trading policies:\nPolicy A: Investment personnel are prohibited from participating in equity IPOs.\nPolicy B: Personal trades are prohibited for five business days before and after client trades in the same security.\nPolicy C: The full personal trading policy is kept confidential within the compliance department and is not provided to clients who request it.\nWhich policy is least consistent with the recommended procedures for Standard VI(B) Priority of Transactions?","options":{"A":"Policy B","B":"Policy C","C":"Policy A"},"answer":"B","explanation":"VI(B) 推荐程序包括：限制参与 IPO、设置交易禁止期（blackout period）、报告要求，以及明确披露个人交易政策。Policy C 把政策保密，既不利于员工清楚了解和遵守，也违背了向投资者披露政策的建议。\n· Policy A：限制或禁止投资人员参与 IPO 是推荐程序之一。\n· Policy B：在客户交易前后设置禁止期也是推荐程序之一。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 44 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_45","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Simone LaRoche, CFA, a wealth manager at Beaumont Private Bank, tells a friend at dinner that a well-known local athlete is her client and recently moved most of his account into speculative growth stocks. Separately, LaRoche buys shares of Orlin Corp. for her own account two days after all client orders in Orlin, which she had recommended, were fully executed. Which Standard(s) did LaRoche most likely violate?","options":{"A":"Standard VI(B) Priority of Transactions only","B":"Standard III(E) Preservation of Confidentiality only","C":"Both Standard III(E) and Standard VI(B)"},"answer":"B","explanation":"她向朋友透露客户身份及其账户信息，违反 III(E) 保密。个人交易发生在所有客户订单执行完毕之后，客户交易优先，未违反 VI(B)。\n· VI(B) only：客户交易已全部完成后再自己买入，符合交易优先级。\n· Both：VI(B) 没有违反，只有 III(E)。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 45 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_48","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Hana Kovac, CFA, a portfolio manager at Adria Securities, receives a written complaint from a client alleging that the firm's trade allocation practices breach securities regulations. Kovac is unsure whether the practices are legal. What is the most appropriate initial action for Kovac?","options":{"A":"Consult the firm's compliance department or securities counsel about the practices.","B":"Report the matter to her local CFA society.","C":"Tell the client that the firm has broken the law and resign immediately."},"answer":"A","explanation":"按 I(A) 的指导，对是否违法存在疑问时，最佳做法是先咨询公司合规部门或证券律师，弄清情况后再决定是否需要进一步行动（如向上级报告、与违规行为划清界限）。\n· 通知当地 CFA 协会：当地协会不是处理此类问题的机构，也不是首选步骤。\n· 告诉客户公司违法并立即辞职：在尚未确认是否违法前就下结论和辞职，过于草率，也可能损害雇主利益。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 48 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_49","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Jasmine Ong, CFA, is one of four partners at Meridian Valuation Group. A former client privately offers her a valuation engagement of the type Meridian regularly performs, suggesting she do it on her own time for a personal fee. Which action by Ong is most consistent with the Standards?","options":{"A":"Accept the engagement, because as a partner and part-owner she is not bound by Standard IV(A).","B":"Accept the engagement, provided she works on weekends and does not use firm resources.","C":"Discuss the engagement with her partners and obtain their consent before accepting it."},"answer":"C","explanation":"IV(A) 对雇主的忠诚同样适用于合伙人：她有责任保护公司及其他合伙人的利益。承接可能与公司竞争的项目前，应先与合伙人沟通并取得同意。\n· 合伙人不受 IV(A) 约束：错误，合伙人对公司和其他合伙人同样负有忠诚义务。\n· 周末做且不用公司资源：即使利用业余时间，承接与公司竞争的业务仍会损害公司利益，必须事先沟通并获同意。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 49 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_51","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"An industry working group chaired by Laurent Moreau, CFA, is drafting principles to strengthen market integrity. Which proposal is most likely to enhance market integrity?","options":{"A":"Require issuers to publicly release all material information within 24 hours of its creation, regardless of circumstances.","B":"Allow brokers to notify clients who pay higher commissions of research changes before other clients, with disclosure afterward.","C":"Require service providers executing trades to give priority to investors' interests when trading."},"answer":"C","explanation":"维护市场诚信的关键是让市场参与者把投资者利益放在首位，要求交易服务提供商在交易时优先考虑投资者利益最能体现这一点。\n· 24 小时内公开所有重大信息：并非所有重大信息都适合立即公开（如进行中的并购谈判），一刀切地强制披露反而可能损害投资者利益。\n· 让高佣金客户提前获知研究变化：选择性披露损害其他投资者，破坏公平和市场诚信。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 51 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_52","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Linh Ngo, CFA, prepares a pitch book for a prospective pension client of Saigon Pearl Asset Management. The pitch book lists the investment team and the strategy's ten-year track record but omits that the lead portfolio manager responsible for that record left the firm last month. Ngo does not mention the departure in the meeting. Which Standard(s) did Ngo most likely violate?","options":{"A":"Standard V(B) Communication with Clients and Prospective Clients only","B":"Standard I(C) Misrepresentation only","C":"Both Standard I(C) Misrepresentation and Standard V(B) Communication with Clients and Prospective Clients"},"answer":"C","explanation":"两条都违反了。遗漏关键人员离职这一重要事实，使宣传材料产生误导，构成 I(C) 虚假陈述（遗漏也属于虚假陈述）；同时，V(B) 要求向客户和潜在客户披露可能实质影响投资流程的重要变化（如关键人员变动），她也没有做到。\n· V(B) only：忽略了遗漏重要事实本身就构成 I(C) 虚假陈述。\n· I(C) only：忽略了 V(B) 对披露投资流程重大变化的要求。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 52 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_55","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"A regulator in Arden Asset Management's home country has issued a new rule that firms must implement within 60 days. The firm's current practice is to review all applicable laws once a year at its annual compliance meeting. Which procedure is most consistent with the recommended procedures for Standard I(A) Knowledge of the Law?","options":{"A":"Establish procedures, such as a compliance or legal function, to identify and communicate regulatory changes promptly so that new rules are implemented by their effective dates.","B":"Keep the annual review cycle and incorporate the new rule at the next annual compliance meeting.","C":"Follow only the Code and Standards, because they are always stricter than local regulations."},"answer":"A","explanation":"I(A) 推荐程序要求建立能够及时获取和传达法规变化信息的程序，确保在政府规定的期限内落实新规。\n· 维持年度审查：新规必须在 60 天内落实，等到下一次年会可能已经超期。\n· 只遵守准则：准则并不总是比当地法规更严格；成员必须遵守两者中更严格的那个。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 55 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_56","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Talbot Wealth Management adopts the following trading policies:\nPolicy 1: Block trades are allocated pro rata among participating client accounts.\nPolicy 2: Fee-paying client accounts in which employees or their family members are beneficiaries are traded only after all other client orders in the same security have been filled.\nPolicy 3: Recommendation changes are disseminated to all clients who have shown interest in the security at the same time.\nWhich policy is inconsistent with Standard III(B) Fair Dealing?","options":{"A":"Policy 1","B":"Policy 2","C":"None, because Policy 2 protects other clients by giving them priority."},"answer":"B","explanation":"III(B) 要求公平对待所有客户。以员工或其家属为受益人的付费客户账户也是客户账户，应与其他客户同等对待；Policy 2 让这些账户总是最后交易，使其处于不利地位，违反公平对待。\n· Policy 1：按比例分配大宗交易是公平分配的推荐做法。\n· None：VI(B) 要求的是客户优先于员工“自己的”交易；员工作为受益人的付费客户账户不应被歧视。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 56 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_57","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Maeve Dolan, CFA, an analyst at Brightwater Capital, has lunch with a recruiter from a competing firm to discuss a possible job opening. She describes her general experience and skills, makes no commitment, does not disclose any of Brightwater's confidential information, and returns to work afterward. She has not told her employer about the lunch. Did Dolan most likely violate the Standards at the lunch?","options":{"A":"Yes, she violated Standard IV(A) Loyalty by not informing her employer before meeting the recruiter.","B":"No.","C":"Yes, she violated Standard IV(A) Loyalty by discussing employment with a competitor while still employed."},"answer":"B","explanation":"没有违规。IV(A) 不禁止员工在职期间寻找新工作或与竞争对手洽谈，只要不泄露雇主机密、不招揽客户、不利用雇主资源、不在离职前开展竞争性业务即可。\n· 与竞争对手讨论就业即违规：讨论潜在工作机会本身是允许的。\n· 必须事先告知雇主：准则没有要求员工在与招聘方见面前通知雇主。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 57 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_59","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Grant Tilley, CFA, a strategist at Harbor Securities, agrees with Rhea Duggan, a portfolio manager at an unaffiliated fund, to email her his unpublished daily market commentary each morning before Harbor distributes it to its own clients. In return, Duggan regularly gives Tilley premium tickets to sporting events. Harbor is unaware of the arrangement. Which Standard(s) did Tilley most likely violate?","options":{"A":"Standard IV(A) Loyalty only","B":"Standard I(B) Independence and Objectivity only","C":"Both Standard IV(A) Loyalty and Standard I(B) Independence and Objectivity"},"answer":"C","explanation":"两条都违反了。把雇主的工作成果提前私下提供给外部人士以换取个人利益，损害雇主利益，违反 IV(A) 忠诚；接受对方定期提供的高价门票作为交换，可能影响其独立性和客观性，违反 I(B)。\n· IV(A) only：忽略了接受利益交换对独立性的影响（I(B)）。\n· I(B) only：忽略了私下转移雇主工作成果对雇主的损害（IV(A)）。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 59 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_61","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"In a compliance training session at Vantage Point Advisors, a presenter states: 'Under Standard I(A) Knowledge of the Law, a member who learns that a colleague is violating securities law must report the colleague to the government regulator.' Is the presenter's statement supported by Standard I(A)?","options":{"A":"Yes; Standard I(A) requires members to report the violation to CFA Institute's Professional Conduct Program within 30 days.","B":"No; Standard I(A) requires the member to dissociate from the violation but does not itself require reporting to regulators, although reporting may be appropriate or legally required.","C":"Yes; Standard I(A) requires members to report known legal violations by colleagues to the relevant regulator."},"answer":"B","explanation":"该说法不正确，不能用 I(A) 来支持。I(A) 要求成员不得知情参与或协助违法行为，发现违规时应与之划清界限（如向上级/合规部门报告，必要时辞职）；准则本身不要求向政府监管机构报告，但在某些情况下这样做是适当的，或者是法律要求的。\n· 必须向监管机构报告：准则没有这样的强制要求。\n· 30 天内报告 CFA 协会：准则鼓励但不强制向 CFA 协会报告，也没有 30 天的期限。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 61 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_62","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"At an industry conference, Daniel Kovi, CFA, tells portfolio managers from other firms that one of his clients, whom he names, is currently under investigation by the securities regulator. Separately, Anna Merin, CFA, a hiring manager, regularly checks the disciplinary notices published on the CFA Institute website before interviewing candidates. Who most likely violated the Standards?","options":{"A":"Kovi only","B":"Merin only","C":"Both Kovi and Merin"},"answer":"A","explanation":"Kovi 向外人说出正被监管机构调查的客户名字，违反 III(E) 保密。Merin 查看 CFA 协会官网公开发布的处分信息并不违规。\n· Merin only：官网公开的处分信息本来就是公开信息，用于招聘尽职调查是合理的。\n· Both：Merin 没有违规，只有 Kovi 违反了 III(E)。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 62 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_66","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Ruth Kaplan, CFA, meets prospective client Leon Marchetti, a corporate executive. She reviews his brokerage statements and discusses his goals. Because details of his pension and stock options must come from his employer's HR department, she sends a questionnaire there. Before receiving the HR department's reply, Kaplan gives Marchetti a specific asset allocation recommendation. Did Kaplan violate Standard III(C) Suitability?","options":{"A":"No, because Standard III(C) applies only after a written investment policy statement has been signed.","B":"Yes, because she made the recommendation before obtaining sufficient information about his financial situation and constraints.","C":"No, because she made a reasonable inquiry by reviewing his brokerage statements and discussing his goals."},"answer":"B","explanation":"违反 III(C) 适当性。虽然她对 Marchetti 的情况做了一定了解，但养老金和股票期权等重要信息尚未取得，在信息不全时就给出具体资产配置建议，不能确保建议适当。\n· 已做合理询问：了解尚未完成，关键信息还在等待中，不能视为充分了解客户。\n· 只在签署 IPS 后适用：III(C) 在建立顾问关系、给出建议前就要求了解客户情况，并不以签署书面 IPS 为前提。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 66 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""},{"id":"eocq_ethics_2_67","subject":"EOC · 道德 Ethical and Professional Standards","subjectKey":"eoc_ethics","verified":true,"vignette":"","stem":"Arjun Mehta, CFA, a consultant, prepares a proposal to help a foundation select global equity managers. He will receive a referral fee from one manager he recommends, and the proposal clearly discloses the nature and estimated amount of the fee. The proposal also states that Mehta has direct experience in all 40 countries the mandate covers, although he has worked in only 10 of them. Which Standard is Mehta least likely to have violated?","options":{"A":"Standard I(D) Misconduct.","B":"Standard VI(C) Referral Fees.","C":"Standard I(C) Misrepresentation."},"answer":"B","explanation":"他在建议书中披露了推荐费的性质和估计金额，符合 VI(C)，所以最不可能违反 VI(C)。\n· I(C)：声称在全部 40 个国家都有直接经验而实际只有 10 个，是对自身资历的虚假陈述。\n· I(D)：故意夸大经验属于不诚实行为，构成不当行为。","qtype":"concept","reading":"EOC 原创练习题 · 对应 Module 2 第 67 题的考点","los":[],"figure":""}]};
